uipment. &nbsp;Australians are being charged with hundreds of dollars above normal prices for protective face masks and other PPEs. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">The federal government is encouraging civilians to stay at home to reduce the spread of COVID-19. Staying at home and usage of personal protective equipment can reduce the chances of getting victimized via this deadly virus. COVID-19 is transmitted primarily by virus-containing droplets that are expelled when an infected person sneezes, coughs or talks, contaminating others in close face-to-face proximity and nearby surfaces. This underlies the general&nbsp;advice&nbsp;to stay more than 1.5 meters away from others, practice good cough etiquette and hand hygiene, and avoid touching your face with your hands.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">During this condition, various suppliers are selling the personal protective equipment at a very high price and because of this Chris Freeman, national president of the Pharmaceutical Society of Australia, has ordered the unethical suppliers to keep their prices fair to ensure masks remain obtainable. Grab Great Deals offers you these personal protective products like KN 95 face masks, digital thermometers, non-touch forehead thermometer, hand sanitizer, and surgical masks at affordable prices. Suppliers of these products of Grab Great Deals maintain the quality of these products. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Strong demands for the above-mentioned products are very limited in stocks. <a href=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/CVOID-19\"><span style=\"color:#3498db\">To buy this order NOW from Grab Great Deals. </span></a></span></span></p>\r\n',0,0,0,0,'2020-03-30 12:21:38','2020-03-30 12:21:38','1'),(7,1,'',' Ecommerce & Corona Virus – Complicating diversion ahead!','Ecommerce-Corona-Virus-Complicating-diversion-ahead','','uploads/blog/1585822363co-in-1.jpg','<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><sup><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">As physical stores and crowded gatherings are very less these days, eCommerce&nbsp;is likely to be one of the most important options for consumers nowadays. Ecommerce is likely to grow. Over a quarter of AUS consumers are avoiding public areas social gatherings and this avoidance causing more traffic on eCommerce sites.&nbsp; This is also causing a huge demand in the eCommerce market as consumers are in need of essential commodities but also can&rsquo;t step outside. &nbsp;During this time Grab Great and its suppliers are making different strategies for order fulfillment and delivery including potentially slowing down fast-shipping strategies, in order to keep up with surging demand and keep works very safe.&nbsp;</span></sup></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><sup><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">A huge shift towards online shopping is helping the eCommerce to grow defiantly but consumers are also worried about the safety measures taken by the supplier companies. Even the supplier companies are working to maintain consumer trust. These days as consumers are visiting less to the stores, the digital services are most likely fulfilling their everyday needs. Grocery products, personal protective equipment (PPE) to prevent COVID-19 are high in demand.&nbsp; </span></sup></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><sup><span s