ld products are ordered digitally to avoid supermarkets or physical stores and crowding with customers. The home delivery of products has the best progression in the market and due to this facility, the digital market got accelerated. E-commerce is limiting the harmful impact of coronavirus on the global economy in this turbulent time. The online orders are trending upwards and the physical stores, supermarkets are trending downwards for the past few weeks. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">But as the demand for the services is very high, many E-commerce brands have set their own standards on types of essential products. Grab Great Deals which has a large heterogeneous collection on various categories has noticed that for the past few weeks the orders on the products like PPE (Personal Protective Equipments), groceries, pet supplies are trending upwards. All the suppliers of Grab Great Deals are delivering the products with the &lsquo;No contact delivery&rsquo; process and extra protection on products is making everyone safe. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Grab Great Deals is offering essential products at a very low price. The best price drop only at Grab Great Deals. To get YOUR PPE products, order protective NOW just by visiting <a href=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/COVID-19\" style=\"color:blue; text-decoration:underline\">https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/COVID-19</a> . Stay safe, stay healthy, and stay at home! </span></strong></em></span></p>\r\n',0,1,0,0,'2020-04-06 14:16:19','2020-04-06 14:16:19','1'),(11,1,'','Specialists have given Thumbs Up on online shopping and delivery services!','Specialists-have-given-Thumbs-Up-on-online-shopping-and-delivery-services','','uploads/blog/1586408547delivery2.jpg','<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Given the fact that everyone has been advised to stay at home and avoid any public and crowded spaces to avoid community spreading of COVID-19.The earth is suffering a lot and it is high time to restrict ourselves and take preventive measures to save us from this pandemic. &nbsp;As the death toll is rising in the country the government has to be imposing restrictions and lots of eCommerce sites have set some regulations. Though it is not undiscovered that online retailers, suppliers are on the side of benefit from a wave of panic due to this outbreak and social distancing especially when our concerns about packages being carriers of Coronavirus have been distorted. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">According to a study people&rsquo;s biggest fear now is to get affected by COVID-19 and they are trying to take the best measures they can. Social distancing is the primary and most important safety measure advised by the government. This has caused a downfall in the market. Everyone is avoiding physical stores or crowded places and as a result, the growth of the eCommerce market is facing a huge rush and somewhere it is helping the economy to stay afloat. Ecommerce is getting all thumbs up and green signals from experts as it is absolutely safe to shop online even for your groceries and PPE products. Online shopping has caused less traffic in physical stores and less community spreading. As all packages are specially taken care of and products are delivered with very protective packaging. The no-touch delivery process is the safest method to deliver products to the consumer. Suppliers are very much concerned about their teams and consumers. This has made them