 travel have somewhere reduced the excitement. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Social and physical distancing has become a crucial factor now to prevent community spreading. Citizens are staying at home and avoiding crowded places like malls, supermarkets, and physical stores and mainly shifted to online shopping for essential products. This year all most all of us will enjoy ester celebration at home! We should be creative enough to make this year&rsquo;s celebration less boring! </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong>Maintain the tradition with the egg hunting activity at the backyard:</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">You can stage a mini egg hunt at the backyard of your house for your kid and can add some more activity. Be very creative this year and let your kids and family members forget about going out. You can ask for everyone&rsquo;s participation in this and can give away some gifts to the winner which can be interesting for everyone at home. You can also make your children draw eggs instead of buying real ones and hang them or decorate them in various places. Be creative and start planning to decorate your backyard! You can order decorative items and other products from Grab Great Deals and get impressive discounts! </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong>Help those who are in need!</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">This Easter helps those who got affected due to this lockdown and running short on food, water, and other essential products. Help the vulnerable with medical aid, food, and clothing in this crisis and help the world to heal again. Order essentials products from online and donate them to various organizations or churches. An act of little benevolence is much needed and appreciated during this crisis. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong>Virtual meetings with friends and family!</strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">This year on Easter there will be no celebratory gatherings and meals among family members, friends and relatives as everyone is advised to stay within their own territory. Even there will be no visit to restaurants for celebratory gatherings. But there is always a solution! Meet your extended family and friends virtually via video callings. It will make you feel closer to your closed ones whom you can&rsquo;t meet this Easter. A virtual Easter lunch can be organised too with all of the cousins or tune in to the same church service together. This can be great fun all together! But don&rsquo;t forget to pick up the calls to wish the loved ones who are less technologically acuity. </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong>Maintain the hygiene and safety </strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">This year we are pledged to maintain basic hygiene and safety to stop the mass spreading. Wearing masks, using hand sanitizer, cleaning the surface can protect you from the community spreading. If you fall sick do check your temperature with an infrared thermometer and self-isolation is a must to save yourself and save your family from the COVID-19 spread. Get all the PPE products at Grab Great Deals at a very reasonable price.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong>Let&rsquo;s pray for the world </strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">&nbsp;This Year let&rsquo;s pray for a safer world where every child and adult is safe and all of us can get back to our daily routines just like old days. Let&rsquo;s also keep in mind that you should do better to the mother earth and should contribute to making the environment less polluted. The world needs our support, care, and prayer now than ever! </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">To order your essential products Order NOW from Grab Great Deals and get unlimited and impressive discounts! To avail, the offers visit <a href=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/\" style=\"color:blue; text-decoration:underline\">https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/</a> NOW or ever! </span></span></p>\r\n',0,0,0,0,'2020-04-10 10:43:02','2020-04-10 10:43:02','1'),(13,1,'','New Arrival hot sale on men’s bag collection 2020: Grab Great Deals','New-Arrival-hot-sale-on-mens-bag-collection-2020-Grab-Great-Deals','','uploads/blog/1587033028maverick_co-manhattan-leather-briefcase-black_5_1600x.jpg','<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"fo