><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Boho is short for bohemian, and typifies a fashion of get dressed inspired by using the lifestyle of unfastened spirits and hippies of the 1960s and Seventies, and even the pre-Raphaelite women of the late nineteenth century. Boho fashion is characterized with the aid of lengthy flowing or tiered skirts and dresses, peasant blouses, ethnic touches like tunics or wooden rings, embroidery or embellishment with beading, fringed purses, and jeweled or decorated flat sandals (or flat ankle boots). The appearance is frequently layered and colorful.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><a href=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/product-details/sky-blue-v-neck-floral-print-boho-ruffled-sleeve-dress\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/307916198.jpg\" style=\"height:599px; width:400px\" /></a></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Today, boho (and the boho lifestyle that first have become popular in 2000) affects are most often worked into a glance with other developments as nicely, rather than sporting the trend from head-to-toe.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">The Boho look is a great example of how boho fashion can be dressy, not only a informal look for music festivals. With beading, silk and fur accents, boho-sublime looks turn out to be dressy options for evening occasions and events. To pull this appearance off at your subsequent wedding ceremony or maybe a category reunion, keep in mind to preserve it cutting-edge and elegant with easy shoes and clean, quite hair. A low bun and a cat eye make-up look will deliver your bohemian-inspired appearance a extra modern-day feel.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">As far as cutting-edge boho fashion icons, it does not get an awful lot higher than Florence Welch. Whether on degree or at an awards show, Boho never fails to showcase her lengthy, wavy pink floral blouse and romantic sense of style.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">While the boho-sublime craze has died down considerably since the early 2000s, the advent of exceedingly private fashion way that influences of all kinds and a couple of trends can all be worn collectively.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">No rely your age, in case you gravitate toward loose silhouettes, beading or peasant-style blouses, there is a way to work them into your current wardrobe. Try a extensive brim hat or a faux fur vest over your favored thin denims. Layer a few gold chains over your cashmere sweater. <a href=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/product-details/sky-blue-v-neck-floral-print-boho-ruffled-sleeve-dress\">Beaded jackets look especially cool over mini skirts or little white clothes... You get the concept. Take an detail that you love from the boho fashion and adapt it in your very own way.</a></span></span></span></p>\r\n',0,0,0,0,'2020-07-28 09:54:11','2020-07-28 09:54:11','1'),(19,29,'','Online shopping - customs and etiquette, do\'s and don\'ts','Online-shopping-customs-and-etiquette-dos-and-donts','','uploads/blog/16594301541_iAu65xDmvpVdBJgps6EDEw_copy.jpg','<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">The Growth of Online shopping-</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Online shopping and the business of e-commerce has a steep candle of growth, almost bullish since 2013 has proven us the people all over the world are comfortable with the idea of ordering things online. With the advent of the internet, online businesses, especially big sharks like Amazon, shein has benefited a lot and have grown 100&times; more than anyone could imagine, both commercial growth and industrial growth. These companies&#39; main focus is to provide quality items in a cutthroat price range and with the comfort of our homes, yes, it did make people lazy but also provided the scope for many online entrepreneurs to thrive in the market</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">Do&rsquo;s and Don&rsquo;ts of online shopping -</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">So, there are some rules you should follow to make your online shopping experience better and more pocket savvy. Choose smaller websites that are genuine and provide more good deals. For example, our website GrabGreatDeals and other small websites that are in the market other than big sharks, comparatively provide more good and quality deals on home appliances, gym equipment, and other commercial products you might want, what it does is that you save a ton of money on things which you typically order usually in the month.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">The abusive power of big corporations</span></span></strong><span style=\"color:black\"> -</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">The other big sharks can&#39;t abuse their power to raise prices on the necessary items. Well, inflation is enough to do, that, other thing you should keep in mind is to read the reviews, generally, on a public forum and market, there is less to none bias ness for the site, so if you see people are bad-mouthing in the comments about the product it means you might not want to buy it, well our site provides reviews open for all people to comment, so we allow you to judge us on our bad reviews not on our good reviews because we have so few of them.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">In conclusion, online shopping is not a bad or a good thing. It depends on how you spend your money by navigating the correct deal aligning with your needs.</span></p>\r\n',0,0,0,0,'2022-08-02 08:47:38','2022-08-02 08:47:38','1'),(20,24,'','The impact of Covid-19 on the fashion industry: Spot these new changes! ','The-impact-of-Covid-19-on-the-fashion-industry-Spot-these-new-changes','','uploads/blog/1659440527fasshion.jpg','<p>The Covid-19 pandemic has had a colossal effect on almost every industry, whether it is health services, non-essential businesses shuttering, or super-markets needed to consider their-restocking tactics and opening hours. Ever wondered if and how, this global pandemic has impacted the fashion industry? With so many industries and individuals impacted by Covid-19, it would be downright strange if the fashion world didn&rsquo;t find itself among them.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Just like the other industries, the fashion industry has also been hit by the pandemic and subsequent series of lockdown, however just like others, the fashion industry too is adapting and moving forward.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>HOW THE WAVES OF&nbsp;COVID-19&nbsp;HAS IMPACTED THE GENRE OF FASHION INDUSTRY ALL OVER?</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><em>Let&rsquo;s discuss about how the Fashion Midseason&rsquo;s saw almost an end</em></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img alt=\"The impact of Covid-19 on the fashion industry: Spot these new changes!\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/7435/4090/files/gucci_480x480.jpg?v=1641638729\" style=\"height:198px; width:354px\" /></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>(Picture Source: Google)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Like giving you relevance how, Alessandro Michelle, the creative director of Gucci, wanted to end his midseason fashion collections by reducing the number of shows from five to two each year. He predicts a future in gender-free fashion, given that there is a positive impact left on the people and the environment. In this way, Alessandro&rsquo;s idea of having no fashion mid-seasons makes sense.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We only see the beauty and glamour on the ramp, but what about the effort that a combined group of put towards making up that show. These events require journalists, seamstresses, designers with a massive number of individuals in a given space.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><em>With the advent of Digital Storefronts- The New Normal</em></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img alt=\"The impact of Covid-19 on the fashion industry: Spot these new changes!\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/7435/4090/files/new_normal_480x480.jpg?v=1641639043\" style=\"height:239px; width:359px\" /></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>(Picture Source: Google)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>According to consumer-sentiment surveys, reports demonstrated a significant drop in consumer&rsquo;s intention to purchase. &nbsp;It was different for online and offline channels. For example, in Europe and North America, according to the reports of the survey, the purchase intention declined 70 to 80 percent in offline cases and 30-40% inflation in online. Do you know that 74 percent of the Chinese customers say they avoided shopping malls? If you really know the answer, then let us know in the comment section at www.grabgreatdeals.com&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>People are loving to adapt to the new normal and turning absolutely in favor of, &lsquo;Digitization&rsquo;. Therefore, it is that digital fashion shopping is what people prefer to get the bulk of their new clothes and accessories, for the upcoming two years at least.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><em>Shifting towards sustainable fashion is also on the rise</em></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img alt=\"The impact of Covid-19 on the fashion industry: Spot these new changes!\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/7435/4090/files/sustainable_480x480.jpg?v=1641639183\" style=\"height:239px; width:359px\" /></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>(Picture Source: Google)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Nowadays, consumers understand the damage done by fast fashion and that resources are increasingly scarce. Wastefulness and cruelty are no longer serving fashion buyers and if designers want to turn a profit, they must change now.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>One of the best examples of sustainable design comes from the young forward-thinking creator Olivia Oblanc. Over the last five years, Olivia has been a key advocate for sustainability in fashion. As a conscious designer, she&rsquo;s always making sure that her creations are both, ethically made and economically feasible.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Opposite to fast fashion, slow fashion is the only way forward as it nurtures and protects our environment.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><em>Increased awareness and engagement</em></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img alt=\"The impact of Covid-19 on the fashion industry: Spot these new changes!\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/7435/4090/files/black_live_smatter_480x480.jpg?v=1641639226\" style=\"height:295px; width:387px\" /></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>(Picture Source: Google)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The fashion industry has developed a reputation of being aloof and disconnected from the realities of this planet. Environment, resources, cruelty, pollution, modern slavery did not concern much at the top of the tropic chain. However, with all its negative and tragic parts, the arrival of Covid-19 has initiated a bit of positive change. Big brands such as Ralph Lauren, Kenneth Cole, Burberry, and Chanel, are pitching in to help with relief efforts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Back to the blindness of the fashion industry, history shows that it only takes action when world-changing events take place. With the #BlackLivesMatter movement, It took another world-changing event to take place for the industry and media to start recognizing and promoting black designers.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><em>Also adapting to green-washing</em></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><img alt=\"The impact of Covid-19 on the fashion industry: Spot these new changes!\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0595/7435/4090/files/greenwash_480x480.jpg?v=1641639250\" style=\"height:217px; width:378px\" /></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>(Picture Source: Google)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Just like the demand for sustainable fashion brands increases, the numbers of companies have an option to create the change that it needs. These brands are unscrupulously green-washing customers with fake advertising campaigns and paid endorsements. That is how with the arrival of covid-19, things in the industry have dynamically started taking a shift.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Millions of people who are attached and are employed to this industry have suffered huge loss over these last years. But the only thing that must keep us going is the ability to battle against this deadly pandemic in the most healthy way.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At Grab Great Deals, we show immense respect to everyone out there who have largely and are yet striving hard to support us at every step.</p>\r\n',0,0,0,0,'2022-08-02 11:36:35','2022-08-02 11:36:35','1'),(21,24,'','Christmas Cookies- Bake the World a Better Place!','Christmas-Cookies-Bake-the-World-a-Better-Place','','uploads/blog/1659613445pexels-cottonbro-3171387.jpg','<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">The Christmas chocolate cookies are known to be brought by the Dutch in early 17<sup>th</sup> century. Christmas cookies are the most delicious during the holiday, the little chocolate chips acts as the beautiful shining stars on a night sky. The point is cookies are universally loved snacks that are just perfect for Christmas. Apart from Chocolate chip Cookies; butter cookies Pillsbury &amp; Grinch cookies are also famous. In this blog we will comprehensively formulate the origin, tradition and process of making an appetizing plate of our favourite Christmas special Chocolate Chip Cookies.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Christmas Chocolate Cookies\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/291072204.png\" style=\"height:400px; width:400px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Picture courtesy &ndash; Google</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Most origins of American foods and dishes are unknown, but chocolate chip cookies are known to be invented by <span style=\"background-color:white\">Ruth Wakefield, who ran the popular Toll House restaurant in Whitman, Massachusetts, with her husband, Kenneth, from 1930 to 1967, brought the Toll House Chocolate Crunch Cookie into being in the late nineteen-thirties. The chocolate bytes engulfed cookie by Ruth gave a sense of hope to the starved and poverty-fed crowd of Great Depression.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Christmas Chocolate Cookies\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/833576123.jpeg\" style=\"height:356px; width:279px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Picture courtesy &ndash; Google</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Here&rsquo;s a quick recipe to make a plate of these chocolate fantasy delights-</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Ingredients that you will need-</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">1 cup butter(softened)</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">1 cup white sugar</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">2 eggs</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">2 teaspoons of Vanilla Extracts</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">1 cup brown sugar</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">1 teaspoon baking soda</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">2 cups semi sweet chocolate chips</span></span></span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">1 cup chopped walnuts</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:36pt; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">The above mentioned ingredients should be arranged beforehand starting the process.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:36pt; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:36pt; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:36pt; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Christmas Chocolate Cookies\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/1654643163.jpg\" style=\"height:800px; width:1200px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Picture courtesy &ndash; Google</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><u><strong><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Directions</span></span></span></span></strong></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Instructions Checklist</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">STEP-1</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">STEP-2</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Cream together the butter, white sugar, and brown sugar until smooth. Beat in the eggs one at a time, and then stir in the vanilla. Dissolve baking soda in hot water. Add to batter along with salt. Stir in flour, chocolate chips, and nuts. Drop by large spoonfuls onto ungreased pans.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">STEP-3</span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Bake for about 10 minutes in the preheated oven, or until edges are nicely browned</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Christmas Chocolate Cookies\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/1906327832.jpeg\" style=\"height:1200px; width:960px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Picture courtesy &ndash; Google</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><u><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt\">The Tradition attached to Christmas</span></u><span style=\"font-size:20.0pt\">-</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Ho ho ho!! The Santa&rsquo;s catchphrase is <span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:#202124\">synonymic with smell of freshly bakes Choc&oacute;-chip cookies as prominent as you can smell it. It seems like Cookies are an integral part of the family tradition on a Christmas Eve, but how it all started-</span></span><span style=\"background-color:white\">Setting out milk and cookies for Santa is a tradition rooted in celebrations of Saint Nicholas, a third-century&nbsp;bishop who was also known for his kindness to children, so on the eve of Saint Nicholas Day (December 6th), children put out food for him&mdash;and what better fuel for a night&#39;s work than Christmas cookies and milk?</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\">Christmas cookies, as we know them today,&nbsp;traces their roots to these Medieval European recipes. Dutch and German settlers introduced cookie cutters, decorative moulds, and festive holiday decorations to America. The act of leaving a treat out for Santa was born during the Great Depression as a lesson from parents to children on giving.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Christmas Chocolate Cookies\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/563203611.jpg\" style=\"height:450px; width:800px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Picture courtesy &ndash; Google image</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Overall we came to the conclusion U.S.A is obsessed with Cookies. Apart from these there are three different types&rsquo; cookies that are absolutely loved by children and the elderly both-</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Butter Cookies -</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:#202124\"> Butter cookies are actually better than chocolate chip cookies! The main difference between the two is the amount of sugar and the baking temperature. Butter cookies have more sugar and bake at a higher temperature than chocolate chip cookies. The amount of flour and sugar is increased, which means they will hold their shape better than Chocolate chip cookies .Butter cookies are great for rolling and cutting into shapes, offer a sturdier texture, and tend to ship well.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:36pt; margin-right:0cm; text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Christmas Chocolate Cookies\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/196385904.jpg\" style=\"height:411px; width:600px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Picture courtesy &ndash; Google image</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:36pt; margin-right:0cm; text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:#202124\">Grinch Cookies - </span>Grinch Cookies are delicious cakey sugar cookies with a green hue and a candy sprinkle heart that are worth guzzling down a dozen, they are so tasty</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.5pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:#102542\">.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:36pt; margin-right:0cm; text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Christmas Chocolate Cookies\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/996281720.jpg\" style=\"height:436px; width:650px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Picture courtesy &ndash; Google image</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:36pt; margin-right:0cm; text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:#202124\">Pillsbury cookies</span></span>- Come who doesn&rsquo;t love a bit of cookies made by the Pillsbury dough. Pillsbury<span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:#202124\"> Chocolate chip cookies makes any day an occasion. And with Ready to Bake Chocolate Chip Cookie Dough, you can create tasty occasions in minutes.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:36pt; margin-right:0cm; text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm; text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">If you want to know more about what&#39;s happening around the world,&nbsp; visit our website GrabGreatDeals- www. grabgreatdeals.com and see lot of other genres.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n',0,0,0,0,'2022-08-04 11:43:15','2022-08-04 11:43:15','1'),(22,24,'','Best Time to Travel is Summer: Check out some latest activities & adventures!','Best-Time-to-Travel-is-Summer-Check-out-some-latest-activities-adventures','','uploads/blog/1660030774Best_Places_To_Travel.png','<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Summer is here, and it&#39;s time to plan your next vacation!</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/966192303.png\" style=\"height:1080px; width:1080px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Whether you&#39;re looking for a relaxing getaway or something more adventurous, we&#39;ve got you covered with the best summer destinations for families and couples. From tropical paradises to mountain wonders, there are plenty of great places to visit this summer.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">It&#39;s finally here: the summer vacation season is upon us. It&#39;s no secret that summer holidays are some of the best times to spend with family and friends, so we thought it would be fun to compile a list of our favorite places to go this summer&mdash;places that are perfect for a relaxing getaway with your loved ones, or even just a solo adventure!</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Whether you&#39;re looking for a cheap vacation spot or an epic destination, we&#39;ve got you covered! We&#39;ve compiled a place of the best summer destinations in the world as well as some of the best deals on vacation packages for this year.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">With so many options out there, choosing where to go can be overwhelming&mdash;that&#39;s why we&#39;re here to help!</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">And with it comes all the fun of traveling. Whether you&#39;re looking for a getaway, a romantic getaway, or just somewhere to escape the day-to-day grind of life, there are tons of options out there.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Summer Getaways:</span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/2133082742.png\" style=\"height:1080px; width:1080px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Thailand is known for its beautiful beaches, beautiful people, and beautiful weather year-round. The city has everything you could possibly want in a beach vacation&mdash;and then some! You can spend your days relaxing on the beach or exploring the city&#39;s many shops and restaurants. And when night falls? You can stay right on the sand without worrying about bugs or getting sick from the ocean air!</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Thailand is a popular vacation spot for many people all over the world. It&#39;s known for its scenic beauty, friendly people, and cheap accommodations.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">The country is divided into five different regions: the North, Northeast, Central Plains, South and the East. Each region has its own climate and culture. The north is known for its snowy mountains and highlands while the south is home to tropical rainforest and islands.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">There are also many islands located off shore from Thailand&#39;s mainland including Phuket, Ko Pha Ngan, Koh Samui and Krabi. They are perfect places to enjoy your vacation because they are close enough to Bangkok but far enough so that you feel like you&#39;re on an island paradise!</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">The best time to visit Thailand is between May and October when temperatures are at their lowest point. This gives you plenty of time to explore the country without being too hot or too cold during those months.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">If you plan on visiting Thailand this summer then here is some information about cheap hotels in Bangkok that will help you save money while still enjoying quality accommodations!</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Family Vacations:</span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">What could be better than spending time with your family? Nothing! It doesn&#39;t matter whether your kids are little or big; they&#39;ll love going on vacation together just as much as you do. When choosing a destination for your family vacation this summer, consider places like Phuket (Thailand)where there&#39;s plenty to do for everyone.<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/749105487.png\" style=\"height:1080px; width:1080px\" /></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n',0,0,0,0,'2022-08-09 07:39:34','2022-08-09 07:39:34','1'),(23,24,'','Is excessive entertainment harming the intellect of youth?','Is-excessive-entertainment-harming-the-intellect-of-youth','','uploads/blog/1660130636WhatsApp_Image_2022-08-10_at_4_38_17_PM.jpeg','<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,\">This question has been hotly debated in the media, with some arguing that cinema is a great way to keep kids occupied while others argue that it has a negative effect on young adults.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,\">Cinema has been around for over 100 years and it&#39;s hard not to find yourself drawn in by its charm and appeal. It&#39;s hard to argue against the fact that it&#39;s an art form, but there are some harmful effects of cinema that need to be considered before deciding if it&#39;s a good idea for your child to watch or not.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,\">The first thing to consider is whether or not you think the movies you watch are good for your child. If you think they aren&#39;t, then you should probably try another form of entertainment (i.e. reading books) until you&#39;ve got a better grasp on what your child likes and dislikes about different forms of media (i.e. cartoons).</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,\">Another thing to consider is whether or not your child has watched/watched enough movies already this year so far; if they haven&#39;t then maybe it would be best if they didn&#39;t watch any more until next year, especially if they&#39;re still young and still growing up physically inside their bodies as well as mentally outside</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,\">&nbsp;The rise of cinema has coincided with a decline in academic standards and a rise in mental illness among young adults. While there are many reasons for this trend, one of the most obvious is fan culture.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,\">Fan culture is a term used to describe people who follow and participate in something for no other reason than to be part of it. Fan culture is often seen as positive, but it can also be toxic if not moderated properly. In fact, studies have shown that fan culture can lead to mental health issues like anxiety or depression.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/13465530.jpeg\" style=\"height:810px; width:1280px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,\">Why cult fan bases are toxic</span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,\">Cult fan bases are especially harmful because they encourage followers to engage with content on social media platforms such as Instagram and Twitter where they see less moderation than they would in real life. This means that these fans are more likely than non-fans to see things that might negatively affect their mental health: violent images, sexualized content (especially when it comes from celebrities), hate speech or other negative content being shared without context or explanation. When this happens regularly over time it can lead to feelings of alienation or isolation which can cause permanent damage to your mental health.&quot;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,\">What is the purpose of entertainment?</span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,\">The answer to this question is simple. Entertainment is an important part of human life, and it has many uses. For one thing, entertainment helps us to relieve stress and anxiety. It also keeps us from getting bored and gives us something to do when we get bored. For example, if you are in a boring situation or if you just need something to do when you are waiting for something else to happen, then watching TV or playing video games can be entertaining.</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,\">Another reason why humans need entertainment is because it keeps them from doing bad things. If there is no entertainment available then people will usually start doing bad things such as stealing money from others or committing crimes against other people who are not involved with their actions whatsoever. In this way, entertainment helps society stay safe by providing them with outlets where they can release their pent-up energy without being hurtful towards others in any way shape or form whatsoever!</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n',0,0,0,0,'2022-08-10 11:23:56','2022-08-10 11:23:56','1');
