INSERT INTO `tbl_product` VALUES (526,'Portable Water Bottle for Pets - Perfect for outdoor outing with Pets- Leak Proof & Safe',0,0,'portable-water-bottle-for-pets-perfect-for-outdoor-outing-with-pets-leak-proof-safe','portablpetwaterbottle0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4001223251270.html?spm=a2g0o.detail.1000014.48.53986f65hUrrG3&gps-id=pcDetailBottomMoreOtherSeller&scm=1007.14976.165864.0&scm_id=1007.14976.165864.0&scm-url=1007.14976.165864.0&pvid=6f2bfaf2-e3ba-4f21-9e43-8e5476ce5935&_t=gps-id:pcDetailBottomMoreOtherSeller,scm-url:1007.14976.165864.0,pvid:6f2bfaf2-e3ba-4f21-9e43-8e5476ce5935,tpp_buckets:668#0#131923#36_668#808#4094#132_668#888#3325#6_4976#0#165864#0_4976#2711#7538#46_4976#3104#9653#4_4976#3141#9888#10_668#2846#8108#142_668#2717#7559#71_668#1000022185#1000066056#0_668#3422#15392#1000','china','<p>Staying hydrated is important and not just for us humans, but for our dogs, too. Whether you’re out on a long dog walk or traveling with your pooch to a pet-friendly destination, a dog travel water bottle will allow your best pet pal to regularly quench his thirst. Most dog water bottles feature a dispenser of some sort, which means your dog can drink straight from the bottle so you don’t need to take a bowl around with you. However, if you are going on a long journey, bringing a travel bowl for dog food, in addition to the travel water bottle, might be a good idea.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you want a simple, yet effective dog travel water bottle, look no further than the Portable Water Bottle for Pets - Perfect for outdoor outing with Pets- Leak Proof & Safe.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/842415188.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The two-piece design features a bowl-style section that easily slides out for you to give your dog a drink from, but stays firmly in place when you want it to. The wide-mouthed opening is easy to fill and pour from and the lid fixes on securely with no leaks.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The 350 ml/12 ounce capacity is fairly generous but not so large that it’s heavy to carry. You might need to find a spot to refill it on a long car journey or an all-day hike, but it’s more than enough for most situations. If you’re concerned about the potentially harmful chemicals in some plastics, you’ll be please to know that the Portable Water Bottle for Pets is completely BPA-free. It’s also dishwasher safe, as long as you don’t put it too near the heating element. With a price tag of just $25, this dog travel water bottle offers exceptional value for money.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Portable Water Bottle for Pets is sleek, stylish, handy and compact dog travel water bottle as our top pick that does its job with no complaints. And costing just $25, you won’t be out of pocket if you buy one of these for your four-legged friend.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1478078140.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The paw print design on the bottle is cute, for users who’d prefer a more plain-looking option. With a capacity of around 12 ounces, this isn’t the water bottle you’d want to take on a long journey (unless you had the option for regular refills), but the smaller size does make it lighter, even when full, so it won’t weigh you down. Plus, it comes on a handy strap to make it easier to carry. This water bottle has a hinged design with a bowl/dispenser that you can set down for your companion to drink from. The only issue is that the bottle remains attached to the dispenser portion, so you have to hold it out of the way while your dog drinks, otherwise it would just fall back down into the bowl. Despite this slight design flaw, it’s still a great product over all, especially if you don’t want a dog water bottle that’s too large.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/353511892.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Unlike many competitors, which feature a bulky plastic dispenser, the drinking bowl on this water bottle is made from a piece of lightweight silicone that flips out from the main body of the bottle. As long as you secure the lid properly, it’s completely leak-free so you don’t have to worry about drips.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>However, it’s especially important that you own one if you regularly take your dog out and about with you for more than a few hours, go on long walks or hikes (especially in warm weather), or bring your dog on lengthy car journeys. You can’t always guarantee that you’ll find a spot where you can stop for water, so it makes sense to be prepared. In addition to our recommendation of buying a travel water bottle for your dog, another must-have travel item for your pet is Portable Pet Carrier Bag Breathable Mesh Pet Travel Backpack - Outdoor Shoulder Bag For Small Dogs Cats to help make carrying your dog on long trips or walks easier.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Its totally water capacity of 12 ounces is plenty to take out on a four or five hour hike (or even longer if you have a small dog or a place to refill) but isn’t so large that it will weigh you down when full. The bottle doesn’t weigh much when empty, either, which makes it lighter when filled than many similar models. The carabiner clip easily attaches to a pack or belt loop, for hands-free carrying and easy access.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A dog travel water bottle should have a few important features. Here’s what to consider when selecting a travel water bottle for your dog:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1389898337.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Never Leak</strong>. Leak Proof Lock Water: Sliding lock switch with one button, make sure the water doesn&#39;t leak in your bag. If you take the time to make sure your lid is fastened appropriately, you will not be disappointed with the quality of your dog water bottles!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Unbreakable.</strong> Travel Partner: Gaity Pet water bottle is great for walking and hiking with your dog or cat. Fashion Appearance, wide sink allows your pet easy to drink water. Durable & recyclable. Never ever worry about your pet gets hurt from toxins. Enjoy the safe and funny outdoor act with your pet.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Reliable Food Grade Materials.</strong> High Quality Material: FDA approved, lead-free, BPA-Free, PET+ ABS, safe and durable, easy dismantling and cleaning</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>One-Handed Operation.</strong> One-key for both open/lock water: One-hand operation, easy to feed water. This Water Bottle is great for walking and travelling with you dog or cat, and it include bottle carabineer can be attached to your backpack, pet crate, stroller or glovebox.</p>\r\n',0,'0',1,208,208,75,49.99,24.99,'25','1','1','2','1598862019ezgif_com-webp-to-jpg_(5).jpg','1598862019ezgif_com-webp-to-jpg_(5)1.jpg','1598862019ezgif_com-webp-to-jpg_(5)2.jpg','1598862019ezgif_com-webp-to-jpg_(5)3.jpg','1598862019ezgif_com-webp-to-jpg_(5)4.jpg','','','portablpetwaterbottle0001-2010291603973209.mp4','1',NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-08-31 08:20:19'),(529,' Infrared Digital LCD Baby Thermometers ',0,21,'infrared-digital-lcd-baby-thermometers','','','china','<p>Fast, accurate and easy to use Infrared Digital thermometers for measuring you and your baby&#39;s temperature. New 4 IN 1 Forehead & Ear  Digital Infrared Thermometer measures the body temperature based on the infrared energy emitted from the eardrum or the forehead.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Non Contact and Accurate Readings : Non-contact infrared measurement. The forehead thermometer medical has been clinically tested, and has a very small error margin. It is actually more accurate and healthier than standard mercury thermometers. This infrared thermometer non contact achieves measuring 1-2 inches away. It supports non-contact measurement which improves safety. Perfect digital thermometers for adults and kids</li>\r\n <li>Sound Alarm : High-accuracy infrared measurement, when the temperature is over, audible alert will trigger. The HD LED screen displays clear and crisp numbers that are easy to read.</li>\r\n <li>Multi-Purposes : The Forehead thermometer is designed for all ages: adults, infants and elders. It supports to take human, room or object temperature.</li>\r\n <li>Memory Feature : It can store up to 32 temperature readings and recall them at any time. This comes in handy for keeping a record, and makes it convenient for babies, children, adults. Also it has auto shutdown feature for power saving.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Infrared forehead thermometer works by scanning heat on the temporal artery on the forehead. It is the latest technology that ensures you get an Accurate temperature reading in 3 seconds. It has both person and object mode. Object mode is very useful if one has to measure the temperature of baby bottle before giving milk to the child. The temperature can be measured in both Celsius and Fahrenheit mode. The unique feature of this thermometer is that it comes with 2 colored coded backlight that makes it easier to understand if the person is having normal temperature or having fever. Memory option stores the last 30 measurements. The thermometer has been designed to be very easy to use. The thermometer being noninvasive and giving accurate temperature readings is preferred choice of doctors and patients globally. Product suitable for all ages including babies.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Infrared Thermometer is designed to take the temperature of different surfaces from a distance of two inches with no impact from the surrounding. This device can be used to measure the temperature of the human body, room, and any other surface quickly and accurately.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Enjoy hospital grade accurate results at home. The thermometer has been clinically tested for accuracy and best when compared to a rectal thermometer.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Babies love it and adults too! The thermometer is extremely easy to operate from babies to adults. As the product is non-contact and quick so, it is the easiest way to measure your baby&#39;s temperature without making contact with the body.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Babies love it and adults too! The thermometer is extremely easy to operate from babies to adults. As the product is non-contact and quick so, it is the easiest way to measure your baby&#39;s temperature without making contact with the body.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The device catches subtle changes in temperature and allows you to take quick actions accordingly. Its LCD screen with backlight displays colour coded results –green light indicates normal body temperature and a red light indicates high fever.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>FAST THERMOMETER GUN: Just press the measure button, this thermometer gun measures temperature in a little as 1 second in either Fahrenheit or Celsius</li>\r\n <li> LCD DISPLAY DIGITAL THERMOMETER: This thermometer digital has a large backlit LCD screen for quick and easy temperature reading. It can store up to 32 temperature readings and recall them at any time</li>\r\n <li> DIGITAL THERMOMETER: This infrared thermometer has a built-in high temperature warning beep indicator</li>\r\n <li> SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Based on the confidence in the quality, our Infrared Thermometers are protected by worry-free support. Customer satisfaction is our top priority.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,'1',0,0,0,0,50,40,'100','1','1','2','1599050109baby_safe_thermometer_digital.jpg','1599050559baby_thermometer_digital_buy_online.jpg','1599050559baby_thermometer_digital_buy_online1.jpg','1599050559baby_thermometer_digital_buy_online2.jpg','1599050559baby_thermometer_digital_buy_online3.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-09-02 12:35:09'),(530,'Safe Electric Baby Nail File Clippers Toes Fingernail Cutter Trimmer',0,0,'safe-electric-baby-nail-file-clippers-toes-fingernail-cutter-trimmer',NULL,NULL,'china','<p>Are you afraid to use nail clippers on your baby&#39;s nails? Concerned that you might accidentally cut their skin. Safe, Gentle and Convenient Electric Baby Nail File Clippers are perfect gifts for Baby</p>\r\n',0,'1',0,0,0,0,20,15,'100','1','1','2','1599050937baby_nail_trimmer.jpg','1599050937baby_nail_trimmer1.jpg','1599050937baby_nail_trimmer2.jpg','1599050937baby_nail_trimmer3.jpg','1599050937baby_nail_trimmer4.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,'2020-09-02 12:48:57'),(531,'Compact & Portable - Easy to Use Mini Electric Waffle Maker',0,17,'compact-portable-easy-to-use-mini-electric-waffle-maker','waffmaker0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000445806900.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.16681b79oYXH9K&algo_pvid=a2a4b36f-03f6-4650-a2a8-648240862bd8&algo_expid=a2a4b36f-03f6-4650-a2a8-648240862bd8-1&btsid=0bb0622915991352734783778e7b3f&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<blockquote>\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Fast Ever Cooking: 350W power, heating, can give you perfect cooking effect every time!</li>\r\n <li>Power indicator: plug in the power, and when the blue light goes out, you can enjoy the food.</li>\r\n <li>Non stick surface: non stick surface makes cleaning easier.</li>\r\n <li>Wide application: it can be used to make waffle.</li>\r\n <li>It can be used to make waffles, cakes, biscuits, etc. to meet your DIY baking needs.</li>\r\n <li>Deep non-stick coating plate: The integrated ultra-deep cooking plate with non-stick coating waffle can also achieve perfection.</li>\r\n <li>Fast and easy to use: Just plug in & use it. it takes a few minutes to heat up. Double non-stick surfaces provide cooking results with consistent every time.</li>\r\n <li>Easily match your room: Its small size and small counter space make it a stylish design and stylish color choice to match any kitchen decoration.</li>\r\n <li>The perfect gift: The perfect wedding, Christmas or new home gift. Small size and small counter space, stylish design and stylish color options can match any kitchen decoration.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p>Easy to making various cakes, waffles, panini cakes. Any wet batter will “waffle” your treats and snacks. Great for kids or on the go. COMPACT + PORTABLE: Easy to use Waffle Maker takes up minimal counter space. Plug it in and go; it heats up in a minutes. The dual PFOA-free non-stick surfaces provide an even cook for consistent results every time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>COMPACT & LIGHTWEIGHT: Weighing around 550 grams, this is a must-have for that first apartment, smaller kitchen, kids party college room life or traveling.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>QUICK & EASY: Simply plug it in and go; it heats up in mere minutes. The dual non-stick surfaces provide an even cook for consistent results, each and every time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>PERFECT GIFT: The perfect wedding or new home gift. Its small size takes up little counter space, and its sleek design and trendy color options will match any kitchen décor.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>MORE THAN WAFFLES: Make paninis, pan cakes, and even biscuit pizzas! Any wet batter will “waffle” your treats and snacks into single serving portions. Great for kids or on the go!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>WHAT YOU WILL GET- Backed by a 1-year manufacturer warranty,  Mini Belgian Waffle maker includes User Manual and a Storage Box (all non-electric parts are easily wiped clean)</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Product Dimensions : 18 x 14 x 9.5 cm; 550 Grams</li>\r\n <li>Item Weight : 550 g</li>\r\n <li>Item Dimensions LxWxH : 18 x 14 x 9.5 Centimeters</li>\r\n <li>Included Components : User Manual & Storage Box</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The  350 watt mini belgian waffle maker machine: 4 inch- getting perfect waffles on first go!!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/809551945.jpg\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\nFresh Belgian waffles and a clean counter-top have always been the unachievable dream for the home cook and breakfast enthusiast. With the mess-free, Anti-Overflow Waffle Maker, The Unique Waffle Iron prevents any batter from overflowing or leaking. The non-stick plates make cleanup a breeze – no spray needed.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nWAFFLE has never been cleaner, simpler, or more delicious! From now on, fresh waffles will be just as easy. A great gift for anyone on your list!<br>\r\n<br>\r\n Superior Non-Stick Surfaces: Extra-strong non-stick coating for easy cleaning and waffle removal. Gently wipe down the exterior and interior plates.The Anti-overflow channel catches any excess batter and helps keep your countertops neat and clean! Gone are the days of batter overflowing out of your waffle iron, making a huge mess. Indicator Lights: Just plug it in. When the green light turns offs, you’re ready to go. With 350 WATTS, it heats up quickly & evenly, giving you perfect results everytime. Easy Storage-  MINI Waffle Maker comes with a Storage Box so you can easily place the unit in any cabinet or cupboard without taking up too much space.<br>\r\nIt&#39;s time to re-think they way you make waffles!<br>\r\nTry classic Belgian waffles topped with just a little maple syrup and fresh fruit, or decadent waffles topped with chocolate hazelnut spread and chopped nuts, or maybe waffles smothered in vanilla ice cream and fudge sauce.<br>\r\nWith this  MINI Waffle Maker you and your kids can enjoy mouth-watering waffles any time you like. A great gift for mothers, father, families, at-home cooks, and more! The timeless style meets modern convenience with this handy electric appliance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1110612671.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Waffle maker is 4 inch in size & it is 350 Watts. The size which you usually get in a waffle store for a individual waffle.Waffles for me is break-fast alternate and takes less than 5 mins. After using this waffle maker, some insights to help you with its features-<br>\r\n1. Good quality product, heats instantly.<br>\r\n2. 10 CM (4 inches) diameter.<br>\r\n3. Very economical. outside its ~Rs. 150 per waffle, at home its less than 30 bucks with all the dressings and toppings.<br>\r\n4. Its compact and occupies less space in kitchen.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You will love this! You can make the most amazing potato-waffles - crisp on outside, soft inside ...like french fries.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nIf you scopp a good bit and placed onto the griddle, pressing very very lightly into the griddle. if you apply too much pressure, it will get stuck in waffle grooves. takes mintues 6:30. makes around 4 potato waffles (depends on size of potato).<br>\r\n<br>\r\nDelicious, filling, nutritious. great for on the go. can be wrapped in foil for late emergency but please try to be eco-friendly. griddle heats up within 3 minutes easy. Don&#39;t overfill. fill slowly leaving the outter rim empty (it will fill in by itself after closing lid).The maker does get really hot and steam is let off from sides. Make sure you clear around it for a foot in all directions.Make sure the batter is of proper consistency; not too thick or too thin.<br>\r\nThere is no timer. You need to set a timer for each one.<br>\r\nAs long as batter is proper - it is fool proof and anyone can use it with great results.<br>\r\nHighly recommended for college/hostel/traveling.My waffles turn out perfect every time.Very filling and satisfying.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/34544141.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>You will truly love this teeny waffle maker machine. It&#39;s small, and easy to store in a kitchen full of this appliance and that it doesn&#39;t take up much storage space. On the flip side, one can churn out just one pancake/waffle at a time. A dual grid would have dished out two at a time & saved on time,<br>\r\nOverall, a good product to have among your appliances. Easy to clean, easier to use and value for money.</p>\r\n',24,'1',0.645,18,8.8,14.5,65,34.99,'50','1','1','1','1599138870waffle_maker_electric.jpg','1599138870waffle_maker_electric1.jpg','1599138870waffle_maker_electric2.jpg','1599443993WafleMakerBox_Pack.jpg','1599138870waffle_maker_electric4.jpg','','','waffmaker0001-2010281603886603.mp4','1',NULL,NULL,'1',NULL,NU