Android mobile phones, with distances up to 10 m / 33 ft.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>360 ° panoramic rotation and vertical angle adjustment, convenient for repair and quick shooting angle.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Supports the latest smartphones and IPADs / tablets on the market. GoPro sports cameras can be used.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The connector of the pan-and-tilt head is made of high-quality metal material to increase its durability. The legs of an octopus can be bent to wrap most objects, such as tree trunks, steel pipes, barbed wire, handlebars, pillars, etc. so that you can highlight your creativity without environmental restrictions. Non-slip textures and non-slip rubber feet ensure a strong grip and stable grip.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Like no more sponge material, it is not easy to crack or break. You can literally use a tripod in water or on a rainy day, without worrying about it. The ball head allows you to capture perfect shots in portrait and landscape mode, 360 ° rotation, 90 ° tilt, 136 ° tilt, up and down rotation, meets all your angle requirements and stimulates your imagination. The locking knob for the ball head is designed to fix the angle.The mini tripod is foldable and easy to carry anywhere in your trekking bag or lightweight that can be carried in any purse, bag, backpack or pocket of a jacket and is therefore portable. The phone measures a maximum width of 5.8 - 17.5 cm, it can be used for all smartphone devices, if you press the expand function at the top, the phone mount can be raised to 17.5 to hold the IPAD for you. Turn on the power switch, the blue LED light will flash.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Turn on the smartphone Bluetooth & Search \"AB shutter 3\" device and connect it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>When successfully connected, the LED light put out.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Press the \"Android or iPhone\" button, then the camera will be working.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Material: Aluminum Metal/ABS</p>\r\n\r\n<p>- Load Capacity: 3 kg</p>\r\n\r\n<p>- Max Height: 12 Inch</p>\r\n\r\n<p>- Tripod Legs: 3 legs</p>\r\n\r\n<p>- Folded Length: 250 mm</p>\r\n\r\n<p>- Head Type: 360 degrees Metal Ball Head</p>\r\n\r\n<p>- Product Weight: 301 g</p>\r\n\r\n<p>- Phone extend size:2.28-6.88 Inch</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Multi-Angle Shots</strong> - 360° Ball Head for multi-angle shooting & adjustable tripod legs help to capture great shots from multi-angle, Hold your Device in both portrait and vertical mode. Easy application and precise positioning with 360 °panning, to expand the range of shots.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>All type Mobile phone compatibility</strong> - Suitable for a iPhone 6/6 Plus 7/7 Pulse 8/8 Plus X XR 11 11Pro and Samsung Galaxy S6 S7 / S7 Edge S8 / S8 Plus Note 7 and other android mobile phones.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>PREMIUM MATERIAL</strong> - Made of premium plastic  and nonslip rubber. The rotatable and easy to use plastic feet can be better adjusted to the floor.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Flexible and Foldable Leg</strong> - Updated food grade material for peerless durability, adjustable rubber grip legs are perfect for outdoor and indoor. The special Neo-rubber legs and Non-slip feet ensure a stable hold or uneven surface and Non-slip design for better protection of your phone and camera.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Mini Flexible Phone Tripod Stand</strong> Capture awesome pictures & video anywhere with your phone. Set it up where ever you want; on a rock, a couch, the dashboard and easily adjust the flexible tripod legs to level it out.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>The flexible and easy to fix legs also hold in any position </strong>you set them, allowing you to wrap it on a lamp, pole, tree or anything else and capture awesome shots or watch videos from any angle! The compact lightweight design makes it super portable. Compatible with any iOS or Android Smartphone.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Universal Compatibility</strong>: We also include a phone mount that is compatible with any phone, making it the perfect tripod for iPhone 4, 5s, 6, 6s , Samsung Galaxy s4, s5, s6, Note 4, Note 5 or any other smartphone model. You can even add an ipad mount to use the Mini Tripod with any iPad or tablet.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Superior Durability:</strong> The Mini Tripod is designed to be highly durable and functional. It can handle abuse and still function perfectly, so you can take it anywhere without any worries</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.06,150,35,35,19.99,12.99,'48','1','1','1','1599142919phone_tripod_mount_for_mobile.jpg','1599142919phone_tripod_mount_for_mobile1.jpg','1599142919phone_tripod_mount_for_mobile2.jpg','1599142919phone_tripod_mount_for_mobile3.jpg','1599142919phone_tripod_mount_for_mobile4.jpg','16024747031717Red.jpg','16024747031717Red1.jpg','phtri0001-2011041604497614.mp4','1',NULL,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-09-03 14:21:59'),(534,'Electric Heating Stainless Steel & Portable Lunch Box - Home Car Dual Use',0,0,'electric-heating-stainless-steel-portable-lunch-box-home-car-dual-use','Ptlunbox0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000296858558.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.6d922d145VVclz&algo_pvid=45a3ee4d-8433-4434-b776-8f83d4daf193&algo_expid=45a3ee4d-8433-4434-b776-8f83d4daf193-0&btsid=0bb0623315991205045197458e6319&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<p>This electric lunch box for Fresh & Hot Meal Anytime Anywhere. A Very Convenient and Easy Way to Warm Up Your Food, Whether You’re At Work Or At College. This Electric Lunch Box has An Electric Tiffin Box That Helps You Heat Food without Having any trouble. It Has A Large Capacity of 1.5L. Trendy Design. Good sealing not afraid of turning at large angle. It has intelligent automatic insulation . After the heating program done the lunch box automatically enters in insulation program to keep the heat of the meal. Easy to use and no harmful substances are generated during heating.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1527658014.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p>General</p>\r\n\r\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"Table\">\r\n <tbody>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Sales Package</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>1 x Electric Lunch Box</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Series</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Toxic™ Safe-686</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Safety Features</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Dishwasher Safe, Freezer Safe, Microwave Safe</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Leak Resistant</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Yes</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Other Lunch Box Features</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td>\r\n   <p>Multifunctional Electric Lunch Box, Made of heat resisting environment-friendly material, Cover has ventilation apparatus keep your food fresh, Odour free, safe and healthy, PTC heat element, Low power and recirculation heating, Keeps your food fresh and hot, Capacity: 600 ml</p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>Description</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Electric Heating Lunch Box 1050ml This Electric Heating Lunch Box has a nickel heating plate for safety and energy savings. It also has two compartments, one removable and extra cover and spoon holders tight lid and allows retain heat. This practical utensil heats food through electrifying jolts of energy, so that the ingredients are always at the point where you love. It has two spacious compartments with a removable compartment that can store abundant food. It is easy to use and ideal to take to school, office, college or anywhere. In addition it generates no odours, is safe, comfortable and healthy. If you do not have time to go to lunch every day, but enjoy a hot meal and with the same taste of home in college or in your office, this offer is for you. Take a somewhat simple electric Lunch Box and make your life. Capacity:1-2L (Rice Box 0.06L, dish box 0.45L) Heating Principle: Hot Air Lightwave  Split: Yes Other Commercial Kitchen Appliance :Other Colour :Blue, Orange, Pink, Blue Condition :New Type: Multi-function Electric Portable Plastic Storage Container Lunch Box Charger:EU / US Plug Voltage:220V ( EU Type) / 110V ( US Type) Frequency: 50 Hz Power : 40 W IN THE BOX • 1 Rice Box • 1 Dish Box • 1 tablespoon • 110v power cable 1 • Manual</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Makes your food hot within minutes. Auto cut-off detachable power cord</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thermo stats for safety of heater as well as tiffin . Electrical shock proof</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Provision in lid to store detachable power cord. Lid with snap clamps for better locking</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/723471254.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Special durable heat resistant plastic for long term use. Put insulation only in the lid keeps the food/contents warm after heating</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Three.S containers with convenient rubber grip lifters. Neon lamp indicator to indicate power on/off</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Like eating hot & fresh meal? Are you compromising to eat hot & fresh meal due to lack of means to heat your food?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It&#39;s time to stop compromising as,  electric lunch box that that serves all your need & allows you to enjoy your meal with convenience without wasting much efforts & time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>New electric lunch box is an innovative product from the  plug eat range. Enjoy hot, home cooked meal even when you are not at home. The new  plug eat is an electrical appliance that is designed to warm up your food anytime & anywhere. Your food is heated to just the right temperature giving your food that \"just cooked taste & feel. Without cooking/over cooking. This is achieved by specially designed heater & thermo stat that efficiently heats & controls the food temperature.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The electric lunch box is made of plastic that includes 3 stainless steel containers that allows you to carry complete meal. It has an intelligent plug-in feature which allows you plug the tiffin at your desk or wherever you are to give you hot food in just 30 minutes. It has a 45 minute auto cut-off feature that keeps your food hot for as long as you want it to be.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cleaning instructions:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Do not immerse your  electric lunch box in water. Before attempting to clean, please ensure that the unit is discontinued from the mains supply & the power cord is detached at both ends. For cleaning the plastic outer body & inner cavity wipe gently with a sponge soaked in mild soap solution. Thereafter with a sponge a cloth dipped in clean water, remove soap suds. Finally, wipe dry with clean soft cloth. The lid & the stainless steel food containers can be washed just like your regular utensils. Use only mild liquid soap solutions for cleaning. This will preserve the appearance & protects its sheen.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>leave it on for 40minutes and the food becomes as hot as from the stove or oven.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Enjoy hot food at your office, school ,anywhere u want every time with -Electric Lunch Boxes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This lunch box is an innovative product , designed keeping you in mind. We bring the enjoyment of a hot, home-cooked meal right into your office.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1690132211.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Product Specifications:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>- 1680 weave Washable Fabric Pouch</p>\r\n\r\n<p>-Stainless Steel Food-Grade containers, Food Grade BPA-free lids with Food-Safe TPE gaskets</p>\r\n\r\n<p>-Electrical Heating Unit and attached plug , Ultra Low Power Consumption</p>\r\n\r\n<p>-Heavy Duty Zippers for heavy wear and tear.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Product Usage Instructions:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>-Read User manual before operating appliance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>-Place containers into Lunch Box</p>\r\n\r\n<p>-Plug Lunch Box into power supply and switch on.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Switch on for atleast 45 minutes for adequate heating. The Lunch Box can be left on for many hours without an worry of overheating.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cleaning Instructions:-</p>\r\n\r\n<p>DO NOT immerse your POWER LUNCH Electric Lunch Box in water. The Unit houses the heating system other electric wiring.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Remove heating Unit and cord and clean the unit with a damp(not dripping) cloth and wipe dry.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For cleaning stubborn stains,food stains etc wipe gently with a sponge dampened with mild soap solution.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thereafter,with a sponge dipped in clean water.Finally, wipe dry with clean cloth.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>DO NOT immerse the heating unit with water.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Stainless Steel containers and lids can be washed just like regular utensils.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Containers and Lids are both Dishwasher Safe.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>safe and shock-proof,food grade easy open lids with steam release design, stainless steel food grade containers ,food grade bpa-free lids with food-safe tpe gaskets.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Attached Power Cord with Storage Pocket for ease of use</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Switch on for at least 45 minutes for adequate heating. you can leave it on for many hours with no worries of overheating or burning.  You can enjoy good and hot food at your door step.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Made of food-grade PP plastic. It’s high quality temperature resistant, on fragile material,safe,healthy,reliable and BPA Free.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Using PTC original constant temperature heating, the use of a more safe and heat insulation dual function.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Unique heating design, the temperature is more uniform, the food is more soft.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>2 layers and sub-grid design, it’s convenient to bring food out. The heating lunch box is suitable for driver who has to drive on the road for a long time. It’s really a good present for them.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Switch on the power, the power indicator lights on indicating that the lunch box began to heat up.It can plug into any 12v socket. (Car lighter).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Size</strong>: 230*165*110mm</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Capacity</strong>:1.05L</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Voltage</strong>?220V+12V/110V+12V</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Power</strong>:40W</p>\r\n',0,'1',2,392,310,298,99.99,74.99,'50','1','1','1','1599144082electric_lunch_box.jpg','1599144082electric_lunch_box1.jpg','1599144082electric_lunch_box2.jpg','16024754605267Portable_electric_lunch_box.jpg','1599144082electric_lunch_box3.jpg','16024754605267Portable_electric_lunch_box1.jpg','16024754605267Portable_electric_lunch_box2.jpg','ptlunbox0001-2010281603887078.mp4','1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-09-03 14:41:22'),(535,'Unisex Breathable & Cartoon Shoes for Little Kids',0,0,'unisex-breathable-cartoon-shoes-for-little-kids','brebabyshoe0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4001317131668.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.65cc5fe0lhh2ce&algo_pvid=ba91eab5-fc43-456e-a70a-7f2b67cfa88f&algo_expid=ba91eab5-fc43-456e-a70a-7f2b67cfa88f-16&btsid=0bb0624415991314146997949e86a9&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<p>HIGH QUALITY BABY SHOE SOCKS: The unisex baby slipper shoes socks were designed to care for your baby’s feet. Made of premium breathable and comfortable cotton fabrics, won&#39;t irritate your baby&#39;s delicate skin!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>RUBBER ANTI COLLISION SHOE HEAD:Rubber anti collision shoe head, protect your toes, buffer impact, protect your toes from injury. The socks mouth adopts high elastic material,can effectively maintain the comfort of the shoes socks and is not easy to slide.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>SAFETY ANTI-SLIP SOLE: Kids grip shoe  have Rubber grips on the bottom, preventing sliding down on the smooth floor and offering your kids more protection during indoor and outdoor  activities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>CARTOON PATTERN DESIGN: Very lovable cartoon pattern ,your toddlers will fall in love these indoor outdoor shoe . Let her run around and play wearing these soft shoe.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>BREATHABLE SHOES: These soft shoes socks are premiu