n<p>This soft cat/dog  recovery collar was a huge help for 12 week old kittens after being spayed/neutered. Get them a size small and it fits great!  Although no cat loves a collar around their neck, these are definitely more comfortable than the regular plastic cones given by the vet. the kittens will like this better. Sleeping is less awkward (they basically have a built in pillow!!!), eating is easier, playing is easier, etc.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe actual pillow itself is made very well with an adjustable neck part, soft fabric, and a plush outer ring. kittens look so cozy and cute wearing them, almost like they’re going for a swim! One thing to note is that as kittens they are super close to the ground and tend to drag their collar through their food, water, or poop in the litter box but these are easily cleaned by sticking it in the washer and dryer with a lingerie bag to protect it. Or hand washing. The string also tends to dangle from the kittens neck but it’s not a big issue, they love playing with it as if it’s a toy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Sizing:  please measure around your pet’s neck prior to ordering. Do not measure tightly. Please choose the correct size for your pet from the Circumference of the inside circle guide:</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> Neck Circumferences from 3-5 inches; Pet Weight - 1 Kg</p>\r\n\r\n<p> Neck Circumferences from 5-7 inches; Pet Weight - 2 Kg</p>\r\n\r\n<p> Neck Circumferences from 7-11 inches; Pet Weight – 4.5 Kg</p>\r\n\r\n<p>: Neck Circumferences from 11-18 inches; | Pet Weight - 7 Kg</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Neck Circumferences from 18-26 inches Pet Weight - 9 Kg.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1699936936.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p>INJURY PREVENTION: Our inflatable recovery collar is specially designed to protect your cat or dog from irritating their stitches, rashes, scratches, and injuries as they heal after surgery. please refer to the second image to ensure your pet will not be able to reach their area of concern, injury, or wound. please also refer to the third image to ensure sizing accuracy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>COMFORTABLE DESIGN: Your pet&#39;s comfort is our top priority. Our inflatable recovery collar is a soft, plush, alternative to traditional pet cones that will ensure your cat or dog is not only comfortable, but able to eat, drink, sleep and play as normal.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ADJUSTABLE STRAP: At the opening of the collar, there is a velcro strap that allows you to adjust the tightness of the collar around your pet&#39;s neck.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>EASY TO MAINTAIN: Our inflatable pet collar is manufactured with thick, durable, fabric that is made to withstand excessive use. You can confidently let your cat or dog eat, sleep, and play knowing that the collar is highly durable.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>PREVENT FROM BITING & SCRATCHING: This inflatable collar can effectively prevent your pet from biting/scratching/licking their wounds after surgery, which is beneficial for their wound recovery. In addition, the comfy cone can be used during pet grooming, nail trimming, and medical appointments.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>MORE COMFORTABLE: This inflatable dog cone more comfortable than the normal plastic collar. Made of thick, durable, fabric material can be use for a long time, there is a and there is a zipper so you can wash it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>NOT BLOCK VISION: This inflatable dog collar with specially designed will not block the pet&#39;s sight at all. Wearing this cone, cats and dogs can eat, sleep, play, and train normally. Highly recommended by veterinarians and beauticians. This inflatable e collar can prevent dogs and cats from biting other items when in the veterinary examination and treatment, beauty, grooming, surgical procedure, shower, trimming the nails and deshedding.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>EASY TO USE: Use the dog neck donut just need three steps. Blow into the air valve, loop to insert the cone, then put it on your pet’s neck. When you&#39;re not using it, you can deflate the gas and store it in a small space.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ADJUSTABLE STRAP: At the opening of the recovery collar, there is a adjustable strap by which you can adjust the tightness of the collar around your pet’s neck. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Rucal Pet’s Inflatable Recovery Dog Collar is a fantastic product to ensure your dog or puppy has a speedy recovery after surgery while ensuring they have the maximum amount of comfort and agility for when they eat, sleep, and play.If your dog gets ticks, our inflatable dog collar is a great option to prevent further irritation from forming on their neck and head. The recovery collar is unique as it acts as a bumper around your dog’s neck and will stop your dog from scratching at their wounds, stitches, or ticks as they wear it. This will shorten the healing time. From small puppies to large dogs, our Inflatable Dog Collar is an excellent option for post-surgery healing, and the prevention of infections. Unlike plastic dog cones, our&#39;s will not mark up walls and furniture.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Soft pad on the inside and outside, for additional comfort and better protection.</li>\r\n <li>Its shape looks like the soft & Cute shape adds more fun to the life!</li>\r\n <li>Not oversize area ensures the pet not to feel much anxious about the blocked field of vision.</li>\r\n <li>This product is for healing E-cone, helps the pet recovery from surgical sites, hot spots, or injuries, keeps dogs and cats from turning their bodies to lick or chew on wound.</li>\r\n <li>Made of soft and light PP cotton, ensures the comfortable experience.</li>\r\n <li>EASY TO USE & HIGHLY DURABLE- the Inflatable recovery collar is soft and washable. Insert your pet&#39;s everyday collar through the inner ring loops for stabilization.</li>\r\n <li>TRENDY DESIGN-   Pet Dog Cat Collar are very soft element that is also fashionable and beautiful.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>More comfortable & convenient</li>\r\n <li>Compared with the traditional comfy cone, this one is softer, lighter and more breathable, and pet can normal action, like eating, drinking, playing, sleeping, and move freely.</li>\r\n <li>Effective against licking & scratching</li>\r\n <li>The collar can effectively prevent pets from scratching and licking wounds, helping quick recovery, and help when they are cut nails, bath.</li>\r\n <li>Lie freely on the floor</li>\r\n <li>It also be used as a pillow for pets to make their sleep comfortable.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,'1',0.113,27.18,26.67,6.6,25,18.99,'49','1','1','1','1599215527Soft_Adjustable_Pet_E-Collar.jpg','1599215527Soft_Adjustable_Pet_E-Collar1.jpg','1599215527Soft_Adjustable_Pet_E-Collar2.jpg','1599215527Soft_Adjustable_Pet_E-Collar3.jpg','1599215527Soft_Adjustable_Pet_E-Collar4.jpg','16024774926494Rose_Red.jpg','16024774926494Rose_Red1.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-09-04 10:32:08'),(538,'Stainless Steel Screw Portable Can Opener - Open all Types of Can lid',0,0,'stainless-steel-screw-portable-can-opener-open-all-types-of-can-lid','porcanope0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005001371239798.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.2665392eR2thKA&algo_pvid=970c8623-764b-4bdd-8c76-eea30354fd1d&algo_expid=970c8623-764b-4bdd-8c76-eea30354fd1d-8&btsid=0bb0600115992076339474467e6209&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<p>This Portable Can Opener is extremely durable, with an all-steel construction. Soft cushion-grips for ensure grip while opening various cans. A high-carbon, gear-driven cutting wheel and skip-proof feed for smooth and easy usage. With an integrated bottle opener on the side, now you can use as two kitchen tools in one! Quickly and easily remove bottle caps in one swift movement.  Measures 20cm long.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Durable Construction: This can opener is one you can rely on to get through tough can tops effortlessly. The body is constructed out of extremely durable steel.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Comfortable Handle: The Professional Can Bottle Opener features an extra-long crank handle for a better grip; helping take the strain and pain from your hands when in use. The crank folds down, making storage easy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Essential for Kitchen: The Portable Can Opener is an ideal addition to any kitchen. No kitchen is complete without one.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Smooth and Easy Usage: The cutting wheel is made of high-carbon and glides easily across the tops of cans. The cutting is smooth and skip-proof making usage easy. A built-in bottle opener is included.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Easy To Clean: It is recommended to hand wash with warm water and a mild detergent; rinse then dry immediately.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>FEATURES:</strong><br>\r\n<br>\r\nSafe and hygienic<br>\r\n<br>\r\nErgonomic handles<br>\r\n<br>\r\nExtreme saey of use<br>\r\n<br>\r\nUltra sharp cutting blade<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>HOW TO USE:</strong><br>\r\n<br>\r\n1. Open the handles and position the rim of can between the blade and the gear.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n2. Squeeze the handles firmly to pierce the can.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n3. Twist the knob clockwise until it cuts around the entire lid.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n4. Open the handles to release the lid.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n5. After usage wash the opener with water, hand wash only.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n6. Dry the opener thorougly.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/198622363.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Notice</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<br>\r\n(1) Please keep the product out of reach of children.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n(2) Do not use the product for purposes other than those specified.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n(3) Clean the can openner with water and detergent after eachuse.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n(4) After cleaning, dry the product with a dry cloth or paper towel and store it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Multifunctional Can Opener: Wanbasion professional can opener with smooth edge can work as jar opener, can opener, tin opener, beer opener and bottle opener, and pry the lids. A pe