ture',0,0,'adjustable-medical-clavicle-posture-corrector-for-men-women-comfortably-improve-bad-posture','poscorr0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4001112833685.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.7b1439291ehyYE&algo_pvid=7749db72-7d19-4a77-a719-1ad7b036a6d0&algo_expid=7749db72-7d19-4a77-a719-1ad7b036a6d0-0&btsid=0bb0623a15991917276145166e1845&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<p>RELIEVE YOUR BACK PAIN AND IMPROVE YOUR POSTURE with our Posture Corrector brace that ensures alignment and stability. Good posture is healthy. Good posture is sexy! Our Posture Corrector for women is the solution! Also for men !</p>\r\n\r\n<p>COUNTERACT THE BAD HABITS OF SLOUCHING OVER YOUR COMPUTER AND PHONE with our posture brace that will help to prevent nerve damage and tight muscles that can occur from bad posture.Try Now the Back Posture Corrector</p>\r\n\r\n<p>THE CLAVICLE BRACE IS MADE FROM STRONG AND BREATHABLE HIGH-QUALITY NEOPRENE .This ensures our posture corrector for men is comfortable and built to last. Wear it under or on top of your clothes. Wear it at home. Wear it at work. Wear it on the go!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>BONUS KINESIOLOGY TAPE AND CARRYING BAG INCLUDED so you have everything you need to take your good posture everywhere you go!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1198958240.jpg\">                                                     <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1881993855.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Healthier, Happier You with our posture corrector with pads! Our mission is to help people live happier, healthier lives. Strong posture brace is the key to a healthier upper body and can increase confidence. Feel good knowing you look good and are properly aligned so you can live the active lifestyle you always wanted. Our posture corrector with pads for women and clavicle brace helps you to be at your very best! Also if you have a posture aid our back brace is the best choice. Bonus Kinesiology Tape and Carrying Bag.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Acts as a clavicle brace in order to provide clavicle posture support while working out, lifting, sitting at the computer desk, working in the office etc. Recover mobility and strengthen the muscles. Realign your vertebrae to their proper position - primate posture.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Become a healthier, happier version of yourself !!!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In the first week, wear the back brace posture support for 30-40 minutes per day, for postural correction. After one to two weeks, you can increase 20 or 30 minutes more every day depending on your comfort with the posture back brace. You may experience some discomfort or tension in the first week using our back braces as your posture is correcting. Please consult a physician before using our posture corrector and kinesiology tape if you are allergic to neoprene or latex or if you are pregnant.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Counteract the bad habits of slouching over your computer and phone with our posture brace that will help to prevent nerve damage and tight muscles that can occur from bad posture. Try Now the Back Posture Corrector.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/2022654993.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>COMPACT SIZE ASJUSTMENT: Posture Corrector for Men and Women According to your body shape that The angles needed to correce are different, the design of correction belt can adopt adjustable nylon belt with magic paste of high quality so that it can be adjusted freely through the shoulder band</p>\r\n\r\n<p>PERFORATION DESIGN,BREATHABLE,COMFORTABLE: The postural correction belt is made of very soft composite fabric and nylon tape, and breathable holes are adopted in back and shoulder straps. Heat dissipation and permeability have been upgraded to improve the comfort of wearing</p>\r\n\r\n<p>SITTING POSITION IMPROVEMENT: Adjustable Shoulder Posture Brace Applicable to men, women and youth(teenagers).Unhealthy posture can lead to long-term back pain, muscle pain, myopia, and other medical problems. Wearing a back corrector can develop muscle memory for a period of time, and you can keep your back straight even if you don&#39;t wear a posture correction device</p>\r\n\r\n<p>APPLICABLE TO A VARIETY OF ENVIRONMENTS: The men women Posture Back Brace Can be used at home, office, gym, yoga room and outdoor. Can be put directly on the clothes, skin irritation would not be caused by the support band</p>\r\n\r\n<p>INVISIBLE UNDER CLOTHES - No need to feel self conscious about wearing a back posture brace. Our adjustable and lightweight design is discreet enough to wear under your shirt or blouse. You can make the most of your posture trainer, such as you can wear our posture corrector while at work, home or out and after a while you’ll forget you’re even wearing the posture corrector.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/956436933.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>ALL DAY COMFORT: Sleek and lightweight. Our back brace can be worn over or under your clothes. No need to feel self-conscious about wearing our brace. You can wear it while at work, home or out and no one will know you have it on.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>BACK POSTURE CORRECTOR: The adjustment range of the back support shoulder straps is 25 - 43 inch. Posture brace for women & men. Flexible enough to allow FREE MOVEMENT, this approved shoulder corrector provides RELIABLE BACK SUPPORT at all times.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>LONG TERM IMPROVEMENT GUARANTEE: Start with 15-30 minutes a day and gradually correct the posture. Please have in mind that this device must be worn for a longer period of time before you can notice improvements with your posture. After 2-4 weeks you will notice the first changes to your posture guaranteed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>GOOD POSTURE IS HEALTHY AND SEXY FOR MEN & WOMEN: Wearing our back brace for some time develops muscle memory which means you’ll keep & hold back straight even without the posture corrector device and you will look more confident than ever before.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>BACK, SHOULDER AND CLAVICLE SUPPORT & PAIN RELIEF: Designed to put an end to the nasty upper and lower back, shoulder and neck pain. Usually, your back, shoulder pain has been caused by your bad posture. This effective back straightener gradually retrains your stiff muscles and adjusts your shoulders to achieve improved posture and proper alignment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1415708926.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Size Chart:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>S:   Chest size: 46 - 68 cm / 18 - 26 inch (Suit for weight: 20-40KG)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>M:   Chest size: 68 - 91 cm / 27 - 36 inch (Suit for weight: 40-60KG)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>L:    Chest size: 91 - 119 cm / 36 - 47 inch (Suit for weight: 60-90KG)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>XL:    Chest size: 119 - 150 cm / 47 - 59 inch (Suit for weight: 90-100KG)</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Easily get perfect & confident posture - start standing, sitting much straighter.</li>\r\n <li>Align your shoulders, spine and upper back.</li>\r\n <li>Improve your posture & reduce slouching immediately with adjustable dual strap design.</li>\r\n <li>Lightweight padded corrector can be worn comfortably under or over clothing.</li>\r\n <li>Eliminates neck and back discomfort from sitting with rounded shoulders in front of the computer.</li>\r\n <li>Wear all and every day to retrain your posture.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>A Healthier, Happier You with our Medical Adjustable Clavicle posture corrector with pads!</strong><br>\r\nStrong posture brace help maintain a healthier upper body and can increase confidence. Feel good when you look good and are properly aligned so you can live the active lifestyle. Our posture corrector with pads and clavicle brace helps you to be at your very best! Also if you have a posture aid our back brace is the best choice for you.<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Carrying Bag!</strong><br>\r\nTake your posture c