ater outlet which drains out dirty water.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>360 Degree Mop Handle</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Clean your house in a hassle-free manner with this spin mop system that comes with a 360 degree mop that rotates to enable you to reach the farthest corners of the room, underneath your furniture and all the other tricky areas.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Equipped with Big Wheels</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>This spin mop bucket is equipped with big wheels that make the portability of this set an easy task. Embrace cleanliness and stay in a hygienic environment with this spin mop set.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Extendable Mop Handle</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>This spin mop comes with an extendable mop handle which lets you adjust the height of your mop according to your requirements. You will not need to bend and strain your back with this ergonomically designed mop handle.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1169523276.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Extendable Mop Handle</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>This spin mop comes with an extendable mop handle which lets you adjust the height of your mop according to your requirements. You will not need to bend and strain your back with this ergonomically designed mop handle.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A spin mop is a floor cleaning item that spins away dirty water easily from the mop. Put the mop in the bucket and it will absorb all the dirty water from mop by spinning it. Household Microfiber Floor Mop Head Magic Replacement Automatic Mop Head 360 Spin Cleaning Pad Home Clean Tools.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1733519852.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>The premium Vileda O-Cedar Easy Wring & Clean Spin Mop set contains a 100% microfiber mop and a spin wring bucket with a foot pedal for effortless wringing and quicker floor cleaning.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Suitable for all type hard floor surfaces including wood and laminate.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Durable and easy to use foot pedal for optimal mop wringing and funnel for easier mop insertion and water splash protection.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>NEW Power fibres delivering advanced cleaning power; Super absorbent 100% microfiber; white strings, combined with red power fibres for superior dirt pick up</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Triangular mop head shape for excellent corner cleaning. Machine-washable mop head. Easy wringing and cleaning with less effort and without getting your hands wet or dirty.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Material</strong>: Microfiber</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Color: </strong>White</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Dimension</strong>:Approx.Outer Diameter: 145mm / 5.7inch</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Inter Diameter</strong>: 100mm / 3.9inch</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features</strong>: For 360 Degree Spin Mop</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package Included:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1*Mop replacement head</p>\r\n',0,'1',2.28,48.2,29,28.2,30,12.99,'54','1','1','1','1599219231spin_mop_replacement_mop.jpg','1599219231spin_mop_replacement_mop1.jpg','1599219231spin_mop_replacement_mop2.jpg','1599219231spin_mop_replacement_mop3.jpg','1599219231spin_mop_replacement_mop4.jpg','','',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-09-04 11:33:51'),(542,'4MP Wireless IP WIFI Camera - Infrared Night Vision Waterproof Outdoor & Indoor Surveillance',0,21,'4mp-wireless-ip-wifi-camera-infrared-night-vision-waterproof-outdoor-indoor-surveillance','wirelsecam0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/32791147226.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.7a456c94ZwLr0L&s=p&ad_pvid=202009070130376642757179236190000100943_10&algo_pvid=e02a7846-8fda-4181-8cda-36cfb79ee3e4&algo_expid=e02a7846-8fda-4181-8cda-36cfb79ee3e4-49&btsid=0bb0623e15994674373314560e37f8&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Waterproof and weatherproof</strong>- Its designed to withstand any outside fluctuating weather conditions. Can be used Indoor and outdoor.Install this durable security camera wherever you need it most - indoors or outdoors. It comes with the highest IP rating available (IP66). So you can count on all-season security monitoring for years and years, even if the camera is directly exposed to the elementsInstall this durable security camera wherever you need it most - indoors or outdoors.</li>\r\n <li><strong>Simple DIY Installation</strong>- Can be easily installed through manual instructions. View anytime anywhere in world and be sure that everything is secure. Install it yourself. Maizic customer care will assist you regarding stepwise installation.</li>\r\n <li><strong>Night Vision and Two way intercommunication</strong>.- 36 Infrared led sensors ensure clear and high definition videos day and night. Visibilty upto 30 meters in pitch dark, never miss a moment. Talk to your loved ones anytime anywhere.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1455794892.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>4MP Video & Audio Pickup:</strong> The lens is 4mm and offers 80 degrees wide view angle with 2560 x 1920 Super HD resolution. With built-in mic, the security camera supports live view and record motions with both video and audio.</li>\r\n <li><strong>2.4G/5G Dual Band WIFI Connection:</strong> With 2T2R Mimo antennas and 2.4GHz/5GHz dual bands, the wireless camera works more stably with a WIFI router and has more network possibility.</li>\r\n <li><strong>SD Card Recording & Remote Playback:</strong> With external micro SD card slot, max support 64GB SD card. It will record whenever motion detection is triggered. Video can be playback from the Reolink app and free client software. Reolink PoE NVR is best for 24hour storage in HDD if more than 4 cameras. (couldn&#39;t work with other brands Onvif NVR) SD card storage Max up to 128 GB supportable - You can record videos up to one month. Record videos either 24*7 or only when motion is detected, thus utilizing SD space (SD card not included in this package). Ideal for home/office monitoring and deter burglary/theft.</li>\r\n <li><strong>Neat Installation</strong>: Equipped with weatherproof housing, the bullet camera can be installed inside and outside, such as gate, front door, garden, backyard, garage, corridor, kitchen, living room, etc. without wiring.</li>\r\n <li><strong>Motion Detection & Multiple Alerts:</strong> FOUR actions when motion is detected: 1-email with a photo or 30s video; 2-push notification to Reolink app.; 3-sd card recording; 4-FTP uploading. You will hardly miss what is going on or happened. Motion detection and Alarm Notification- When motion is detected camera will start buzzing and a notification will be sent on app. This will alert you against any potential theft and shall deter burglars.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/581557158.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Type: IP Camera</li>\r\n <li>Supported Operating Systems: Windows 10</li>\r\n <li>Supported Operating Systems: Windows 8</li>\r\n <li>Supported Operating Systems: Windows 7</li>\r\n <li>Supported Operating Systems: Mac os</li>\r\n <li>High Definition: 4.0 Megapixels</li>\r\n <li>Lens (mm): 4mm</li>\r\n <li>Style: Bullet Camera</li>\r\n <li>Connectivity: IP/Network Wireless</li>\r\n <li>Installation: Side</li>\r\n <li>Wall Bracket: Side</li>\r\n <li>Power Consumption(W): 5.5W</li>\r\n <li>Color: White</li>\r\n <li>Minimum Illumination(Lux): 0</li>\r\n <li>Sensor: CMOS</li>\r\n <li>Megapixels: 4MP</li>\r\n <li>Sensor Brand: Omnivision</li>\r\n <li>Special Features: Waterproof / Weatherproof</li>\r\n <li>Storage: None</li>\r\n <li>Alarm Action: FTP Photo</li>\r\n <li>Alarm Action: Email Photo</li>\r\n <li>Video Compression Format: H.264</li>\r\n <li>Power Supply: Normal</li>\r\n <li>TF Card: None</li>\r\n <li>IR Distance(m): 30m</li>\r\n <li>is_customized: No</li>\r\n <li>Power Supply(V): DC 12V</li>\r\n <li>Model Number: RLC-410W-