ng! Put the laptop workstation on the table for a stand work level to reduce your uncomfortable feelings or back pain from sitting up right in a chair for so long.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Easily adjust the height and angle of your laptop and keep it cool.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This laptop lap desk rests on the couch letting you stretch out and move around.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Enjoy the freedom to stand up and work anywhere, this adjustable height laptop standing desk riser raises laptops up to 18\" above your desk.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Stop hunching! Raise laptops to eye-level.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Reduce screen glare and make it easy to see (and share) your screen with others.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>BUILT-IN TWO BIG FAN:</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>The powerful CPU fan will reduce the working temperature of your laptop and provide steady airflow around it. It uses active cooling methods to distribute air quietly and evenly under the base of your laptop or notebook.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>ADJUST ANY ANGLE:</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>This Laptop Stand with adjustable auto-locking joints which are available for rotating around 360 degrees. It can hold things in a variety of configurations. The table will provide the most comfortable typing angle when you are sitting on chair or lying down on bed.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>360-DEGREE JOINTS:</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>Ergonomic designed with 360-degree adjustable rotation laptop stand.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Adjust your laptop screen to the best sight level to protect your body from suffering neck pain and shoulder pressure.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Please check the angles of both sides, because you have to be perfect on both sides for this device to be stable. If you adjust the table to the highest level, it may wobble slightly because each leg has three joints. If you want to put the table on a smooth surface, you can prepare several small anti skid pads to reduce slipping.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Laptop Lap Desk for Bed</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>Stretch out, move your legs and let the ergonomic laptop stand perfectly position your screen.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Computer Lap Desk for Couch</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>Lounge on the couch and compute in comfort with this cooling laptop stand.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Ergonomic Laptop Riser for Sitting at a Desk</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>Sit up straight and reduce screen glare by holding your laptop at the perfect height.</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong>Simple Portable Laptop Standing Desk Riser</strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<p>Stand up and work at any table - this ergonomic laptop standing desk raises screens up to 18\" and includes a mouse pad.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are a green hand in using the laptop table, It may take you some minutes to operate it! P</p>\r\n\r\n<p>lease sure that our instruction will provide you the most considerate references! And in the next operations, it will cost you only a few minutes to get the lap table at the right level. When you get familiar with this product, you may love it for it’s convenience and multi-positions function!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Material -  aluminum-magnesium alloy+ABS</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Dimensions (L x W x H) - 42 x 26 x (45-49) cm </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Mouse panel dimensions – 15 x 16 cm</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>This Adjustable Laptop Stand desk will provide you with full control and flexibility to place at your most comfortable position for typing angle and reducing neck and shoulder stress and pain. You can use it as a adjustable standing desk, you can do it as a laptop desk for bed. No more neck pains due to hours of using your computers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\nThe Laptop Stand made by high quality Aluminium alloy - ultra light and strong. One big silent built-in fans - cool your laptop on USB power.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\nFully adjustable legs- Rotate 360 Degrees and Lock in Place at Various Angles. Quickly Collapse the Stand to Make it Portable.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\nEasy to use and easy to carry, to adjust the angle you want, press the button down, you can adjust to the angle you want, release the button automatically fixed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Laptop Stand-Adjustable Laptop Desk</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Make you working in a comfortable environment. Say bye bye to neck pain and tension from always looking down at your laptop.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Introducing the Executive Office Solutions Vented Laptop Stand! This laptop desk is designed to allow you to set up an office anywhere! It is easy to carry, with a light weight frame. While this device makes a perfect desk for your laptop, it also has several other uses, including:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>TV Dinner Tray<br>\r\nProjector Table<br>\r\nStanding Desk<br>\r\nBook Tray<br>\r\nWriting Desk<br>\r\nTablet Holder<br>\r\nStanding Desk/Stand Up Desk</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package Includes:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 x Folding Table<br>\r\n1 x Mouse Plate<br>\r\n2 x Radiator Fans<br>\r\n1 x Installation Instruction</p>\r\n',0,'1',1.59,42,26,49,99.99,59.99,'25','1','1','2','1599477409laptop_table_stand_adjustable.jpg','1599477409laptop_table_stand_adjustable1.jpg','1599477409laptop_table_stand_adjustable2.jpg','1599477409laptop_table_stand_adjustable3.jpg','1599477409laptop_table_stand_adjustable4.jpg','16024837665917laptop_table.jpg','16024837665917laptop_table1.jpg','laptab0001-2010281603887836.mp4','1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-09-07 11:16:49'),(546,'Waterproof Outdoor Garden Solar Power Security Wall Light - 118 LED Lamp with PIR Motion Sensor Activated',0,0,'waterproof-outdoor-garden-solar-power-security-wall-light-118-led-lamp-with-pir-motion-sensor-activated','outsolig0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000611759843.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.5ed321c9iKVTLr&algo_pvid=2460265c-754d-4e17-a0e2-a4178d1ea669&algo_expid=2460265c-754d-4e17-a0e2-a4178d1ea669-1&btsid=0bb0623f15994600779351603e4d48&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<ul>\r\n <li>One Light for The Whole Yard: 118 LED Brightest Solar Light on the Market, equals to 3~4 normal solar lights of other brands. This solar lights with 118 super bright LED beads & 270°wide lighting angle provides excellent illumination and larger illumination coverage (up to 430ft?2;)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Never Worry About Lights Out of Power: A button on the front of solar light is convenient for you to change 3 lighting modes according to your need. If the low battery indicator turns red, it indicates that the battery is out of power, you need to charge it under direct sunlight.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Charging 3.5 Hours for All Night Lighting: 1.8w solar panel provides up to 19.5% conversion rate; after fully charged, built-in 2200mAh rechargeable lithium battery offers all night accompany to light up anywhere of your home.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>PIR Sensor Sense Even A Cat: for the safety of your family, especially kids running at night we cares about the safety of our customers, thus 118 led solar lights use upgraded PIR sensor offers 6-8 meter sensing range and no blind area like other brands.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Last for More Than 3 Years & IP67 Waterproof: IP67 waterproof, heat-resistant & frost-resistant LITOM solar light outdoors can withstand all kinds of extreme weather conditions.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>We have been testing for thousands of times for the research innovative real IP67 waterproof level on outdoor solar lights, Solar powered motion lights can withstand all kinds of extreme weather conditions.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Your Solar Security Lights Outdoor  -The motion detection is sensitive enough to provide perfect lighting to illuminate any surroundings.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,'1',0.179,130,100,55,70,65,'40','1','1','2','1599478093ae01_alicdn_com520H9fa119468f9846ca8228fc2485870f81o.jpg','15