shaped eyebrows without plucking, waxing or threading, with a </strong>razor that is designed not to cut or irritate the skin. <br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Perfect for both men and women.<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Designed to be Pain-Free.<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Salon style results at a FRACTION of the price.<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Can be used above, below or between your brows.<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also works wonders on the delicate upper lip area, chin and cheek, back of neck between haircuts and bikini line! If you have an unwanted hair, use it there!<br>\r\n<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<h1><strong><big>How to use?</big></strong><br>\r\n </h1>\r\n\r\n<p>Place at a slight 45-degree angle against clean, dry skin. Working against the hair growth, glide the Brow Shaper across your skin in short strokes. Don&#39;t add too much pressure- a gentle glide is all you need. After each use, wipe the Brow Shaper clean. <br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Not only is it a hair removal tool, but it is also a dermaplaning tool! Dermaplaning is a method of exfoliations that gently removes the top layer of dulling dead skin cells in order to reveal a smoother, brighter complexion. Once the dead skin cells and hair is removed, your favourite skincare products can be absorbed much more effectively and make-up can sit much more evenly on this smooth surface! <br>\r\n<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Why not try the Brow Shaper elsewhere? <br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p>This tool is not only fantastic for the brows but also works wonders on any area including: Upper Lip, Peach Fuzz/Side Burns. Chin, Uneven hairline, Shaping stubble, Back of Neck, Knuckles, Toes, Bikini Line<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p>A safe, gentle, easy and effective way to shape and sculpt eyebrows without an eyebrow stencil.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package Included:</strong><br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p>1*Eyebrow Razor Blades.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Notes:</strong><br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Due to the difference between different monitors, th