ut worries of replacing filters.</li>\r\n <li>Safer & Easier-- LED ring light kit utilize dichromatic LED which enable you to customize your color temperature and brightness level via simply rotation. It is safer and more convenient without worries of replacing filters.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Flexible Angle Adjust handle?-- Video lighting designs with an angle adjusting handle. You can adjust any angle as you like for portrait, makeup, YouTube videos, Studio shoot, video blogging,7 feet Foldable tripod Stand</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Widely Compatible-- With a 360 degree rotated smartphone holder, you can angle vertically or horizontally without taking the phone out of the holder.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>PHONE HOLDER AND 7\"feet tripod - Each Ring Light has a rotating (360 degrees) phone holder and a retractable tripod that effortlessly helps you capture different levels of brightness and angles of lighting! The phone holder is suitable for most smartphones.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>USB Cable Powered</li>\r\n <li>This ring light needs to be plugged into to a USB Port to light up, it works with computer, laptop, power bank, and wall charger.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Flexible Phone Holder</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The flexible arm phone holder can be adjusted to any angle (face downwards, portrait and landscape) to free your hands. It is spring-loaded and compatible with almost ALL smartphones with or without a case.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1536381242.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>RING LIGHT WITH USB - High power 10W Ring LED is suitable for most devices that support USB ports, such as laptops, PCs, mobile power, USB chargers, AC adapters, etc.There are four buttons on the selfie ring light, which can be turned on / off, switch the lighting mode and adjust the brightness level, it is easy to fin