e cream machine which is of 600 ml  which is absolutely fast for making ice cream and yogurt at your finger tips. This product has some exclusively great features like  the removal paddle stirred uniform, it has powerful motor and with unique paddle designs which works more efficiently to make ice cream quickly. It has  a key switch with  full copper motor with button operation with excellent streamlined process. It has a  small double leaf imitation low speed stirring,  which makes the creamy texture more smooth. The capacity is about 600ml . weight of 1.5 kg uses power only 7 watts. It has a Thick liner using food-grade aluminum which freezes faster, which is very  Safe and easy to clean with anti-sticking rust.  It has a powerful motor and unique paddle design which  mixes more efficiently to make ice cream quickly at your tips. It Includes a double-insulated freezer bowl with integrated cooling liquid with an automatic design which is  Built with a digital timer helps the Electric Ice cream maker to function automatically very fast at  the Present times, after which automatically it stops. So  there  is no need to wait to switch off & you  are free to do other work at the same time while making the ice cream. you can eat and fresh by not keeping it for many days . it is the best best quality, durable & trusted ice cream maker.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1286740472.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The most important steps that needs to be followed while making the ice cream are that You need to Freeze the Ice Cream Bowl of the Machine in Double Door or Above Refrigerator Freezer for 12-18 Hrs and in  Single Door Refrigerator it will also work but you have to give  it some time.  i have been using it for 2 weeks now. It has been  very efficient and handy.  This product is a must have for every kitchen.  beat part is that the components of this mixer such as the transparent lid, paddle and the inner bowl can be separated from the