he operation of the mixer.  It does not matter how much you make too can make more from this ice cream maker. It has a chilled aluminium bowl with an automatic rotating spatula for you. The machine has a lot to do with the quality and taste of your ice cream making the ice cream more delicious . You will find that It is mostly the ingredients and consistency which you are  using that will determine the end result. I have been very lucky in using this producT.  I can  assure that you too will have a  good experience with it - If any difficulty you face you can follow all</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The guidelines given in the instruction booklet which will be given to you . Make sure that that the coolant in the inner cooling bucket has to be frozen solid by putting the bucket inside the freezer for at least the time given above - gently tilting it will tell if the coolant is frozen solid,  use Amul cream in a ratio of one : one of full cream milk or less - meaning more cream, works well with all. You can also attempt a little experimentation if needed to find out the mix that works,  the ice cream mix has to be really cold, a slurry that is close to frozen, the machine has to be running while pouring the slurry in otherwise it freezes solid on contact and the paddle will not turn, please keep the amount of ice cream limited to about 600 or 700 ml, 6 - if lots of ice cream needs to be produced it might be an idea to buy a second freezing bucket to enjoy. It will definitely turn out well if the Ingredients are absolutely suitable in their  place.  This is a magic machine that turns anything into ice cream.<br>\r\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1920188018.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>It will be perfect with a bit of practice. you can  Use air tight container to pre chill the mix. If you want  to keep the semisolid content that comes out of the ice cream maker again in the freezer,  then use air tight container again. Preventing moisture from entering the mix at both these stages is the key. I can assure you tht with appliances you can make a perfect ice cream at your finger tip.</p>\r\n',0,'1',1.5,215,215,220,199.99,109.99,'50','1','1','2','1599742878Homemade_ice_Cream_Machine.jpg','1599742878Homemade_ice_Cream_Machine1.jpg','1599742878Homemade_ice_Cream_Machine2.jpg','1599742878Homemade_ice_Cream_Machine3.jpg','1599742878Homemade_ice_Cream_Machine4.jpg','16025684823325household_ice_cream_maker.jpg','16025684823325household_ice_cream_maker1.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-09-10 13:01:18'),(565,'Carbon Fiber RFID Blocking Credit Card Holder for Men - Minimalist Wallet',0,21,'carbon-fiber-rfid-blocking-credit-card-holder-for-men-minimalist-wallet','minimawalet0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000238437931.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.3e557a87Qa9uPr&algo_pvid=a8ab189d-6b3b-4f99-92ea-e6e001e41e24&algo_expid=a8ab189d-6b3b-4f99-92ea-e6e001e41e24-5&btsid=0bb0624215997246579558113e6056&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<p><strong>PROTECTION from RFID THEFT</strong>: In this rapidly evolving digital age, the money in your bank is at constant risk. RFID Blocking Anti-Theft Card Holders ensures blocking of unwanted RFID scanners and hence digital theft. The holder comes with RFID Blocking Mechanism which prevents unauthorized access to your credit/debit or even metro or ID cards.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>DESIGN</strong>: This new age wallet is designed for the smart you. It’s minimalist design allows you to keep it either in your front pocket or your handbag for daily use. It can hold 12 Credit/Debit cards in two slot or 10-12 Business/Visiting cards. The money clip on the front side makes it a perfect holder for office, gym, shopping malls, or just for a walk. Its durability makes it convenient for everyday commuters and travellers. It has a special pocket to keep your money safe as well.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>EASY, SLIDE UP ACCESS</strong>: A quick and easy action 