mfort in mind. The bathtub provides plenty of space for your baby to safely bath and play</li>\r\n <li>Innovative & unique design that can be folded and stored in a small space. Your best companion for travel and easy storage</li>\r\n <li>Equipped with strong support legs with non-slippery material that makes it usable on any flat surface</li>\r\n <li>Experience safe bathing with this tub; the curved edges provide extreme comfort and safety.</li>\r\n <li>Safety 1st - Designed as per safety standards and made out of the best plastic material to give a strong and safe Product to your little one</li>\r\n <li><strong>Grows with your Baby</strong> -It can be adjusted with the growth of your Baby! Can be used as a bathtub when your baby starts sitting independently. Ideal for 0-3 years baby</li>\r\n <li><strong>Temperature Sensitive Plug</strong> – Bubble double bathtub comes with a Temperature-sensitive Plug which changes the color if the temperature of the water in the baby tub is hot.</li>\r\n <li><strong>Innovative Design </strong>- Innovative & unique design that can be folded and stored in a small space. Your best companion for travel and easy storage.</li>\r\n <li><strong>Strong support Legs </strong>- Equipped with strong support legs with non-slippery material that makes it usable on any flat surface</li>\r\n <li><strong>Safety 1st</strong> - Designed as per safety standards and made out of the best plastic material to give a strong and safe Product to your little one</li>\r\n <li><strong>Grows with your Baby</strong> -It can be adjusted with the growth of your Baby! Can be used as a bathtub when your baby starts sitting independently. Ideal for 0-3 years baby</li>\r\n <li><strong>Temperature Sensitive Plug</strong> – Bubble double bathtub comes with a Temperature-sensitive Plug which changes the color if the temperature of the water in the baby tub is hot.</li>\r\n <li><strong>Innovative Design</strong> - Innovative & unique design that can be folded and stored in a small space. Your best companion for travel and easy storage.</li>\r\n <li><strong>Strong support Legs</strong> - Equipped with strong support legs with non-slippery material that makes it usable on any flat surface.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Ergonomic design</strong>: This bathtub for baby features an Infant hammock sling inside the tub and holds a growing baby better during bath time</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1597122440.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Stability</strong>: Non-slip design on the bottom of supporting legs stable supporting rack and safety lock.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Soft & Safe Materials</strong>: Non-toxic PP, practical, durable, allow you to bathe baby anywhere you go, easy to use, and clean. Ideal for babies between 0 to 8 years.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>The bathtub is foldable</strong>. It is small in size and easy to store. It can be placed in a small space such as the bottom of the bed or the corner of the wall to save space.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Scope of application</strong>: Baby shower<br>\r\n<strong>Style</strong>: Folding<br>\r\n<strong>Colour</strong>: Blue, Pink<br>\r\n<strong>Weight</strong>: about 1.6kg<br>\r\n<strong>Size</strong>: 77*43*8.5<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Features:</strong><br>\r\nFoldable bathtub saves space<br>\r\nBuilt-in anti-skid layer, basin bottom insulation layer, anti-skid and <br>\r\nAnti-skid and wear-resistant.<br>\r\n </p>\r\n',0,'1',1.6,77,43,8.5,79.99,149.99,'50','1','1','1','1599821091baby_bath_tub_foldable.jpg','1599821091baby_bath_tub_foldable1.jpg','1599821091baby_bath_tub_foldable2.jpg','1599821091baby_bath_tub_foldable3.jpg','1599821091baby_bath_tub_foldable4.jpg','','','babybathtu0001-2010281603888734.mp4','1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-09-11 10:44:51'),(568,'Ultrasonic 1000ML Air Humidifier Diffuser - Mute & 7 Color Night Light Mini Mist Maker & Home Purifier',0,21,'ultrasonic-1000ml-air-humidifier-diffuser-mute-7-color-night-light-mini-mist-maker-home-purifier','homehumid0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/33016291857.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.2ffd6821JtukLh&s=p&ad_pvid=2020091100035114118502585932900007921083_2&algo_pvid=f4226524-9428-4c20-9a79-24d76dbef132&algo_expid=f4226524-9428-4c20-9a79-24d76dbef132-9&btsid=0bb0622915998078316883704eb8a5&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<p>The Ultrasonic Air Humidifier Diffuser- Mini Mist Maker & Home Purifier has a very unique design as it has three procedures of purifying the water and air to produce better mist. The light design is a clearer way to know the condition of the machine. The stepless knob make it available to blow the mist according to the personal need.There is a hidden space for aroma making it can be used as an aromatherapy diffuser without erosion of the water tank.Features:The water tank has equipped with multiple processes of purifying to produce purer mist.The light alert design can show the state of machine clearly. Stepless knob can provide different amount of mist according to personal need.It has a huge capacity which can work for a long time without replenishing.The humidifier blows mist from a high position in 360 degree to prevent the furniture from wetting.There is a hidden space for aroma making it can be used as an aromatherapy diffuser without erosion of the water tank.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/76806922.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Powerful Functions</strong>: 1L water tank, soft7 colour night light, and auto shut-off when waterless and tank lifted up, surrounding you with clean air evenly and safely.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Ultra-quiet Working Process</strong>: Intelligent air inlet design, FCC certificated and BPA FREE you a quiet use, perfect for baby room or nursery.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Easy Refill Design</strong>: Remove the lid to add cool water directly into the water tank, making refills and cleaning easier than the traditional humidifiers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Soft Night Light</strong>: Press and hold the light button to create a gentle glow and smoothly adjust the night light, perfect for night time breastfeeding and to help babies get a restful sleep.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Operation Instruction</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Press the switch 1st time: light + spray</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Press the switch 2nd time: Fixed color+Spray</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Press the switch 3rd time: Spray + the light closed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Press the switch 4th time: colourful night light + Spray end.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Press the swith 2 seconds: close the Humidifier</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/394003042.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tips:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. The voltage used by this product is DC-5V. Please ensure that the working power supply is 5V DC power supply.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. If you do not use this product for a long time, please keep the water tank clean, and wash the water rod to dry and unplug the power supply.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. It is recommended to use pure water. don&#39;t add essential oils to the humidifier?clean the water storage box once a month.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> 4. If there is abnormal sound or the water mist is obviously smaller, please re-water the water tank after shutting down.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For the first time, put the Cotton Core into the water for 3~5 minutes, let the Cotton Core completely penetrate the water, then put it into use .</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Specifications:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Product name: Ultrasonic Air Humidifier Diffuser- Mini Mist Maker & Home Purifier</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Product size: 10.3*10.3*21.8cm</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Product weight: 500g</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Voltage: DC5V</p>\r\