nterfered by it. The humidifier is so Whisper-quiet with elegant mist</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>ECO- FRIENDLY</strong> - Environmental friendly ABS and PP, nontoxic, odour-free, corrosion resistant and durable.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>HUMIDIFIER </strong>- Nebelr Cool Mist Ultrasonic Humidifier effectively increases room humidity levels and improves Air condition. It humidifies the air, breathe easier, and relieve cough and sinus congestion due to colds, allergies, and flu. Humidifier is designed to work perfectly in Car, Office cabin or small room to maintain humidity, freshness and air quality. It helps get rid of dry air, increasing the air humidity, and keeps your skin fresh, healthy, and wet.</li>\r\n <li><strong>BENEFITS</strong> - Reduces allergy, dry skin, itching, snoring and air dryness. Relieves stress, eye fatigue and headache. Improve sleep quality and keep your skin moisturized.</li>\r\n <li> <strong>PERSONAL SKIN CARE MOISTURIZING</strong> - Ultra-fine water mist can soften and moisten dry and chapped skin in winters. Also, helps you breathe fresh and moist air when sleeping with Air conditioner on in summers too.</li>\r\n <li><strong>TWO MIST MODES</strong> - Continuously spray works for 9 hours Water level window helps you check the water capacity.</li>\r\n <li><strong>SUPER QUIET</strong> – Using Ultrasonic Technology, Nebelr Humidifier is extremely quiet when working. AUTO SHUT OFF - Nebelr Humidifier provides a safe Auto shut off for preventing dry running. Humidifier will turn off automatically when water runs out</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>                       <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1664145215.png\" xss=removed>                                                                                                                                   </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Powerful Functions</strong>: 1L water tank, soft7 colour night light, and auto shut-off when waterless and tank lifted up, surrounding you with clean air evenly and safely.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Ultra-quiet Working Process</strong>: Intelligent air inlet design, FCC certificated and BPA FREE you a quiet use, perfect for baby room or nursery.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Easy Refill Design</strong>: Remove the lid to add cool water directly into the water tank, making refills and cleaning easier than the traditional humidifiers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Soft Night Light</strong>: Press and hold the light button to create a gentle glow and smoothly adjust the night light, perfect for night time breastfeeding and to help babies get a restful sleep.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Operation Instruction</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Press the switch 1st time: light + spray</li>\r\n <li>Press the switch 2nd time: Fixed color+Spray</li>\r\n <li>Press the switch 3rd time: Spray + the light closed.</li>\r\n <li>Press the switch 4th time: colourful night light + Spray end.</li>\r\n <li>Press the swith 2 seconds: close the Humidifier</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/900605961.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tips:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. The voltage used by this product is DC-5V. Please ensure that the working power supply is 5V DC power supply.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. If you do not use this product for a long time, please keep the water tank clean, and wash the water rod to dry and unplug the power supply.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. It is recommended to use pure water. don&#39;t add essential oils to the humidifier?clean the water storage box once a month.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> 4. If there is abnormal sound or the water mist is obviously smaller, please re-water the water tank after shutting down.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n',0,'1',0.5,10.3,10.3,21.8,79.99,49.99,'100','1','1','1','1599821747air_humidifier_and_diffuser.jpg','1599821747air_humidifier_and_diffuser1.jpg','1599821747air_humidifier_and_diffuser2.jpg','1599821747air_humidifier_and_diffuser3.jpg','1599821747air_humidifier_and_diffuser4.jpg','16025710722237Air_Humidifier_Diffuser.jpg','','homehumid0001-2010281603890187.mp4','1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-09-11 10:55:47'),(569,'Mini Rechargeable Fingerprint Padlock - Smart Key-less Padlock Anti-Theft Security for Door, Luggage & Small Box Lock',0,21,'mini-rechargeable-fingerprint-padlock-smart-key-less-padlock-anti-theft-security-for-door-luggage-small-box-lock','padlock0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000591032722.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.6bde3081qbjoOK&algo_pvid=d0a802ce-a792-46d8-91a4-a199320ebf13&algo_expid=d0a802ce-a792-46d8-91a4-a199320ebf13-34&btsid=0bb0623c15998032637165794e2f4b&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>It is a portable smart lock. and its size allows the lock to be carried to everywhere you want. Powerful smart universal fingerprint lock is suitable for outdoor and indoor, such as house door, gym, gate, warehouse, cabinet, shed, suitcase, handbag, box, bike, bicycle, luggage, fence, garage, office, and etc.</li>\r\n <li>Say \"Bye Bye\" to keys and cumbersome combinations. Never worry about losing your key or forgetting passwords. Your finger is the key, and it only takes 0.5 second unlock it. The smart lock can record up to 10 different fingerprints (2 Administrator+8 Users).</li>\r\n <li>Up to IP62 rated weatherproof electronic lock is resistant to water and dust efficiently. Suitable for both indoor and outdoor use. Body is made of Zinc alloy and the lock beam is made of stainless steel for superior cut resistance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1924975034.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Time Office is One of the leading Biometric brand In India. Our aim is to bring new, unique and good quality products for our customers. We believe in quality. Time Office L25 fingerprint lock built on a unique technology and the highlights of the product are as below 1. Fingerprint Padlock can be unlocked with your fingerprints in just a second ! 2. Key-less design provides flexibility and makes it easier for you as you don’t have to worry about the keys. 3. It can record up to 10 fingerprints for managers and multiple users. 4. The product is different from ordinary locks in the market. It is key-less and has no complicated app operation. It only needs simple fingerprint record and deletion. 5. Smart padlock is equipped with lower power consumption and long standby time. When the battery is out of power, the smart lock will remain locked and can be restored by simply connecting the lock to the power by Micro-USB Port. 6. Fingerprint Padlock only weighs about 98 grams. Mini size makes it more portable and convenient. you could even put it in your pocket. Wide Applications : Smart universal fingerprint lock is suitable for outdoor and indoor, such as - house door, - gym, - gate -, warehouse, - cabinet, - shed, -suitcase, - handbag, - box, -bike, - bicycle -, luggage, - fence, - garage, -office, and etc. 7. Intelligent Padlock supports 360 degree arbitrary square pressing fingerprint recognition with a resolution of 500 DPI. When smart padlock is in a low battery state, Red light will blink in every minute. hardened body and fingerprint recognition technology for strength and security, Prevent from being pried or smashed or cut.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1225210613.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>OPENS IN LESS THAN A SECOND</strong> - Say goodbye to cumbersome password combinations to open locks, you can now unlock your smart padlock with your finger in a split second. Latch Mini has an amazing fingerprint sensor that reads and opens at the speed of ‘flash’. The outer case of this lock is made up of non-slippery weather-resistant silicone material with a coating of yellow colour which makes it more appealing and attractive.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>SLEEK & SECURE PADLOCK WITH STURDY STRUCTURE</strong> - A new, intuitive, powerful smart lock that is revolutionized with advanced technology that opens at the touch of your finger. A lock that can’t be picked- it’s too smart and too strong. Made with durable materials (Zinc alloy and Steel 303 SUS) and designed with muscle in mind, it is IP65 weatherproof made for secure unlocking and works seamlessly in any weather condition.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>REMEMBERS WHO YOU ARE AND WHO YOU TRUST</strong> - A smart lock with a stubborn memory. Latch Mini will remember your unique fingerprint and detect you immediately. You can also program it to remember up to 19 of your trusted friends. So, you can share access without having to have keys exchanged. Latch Mini makes it possible for you to share your lock’s access with other trusted friends&#39; and family. The ideal choice for family friends and small teams without the hassle of creating duplicate keys.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>LONG-LASTING RECHARGEABLE BATTERY</strong> - Latch Mini comes with a 3.7V, 150mAh, 0.55Wh rechargeable Lithium polymer. Enjoy a long battery life of 3 months on 2hrs of a single charge. Charging is made easy, via USB cable to remove the hassle of changing batteries. The lock also comes with an indicator that gives you a reminder to recharge when the battery is low, ahead of time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>SMALL IN SIZE; MANY APPLICATIONS</strong> - A modular body that fits perfectly in your palm, Latch Mini will do its job to protect any place, space, and case you have. From your door to your backpack, there is no limit to what it can protect. It can be used to lock your Bikes, Suitcase, Laptop Bags, Sports Gear, Toolbox, Trekking/Camping Gear, Gym Lockers and School Lockers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/420355493.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Go to App Store or Play store type “Aran Lock” and click Install.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Open the app > Sign up using the required information “Note: You will receive an OTP on your registered mobile number”</p>\r\n\r\n<p>After you enter the OTP, you will receive an e-mail verification. Click on the link in your mailbox to complete the verification.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Unbox the lock & scan the QR code behind the box.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Follow steps 1 and 2 (change the username and password in your hotspot settings)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Pick the lock & press the “Side button” twice, you will see a blue light blinking. Wait for the blue light to stabilise, tap on connect via hotspot and setup the admin name & register the admin fingerprint Note: Your Admin Fingerprint & App login is the MASTER KEY of Aran Lock</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Place your fingerprint thrice and you will see a green light indication once it is registered successfully.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Important:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Now go to settings > mobile hotspot settings > configure your default hotspot name & password</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Configure Home/Office Wi-Fi network</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Go to menu> click on settings >click Wi-Fi router settings</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Enter the username and password of your WiFi/Router Note: Once done, you can turn off the hotspot and connect the device to your home/office WiFi Important: WiFi range may not be as effective as other devices due to steal body, please keep the lock closer to the router</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Note: Once all the process is done, please change your mobile hotspot to the same credentials for the next successful connection.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Remote unlock from anywhere anytime</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Note: Lock should be connected with home/office Wi-Fi to perform remote unlock</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Ask the visitor to press the side button thrice.</li>\r\n <li>Go to the home screen and click the Wi-Fi icon and click on the unlock option.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1968908411.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Application</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Padlock is best used as a school Locker lock and gym lock, suitable for suitcases, golf bags, handbags, school lockers, furniture, wardrobes, bicycle ect.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Easy Operation</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>NO app, NO key, NO Bluetooth. Friendly to kids and elderly, your finger is the key which discourages the thief to crack the code.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Advanced fingerprint identification</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The lock locker adopts the advanced fingerprint identification chip,Quick unlock in 0.5 seconds. It can collect 2 administrators and up to 10 fingerprints total, easy to use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Security Lock for Locker</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Smart lock is made of aluminium alloy metal body and stainless steel shackle for superior cut resistance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specifications</strong>:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Material: zinc alloy</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Working voltage: 3.0-4.2V</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Lock weight and Size:90g,7.6*4.6*1.3(cm)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. Fingerprint sensor coverage: 72*64MM</p>\r\n\r\n<p>5. Unlock speed: within 1 second</p>\r\n\r\n<p>6. working period: a year per power Charge</p>\r\n\r\n<p>7. LED light: three color light: red / blue / green</p>\r\n\r\n<p>8. Battery: 3.7V lithium build in battery</p>\r\n\r\n<p>9. Working temperature: -10~+40 degrees Celsius</p>\r\n\r\n<p>10. Fingerprint capacity: record 10 times and save 10 groups</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/205091409.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Other instructions:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Charge</strong>: Red LED always on in charging, red led off when full charged?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Low battery alarm: If the battery is too low, the red led is flashing after unlocking, please charge soon.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Power usage</strong>: can unlock 8000 times when full battery, can max unlock 100 times after low battery alarm.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Emergency unlock</strong>: If the battery to low, they can’t unlock, please connect MICRO USB cable to unlock and then charge at once.</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.09,7.6,4.6,1.3,99.99,49.99,'100','1','1','1','1599822716finger_print_pad_lock.jpg','1599822716finger_print_pad_lock1.jpg','1599822716finger_print_pad_lock2.jpg','1599822716finger_print_pad_lock3.jpg','1599822716finger_print_pad_lock4.jpg','16025715968545Manual.jpg','',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-09-11 11:11:56'),(570,'Mini Portable Bluetooth Speakers - LED USB Radio FM MP3 Stereo Sound Speaker for Computer & Mobile Phone',0,21,'mini-portable-bluetooth-speakers-led-usb-radio-fm-mp3-stereo-sound-speaker-for-computer-mobile-phone','bluespeaker0001','http://aliexpress.com/item/4000953727883.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.73027dfeGIHjIb&algo_pvid=93a44358-d1be-49ee-a770-4fe99c3d02d0&algo_expid=93a44358-d1be-49ee-a770-4fe99c3d02d0-6&btsid=0bb0622e15998112248458039e3b6b&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<p><strong> </strong>The portable<strong> </strong>Bluetooth speaker is  with stylish appearance is, but also durable too .Bluetooth wireless transmission, support hands-free calling small body drive, large capacity, super loud volume, strong and powerful treble Support audio output, can be connected to computer, mobile phone, MP3 and other audio interfaces.  It  Supports  TF card auto-play function , Bluetooth Speaker With Led Lights Is Compatible With Pc, Laptop, Mp3/4 Player, Micros, UBS Flash Drive And Any Audio Device That Is Bluetooth Compatible Portable design convenient for you to carry with, enjoy music at any time and at any places. The   large capacity battery provides long-term playing   It is built-in HD sensitivity microphone. It is  Ideal for in-car calling or work-place use.  The HFP, HSP, Asp, AVRCP, CVC technologies support for y