ring use, effectively solve the problem of hair knot. Tip has a larger contact surface and gently protects your scalp<br>\r\n 3.    Promote blood circulation, relieve fatigue, strengthen brain and develop intelligence, improve sleep quality.<br>\r\n4     Long-term use can reduce hair loss effectively, relieve headaches and dizziness.<br>\r\n5     Portable Design, enjoy a massage experience at anytime anywhere.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>6.    Ergonomic design for better handing experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>7.   The real colour of the item may be slightly different from the pictures shown on caused by many factors. such as brightness of your monitor and light brightness.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/550799361.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>SPECIFICATIONS:</strong><br>\r\n             Combs hair, relieve stress, hair SPA, hair massage Style: Electric hair comb ,brush, massage<br>\r\n              Suitable for all types of hair</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Massages your scalp  electric detangling massage hair brush for all hair types. Massage scalp stimulates blood flow bringing healthy nutrients to the hair follicles, generate blood circulation, relieve fatigue, strengthen brain and develop intelligence, improve sleep quality. Long-term use can reduce hair loss effectively, relieve headaches and dizziness</li>\r\n <li>More healthier the electric massage comb is made from high quality ABS environmental material, skin friendly and durable. Clean hair scalp, strengthen hair roots and help hair grow smoothly. improve sleep quality and helping you combat fatigue and feel more energized in all day. Relax your head, improve your mood and eliminate stress</li>\r\n <li>Portable design-easy to use: compact and lightweight design makes it easy to use and convenient to carry. At just approx. 7.5 x 10.5cm / 2.95 x 4.13inch, this mini brush easily tucks into a carry-on bag or purse without taking