e a beautiful hair and a health care massage for your head. This hair straightened is of dual voltage:110V-230V.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Healthy: Using the power of technology to make straight hair and replenish, rejuvenate, strengthen your hair by reducing frizz and static electricity build-up. Anti scald with heat protection, detangling brush for natural cool hair style .Multifunction: This fast hair straightened is a combination of ceramic iron straightened + detangling brush + Anion hair massager. We&#39;ve merged a ceramic plate straightened flat iron, hair detangles brush, and anion hair massager together to give your head the benefits of all three into one versatile and portable mini hair brushes set.  I can assure you that you get a lot of help from this brush , instead of going to the saloon you can also use it at home and get the saloon look at once .</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>TIPS FOR USING:-</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Before using a negative ion styling comb, if the hair is dry, the hair may be slightly wet.<br>\r\n2. If used after shampooing. Please blow your hair to 70% dry.<br>\r\n3. Turn on the power switch and confirm that the negative ion indicator is lit.<br>\r\n4. From the beginning of the hair to the beginning of the slow combing, the middle long hair crowd, it is recommended to use the time of about 4 minutes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/269601613.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>CLEANING AND MAINTENANCE:-</strong><br>\r\n1. Store the product in a safe and dry environment, avoid direct sunlight, so as not to cause cracking and aging of the product.<br>\r\n2. Do not scrape with hard objects to avoid surface scratching and affect the appearance.<br>\r\n3. When cleaning, clean the comb with a dry/wet cloth. Do not invade the comb and do not rinse it under the tap.<br>\r\n4. When cleaning, the comb pad is removed from the comb, and the dust or hair on the styling comb is cleaned with a finger brush. It can be rinsed under the faucet, naturally dried and confirmed that the comb pad is completely dry and then returned to the comb.<br>\r\n5. Do not use corrosive liquids to clean the comb pads, as this may damage the product.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Long-term use can effectively reduce hair loss, relieve headaches and dizziness.</li>\r\n <li>Promotes blood circulation of the scalp layer, relieves the pressure on the head.</li>\r\n <li>Functioning anti-static, anti-scald and anti-hair broken, the hair straightened efficiently help to solve hair knotting, reduce pain and hair broken.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tips for using:-</strong><br>\r\n 1. Before using a negative ion styling comb, if the hair is dry, the hair may be slightly wet.<br>\r\n2. If used after shampooing. Please blow your hair to 70% dry.<br>\r\n3. Turn on the power switch and confirm that the negative ion indicator is lit.<br>\r\n4. From the beginning of the hair to the beginning of the slow combing, the middle long hair crowd, it is recommended to use the time of about 4 minutes.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Cleaning and maintenance:-</strong><br>\r\n1. Store the product in a safe and dry environment, avoid direct sunlight, so as not to cause cracking and aging of the product.<br>\r\n2. Do not scrape with hard objects to avoid surface scratching and affect the appearance.<br>\r\n3. When cleaning, clean the comb with a dry/wet cloth. Do not invade the comb and do not rinse it under the tap.<br>\r\n4. When cleaning, the comb pad is removed from the comb, and the dust or hair on the styling comb is cleaned with a finger brush. It can be rinsed under the faucet, naturally dried and confirmed that the comb pad is completely dry and then returned to the comb.<br>\r\n5. Do not use corrosive liquids to clean the comb pads, as this may damage the product.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/671350174.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>       Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Portable Light-weight Design: Enjoy a massage experience at anytime anywhere.</li>\r\n <li>Inheriting the meridian principle of traditional chinese medicine.</li>\r\n <li>Promote blood circulation, relieve fatigue, strengthen brain and develop intelligence, improve sleep quality</li>\r\n <li>Long-term use can reduce hair loss effectively, relieve headaches and dizziness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>       Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Item: Electric Massage Comb</li>\r\n <li>Material: ABS +Stainless Steel</li>\r\n <li>Size: Approx.13x 7x 5cm /5.12 X 2.76 X 1.97in.</li>\r\n <li>Power Supply: 1*AAA battery(Not Include)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>     <strong>Package included:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>1*hairbrush</strong></li>\r\n <li><strong>1*box package</strong></li>\r\n <li><strong>1* user manual</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,'1',0.14,14,7,5.5,69.99,49.99,'100','1','1','1','1600171725women_ionic_hair_brush.jpg','1600171725women_ionic_hair_brush1.jpg','1600171725women_ionic_hair_brush2.jpg','1600171725women_ionic_hair_brush3.jpg','1600171725women_ionic_hair_brush4.jpg','16025750327207portable_electric_ionic_hairbrush.jpg','','ionichairbru0001-2010291603972734.mp4','1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-09-15 12:08:45'),(579,'36cm Swing Balance Board - Stable Plate for Yoga & Exercise Sport',0,0,'36cm-swing-balance-board-stable-plate-for-yoga-exercise-sport','HSBBoard001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000472735540.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.198c5cf0pKKVkH&algo_pvid=cff64896-481f-4bbb-b627-e71906aef830&algo_expid=cff64896-481f-4bbb-b627-e71906aef830-7&btsid=0bb0600116000708705425678e2eed&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<p><strong>BALANCE BOARD</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The swing  balance board is of  40 cm which is made by good materials