ikes to exercise and wants to lose weight. Let’s discover our pilates fitness circle and improve your muscle tone, flexibility and fitness. Compare with similar items.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1143473796.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specification:</strong><br>\r\n<strong>Diameter</strong>: 39cm/15.35&#39;&#39;<br>\r\n<strong>Circle width</strong>: 3cm/1.18&#39;&#39;<br>\r\n<strong>Material</strong>: NBR<br>\r\n<strong>Weight</strong>: 260g<br>\r\n<strong>Color</strong>: Black, Grey, Purple, Blue</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package Included</strong> - 1 x Yoga Pilates Ring <br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Note:  </strong><br>\r\nPlease allow 1-3mm differs due to manual measurement.<br>\r\nDue to the different display and different light, the picture may not show the actual color of the item. Thanks for your understanding.</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.3,39.4,38.6,5.2,39.99,29.99,'100','1','1','1','1600253710best_yoga_pilates_ring.jpg','1600253710best_yoga_pilates_ring1.jpg','1600253710best_yoga_pilates_ring2.jpg','1600253710best_yoga_pilates_ring3.jpg','1600253710best_yoga_pilates_ring4.jpg','','',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-09-16 10:55:10'),(585,'Lightweight EVA Yoga Block Great for Yoga and Improve Balance and Flexibility Perfect for Home or Gym',0,0,'lightweight-eva-yoga-block-great-for-yoga-and-improve-balance-and-flexibility-perfect-for-home-or-gym','Pilates001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/32900835374.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.75be4c5e7KnAcZ&algo_pvid=b1d806ef-a013-422b-b302-286c1c11f600&algo_expid=b1d806ef-a013-422b-b302-286c1c11f600-23&btsid=0bb0623e16001450656503003ec7f4&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<p>Yoga Block is becoming more and more popular as a kind of healthy exercise. Have you tried yoga exercises and are unable to perform certain yoga poses? Are your muscles tense or physical challenged when you fully stretch your body into a posture? Yoga blocks are the best choice for you to lessen the distance you have to stretch for extra support and stability Lightweight and Portable Suitable for both beginners and seasoned yogi’s .Non-Slip surface for a secure hold you can trust. Come with bevelled edges for a comfortable, steady grip. Large enough to comfortably sit on with sufficient surface. Specification: Material: Eva foam, Sizes: 9\"x6\"x4\" ,Weight: 200 Grams .Package included:2 x Yoga blocks.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1787414012.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>ADVANTAGES</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>High-density EVA material, an essential tool for practicing yoga.</li>\r\n <li>It can help beginners to support the body firmly, complete the movement accurately, and avoid part of the body tension caused by stiffness.</li>\r\n <li>Soft and solid surface brings you a relaxed and enjoyable yoga experience.</li>\r\n <li>The yoga block is made of environmentally friendly materials, which is not easy to breed bacteria, has good anti-slip performance, and is resistant to pressure and wear.</li>\r\n <li>Yoga blocks can assist in practicing difficult movements, help adjust posture, and prevent strain when muscle strength is not enough.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>PROVIDES YOU WITH:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>STABILITY & BALANCE:  EVA Yoga blocks provide the stability and balance needed in your practice to help with optimal alignment, deeper poses and increased strength. Yoga blocks provide the stability and balance needed in your practice to help with optimal alignment, deeper poses and increased strength</li>\r\n <li>DURABLE SUPPORTIVE FOAM: This lightweight and supportive foam blocks are constructed of durable foam with a nonslip surface and bevelled edges for easy gripping.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1635185022.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>MODIFY & ALIGN: Use under your hands, feet or seat (meditation) to ensure the proper alignment needed in order to safely support and modify poses to suit your level of flexibility - If you feel tight, don&#39;t risk injury and grab a block or two.  Use under your hands, feet or seat (meditation) to ensure the proper alignment needed in order to safely support and modify poses to suit your level of flexibility If you feel tight, don&#39;t risk injury and grab a block or two</li>\r\n <li>EXTEND & DEEPEN STRETCHES: Blocks make for the ideal yoga prop and companion, as they are an important tool in your practice to help extend, support and deepen your stretches while also working to increase your range of motion. Blocks make for the ideal yoga prop and companion, as they are an important tool in your practice to help extend, support and deepen your stretches while also working to increase your range of motion<strong>  </strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>???????<strong> FEATURES: </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>100% Non Toxic, non slip sweat resistant, light weight with high density, moisture proof</li>\r\n <li>CARE INFO: Spot clean with mild detergent - towel or air dry.</li>\r\n <li>DURABLE SUPPORTIVE FOAM: These lightweight and supportive foam blocks are constructed of a durable foam with a nonslip surface and bevelled edges for easy gripping. Premium blocks are 50 percentage denser than standard EVA blocks.</li>\r\n <li>Measuring 9 x 6x 4 inches, made of high-density and sturdy  foam for long-lasting durability</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">Featuring bevelled edges for soft, firm and easy griping and light in weight and non-slip even sweat</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">Make difficult yoga poses accessible to beginners and those with injuries or physical limitations</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">Moisture-proof to avoid growing bacteria and cleans easily with a little soap or detergent to wash away the odours</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">Easy to travel, perfect for at home use and in the studio</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/2001047611.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>HOUSE OF QUIRK YOGA BLOCKS –</strong> Help you achieve better flexibility, balance, comfort and stability! Yoga blocks are not just for beginner. Blocks can be used at any lever to achieve better flexibility, balance, comfort and stability. Blocks make difficult yoga poses accessible to beginners and those with injuries or physical limitations. What Are Yoga Blocks Used For Flexibility - The Gymnastic blocks can help keep your balance, it will then allow you to become more flexible as well. This is helpful for people who are having a hard time performing some poses that require a flexible body such as the half moon pose. To Provide Support - It can support your head and neck during lying positions or support your weight during sitting and standing positions. It can also help support various poses by allowing you to hold that poses longer and better. For Balance - It can help maintain balance. This is particularly helpful during standing, squatting, and sitting positions. This will help you find your centre of gravity easier so you can maintain your balanced position longer. For Longer and Comfortable Position - It can help you balance, become more flexible, and provide support for your weight it can therefore allow you to hold your poses for a longer time and stay comfortable in that position as well. Why Choose Our Yoga Blocks? Non-slip, waterproof, non-toxic - Improve overall flexibility at any practice level . Block supports your body to make difficult poses more accessible - Build your confidence with  yoga block .Available in 4 colours, size: 9\"x6\"x4\" .Lightweight yet sturdy foam block.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/634946788.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>SUPPORT YOUR STRETCH WITH HOUSE OF QUIRK YOGA BLOCKS</strong> : These lightweight and supportive foam blocks provide the stability needed for optimal alignment, extension for deeper poses and increased strength. Used under hands, feet or your seat, lightweight blocks will ensure proper alignment to safely support and modify poses to suit your level of flexibility.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Provides stability and balance to help with optimal alignment, deeper poses and increased strength.</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">Extend, support and deepen stretches while increasing range of motion.</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">Made from durable, supportive foam (Premium blocks are twice as dense)</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">Large enough to sit on comfortably for meditation practices.</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">Spot clean with mild detergent - towel or air dry (dimensions: 9\"W x 6\"H x 4\"D)</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">Sold as 2-Pack.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>NON-SLIP SURFACE :     </strong>If you feel tight, don&#39;t risk injury - grab a block or two and enjoy your yoga session with confidence. Constructed of a durable with a nonslip surface. Premium blocks are twice as dense as standard blocks. These durable, lightweight and supportive foam blocks with a non-slip surface provide the stability needed for optimal alignment, extension for deeper poses and increased strength.The supportive blocks help with everything from extending your reach to properly aligning your body or creating enhanced stability in a wide range of poses. Use the blocks separately or stacked together. Their modular design allows for placing them vertically, horizontally, or on their side (or a combination thereof when used together), which quickly creates a range of possibilities for extra height and support. Reposition the lightweight and easy-to-use blocks as needed for each pose in your practice—from side angle or seated pose to forward bend and beyond .Yoga blocks are perfect for Yoga, daily exercises, or physical therapy. These blocks are large enough to comfortably sit on. Great size for on-the-go, in the studio, or at home use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1418027692.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>LIGHTWEIGHT AND STURDY: Whether you&#39;re a beginner or advanced yogi, our high-density EVA foam brick offers exceptional stability, support and alignment for yoga, Pilates, and more. Weighing just under 3 ounces it to carry around and is the perfect brick to for use in any yoga class.</li>\r\n <li>COMPACT SIZE: The unique shape of this 12\" x 8\" x 2\" brick, makes it ideal for use in a variety of different postures. It is ideally sized to throw in a yoga bag to and from class, stacking neatly in the studio, or for home use.</li>\r\n <li>SAFE & EFFECTIVE: Improve your practice by using a brick to deepen your practice, maintain proper alignment, and help stay safe by reducing injury and muscle strain - this brick can help you do it all!</li>\r\n <li>COMFORT EDGES: The bevelled edges of this brick provide a soft, secure and comfortable grip.</li>\r\n <li>MOISTURE-PROOF: Offering double-duty practicality, the EVA foam material is non-slip and is made with closed cell technology, preventing moisture and bacteria.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1926085556.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>STABILITY & BALANCE:</strong> Yoga blocks provide the stability and balance needed in your practice to help with optimal alignment, deeper poses and increased strength.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>DURABLE SUPPORTIVE FOAM:</strong> This lightweight and supportive foam blocks are constructed of durable foam with a nonslip surface and bevelled edges for easy gripping.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>MODIFY & ALIGN</strong>: Use under your hands, feet or seat (meditation) to ensure the proper alignment needed in order to safely support 