amic game play over the course of 9 holes; Players move the included chipping mat around the play area and aim for the target main hole to score the most points just watch for the water and sand hazards.</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">Chipping iron not included<strong>:</strong> We made this game affordable so B.Y.O.C bring your own club; we recommend using a wedge, sand wedge or lob wedge for maximum enjoyment of battle chip.</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">Kids and adults<strong>:</strong> You don’t need to be a pro golfer to become battle chip champ it’s a hole in one for all skill levels</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">Improve Your Accuracy: Perfect your swing and important shot types including lob shots, pitch shots, chip shots, running shots, punch shots, and more.</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">Net: Made with a flexible frame and nylon netting, able to withstand many golf seasons of practice time and enjoyment.</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">Instant Setup: Targets setup in seconds and neatly store in the included carrying case.</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\"> Practice Anywhere: Use outdoors with real golf balls or indoor with foam balls.</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">Great Gift for Golfers: Comes in a full color retail box making it a great gift for golfers of all abilities.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> The 3-Layer Golfing Practice Net for kids and adults, indoor and outdoor. Perfect for golf beginners to practice hitting and chipping. Instantly open up and folds away in seconds, can be folded for more than 1000 times. Made from nylon netting and fiber support rod, lightweight and durable. Portable design with a free carry bag to carry and store it easily. Great for all lever golfers, help you improve your accuracy level. Unique design gives you different life experiences.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1748476127.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>PROVIDES YOU WITH :</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> <