 brightness .</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/331659493.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>3D PRINTING TECHNOLOGY<strong> - </strong>Remote Control Lunar Lamp is made by 3D printing technology. In accordance with the astronomical data, every mountain and crater on the lunar surface are reproduced. The realistic starry moon lamp makes your dream of touching the moon come into reality.</li>\r\n <li>REMOTE CONTROL & TAP CONTROL- The smart remote control has various functions such as adjustments of the brightness, colour, flicker mode and more. In addition to remote control and touch control. Interesting and convenient it is to change colours randomly with a light tap! </li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">16 COLORS - More choices, more possibilities! This 3D Printing Moon Light comes with 16 light colours.</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">EXTRA LONG BATTERY LIFE - Get rid of the hassle of frequent charging! Thanks to the built-in 400mA rechargeable battery, you can enjoy 6 to 8 hours of long-lasting illumination. Plus, this Night Lamp can be powered by the computer charging port, power outlet, charging adapter and other USB outlet.</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">BRILLIANT GIFT: Crafted from PLA material, the tap control rechargeable moon light is durable and shatterproof. With a solid wooden frame, it will not fall from the table. It is a perfect gift for Thanksgiving, birthday, party, wedding, anniversary and more. It can also be used as a fairy tale night light to create a warm and dreamy atmosphere for bedrooms, offices, restaurants.</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">The colourful 3D starry sky effect gives people unlimited imagination over the universe or distant galaxies.</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">Soft, controllable lighting with built-in polymer lithium battery - supports 6-8 hours of lighting. Connect the charging cable to the power source for lighting.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<