y and simple to be controlled using the touch switch, on and off / changing color seven. The remote control the lamp on and off / change 16 colors / brightness / time and etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>The package includes</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 *Moon Lamp Night Lights</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 * USB Cable</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 * Stent</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1*remote control</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.45,20.32,18.8,18.54,39.99,29.99,'100','1','1','1','16003389543d_moon_night_light_lamp.jpg','16003389543d_moon_night_light_lamp1.jpg','16003389543d_moon_night_light_lamp2.jpg','16003389543d_moon_night_light_lamp3.jpg','16003389543d_moon_night_light_lamp4.jpg','16003389543d_moon_night_light_lamp5.jpg','16003389543d_moon_night_light_lamp6.jpg','moonnighlam0001-2011041604492233.mp4','1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-09-17 10:35:54'),(595,'Bathroom Shower Filter - Bathing Water Treatment Chlorine Removal',0,0,'bathroom-shower-filter-bathing-water-treatment-chlorine-removal','showaterfil0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/32848986973.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.193012f2LL06Qd&algo_pvid=c3b9b51f-1936-4af7-8450-5111ffa0a96c&algo_expid=c3b9b51f-1936-4af7-8450-5111ffa0a96c-13&btsid=0bb0623f16002498508293927eaf89&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>SHOWER FILTER FOR HAIR FOR HARD WATER TREATMENT</strong> : High Quality Universal Shower Filter with 2 Filter Cartridges with 15 Multi Stage Filter Layer To Remove Harmful Chlorine, Fluoride, Dirt, Bad Odours And Helps Control The Growth Of Scale And Helps For Hair Fall Reduction, Dry, Itchy Skin, Eczema, Pustules, Acne. look better, feel cleaner & enjoy the skin you’re in again!</li>\r\n <li><strong>15-STAGE SHOWER HEAD FILTER</strong>: Our shower filter contains several filtering layers: activated carbon, KDF 55, calcium sulphite, cotton and metal mesh, tourmaline balls, germanium and magnetic energy ceramic balls. It’s a tested and effective composition for Treating Hard Water.</li>\r\n <li><strong>PROMOTES HEALING & RESTORATION</strong>: Beyond the fact that our multi stage filter reduces dry itchy skin, dandruff and eczema it’s unique multi stage filtration system is recognized among the best for improving the condition of your skin, hair and nails.</li>\r\n <li><strong>EASY INSTALLATION</strong>: Installation takes only a few minutes and no tools required. Capacity of the cartridge is 16,000 gallons of water, which provides clean water for 4 to 6 months, depending on your water quality.</li>\r\n <li><strong>IN THE KIT</strong>: We supply our shower water filter with everything that can help you for immediate installation and usage. Comes with 22 mm Female & 24 mm Male Fitting Tap Connector, 2 cartridge included. No tools required.</li>\r\n <li><strong>WORRIED ABOUT YOUR FALLING HAIR AND DRY SKIN</strong> - Use River Soft proprietary technology in your shower to get rid of your water woes</li>\r\n <li><strong>PUIRIFIES YOUR WATER AND PROTECTS YOUR SKIN AND HAIR </strong>- SF-15 PRO shower filter with 15 stages contains the right combination of high purity KDF, Calcium Sulphite, Active Carbon and Vitamin C which neutralizes harmful Chlorine. It also removes harmful organic matter and dilutes hard salts and has anti-bacterial effect. Mineral stones and alkaline ball – recharges water with minerals and sets the pH just right to smoothen your skin and hair.</li>\r\n <li><strong>EASY TO INSTALL (SELF INSTALLATION - DIY)</strong> – The filter has universal ½ inch inlet and outlet for direct installation to all kind of showers. For tap installation, a connector may be required. Contact customer care for connector requirement.</li>\r\n <li><strong>HIGH CAPACITY</strong> – Each cartridge will last for 40,000 litres of water (or about 6 months). If your water has higher impurity level then cartridge would need to be changed more often. It won’t reduce existing water pressure</li>\r\n <li><strong>BOX CONTAINS</strong> - 1 x Filter Housing, 1 x Cartridge, 1x Teflon Tape , 2 x Silicon Seal ,1 x User’s Manual. Recommended for water qualities below 1000 TDS.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/3773789.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Are you worried about your hair-fall? Are you facing skin related problems? Have you tried to clean your water?</strong><br>\r\n<br>\r\nThis shower filter<strong> </strong>will make your water clean and free from harmful chemicals. Shower water contains a number of harmful chemicals and impurities such as Chlorine, hard salts, heavy metals, bacteria etc which can impact our health. Chlorine inhalation is a common problem in shower and leads to respiratory problems; Chlorine and hard salts like calcium and magnesium carbonates kills the skin protein, making the skin dry and leads to scalp flakiness which makes hair dull and weak. This shower filter<strong>  </strong>reduces harmful effect of chlorine, heavy metals and hard salts protecting skin and hair and by using best quality materials enriches water with essential minerals. With Vitamin C and alkaline balls it sets the pH right to nourish hair and skin. This shower filter<strong> </strong> shower filters helps to</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n <li><strong>Reduces hair-fall and improves quality of hair</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>This shower filter<strong> </strong> uses NSF approved KDF technology to reduce chlorine to non-harmful form. Calcium sulphite used, is extremely good in removing chlorine in hot showers. Vitamin C help the hair maintain its natural colour and look<br>\r\n<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<ol start=\"2\">\r\n <li><strong>Prevents skin dryness</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>KDF and active carbon prevents chlorine from damaging your skin. It also prevents hard salts to form deposit on skin. Mineral balls enrich water and provide essential nutrients to the skin. Vitamin C with the “Antioxidant Property” helps to neutralize free radicals found in water<br>\r\n<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<ol start=\"3\">\r\n <li><strong>Prevents bacteria</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>Bacteria and other microbes can colonize your showerhead and pose a health hazard. KDF and active carbon have anti-bacterial properties – so it inhibits their growth and keep your shower clean.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<ol start=\"4\">\r\n <li><strong>Removes bad odour</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>With multi stage filtration, chlorine is reduced and hence the after-shower “bleaching” powder smell that emanates, is also reduced.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1034861603.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>A high-quality and efficient 15-Stage shower filter for bathroom for hard water treatment By Dr Recommends that is easy to use, inexpensive and compact! - Our shower filter is mainly designed to remove Chlorine, because, in bathing, harmful Chlorine and its vapours generated by hot water are absorbed through the skin and respiratory system - It dramatically reduces levels of chlorine and other harmful compounds in your shower water, thus shielding you from further intoxication and improving your health - And thanks to its advanced filtering layers, our 15-stage filter also removes from shower water other unhealthy impurities, sediments and rust Activated carbon traps toxins and chemicals Calcium sulphite can remove chlorine in hot and cold water instantaneously KDF 55 eliminates hydrogen sulphide and arsenic Germanium ceramic balls used to sterilize, deodorize, activate and purify water Tourmaline balls support the body’s ability to release toxins and wastes Magnetic energy ceramic balls adsorb impurities and harmful heavy metals PP Cotton and Mesh filter prevents dust, sediments and rust - We supply our water filter with everything that can help you for immediate installation and usage. It fits all the standard joints, and you can easily install it by twisting its hose. - The kit includes 1 extra 15 stage cartridge, silicon seals, instructions, and an isolating Teflon string for extremely accurate and reliable installation. You don’t need any special skills, knowledge or tools to install the shower water filter - The cartridge can be replaced effortlessly and it can serve you for up to 6 months before it will be due for replacement. One cartridge is enough to effectively clean 10,000-12,000 gallons.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>PURIFIES YOUR WATER</strong> - Removes Chlorine, heavy metals (lead, mercury, nickel, chromium), bacteria, pesticides, and inhibits the growth of scale, algae and fungi.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>REVITALIZES YOUR BODY</strong> - Reduces dry itchy skin, dandruff, eczema, and dramatically improves the condition of your skin, hair and nails.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>MULTI-STAGE FILTRATION</strong> - Unique blend of KDF 55, calcium sulphite and activated carbon, ensure maximum filtration in both hot and cold water.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>INSTALLS IN MINUTES</strong> - Universal connections work with all shower types, including fixed, rain and handheld showers. No tools required.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>REPLACEABLE FILTERS</strong> - Contains a removable filter cartridge, which can be easily changed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/109430956.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1.100% Brand new and high quality.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2.Standard Screw Fit Most Of Connectors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> 3.Ultra high molecular weight PE membrane filtration.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> 4.High porosity ratio ,high water output and good filtering effect. Activated carbon removes chlorine and bad odor. KDF removes chlorine and heavy metal ions,such as Zn2+,Hg2+,Cu2+, Cd2+. Easy Install - Simply screw on between shower unit and shower hose.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>5.KDF+Calcium sulfite +Activated carbon.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/105747633.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Function</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. KDF : Bacteriostatic effect Reduce chlorine Remove heavy metals Inhibit the growth of microorganism</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Calcium sulphite : Inhibit the reproduction of bacteria Adsorption organic matter Adsorption toxic metal ions Adsorption bacteria</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Activated carbon : Dechloridation</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specifications</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1.Color: Silver</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2.Body material: ABS</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3.Bigger Head Diameter: 2.7 CM</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4.Smaller Head Diameter: 2CM</p>\r\n\r\n<p>5.Pressure range: 5-90 PSI</p>\r\n\r\n<p>6.Temperature range: 4 ~ 60Celsius</p>\r\n\r\n<p>7.Flow rate: 1 GPM</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/614973285.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Benefits</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1.Improves the look and feel of skin and hair.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2.Ideal for people with sensitive skin and lung.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3.Enhances effect and performance of health and beauty products - use less soap, shampoo and conditioner.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4.Helps preserve hair color treatments.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> 5.Eliminates unpleasant odors from water.</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.6,19.56,9.4,8.89,79.99,49.99,'100','1','1','1','1600339405shower_water_filter_for_hair.jpg','1600339405shower_water_filter_for_hair1.jpg','1600339405shower_water_filter_for_hair2.jpg','1600339405shower_water_filter_for_hair3.jpg','1600339405shower_water_filter_for_hair4.jpg','1600339405shower_water_filter_for_hair5.jpg','',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-09-17 10:43:25'),(596,'3.0 or 2.0 USB Multi Hub Expander 4 Port HUB for PC Laptop',0,0,'30-or-20-usb-multi-hub-expander-4-port-hub-for-pc-laptop','usbhub0001','https://www.aliexpress.c