rnal power needed --</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>4-Port ultra high speed USB Hub</li>\r\n <li>Useful for laptop and desktop</li>\r\n <li>Comes in red colour</li>\r\n <li>Application: Truly Plug and play automatic with All OS including windows 98,2000,ME,XP,7,Mac Linux virtually ; Network Speed: 480</li>\r\n <li>Packaging: 4 port USB Mini- Hub with attached Usb Cable, Ultra High Speed, Usb 2.0 High- speed 480 MBPS HUB, Sleek design, 4 ports work together</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/103381615.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>COMPACT & HANDY</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Keep the devices sorted and in place with this compactly designed USB hub. You can carry it in your backpack or laptop bag while heading towards office.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>BUILD TO LAST</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The outer case of the hub is made durable to last long. With superior build quality and anti rust USB ports, the hub is designed to keep your USB devices connected.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>HIGH DATA TRANSFER SPEED</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>This USB hub a user friendly accessory designed for your modern needs of high speed data transfer. The USB ports provide you an ultrahigh-speed of 480 Mbps.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>ERGONOMIC DESIGN</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>All the 4 universal ports can work in one go. Truly plug and play device will ensure that all the ports work instantly and simultaneously.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>WIDE COMPATIBILITY</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The USB hub is compatible with all Android, iOS, and USB devices with OS including, Windows 98, 2000, ME, XP, 7, Mac, Linux etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>MULTIPLE USAGE</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The USB hub has wide and multiple applications and can be used for home or work purpose.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>ERGONOMIC 4 IN 1 DESIGN</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Save yourself a whole lot of stress and potential by choosing this 4 in 1 USB Hub with 4 USB ports capable of chaining up to 127 USB devices and compatible with all Android, iOS devices and Linux devices.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1271779223.jpg\">???????</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Instantly Add Four USB 3.0 or 2.0 Ports to Any Compatible Device.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Supports Transfer Speeds up to 5Gbps (USB 3.0), 480Mbps (USB 2.0)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Support Windows XP/2000/Vista/WIN 7/8/10, Mac OS, etc.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Reverse Compatible USB 2.0 and USB 3.0</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>No power supply needed. Simply plug it into any desktop/laptop, and it will work perfectly for normal daily use, such as mouse, keyboard, etc. (Note: HUB is NOT a charger, and may not charge your phone/tablets)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1105135881.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Ports</strong>: 4</li>\r\n <li><strong>Function</strong>: Reader</li>\r\n <li><strong>Standard</strong>: USB 3.0 or USB 2.0</li>\r\n <li><strong>Package</strong>: Yes</li>\r\n <li><strong>Certification</strong>: CE,CCC,ROSH</li>\r\n <li>Feature 1: USB HUB</li>\r\n <li><strong>Feature 2</strong>: USB Splitter</li>\r\n <li><strong>Feature 3</strong>: USB Port</li>\r\n <li><strong>Feature 4</strong>: USB 3.0 /2.0 / type c Hub</li>\r\n <li><strong>Feature 5</strong>: Multi USB</li>\r\n <li><strong>Feature 6</strong>: Micro USB</li>\r\n <li><strong>Feature 7:</strong> USB Multi Port</li>\r\n <li><strong>Feature 8</strong>: USB Multiple</li>\r\n <li><strong>Support system</strong>: Windows/Mac OS/Linux</li>\r\n <li><strong>Feature 9</strong>: USB HUB 2.0 ,usb hub card reader ,multi usb 3.0</li>\r\n <li><strong>Feature 10:</strong> usb 3.0 hub , hub usb , usb splitter , multi usb</li>\r\n <li><strong>Feature 11</strong>: hub usb 3.