It can trim your beard easily. Best for beard and moustache.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Hassle-Free charging for convenient use - Easy and On the GO charging with USB charging cable. Ideal for daily use, travel, holiday, and business trips.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Ergonomic Design: compact body design, easy to hold in hand, lightweight, and portable.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Easy Rotating Wheel – Get Precision trimming with 23 length settings (1mm – 23 mm).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Charging & Runtime - 8 hours of charging time on a single charge gives 40 minutes of the run time of cordless use.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>In the Box: 1 Trimmer with comb attachment, 1 USB charging cable, 1 cleaning oil, 1 cleaning brush, 1 user manual</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Choose your beard style from a short stubble, medium, or a full beard with Vega T-1 beard trimmer. With the easy rotating wheel and lock functionality, you can trim your hair to the exact length you select. Choose from 23 length settings (1 mm to 12 mm) You can charge the trimmer by just plugging in the USB cable onto a laptop. power bank or use your adaptor (adaptor excluded). Charge your trimmer for 8 hours to get 40 minutes of cordless use. The trimmer has stainless steel blades with a smooth tip for a safe and easy trim. Look your best every day.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/766662682.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>FEATURES:</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<br>\r\nUSB charging<br>\r\n<br>\r\n23 length settings<br>\r\n<br>\r\nStainless steel blades<br>\r\n<br>\r\nCordless use<br>\r\n<br>\r\n40 minute run time<br>\r\n<br>\r\nErgonomic design for solid grip and comfort<br>\r\n<br>\r\n220-240v, 50-60hz<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/883295457.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\nImportant:<br>\r\n<br>\r\nPlease read the enclosed user manual carefully before operating the app ance.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nPlease ensure that the warranty card is enclosed while purchasing this appliance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>FEATURES:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Corded and Cordless Use, Adjustable Clip, Low Noise, Skin Friendly, Fast Charging etc</li>\r\n <li>Battery Backup: 30 Min (Continuous Use) , Charging Time: 6-8 Hours , Battery Type: Li-Po 5V 600mAh (Not Included)</li>\r\n <li>Pack Contains:1 Trimmer, 1 Adjustable Clip, Charging Cable, Cleaning Brush, Oil and User Manual</li>\r\n <li>Discover the new LetsShave & Co. Beard & Body Trimmer, a multi-grooming kit. It gives you ultimate control over the contours of your face, head, and body for precise and comfortable trim.</li>\r\n <li>The two detachable trimming combs provide 38 length settings between 1 - 10 mm and 11- 20mm having Precision Dial. Precision trimming that can go as low as 0.5 mm.</li>\r\n <li>The latest technology Lithium-ion battery for excellent output and performance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/397241937.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>90 minutes of cordless usage time with a quick charge time of just 120 minutes. Lifetime Sharp, self-sharpening stainless steel blades for long-lasting power of precision trim. An LED battery charging indicator that flashes RED when the battery is low and flashes GREEN when the trimmer is on charging. 100% waterproof blade. Corded and cordless use for maximum convenience. Corded and Cordless Use, Adjustable Clip, Low Noise, Skin Friendly, Fast Charging etc. Battery Backup: 30 Min (Continuous Use) , Charging Time: 6-8 Hours , Battery Type: Li-Po 5V 600mAh (Not Included)</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>High Performance Sharp Steel Blades</strong> - Designed with sharp but skin-friendly blades, our trimmer&#39;s stainless steel moving and standing blades have precise gaps, deep close to the skin to create clean, straight lines and evenly trim through the thickest hair without pulling hair or burning skin.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Washable, Rechargeable & Portable</strong> - The trimmer and all of its attachments are fully washable which is easy to clean and can be used for shower in wet conditions. Equipped with rechargeable battery ensure you to groom at home, dormitory or travel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Ergonomic, Lightweight & Durable</strong> - Ergonomic design makes it more comfortable to hold in hand, made in ABS material make it more lightweight and will not feel tired for long time grooming.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/235779946.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specification: </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Material</strong>: ABS + stainless steel</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Voltage</strong>: 110-240V (the voltage description in item is 220-240V, actully It also can be used in 110-240V,it had been tested many times)  </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong>: 50/60Hz</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Power</strong>: 3W</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Battery capacity</strong>: 600mAh</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Charging time</strong>: 2-3 hours</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Using time</strong>: 40 minutes</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Color</strong>: Sapphire blue</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Size</strong>: 17*4*3.5cm(Length*Width*Thickness)</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Weight</strong>: 186g</p>\r\n\r\n<p> <strong>Package content:</strong><br>\r\n1 x Hair clipper<br>\r\n1 x USB charging line <br>\r\n4 x Limit combs(3mm, 6mm, 9mm, 12mm)<br>\r\n1 x Cleaning brush<br>\r\n1 x User manual(English)</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Note</strong>:<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe blade can be washed with water, but the machine body can’t be washed with water.</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.186,17,4,3.5,49.99,29.99,'100','1','1','1','160042628