ester +spandex </strong>+cotton<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Color: As picture show</strong><br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Style: Women&#39;s Shorts</strong><br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Size</strong><strong>: S M L XL</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H0dd91c6dc52a468db2b78a34dbdf10e5l.jpg?smt_ispass_3203422\" id=\"Picture_x0020_1\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H0dd91c6dc52a468db2b78a34dbdf10e5l.jpg?smt_ispass_3203422\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>There is 2-3% difference according to manual measurement.</strong><br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Please check the measurement chart carefully before you buy the item.</strong><br>\r\n<strong>1 inch = 2.54 cm</strong><br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Please note that slight color difference should be acceptable due to the light and screen.</strong><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>What You Get:</strong><br>\r\n<strong>1 x Pants</strong></p>\r\n',0,'1',0.182,22.6,19.7,5.1,19.99,14.99,'100','1','1','1','1600427085bike_shorts_women.jpg','1600427085bike_shorts_women1.jpg','1600427085bike_shorts_women2.jpg','1600427085bike_shorts_women3.jpg','1600427085bike_shorts_women4.jpg','1600427085bike_shorts_women5.jpg','1600427085bike_shorts_women6.jpg','bikeshorts0001-2011041604492467.mp4','1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-09-18 11:04:45'),(599,'Bluetooth 5.0 FM Transmitter Hands free Wireless Car MP3 Player with Dual USB Car Charging Ports - Music Player Support TF/SD Card, USB Disk',0,0,'bluetooth-50-fm-transmitter-hands-free-wireless-car-mp3-player-with-dual-usb-car-charging-ports-music-player-support-tfsd-card-usb-disk','carbluefmtran0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4001041741785.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.42f11057HSOlJL&algo_pvid=18f3ae87-35f2-492b-b6fe-001b78cbbeec&algo_expid=18f3ae87-35f2-492b-b6fe-001b78cbbeec-3&btsid=0bb0622f16003223205402931e8d58&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<p>Bluetooth 5.0 version, fast connection speed, supports operation voice prompt, support call number.  Compact size, suitable for most models.  Digital display, can display working status information such as</p>\r\n\r\n<p>frequency. Support Bluetooth hands-free phone, answer, hang up, reject, call back and other phone functions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Support Bluetooth stereo A2DP music playback. Support external TF card / U disk interface, support lossless music format, file menu operation, support automatic power-off memory function. Support FM full frequency point transmission function, a total of 206 frequency points. Supports echo cancellation and noise suppression (CVC) technology during calls.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1762680710.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> <strong>FEATURES:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol start=\"5\">\r\n <li>Hands-Free Calls - FM Bluetooth Transmitter adapter built-in microphone to automatically switch from music playing to hands-free mode when answering a phone call. One press to answer/hang up the call. Convenient and safe for driving.</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">High Quality - The FM transmitter more stable FM signal, adopted advanced noise cancelling technology-CVC technology creates full-duplex sound and suppresses noise and wind, improved the using experience, better anti-interference performance.</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">Universal Compatibility - Wireless fm transmitter supporting mobile&#39;s A2DP function, work with SD, TF card and USB, listening to music when charging. Compatible for iPad,iPhone,Samsung,Google,LG,tablets,Andorid or other device with Bluetooth connectivity.</li>\r\n <li value=\"5\">Easy operation - The Bluetooth FM transmitter simply plug into the car cigarette lighter and pair it with car radio or Smartphone. Then it could be automatically searched and connected to your device next time, if the device had been connected before.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1251032548.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Dual USB Ports:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>With two USB charging ports, you can charge your phone or other device at the same time.<br>\r\nSimultaneously charge driver and passenger. No need to worry about power shortage.<br>\r\n<strong>Hands-Free Calls</strong><br>\r\nBluetooth 5.0 provides a strong connection,FM transmitter built-in microphone with CVC noise reduction and echo cancellation technologies achieve high quality calls,one click the button to answer/redial/hang up or reject calls.<br>\r\n<strong>Voice Navigation</strong><br>\r\nMore stable FM signal, better anti-interference performance, you can get clear voice navigation from your phone&#39;s app, wireless FM transmitter automatically adjust navigation volume when playing music. Safe and convenient for driving.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>ADVANTAGES :</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Plug the FM transmitter into your car cigarette lighter socket, it will turn on automatically and please search this device with the name of BT36.<br>\r\n  </li>\r\n <li>Adjust car FM to channel(87.5-108MHz),then find an empty station and keep the FM transmitter and car FM radio at the same frequency.<br>\r\n  </li>\r\n <li>Insert a USB flash driver, TF card or connect with Bluetooth FM transmitter(name‘BT36&#39;)to enjoy music or hands-free conversation.</li>\r\n <li>Easy to switch between Bluetooth, TF card, USB disk mode with long press?&gt;>I key. The priority play sequence is Bluetooth > TF card > USB.</li>\r\n <li>Transform Your Car Music System: - This Car Bluetooth device connects to your Car Stereo wirelessly via FM and to your Smartphone via Bluetooth so you can Stream Music, Get Turn by Turn Audio Navigation Assistance, Make & Receive Calls and much more on your existing Car Music System.</li>\r\n <li>Hands Free Calls: - Inbuilt Mica with Unmatched Echo Cancellation & Noise Suppression using Latest CVC Technology enables you to attend to Calls on your Car Music System.</li>\r\n <li>3 Music Playing Modes: - Stream Music from your Smartphone via Bluetooth 5.0 or plug in your USB Disk / Micros Cards (up to 32GB) for playing MP3/WMA/FLAC music formats. Supports Bluetooth A2DP for High Quality Stereo Audio.</li>\r\n <li>Fast Dual USB Car Charger: - Supports charging two devices simultaneously so you never run out of charge on long trips.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1117117895.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>BENEFITS:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Wide Compatibility: - Fits in all cars; All you need is a Car Power Outlet (Cigarette Lighter Port) (12-24V) and a Car Stereo that supports FM. Works with iPhone, iPod, Android, Blackberry, Windows Phones, Tablets, MP3 Players and more Bluetooth enabled devices.</li>\r\n <li>WIDE COMPATIBILITY: Bluetooth Car FM Transmitter can be paired as a hands-free kit with all Bluetooth enabled devices, such as phone, iPhone, iPod, Tablet, Samsung, HTC, Sony and other Android Smartphone’s.</li>\r\n <li>ANSWER CALLS HANDS-FREE: High-performance microphone with Noise Suppression (CVC) technology, grants you crystal clear call. Answering/redialling/dismissing or ending call just simply click a button.</li>\r\n <li>MULTI-SAFETY PROTECTION: Comes with built-in over-current protection, over-voltage protection, intelligent temperature control, short circuit protection.</li>\r\n <li>7 COLOR LED BACKLIT MODE - 7 single-colour lighting modes and 1 cycle colour mode that can get a visually stunning display of colours, you can keep 1 colour or play the colours in turn. It helps you easily use in the dark, safer for driving.</li>\r\n <li>Quick Charge 3.0 Possibly the latest, fastest and most efficient USB charging technology in the world. Up to 4X faster than standard chargers, it is able to charge compatible devices to 80% within 35 minutes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>SUPPORTS AUDIO PLAY :</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can use the included 3.5 mm audio cable to transmit music through Bluetooth if your car has aux-in port. This gives better performance for the audiophile in you. Crystal clear sound from pen drive, micro sd card or mobile phone connected via the V4.1 Bluetooth</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can charge one mobile and at the same time or play music via usb drive. The charger supports 5 V / 2.1 A fast charging. Fast Charging of most modern mobiles and music play function from a usb drive</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The FM transmitter will display car voltage when plugged into the car cigarette lighter. Enable you to know your car battery state easily. Then it will enter automatic play modes</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bluetooth V4.1 FM Transmitter has multiple options to play music. You can stream music from your mobile phone or play music from songs stored from your USB / Pen drive or form a micro sod memory card. All options are available so you are not stuck with one playing mode. The player supports Pen Drives /TF cards up to 32 GB. One GB supports 200 songs. So you have an almost infinite music capacity with just one pen drive or Micro SD card. For CD like sound quality use the aux output to connect to car stereo. While speaking on call, you need to face the direction of the T19 device and speak a little louder than usual as mic is unidirectional and noise cancelling Car Locator App. The smart car charger is a GPS tracking device that can track your car through mobile APP. The App will automatically record your parking location. The compass will indicate the direction and location of your car. This is purely a software function. It will mark parked location of car in the app on your mobile.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Dual USB Ports - Bluetooth Car Charger with 2 USB charging port to charge most USB devices,you can charge 2 devices(IOS or Android ) simultaneously. One USB port music icon is for reading USB disk but also charge your device.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Hands-Free Calls - FM Bluetooth Transmitter adapter built-in microphone to automatically switch from music playing to hands-free mode when answering a phone call. One press to answer/hang up the call. Convenient and safe for driving.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>High Quality - The FM transmitter more stable FM signal, adopted advanced noise cancelling technology-CVC technology creates full-duplex sound and suppresses noise and wind, improved the using experience, better anti-interference performance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Universal Compatibility - Wireless fm transmitter supporting mobile&#39;s A2DP function, work with SD, TF card and USB, listening to music when charging. Compatible for iPad,iPhone,Samsung,Google,LG,tablets,Andorid or other device with Bluetooth connectivity.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Easy operation - The Bluetooth FM transmitter simply plug into the car cigarette lighter and pair it with car radio or Smartphone. Then it could be automatically searched and connected to your device next time, if the device had been connected before.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1447196870.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>Dual USB Ports</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>With two USB charging ports, you can charge your phone or other device at the same time.<br>\r\nSimultaneously charge driver and passenger.<br>\r\nNo need to worry about power shortage.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Hands-Free Calls</strong><br>\r\nBluetooth 5.0 provides a strong connection,FM transmitter built-in microphone with CVC noise reduction and echo cancellation technologies achieve high quality calls,one click the button to answer/redial/hang up or reject calls.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Voice Navigation</strong><br>\r\nMore stable FM signal, better anti-interference performance, you can get clear voice navigation from your phone&#39;s app, wireless FM transmitter automatically adjust navigation volume when playing music. Safe and convenient for driving.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Operation Guide:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n <li>Plug the FM transmitter into your car cigarette lighter socket, it will turn on automatically and please search this device with the name of BT36.<br>\r\n  </li>\r\n <li>Adjust car FM to channel(87.5-108MHz),then find an empty station and keep the FM transmitter and car FM radio at the same frequency.<br>\r\n  </li>\r\n <li>Insert a USB flash driver, TF card or connect with Bluetooth FM transmitter(name‘BT36&#39;)to enjoy music or hands-free conversation.</li>\r\n <li>Easy to switch between Bluetooth, TF card, USB disk mode with long press?&gt;>I key. The priority play sequence is Bluetooth > TF card > USB.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/530198711.jpg\" xss=removed></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Model Name: BT36</li>\r\n <li>Out Power: 18W</li>\r\n <li>Material Type: ABS</li>\r\n <li>Item Type: FM Transmitters</li>\r\n <li>Voltage: 12V</li>\r\n <li>Item Weight: 40g</li>\r\n <li>Special Features: Bluetooth 5.0 hands-free FM transmitter</li>\r\n <li>Item Size: 51*45*82mm</li>\r\n <li>fm transmitter: car bluetooth</li>\r\n <li>mp3 player Bluetooth for car: car music player</li>\r\n <li>multiport car charger: led display quick charge 3.0 car charger</li>\r\n <li>car accessories: universal charger</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,'1',0.04,5.1,4.5,8.2,19.99,14.99,'100','1','1','1','1600427934bluetooth_fm_transmitter_car.jpg','1600427934bluetooth_fm_transmitter_car1.jpg','1600428511bluetooth_fm_transmitter.jpg','1600427934bluetooth_fm_transmitter_car3.jpg','1600427934bluetooth_fm_transmitter_car4.jpg','1600427934bluetooth_fm_transmitter_car5.jpg','1600427934bluetooth_fm_transmitter_car6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,