2.11g, IEEE 802.11b standards.</li>\r\n <li>Provides up to 300Mbps transmission rates.</li>\r\n <li>Support 2.4 GHz WLAN networks.</li>\r\n <li>Maximum WLAN security with WPA2, WPA and WEP (128/64).</li>\r\n <li>Software wizard for simple setup.</li>\r\n <li>2dBi antennas integrated</li>\r\n <li>Support Wireless Repeater Mode and Standard AP Mode.</li>\r\n <li>Provides one 10/100Mbps Auto-Negotiation Ethernet LAN ports.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specification</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Product Type: WIFI Repeater</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Color: White</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Voltage: AC 110-240V</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Transmission Rate: 300Mbps</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Frequency Range: 2.41-2.48GHz</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Networking Cable Length: Approx. 1m</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1x Wireless WiFi Repeater</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1x RJ-45 Networking Cable</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1x Installation Guide</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.14,11.6,11.4,6.8,49.99,24.99,'200','1','1','1','16011262268540Best_Wi-Fi_repeater.jpg','16011262268540Best_Wi-Fi_repeater1.jpg','16011262268540Best_Wi-Fi_repeater2.jpg','16011262268540Best_Wi-Fi_repeater3.jpg','16011262268540Best_Wi-Fi_repeater4.jpg','16011262268540Best_Wi-Fi_repeater5.jpg','',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-09-26 13:17:07'),(652,'LED Backlit Rechargeable Wireless Silent Mouse – Ergonomic Optical Wireless Desktop PC Laptop Mouse',0,0,'led-backlit-rechargeable-wireless-silent-mouse-ergonomic-optical-wireless-desktop-pc-laptop-mouse','wirelessmous0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000955935039.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.48b33aacSfakCq&algo_pvid=daf414ca-8a2c-44c9-9337-56b3e60263ca&algo_expid=daf414ca-8a2c-44c9-9337-56b3e60263ca-16&btsid=0bb0623a16010145725987417ed2f2&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<ul>\r\n <li>2.4GHz WIRELESS No driver, Plug & Play. Wireless mouse for laptop provide you with a more secure and precise experience with an increased working distance up to 15m/49FT. F