), equipped with infrared night vision technology and high dynamic range, capturing more light to show ultra-high-pixel night vision, even on rainy nights Can capture car license plates and road signs vividly.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Reverse Assistance and Safe Parking:</strong> Please connect the rear camera red wire to your reverse light positive lead, so that the dash cam will display reverse image automatically in any situation when the R gear is engaged. Also, the parking guide line will help you park easily and safety. We offer a Class 10 32GB SD card for free. We are committed to providing better products and services. If you have any question, please feel free to contact, we will reply within 24 hours.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Without RC: Does not include the rear view camera</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>With RC: includes rear view camera</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Note - </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. There may be slight size deviations due to manual measurement, different measuring methods and tools.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. The picture may not reflect the actual color of the item because of different photographing light, angle and display monitor.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. The screen resolution of the recorder is low, so the display effect on the recorder screen is not perfect.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features -</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Touch IPS Screen resolution: 800x600</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Video resolution:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>True Front resolution: 1000x800</p>\r\n\r\n<p>True rear view resolution: 800x600</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Screen Size - 3.6 inch</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Video format  - AVI</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Photo format - JPEG</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Function: loop recording / motion detection / gravity sensing / parking monitoring</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Lens Angle: 140 degrees.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>TF  - 8G~32GB ?C10?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Operation voltage - DC 5V</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Operation current  - 2000mA</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Frequency: 50HZ / 60HZ</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Battery: 200mA, built-in.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package Include -</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 x car DVR</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 x car charger</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 x user manual</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 x bracket</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.34,12.45,10.16,9.65,150,99.99,'25','1','1','1','16018975327475dash_cam.jpg','16018975327475dash_cam1.jpg','16018975327475dash_cam2.jpg','16018975327475dash_cam3.jpg','16018975327475dash_cam4.jpg','16018975327475dash_cam5.jpg','16018975327475dash_cam6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-10-05 11:32:13'),(679,'Foldable Insulated Lunch Bag - Household Car Non-woven Fabric Preservation Package Insulated Cool Tote Bag',0,0,'foldable-insulated-lunch-bag-household-car-non-woven-fabric-preservation-package-insulated-cool-tote-bag','insulatedbag0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/10000000359803.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.74d25ddaEi3prO&algo_pvid=cccc4a64-cc04-4af8-b79c-c7d2dbb0133a&algo_expid=cccc4a64-cc04-4af8-b79c-c7d2dbb0133a-26&btsid=0bb0622916012754655094451ee9ef&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<p><strong>Large Capacity</strong>: Large capacity (14H * 13L * 8W) is ideal for groceries, parties, beaches, food delivery and camping. Easily hold 8 bottles.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Soft and Foldable</strong>: The soft fabric side can accommodate shaped items. Folded flat for easy storage in the kitchen, under the car seat or in the trunk. A smooth zippered zip closure prevents items from falling.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Convenient and Portable:</strong> Transport or carry all hot or cold items! Ideal for frozen groceries and produce. Make the ideal food delivery bag.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Food Preservation</strong>: Keep cold drinks, fruits, milk, seafood, etc.; keep pizza and other cooked food (2-3 hours).</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Rugged Load-bearing:</strong> This insulated case has a double zippered reinforced handle at the bottom for groceries and reusable load-bearing for food transport.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Visual - impress friends, family & customers with your jet black, eternally clean-looking insulated bag suitable for any occasion.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Valuable - this bag represents an excellent value proposition because we designed it for quick trips from home to the store and home again.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Functional - 3 inch pullers on each zipper allow you to find the zip quickly whilst also helping those that have trouble gripping the small metal pullers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Durable - hardcore home shoppers require a strong bag that they can rely on to haul groceries, blankets, laundry, toys or whatever to wherever, whenever.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Adaptable - we all have different strength & comfort zones so we have made sure our bag has front, back, & side handles so you have more carrying options.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Material: non-woven</strong><br>\r\n<strong><strong>Color: black</strong><br>\r\n<strong>Size: about 33*20.5*35.5cm/12.99*8.07*13.98in</strong></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong><strong>Packing List:</strong><br>\r\n<strong>1* Insulated bag</strong></strong></p>\r\n',0,'1',0.085,40.6,30,13.9,30,21.99,'22','1','1','1','16018992986881insulated_bag_for_food.jpg','16018992986881insulated_bag_for_food1.jpg','16018992986881insulated_bag_for_food2.jpg','16018992986881insulated_bag_for_food3.jpg','16018992986881insulated_bag_for_food4.jpg','16018992986881insulated_bag_for_food5.jpg','16018992986881insulated_bag_for_food6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-10-05 12:01:40'),(680,'Techkey-Waterproof USB Flash Drive ',0,0,'techkey-waterproof-usb-flash-drive','pdrive0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/32795437819.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.35364f94G3xrYr&algo_pvid=7b46312a-ecac-4689-b49a-f977ef412676&algo_expid=7b46312a-ecac-4689-b49a-f977ef412676-12&btsid=0bb0622916013620322493408eb747&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<p><strong>Specifications :</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Interface: USB 2.0</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Read Speed: 8MB -15MB/second</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Write Speed: 4MB -6MB/second</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Power: No external power required</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Compatibility For Macs and PCs</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>About Capacity :</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Due to different ways of computing, or the existing bad block, or some built-in software ,  the memory capacity of the usb flash drive may show less on the PC . And the more capacity is, the more deviation is.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Storage Industry Area calculation method:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1GB=1000MB=1000*1000KB=1000*1000*1000B</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Operation System calculation method:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1GB=1024MB=1024*1024KB=1024*1024*1024B</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So 1GB storage in OS shows as: (1000^3)/(1024^3)?0.93GB</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>8G=approx 7.4G</p>\r\n\r\n<p>16G=approx 14.6G</p>\r\n\r\n<p>32G=approx  29.1G</p>\r\n\r\n<p>64G=approx  59.0G</p>\r\n\r\n<p>128G=approx  119.0G</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Note  -</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. To avoid data loss or mechanical damage, do not turn off the computer power during transmission.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Do not remove the USB flash drive during use, otherwise data may be lost.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. After using a USB flash drive, it is best to safely eject the USB flash drive on your computer, which will help to extend its storage life.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. Please use FAT32 or exFAT to format the memory disk. Please do not format your USB flash drive frequently, otherwise the USB will be damaged easily.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package included</strong>  - 1 x USB flash drive</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.007,3.9,1.23,0.45,15,10.99,'25','1','1','1','1601901126312764_GB_pen_drive.jpg','1601901126312764_GB_pen_drive1.jpg','1601901126312764_GB_pen_drive2.jpg','1601901126312764_GB_pen_drive3.jpg','1601901126312764_GB_pen_drive4.jpg','1601901126312764_GB_pen_drive5.jpg','1601901126312764_GB_pen_drive6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-10-05 12:32:07'),(681,'Kitchen Sharpening Tool Steel Knife Sharpener with Suction Pad',0,0,'kitchen-sharpening-tool-steel-knife-sharpener-with-suction-pad','knifesharp0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/32621522394.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.4e2ab547AfPFxF&algo_pvid=b7ea9dc7-a0e9-48e2-b9d9-15b5b8eaea70&algo_expid=b7ea9dc7-a0e9-48e2-b9d9-15b5b8eaea70-14&btsid=0bb0624016013728030046424e16b6&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<h2>Product description</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Anyone&#39;s an expert with AnySharp!</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The AnySharp Classic Global Knife Sharpener is the best knife sharpener you&#39;ll ever use. Restores old, dull knives to make cutting easier and safer for you to use - this product will pay for itself in days. The advanced diamond-honed tungsten carbide sharpening tool is pre-set to a 20 degree angle for optimal sharpening. Suitable for common kitchen knives, serrated blades and even certain garden tools.Featuring a super safe design with a powerful suction grip cup for stable, hands-free use and a safety knife edge to prevent any slips. Anyone can use this professional knife sharpener at home, no training required. Its compact size and lightweight design ensures it can be tidily stored away in a drawer, cupboard or tool box when not in use. No battery or electricity required and includes a 2 year warranty.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Restores old, dull knives to make cutting easy again and safer for you to use - the best knife sharpener you&#39;ll ever use, this product will pay for itself in days!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Pre-set 20 degree angle to provide optimum sharpening. Suitable for all kitchen knives, serrated blades and garden tools.</li>\r\n</ul