603_','china','<p>This is a dent puller kit which removes dents from hail, other car doors and more, will not harm the painted surfaces. Use widely for the sheet metal processing of automobile, refrigerator, motorcycle, washing machine, etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features –</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dent Remover Repair Kit help quickly repair the dents on your car. Replacement tabs in different shapes for multiple purposes. Paint less repairing car dent body, does not damage the original paint. Different sizes of traction tabs, which has used for the different size of dent. Use widely for the sheet metal processing of automobile, refrigerator, motorcycle, washing machine, etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>How to use PDR paint less dent repair kits? </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Clean the dent with a clean wet cloth (you can use the yellow line board to confirm the dent).</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Mount the glue stick into the glue gun, pull the trigger to let the glue stick enter into the glue gun, connect the power source and preheat for 5 minutes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Use a proper drawing gasket. Large dent requires a large drawing gasket.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. Pull the trigger and apply the drawing gasket with extruded glue.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>5. Fast place the drawing gasket with hot melt glue at the centre of dent, press lightly until the glue cures and adheres (Let the glue cool for about 8 minutes. The cooling time should be less than 10 minutes and should be shorter slightly in winter).</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>6. Align the T-shaped repairer and press the drawing gasket with hot melt glue, pull the sliding rod backwards to pull up the dent.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>7. Check with a Line board. If dent still exists, knock it slightly with a flattening hammer or pen.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>8. Clean the repaired place with a clean wet cloth.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Note</strong>: · Please allow 0.5-1cm errors due to manual measurement · Item color displayed in photos may be showing slightly different on your computer monitor since monitors are not calibrated same.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package listing: </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 pc gold dent lifter </p>\r\n\r\n<p>10 pcs blue tabs</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.34,16.99,12.7,8.89,99.99,59.99,'21','1','1','1','16019866636733best_dent_removal_kit.jpg','16019866636733best_dent_removal_kit1.jpg','16019866636733best_dent_removal_kit2.jpg','16019866636733best_dent_removal_kit3.jpg','16019866636733best_dent_removal_kit4.jpg','16019866636733best_dent_removal_kit5.jpg','16019866636733best_dent_removal_kit6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-10-06 12:17:44'),(685,'Stainless Meat Tenderizer Needle for Steak Kitchen Tools Cooking Accessories',0,0,'stainless-meat-tenderizer-needle-for-steak-kitchen-tools-cooking-accessories','meattenderizer0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/32865011211.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.127270a0WVwQRf&algo_pvid=ac16bf1d-0ae8-4845-adf4-f26cc9228d86&algo_expid=ac16bf1d-0ae8-4845-adf4-f26cc9228d86-3&btsid=0bb0623c16019662736682586efdb5&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>A MUST HAVE ESSENTIAL KITCHEN TOOL</strong> - Tired of cleaning the splatters of blood and meat bits from the tile behind your kitchen counter? Get rid of that meat mallets or hawkers! Why? Because Pounding Make The Meat Flatten Destroying The Muscles Fibbers And The Collagen. Making The Meat Looks Horrible And Smashed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>ENJOY YOUR COOKING</strong> - The professional stainless steel meat tenderiser keep the shape and appearance of the meat when do the meat tenderiser knuckle, creates tiny aisles in the meat, to reduce the cooking time by up to 40% and helps maintain the original taste and flavour.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>SUITABLE FOR 