cation –</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>Battery Capacity</strong>:1800mAh<br>\r\n<strong>Charger Time</strong>:4 Hours<br>\r\n<strong>Power / voltage</strong>:80W / DC 12V<br>\r\n<strong>Motor model</strong>:385 motor<br>\r\n<strong>Cylinder diameter</strong>:16mm<br>\r\n<strong>Inflation Efficiency</strong>:25L/min<br>\r\n<strong>Max Inflation Pressure</strong>:150PSI / 10.3BAR / 990KPA / 10.5KG/CM<br>\r\n<strong>Pressure Units</strong>: PSI, BAR, KPA, KG/CM2<br>\r\n<strong>0-2.5KG inflation time (195 / 55R15 tire)</strong>:12 minutes and 50 seconds<br>\r\n<strong>The number of tires fully charged (195 / 55R15 tires)</strong>:1-2 tires<br>\r\n<strong>Inflatable noise (at one meter):</strong>less than 80 decibels<br>\r\n<strong>Relevant certification:</strong> CE / ROHS / FCC / PSE / MSDS<br>\r\n<strong>Working Temperature:-</strong> 20°C~ + 70°C<br>\r\n<strong>Input Voltage:</strong> DC 5 - 15V (USB cable)<br>\r\n<strong>Working Current:</strong>1~5A<br>\r\n<strong>Floodlight</strong>:80Lumens<br>\r\n<strong>Weight</strong>:600g<br>\r\n<strong>Outer Air Hose Length:</strong>15cm (5.9 inch)</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Application –</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n1.Multiple Use is designed for your life<br>\r\n2.For car/SUV/RV tires from relatively low pressure to preset pressure<br>\r\n3.For bike/motorcycle tires<br>\r\n4.For sports equipment<br>\r\n5.For inflatable toys</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Note: NOT for van, coaches, motor homes, trucks.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Operation Steps - </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Connect the hose into the bottom tire valve core.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Press down the buckle on the air hose to prevent air leaking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Press the button \"Unit\" to wake up the LCD screen.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. Press the button \"+\" and \"-\" to preset tire pressure.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>5. Press the power button to start inflating; it will stop automatically when the preset pressure is reached.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package Included –</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n1 XAir Compressor<br>\r\n1 X USB Charging Cable<br>\r\n1 X Air Hose<br>\r\n1 X Ball Needle<br>\r\n1 X Toy Nozzle<br>\r\n1 X Storage Box<br>\r\n1 X User Manual</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.6,22,5.51,5.51,150,99.99,'25','1','1','1','16020710563220portable_tyre_inflator.jpg','16020710563220portable_tyre_inflator1.jpg','16020710563220portable_tyre_inflator2.jpg','16020710563220portable_tyre_inflator3.jpg','16020710563220portable_tyre_inflator4.jpg','16020710563220portable_tyre_inflator5.jpg','16020710563220portable_tyre_inflator6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-10-07 11:44:17'),(691,'Women Canvas 4Pcs/set School & College Backpacks for Teenager Girls ',0,0,'women-canvas-4pcsset-school-college-backpacks-for-teenager-girls','teenagerbackp0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/32936092771.html?spm=a2g0o.detail.1000060.1.31d2562dt4exaj&gps-id=pcDetailBottomMoreThisSeller&scm=1007.13339.169870.0&scm_id=1007.13339.169870.0&scm-url=1007.13339.169870.0&pvid=4c4ef185-46b3-4542-9ab3-4379aa85f3ec&_t=gps-id:pcDetailBottomMoreThisSeller,scm-url:1007.13339.169870.0,pvid:4c4ef185-46b3-4542-9ab3-4379aa85f3ec,tpp_buckets:668#0#131923#89_668#808#3772#904_668#888#3325#3_668#2846#8114#755_668#2717#7567#996_668#1000022185#1000066058#0_668#3468#15612#314','china','<ul>\r\n <li>Size: Backpack:19(L)*13(W)*43cm(H) , Weight: 0.60KG; Handbag: 20(L)*5(W)*22cm(H)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>High density canvas fabric, durable, wear-resistant and anti-tear; Multifunctional: Used as school bags, laptop backpack, casual daypack, school backpack, travel rucksack.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Comfortable: Widen and thicken shoulder straps, breathable padded back, nylon decompression handle alleviate burdens on your shoulders and hands.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li