\n<p>Not only can illuminate your life,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>But also add more color to your life.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Make your life smarter,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Improve the happiness of your life.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Intelligent Control Remotely Function:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Work with Wi-Fi(2.4GHz) or cellphone traffic, Control your bulb anywhere with your ios/andriod Smartphone or tablet. App allows you to control a single bulb, or group bulbs and control them together. Work with Amazon Alexa and can be voice controlled</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Lighting Colorful:16 million colors(white +RGB) change</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>16 million colors(warm + cool white +RGB) change, and every color is dimmable from 100% to 1%, regulating in a wide range. Choose different colors to suit your mood Scene Mode:You can switch mode freely when you are sleeping, reading or at a movie night. It Can be used in the home indoor lighting, hotel, meeting room, bar, cocktail party, birthday party, etc. Just find your favorite scene atmosphere</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Time Function And Wake Up Function:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Schedule your bulb to turn on or off at specific time. Wake up in the morning to your favoritecolors. Come home to a bright and well lit home. During Vacation make it look like someone’s home, even when you’re not. Take control of your lighting from your Smartphone or Tablet. App allows you to control a single bulb, or group bulbs and control them together.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>VOICE CONTROL Function</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Compatible with your a lexa and Google Home , Control your lights just by your voice. Just ask to command.Work with IFTTT, Personalize your lighting through a color palette of over 16 million hues of color to control its brightness and tones. You can dim any color from dark to bright . You can choose color modes for different scenes, such as reading mode, dinner mode, etc., just at your fingertips or your voice.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>EASY TO INSTALL</st