></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The two hammock hang buckles are directly hung on the tying rope, and the mosquito nets are automatically opened for 1 second to avoid the trouble of pulling the rope in the past. Mix the ground nails and the wind rope on the side to make the space of the hammock bigger and more stretched.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>NO.4, easy to defend against \"enemy\" attacks</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The integrated automatic mosquito net is made of encrypted nylon mesh, the mesh is even and fine, and the small mosquitoes will not enter, effectively preventing the infestation of insects, sand and leaves.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>NO.5, lightweight and portable to carry</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Lightweight parachute cloth material, the whole bed weighs only 740 grams, light and portable. The side-connected integrated storage bag design allows you to store the hammock and place your belongings. The storage size is only about 30*22CM, and the hammock can be folded and stored easily. Quick and convenient, and will not cause the bag to be lost, the storage bag can also be placed in the hammock when hanging up, a multi-purpose.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>NO.6, a variety of usages vary with you</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>According to your own preferences and the use environment, you can flip the hammock, you can turn into a common hammock without mosquito nets, sit or lie, or use as a swing.</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.79,28,20,16,100,95,'24','1','1','2','16038834957977Hammock_Tent_with_Mosquito_Nets.jpg','16038834957977Hammock_Tent_with_Mosquito_Nets1.jpg','16038834957977Hammock_Tent_with_Mosquito_Nets2.jpg','16038834957977Hammock_Tent_with_Mosquito_Nets3.jpg','16038834957977Hammock_Tent_with_Mosquito_Nets4.jpg','16038834957977Hammock_Tent_with_Mosquito_Nets5.jpg','16038834957977Hammock_Tent_with_Mosquito_Nets6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-10-28 11:11:36'),(724,'Men Printed Beach Shorts Casual Loose Sports - Surfing Shorts Su