essure </strong>has long been a best kept secret for pain relief. Now you can get immediate back and neck pain relief in the comfort of your own home in as little as 20 minutes per day. Enjoy immediate natural pain relief in your own home without the expense of a chiropractor, masseuse, acupuncturist or physical therapist with Acupressure Mat and Pillow Set. Acupressure Mat is designed to stimulate the pressure points along the meridians of the body. It assists in improving the blood circulation of the body. It is helpful in increasing the energy flow and providing relief in muscle pain. Made of cotton fabric, sponge and polypropylene materials, environmentally friendly and harmless. Activate the nervous system, allowing you to relax deeply in natural healing.(Note) : Pregnant women, the skin surface inflammation or open wounds, hypotension, heart disease with caution, children need to be used under adult supervision.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/820751045.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>PAIN REDUCTION:</strong> Naturally reduce muscle tension, back pain, and headaches by simply laying on the mat daily for 10-30 minutes. Acupressure releases endorphins that block pain, and helps relax the muscles in your back, neck and feet.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>STRESS RELIEF:</strong> Acupressure mats, also known as acupuncture mats, stimulate circulation and blood flow. The tiny needles massage trigger points relieving stress, headaches, exhaustion, insomnia and nerve pain. Lay back and relax onto this \"bed of needles\" to massage pressure points that help release tight muscles and relieve stress. Use prior to bedtime to improve your sleep.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>FULL SUPPORT: </strong>The cushioned foam mat is large enough to fit your full back, and unlike many mats that only cover your back, this set includes a pillow cover