 15 minutes and then store it away.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>Warning:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n <li>Be kept out the reach of children as they are possible sources of danger.</li>\r\n <li>Pay special attention to the external parts of iron plates, they are very hot and may cause burning.</li>\r\n <li>Avoid touching the skin on the neck or face.</li>\r\n <li>Keep the curler closed for 10 seconds at most so that you do not damage the hair.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<br>\r\nThermal conductivity material: Tourmaline Ceramic<br>\r\nVoltage: 110-220V<br>\r\nFrequency: 50/60Hz<br>\r\nPower: 45W<br>\r\nApplicable hair: Dry<br>\r\nHeating element: PTC heating element<br>\r\nTemperature control: Adjustable 170°C, 220°C<br>\r\nColor: Gold<br>\r\nWeight: 402g<br>\r\nCable length: 1.7m<br>\r\nSize: Approx. 33.5x8.2cm(Length*Width)<br>\r\n </p>\r\n',0,'1',0.5,40,8.8,7.8,99,49,'25','1','1','1','16049411387044hair_curler_electric.jpg','16049411387044hair_curler_electric1.jpg','16049411387044hair_curler_electric2.jpg','16049411387044hair_curler_electric3.jpg','16049411387044hair_curler_electric4.jpg','16049411387044hair_curler_electric5.jpg','16049411387044hair_curler_electric6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-11-09 16:58:59'),(765,'Giant Unicorn Plush Toy Soft Stuffed - Unicorn Soft Dolls Animal Horse Toys For Children Girl Pillow Birthday Gifts',0,0,'giant-unicorn-plush-toy-soft-stuffed-unicorn-soft-dolls-animal-horse-toys-for-children-girl-pillow-birthday-gifts','sftdl0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000114119635.html?spm=a2g0o.tm538100.4718822260.19.7100ejL8ejL8uX&&scm=1007.25281.150765.0&scm_id=1007.25281.150765.0&scm-url=1007.25281.150765.0&pvid=8beceed4-618c-4af1-b977-440fbc137d1d&utparam={','china','<ul>\r\n <li>This cute soft plush animal pillow is a best gift for festival and holiday, nobody can refuse the Kawaii seal.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Rich PP cotton filler and made of skin friendly s