o wings can support the neck to prevent the neck from hanging and sleep peacefully. Aluminum alloy support rod, leaning firmly.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>EASY INSTALLATION -</strong> Push and press install in one second. Suitable for 99?r models, comfortable to lean on without affecting the normal driving. Wipe the surface layer of leather with wet paper towelor rag, which is simple and convenient.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>100% SERVICE -</strong> If you are confused about the quality of the product or have any other questions, you can email us and we will be happy to solve the problem for you. If you are not satisfied or inappropriate about the product, you can contact us and we will give you a satisfactory answer.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>SPECIFICATION</strong><strong> -</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Material: PU leather + aluminum alloy</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Front Size:270*123mm</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Side Size:181*123mm</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Weight?1160 g</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Color: Black</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Package includes:  1 Car Neck Pillows</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features -</strong><br>\r\n<br>\r\nAre you trying to find a head and neck rest solution when drive or go for a travel in the train, road trip or airplane? This cervial roll car neck pillow would be your wise choice.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nRound roll design absolutely conforms to your neck curve, works well in back pain relief.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe comfortable supports to your head and neck will greatly improves driving experience,also great for napping pillow on long trips.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nMemory foam softens in reaction to body heat, allowing it to mold to a warm body in a few minutes. After leaving, it will recovery fast.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nWith compact design,wherever you go,you can take the light neck back pillow with you.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nBuckle design,easy to install,and you can attach it with your luggage when go for travel<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe removable