der uv/led lamp<br>\r\n5. Seal it with uv top coat and cure it under uv/led lamp<br>\r\n<br>\r\nVery simple and very beautiful nail ornaments.<br>\r\nThis is a more common decoration used in nail decoration to increase the atmosphere of Christmas. It can be added to crystal powder and nail polish, and then it has a flavor on the nail.</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.005,12.7,7.87,1.27,12.99,5.99,'24','1','1','1','16062235017376Nail_Arts_Decorations.jpg','16062235017376Nail_Arts_Decorations1.jpg','16062235017376Nail_Arts_Decorations2.jpg','16062235017376Nail_Arts_Decorations3.jpg','16062235017376Nail_Arts_Decorations4.jpg','16062235017376Nail_Arts_Decorations5.jpg','16062235017376Nail_Arts_Decorations6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-11-24 13:11:42'),(842,'Fun Loving Inflatable Water Slide for Children',0,30,'fun-loving-inflatable-water-slide-for-children','wtrsld0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005001762083855.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.5946335aYRoMz0&algo_pvid=0e07f6c3-5fb0-44fc-b055-097fd3d0eb6a&algo_expid=0e07f6c3-5fb0-44fc-b055-097fd3d0eb6a-18&btsid=0bb0620316061240630217447e59de&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>3 IN 1 Water Slide</strong> : Water Slide , Slide & Sprinkler In One! Length 432cm / 170\", width 66cm / 25.98\". Amazing summer fun for Kids. Water-spraying bumper all over the rainbow slide and an air-filled cushion at the end which works as a crash pad. Just slip, slide and get soaked with this inflatable water slide.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>WATER SPRINKLER</strong>: 14 Ft super long water slide with zigzag spray pattern sprinkler system runs the length of the slide for awesome water coverage for long great sliding. Add soap for extra slide. A hit with the kids and adults. Great for cooling off and having fun during the summer months.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>LONGER & DURABLE</strong> : Long 14 ft giant wat