, hiking, driving or even gardening.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>SEAMLESS COMFORT:</strong> Unlike other sun sleeves that make you itchy and leave imprints all over your arms, these sun sleeves are seamless. We make sure you&#39;ll be comfortable and happy.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>STRETCH FIT AND FULL HAND COVERAGE:</strong> Our sleeves are incredibly durable and stretchy. Easy to machine wash and hang dry. The hand cover ensures full coverage while the thumb holes will keep your arm sleeves in place. Our stretchy 89% polyester 11% spandex blend makes them perfect for both men and women. Sold as 1 pair.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Product Descriptions</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Sport Cooling Arm Warmers Sleeves Cover Sun Protective UV Cover Golf Unisex</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Color:Black,White,Blue,Pink<br>\r\nItem Type:Arm Warmers<br>\r\nGlove Size:about 34cm (stretchable about 100cm)<br>\r\nWrist Size:about 8cm (stretchable about 13cm)<br>\r\nFunction:sun protection, anti-UV, anti-UV, moisture wicking, cooling<br>\r\nMaterial:Ice silk<br>\r\nGender:Unisex</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Packaging</strong>:1pair of the Arm Warmers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Note:</strong>Please allow some slight color difference as different lights and monitors always show different colors. Thanks for understanding!</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.045,20.32,7.87,0.05,19.99,9.99,'25','1','1','1','16063256125147sun_screen_sleeves.jpg','16063256125147sun_screen_sleeves1.jpg','16063256125147sun_screen_sleeves2.jpg','16063256125147sun_screen_sleeves3.jpg','16063256125147sun_screen_sleeves4.jpg','16063256125147sun_screen_sleeves5.jpg','16063256125147sun_screen_sleeves6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-11-25 17:33:33'),(850,'Waterfall Fountain with Color Changing LED Lights Spray - Wealth Fengshui',0,30,'waterfall-fountain-with-color-changing-led-lights-spray-wealth-fengshui','watrflfutin0001','https://www