r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Notes:</strong><br>\r\nDue to the light and screen setting difference, the item&#39;s color may be slightly different from the pictures.<br>\r\nPlease allow slight dimension difference due to different manual measurement.</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.63502,22,17,30,149,99,'25','1','1','1','16063263599627waterfall_fountain_for_garden.jpg','16063263599627waterfall_fountain_for_garden1.jpg','16063263599627waterfall_fountain_for_garden2.jpg','16063263599627waterfall_fountain_for_garden3.jpg','16063263599627waterfall_fountain_for_garden4.jpg','16063263599627waterfall_fountain_for_garden5.jpg','',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-11-25 17:46:00'),(851,'Waterproof Feeding Bibs For Baby Feeding',0,30,'waterproof-feeding-bibs-for-baby-feeding','babybibs0002','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000464125761.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.19ea62a5NtJq1c&algo_pvid=e45b1aab-5406-419f-a2c3-e5f6016be779&algo_expid=e45b1aab-5406-419f-a2c3-e5f6016be779-7&btsid=2100bde116063807151795903ee66c&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>SUPERIOR & BABY SAFE MATERIAL</strong>: This food catching baby bibs are made from 100% food grade and BPA free silicone. Silicone feeding bib is a better choice than cloth bibs because they are anti-bacterial and don’t absorb water or food, making them the most hygienic choice for your baby.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>ONE SIZE FITS ALL</strong>: The easy-to-adjust strap of our food grade silicone bib feature 6 buttonholes and 2 tightening buttons, making this bib suitable for babies aged 6 months old to 3 years. The buttons secure the bib and strap makes it easy to put on and remove the bibs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>WIDE & STAY OPEN FRONT POCKET</strong>: Feeding will be mess-free because these baby feeding bib feature a built-in food pocket that catches all the food and drink spills. The pouch is designed to stay open and in its shape, so there will less mess on your child’s cloth, high chair and the floor.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>EASY TO CLEAN & DISHWASHER SAFE</strong>: Yes we know how precious a parent’s time is and that is why our feeder bibs can be easily cleaned by hand or in the dishwasher. Soft silicon dries quickly and does not absorb stains so all you have to do is wash them with soapy water and they will be ready to use again.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>FOR THE MUM ON THE GO</strong>: These easy to carry mealtime bibs can be easily rolled up and put it diaper bag or even purse for travel, shopping, restaurant visits, or day out with your baby. The space-saving design of feeding bibs also fits easily in your car glove compartment, stroller pocket, or kitchen drawers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Functionality At Its Best</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Adjustable straps - fits babies from age 6 months to 3 years.</li>\r\n <li>Stays Put - buttons secure the bib for a snug fit so your child cannot easily open it.</li>\r\n <li>Lightweight design and rounded edges - ensures maximum comfort. He won’t even feel like he is wearing it.</li>\r\n <li>Wide neckline - designed to fit seamlessly to your baby’s curvature.</li>\r\n <li>Stain-resistant and quick-drying material - allows convenient cleaning.</li>\r\n <li>Slim and lightweight yet durable - will last for years to come.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Stylish Babies needs stylish stuff too:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Get your cameras on! Because the only thing more adorable than your baby is your baby eating wearing this super cute bib. We have designed our baby animal bib to be very attractive and charming, just like your baby. The vibrant colors and beautiful designs are sure will be loved by all. Plus these baby bibs are unisex too.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Why Choose Silicone Bibs Over Plastic & Cloth Bibs?</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The main reason why silicon bibs should be preferred is that they are much more convenient, functional and most importantly, hygienic. In cloth bibs, the food and liquid can get stuck in seams where mildew can set in. And cleaning and drying them is a task. While the hard plastic bibs are not so comfortable for your baby and don’t get rolled up, so they take too much space. Plus they are easily ripped off and can get scuffs or scratches with just a few days of use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package Includes:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 x Silicone Baby Bibs (Green & Blue)</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.075,28.1,24.1,4.2,19.99,9.99,'25','1','1','1','16063961947727Waterproff_bibs.jpg','16063961947727Waterproff_bibs1.jpg','16063961947727Waterproff_bibs2.jpg','16063961947727Waterproff_bibs3.jpg','16063961947727Waterproff_bibs4.jpg','16063961947727Waterproff_bibs5.jpg','16063961947727Waterproff_bibs6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-11-26 13:09:56'),(852,'Silver and Gold Jewelry Cleaner 100ML Bottle',0,30,'silver-and-gold-jewelry-cleaner-100ml-bottle','jwlryclnr123','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000630132760.html?spm=a2g0o.detail.1000060.3.20f114d1CuH2IX&gps-id=pcDetailBottomMoreThisSeller&scm=1007.13339.169870.0&scm_id=1007.13339.169870.0&scm-url=1007.13339.169870.0&pvid=f45fbc09-8a37-41fb-8c7e-6fa57b725c56&_t=gps-id:pcDetailBottomMoreThisSeller,scm-url:1007.13339.169870.0,pvid:f45fbc09-8a37-41fb-8c7e-6fa57b725c56,tpp_buckets:668#0#131923#0_668#808#4094#544_668#888#3325#15_668#2846#8108#150_668#2717#7566#900_668#1000022185#1000066059#0_668#3468#15618#956','china','<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Our cleaner is formulated to safely clean gold, palladium, platinum, sterling silver, stainless steel,  titanium, Diamonds, CZ, pearls, beads, porous stones, soft stones, enamel, treated gemstones and more!</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>2.our solution contains absolutely no ammonia or harsh chemicals. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Specially formulated to deep clean while not harming your jewellery with abrasive chemicals. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>100% non-toxic and biodegradable.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specification:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Type: Liquid</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Main Material: Hydrogen Peroxide & Suede Fabric</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Net Weight: 100ml</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Quantity: 1 Pc</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>How to use: </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>    1. Shake homogeneous before use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>    2. Fill with this liquid on your towel or cotton bud and wipe your jewelry.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>   3. Remain it for about one minute to make it effective.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>   4. Wipe it lastly with a dry towel.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Note:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Please allow 1-3cm error due to manual measurement. pls make sure you do not mind before you bid.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Due to the difference between different monitors, the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item. Thank you!</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package includes(without retail package):</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>100 ML x Jewelry Cleaner Solution.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n',0,'1',0.136,14.73,4.06,3.05,99.99,49.99,'25','1','1','1','16063968836972diamond_jewellery_cleaner.jpg','16063968836972diamond_jewellery_cleaner1.jpg','16063968836972diamond_jewellery_cleaner2.jpg','16063968836972diamond_jewellery_cleaner3.jpg','16063968836972diamond_jewellery_cleaner4.jpg','16063968836972diamond_jewellery_cleaner5.jpg','16063968836972diamond_jewellery_cleaner6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-11-26 13:21:24'),(853,'Yongnuo YN360III Handheld 3200K-5500K RGB Colorful Ice Stick LED Video Light - Adjusting Controlled by Phone App',0,0,'yongnuo-yn360iii-handheld-3200k-5500k-rgb-colorful-ice-stick-led-video-light-adjusting-controlled-by-phone-app','ledvdolightstick0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000119091415.html?spm=a2g0o.detail.100009.2.15943910pZ8I44&