igh CRI</strong><br>\r\nAdopts 360 well-selected high-quality lamp beads with  big luminous chip, color rendering index is greater than or equal to 95, YN360III can perfectly restore the true color of the object.<br>\r\n <br>\r\nSupports YONGNUO LED wireless control system, YN360III can realize mutual communication and synchronous control function with other YONGNUO LED lights.<br>\r\n <br>\r\n<strong>Two Power Supply Modes</strong><br>\r\n1.Applicable battery:NP-F550,NP-F750,NP-F970 <br>\r\n2.Supports external DC power supply for long time use,the applicable voltage is: 12V 2A (Please do not use the laptop power supply).<br>\r\n <br>\r\n*Adopts YONGNUO LED constant current driving technology specially developed for LED video light,  light output is stable and  intuitive, photographic effect is more reliable. the details of the selling point above, attracting and providing trust to your potential users.<br>\r\n </span></span></span></span></span></span><br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Specification</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><br>\r\n<span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Color Temperature:3200K,5500K and RGB full color <br>\r\nColor Rendering Index: greater than or equal to 95<br>\r\nRemote Distance: less than 15meters<br>\r\nPower:21.6W and 10.8W          Lumen Value:2790LM<br>\r\nWeight:approx.805g     <br>\r\nIllumination Angle:55 degrees and 110 degrees  <br>\r\nExternal DC Power Supply: 12V 2A  DC power<br>\r\nDimension: 583*48*24mm</span></span></span></span></span></span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Kit 1 Package Listing:</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span><br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p xs