d, can be very easily removed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Suitable for private car, cars, trains, buses, trucks, ships and other modes of transport!Rapid escape by breaking the window in one second.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Break in one hit / Sharp cutting knife / Scratch-proof design / Mini and compact</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>1. Water ponding</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>If the water ponding is too deep, the vehicle will sink deeply and the possibility of drowning will increase.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>2. Fire</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>In case of a fire in the car, the doors and windows could not be opened, the risk of danger is multiplied.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>3. Fall into the water</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>In case of an accidental falling into the water, and unable to open the car door, it could lead to a tragedy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>2-in-1 Safety Hammer + Seat Belt Cutter</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>This life saving gadget has the power to get you out of trouble when you need it most.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Solid and universal tungsten steel head</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tungsten steel has a Rockwell hardness of 55 and can easily cut metal and glass.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Gun-type spring breaks window with skills</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The working principle of gun type produces strong impact force instantly. Easily break a window even for a young lady. Instantly break a window in 0.1s Impact force of 6kg</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Break (a window) even under the pressure of water</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Never breaks the window with force, easily break the window even underwater.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Emergency escape without obstruction</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Built-in stainless steel cutter helps you quickly and easily cut off safety belt in case of a danger.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Safe without hurting hands</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>U-shaped opening prevents reaching in of fingers and accidental scratches.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Mini and simple, portable with you</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The size and weight are the same as car keys, thus it is simpler and more fashionable.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Metal and dull polished, match your car even more</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Aluminium alloy in the car, high and low temperature resistant.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Fixed in the car, reassured and safety guaranteed</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Complimentary storage base can be attached to the car freely to make driving safer.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Instructions</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>How to use the window breaking hammer</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1..Pull off the lid</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Press gently at the four corners of the side window. (The front and rear windshields are explosion-proof windows, more force is required.)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Remove broken pieces and escape.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>How to use the safety belt cutter</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1.Fasten the hanging rope and pull off the lid.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2.Align the notch with the side of the safety belt and pushed forward.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3.Cut the safety belt</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.09,24.5,8,3.7,49.99,29.99,'25','1','1','2','16075318778735Car_glass_hammer.jpg','16075318778735Car_glass_hammer1.jpg','16075318778735Car_glass_hammer2.jpg','16075318778735Car_glass_hammer3.jpg','16075318778735Car_glass_hammer4.jpg','16075318778735Car_glass_hammer5.jpg','16075318778735Car_glass_hammer6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-12-09 16:37:59'),(895,'Funny Middle Finger Have A Nice Day Slogan Creative Mug',0,0,'funny-middle-finger-have-a-nice-day-slogan-creative-mug','cofemug0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1000005893425.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.429975acTTFtgE&algo_pvid=fc30b7a8-ba92-4f35-9b65-ec1606a68e3a&algo_expid=fc30b7a8-ba92-4f35-9b65-ec1606a68e3a-2&btsid=0b0a187916069836532497984e2156&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','china','<ul>\r\n <li>Funny coffee mu