ong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Separated Design</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>11.8 inch Width for shrink-wrapping allows you to seal more than 2 or 3 bags of food at the same time. You can take off the upper lid to clean the sealer machine easily & safely. Compact size and lightweight design are easy to store and move around. Fits up to almost all sealer bags and rolls.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Multifunctional Vacuuming Modes:</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>More selectable modes including dry and moist modes provide best food preservation based on your different types of food. Not only a sous-vide cooking assistant but also ideal for jar sealing and red wine preservation sealing.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed>Automatic Vacuum Sealing System</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Food Saving, Space Saving, Time Saving and Money Saving.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Keep your busy kitchen running smoothly.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Preserve food and wine with vacuum sealing.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Prepare foods in advance for picnics, camping trips and barbecues.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Maintain the freshness of dry foods such as beans, nuts, and cereals.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Package foods such as meat, fish, poultry, seafood and vegetables for refrigerated storage.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Cook food in advance then vacuum seal individual portions or entire meals for later consumption.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed>Packing Includes:</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>1 x Automatic Food Sealer Vacuum Packing Machine</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>10 x Vacuum Sealer Bags (10x7.9 inches)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>1 x Vacuum Tube</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>1 x User Manual</span></span></span></p>\r\n',0,'1',1.6,43,20.2,10,180,170,'25','1','1','2','16079633531533food_vacuum_sealer.jpg','16079633531533food_vacuum_sealer1.jpg','16079633531533food_vacuum_sealer2.jpg','16079633531533food_vacuum_sealer3.jpg','16079633531533food_vacuum_sealer4.jpg','16079633531533food_vacuum_sealer5.jpg','16079633531533food_vacuum_sealer6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-12-14 16:29:14'),(910,'IPS HD Graphics Drawing Display Digital Tablet Monitor With 8 Shortcut Keys & 8192 Levels Battery-Free Pen',0,0,'ips-hd-graphics-drawing-display-digital-tablet-monitor-with-8-shortcut-keys-8192-levels-battery-free-pen','dgtldrwtblt0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/33028093884.html?spm=a2g0o.tm593792.1810266160.9.11236bAM6bAMyZ&gps-id=seaZeus&scm=1007.25281.191399.0&scm_id=1007.25281.191399.0&scm-url=1007.25281.191399.0&pvid=0b9a3712-6d3a-4ce3-a109-52175b3805e4','China','<p>1. <strong>8192 LEVELS PASSIVE PEN</strong> - With 8192 Levels Pen Pressure, it enables accurate, smooth, neat and natural lines during digital creation. With the battery free technology, no need to charge the pen or replace battery anymore, which is environment-friendly. The silicone covers the hand holding part of the pen, which can get your hands no pain and no discomfort after prolonged creation. [8 Replacement Nibs]--- are placed in the pen holder, Pen nib Clip is integrated at the bottom of the holder.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. <strong>8 SHORTCUT KEYS - </strong>There are 8 shortcut keys available to be customized according to your own creative habits, like zoom in/out, scroll up and down, and more, to accelerate your work efficiency. [5 Menu Keys]---- AUTO/+ /- /MENU/POWER. They are placed at left side of board. You can make adjustments of color, brightness, contrast, etc. through here.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>3.<strong> LIGHT WEIGHT & PORTABLE - </strong>With 866g (1.9lb) net weight, 11.6 inch PD1161 is engineered for great convenience with carefree creation experience, offering you sufficient working space. And it is easy to carry the pen display to anywhere you need, like the workplace, school, outdoor painting and a temporary trip so that you can use the tablet for on the go creation. You are free to record your inspiration without limits.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. <strong>IPS FULL HD SCREEN - </strong>Screen Resolution: 1920 x 1080?16:9?Resolution:5080LPI Report Rate: 266PPS  Display Area: 256.32 x 144.18mm(10.09*5.68 inch) Accuracy:±0.5mm (Centre) \\ ±3mm(Corner)  Sensing Height:10mm  Signal Output: Mini HDMI&Type-C. Viewing able: 89°/89°(H)/89°/89°(V) (Typ.)(CR?10) </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>5.<strong> OS SUPPORT& PROGRAM COMPATIBILITY - </strong>Seamlessly compatible with Win 7 or macOS 10.12 or above.  It is ideal for drawing, photography, animation, fashion, sketching, image editing, 3D sculpture, drawing beginners, painting enthusiasts, architectural designers etc. And it is compatible with most painting software, like Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, Clip Studio, Light room, Sketchbook Pro, Manga Studio, Corel Painter, Fire Alpaca, Open Canvas, Paint Tool Sai2, Krita and so on.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Portable Size</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The 11.6 inches working area is definitely enough for your needs. Plus with 15mm thickness and 1.65kg weight, it&#39;s easy to carry together with your laptop in your backpack.. You are free to record your inspiration without limits.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Remarkable Screen</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>IPS LCD screen with 178°viewing angle, it provides you with a vast working area, allows you to see the screen in a very comfortable way. 1920*1080 full HD can present the details of your artwork with accuracy, deliver incredible visual clarity and color saturation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>DUAL/TRI MONITOR SUPPORT</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Duplicated Mode: The PD1161 will display exact the same with your computer monitor. What you draw on PD1161, it will display on your computer monitor.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Windows OS: Press ‘Windows’ on keyboard----Check ‘Duplicate’</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mac OS: System Preference-- Displays--Arrangement-- Check the ‘’Mirror Displays’’</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Extended Mode: PD1161 display the wall paper of PD1161 without programs on it. You can draw on PD1161 while computer monitor can display other things separately.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Windows OS: Press ‘Windows’ on keyboard----Check ‘Duplicate’---Open GAOMON Driver Panel--Work Area---You will see options: Display 1/Display 2/All Displays--- Choose PD1161 1920*1080 one as work area, it is usually Display 2---Apply and OK.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mac OS: System Preference-- Displays--Arrangement-- Uncheck the ‘’Mirror Displays’’-- Open GAOMON Driver Panel--Work Area---You will see options: Display 1/Display 2/All Displays--- Choose PD1161 1920*1080 one as work area, it is usually Display 2---Apply and OK.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>As for Tri-Monitor support, it depends on whether your computer graphic card support 3 monitors connected at the same time.If your computer supports it, please refer to above instruction for Dual monitor settings.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Notes:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1- Before installing driver, please uninstall all tablet drivers from your computer, and keep all antivirus program closed, after installation then restart your computer. You can download the driver from our official website: gaomon dot net.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>2- we cover 1 year warranty basing on non-human made damages and accident damages, any assistance, feel free to contact us!</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>3- for Mac Mojave Users: Mac 10.14 new OS requires higher permission for newly downloaded programs. After Gaomon driver is installed, please open system preference---security &privacy---Please add.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>‘’GaomonTable’’t and ’’TabletDriverAgent’’ into the list, to make sure the pen works properly in mac 10.14 new os.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Product Parameter</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Product Model: PD1161</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Digital Pen: Art Paint AP50</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Screen Size: 11.6 Inches</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Screen Resolution: 1920 x 1080?16:9?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Liquid Crystal Type: IPS</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dimension: 361.6 x 200 x 13 mm</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Active Area: 256.32 x 144.18 mm</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Contrast Ratio: 1000?1</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Brightness: 220 cd/m2</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Report Time: 25 ms</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Resolution: 5080 LPI</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Pressure Sensitivity: 8192 Levels</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Reading Height: 10mm</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Report Rate: 266 PPS</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Net Weight: 866g</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Gross Weight: 1.65 kg</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Signal Interface: Mini HDMI, Type-C</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Accuracy: ±0.5mm (Centre) \\ ±3mm(Corner)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Pen Technology: Battery Free Electromagnetic Resonance</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Viewing Angle: 89deg/89deg (H)/89deg/89deg (V) (Typ.) (CR?10)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>OS Support: Windows 7 or later, macOS 10.12 or later  </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>What&#39;s in the box</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Pen Display PD1161 x 1</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Passive Pen AP50 x 1</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Power Adapter x 1</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Pen Holder x 1 (Replacement Nibsx8 inside)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Glove x 1</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3-in-1 Integrated Cablex1</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Quick Start Guide x 1</p>\r\n',0,'1',1.65,40.2,24.2,7.6,450,410,'25','1','1','2','16079685082927Drawing_Digital_Tablet.jpg','16079685082927Drawing_Digital_Tablet1.jpg','16079685082927Drawing_Digital_Tablet2.jpg','16079685082927Drawing_Digital_Tablet3.jpg','16079685082927Drawing_Digital_Tablet4.jpg','16079685082927Drawing_Digital_Tablet5.jpg','16079685082927Drawing_Digital_Tablet6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-12-14 17:55:10'),(911,'Document Camera Scanner A3 Capture Size Dual Camera - USB2.0 High Speed Scanner',0,0,'document-camera-scanner-a3-capture-size-dual-camera-usb20-high-speed-scanner','dcumntsnr0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005001741508285.html?spm=a2g0o.tm593792.2269449530.17.11236bAM6bAMyZ&gps-id=seaZeus&scm=1007.25281.191399.0&scm_id=1007.25281.191399.0&scm-url=1007.25281.191399.0&pvid=f1e3c9c6-4f37-44b8-bd6e-b8bed64cb2e3','China','<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Dual Camera Scanner</span><span xss=removed> </span></span></span></span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>: </span></span></span></span></strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>3264*2448(8 megapixel)main camera for for documents or objects scanning, 1600*1200(2 megapixel)sub camera for portrait shooting. Sub camera can rotate 270°horizontally.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><br>\r\n<span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>High Speed Scanning</span><span xss=removed> </span></span></span></span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>: </span></span></span></span></strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Just click the mouse, then you can get the picture in about 1 second, very efficient. The height of the scanner is adjustable, and the scan size is up to A3. Support shooting/continuous shooting/timing continuous shooting.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><br>\r\n<span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Practical Functions</span><span xss=removed> </span></span></span></span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>: </span></span></span></span></strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Support color/gray/black and white scanning, automatic correction, ID card merging, picture merging, set watermarks. Supports OCR function(can recognize English & Chinese), which can convert image format into editable word format. Support for exporting images in PDF and TIFF format.</span