s area-imaging pocket scanner.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Quickly pair the scanner with your iOS, Android or Windows Mobile device, or a standard PC or laptop equipped with Bluetooth wireless technology.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Scan virtually all 1D and 2D barcodes – even poor quality, damaged, or low contrast codes – with the same high-performance area-imaging engine found in our full-size handheld scanners.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Scan barcodes right off your customers’ mobile phone screens for revenue-generating mobile marketing initiatives.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>The C750 scanner has the looks to complement the clean design of consumer zed devices while comfortably moving with your mobile workers. Its contoured design fits perfectly in the palm. Soft touch plastics, an over-sized trigger button with tactile feedback, and a white LED aimer make scanning easy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>The NETUM® C750 pocket scanner is ideal for a variety of tablet-based applications, including:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Fixed point-of-sale</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mobile point-of-sale</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Inventory management</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Backroom/stockroom</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In-store customer engagement</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Non-retail scanning applications such as sales force automation</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Important Note:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Some types of barcodes cannot be decoded by this 2.4G wireless &Bluetooth scanner before you program it. In this case please contact us to get the command barcodes to program it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. When scanner makes 2 beeps please charge power for it immediately.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Product Name: C740 Bluetooth CCD (1D) Barcode Scanner</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. NETUM C740 3 in 1 connections: Scanner can work via 2.4G USB Dongle (by default) or USB cable or Bluetooth.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Easy installation: If you work via 2.4G USB dongle or USB cable ,both ways are plug and play. If there&#39;s no USB interface on your device you can work it via Bluetooth.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Excellent decoding speed for reading 1D barcodes</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. Scanner is able to decode 1D barcodes from paper or LCD screen.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>5. Scanner can be programmed to have auto-scan function. An affordable stand is available to support this model</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>6. Scanner can be programmed to have prefix or suffix.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>7. C740 Scanner decodes many kinds of 1D  barcodes in a very fast speed,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>including CODE128, UPC/EAN Add on 2 or 5</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>8. This wireless&Bluetooth scanner has flash memory, can store around 2000 code128.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>9. The reader can be able to connect it with different kinds of devices, like laptops, tablets, phones, and POS systems. Compatible with windows, Mac OS,Linux,Android ,IOS etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>NETUM NT-L3 Handheld CCD Barcode Scanner Portable USB Wired 1D Cable Reader Bar Code for POS System Supermarket</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Application:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Supermarket, store and some commercial POS system;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Logistics, warehousing, libraries, banks, transportation and postal service</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Manufacturing process management</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. Some public industry such as tourism, insurance and government.</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.302,18.4,12,11.2,35,30,'25','1','1','2','16081353001015Barcode_Scanner_Wireless_2d.jpg','16081353001015Barcode_Scanner_Wireless_2d1.jpg','16081353001015Barcode_Scanner_Wireless_2d2.jpg','16081353001015Barcode_Scanner_Wireless_2d3.jpg','16081353001015Barcode_Scanner_Wireless_2d4.jpg','16081353001015Barcode_Scanner_Wireless_2d5.jpg','16081353001015Barcode_Scanner_Wireless_2d6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-12-16 16:15:02'),(915,'Stylus Apple Pencil 2 iPad Pen For iPad Pro 11 1st 2nd/ 12.9 3rd 4th/ 2018 6th/ 201