<p>Writing or drawing by this pencil,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Without any effect,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You don’t have to wear the glove</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Magnetic adsorption, easy to carry</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Can only be attached to the side of iPad Pro 11 (1st and 2nd generation) and iPad Pro 12.9 (3rd and 4th generation)?Does not support wireless charging.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Newly upgraded nib</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The nib is completely made of the hardest Poly formaldehyde plastic,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With anti-drop and wear-resistant characteristics,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The pen tip is not easily damaged when dropped.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Use for 10 hours on one charge.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Universal Type C charging port, fast and convenient charging, long time use on one charge.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 hours Charging time</p>\r\n\r\n<p>10 hours Continuous use</p>\r\n\r\n<p>90 days Standby</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Applicable scene</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Sketches, design drawings, drawings, homework assignments, class studies, meeting notes, more functions waiting for you to discover.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n',0,'1',0.0124,16.2,2.94,2.94,45,40,'25','1','1','2','16081364734287apple_pro_ipad_pen.jpg','16081364734287apple_pro_ipad_pen1.jpg','16081364734287apple_pro_ipad_pen2.jpg','16081364734287apple_pro_ipad_pen3.jpg','16081364734287apple_pro_ipad_pen4.jpg','16081364734287apple_pro_ipad_pen5.jpg','16081364734287apple_pro_ipad_pen6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-12-16 16:34:35'),(916,'XP-365B 80mm POS Thermal Receipt Label Printer for Supermarket Barcode QR Code Sticker Date Price USB Bluetooth Android Windows',0,0,'xp-365b-80mm-pos-thermal-receipt-label-printer-for-supermarket-barcode-qr-code-sticker-date-price-usb-bluetooth-android-windows','lblpintr0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000693611512.html?spm=a2g0o.store_home.hotSpots_867472017.0','China','<ul>\r\n <li>It applies mobile products to 