n<p>        6 X m6 bolts to hard mount your wheel and pedals</p>\r\n\r\n<p>        5 X Wrenches (2xOpen End Wrenches & 3xAllen Keys) to s<strong>ecure your wheel, pedals and shifter to our stand</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>       </strong> 4 X Tie-wraps to keep your wiring in line</p>\r\n\r\n<p>        1 X Instructions in English</p>\r\n',0,'1',19.05,13,62,71,310,300,'25','1','1','2','16093407105659Racing_Steering_Wheel_Stand.jpg','16093407105659Racing_Steering_Wheel_Stand1.jpg','16093407105659Racing_Steering_Wheel_Stand2.jpg','16093407105659Racing_Steering_Wheel_Stand3.jpg','16093407105659Racing_Steering_Wheel_Stand4.jpg','16093407105659Racing_Steering_Wheel_Stand5.jpg','',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-12-30 15:05:11'),(990,'Automatic Foam Soap Dispenser Hand Washing Machine - Liquid Induction Smart Touch less Infrared Sensor',0,0,'automatic-foam-soap-dispenser-hand-washing-machine-liquid-induction-smart-touch-less-infrared-sensor','autfmdpnsr123','https://fr.aliexpress.com/item/4001021285602.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.ee691b03FEgStS&algo_pvid=93674a4b-c269-42c4-8ce8-35f8b38e670c&algo_expid=93674a4b-c269-42c4-8ce8-35f8b38e670c-6&btsid=0b0a556d16091638221914998e9c8f&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<p>The KENAIPU automatic soap dispenser uses the very sensitive infrared detection system, the squirted foam only needs 0.26s once your hand is put under the nozzle without touching. The nozzle is ergonomically designed in a 20 ? angle, allowing you to get the foam easy and convenient</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The new design can catch the eyes of children and allow them to wash their hands often. It&#39;s a good habit. They move away from the virus, and you let go. It is worth to own</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>1, Highly Sensitive - </strong>Non-contact and sensitively - infrared detection system can squirt foam instantly, only 0.26s. Put your hand under the nozzle less than 10cm (3.9in). No touch function makes it healthy and germ free for you and your family.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>2, Material & Battery</strong><strong> - </strong>Automatic soap dispenser ABS plastic environmentally friendly materials, which are extremely technical in appearance and durable use. The waterproof level can reach IPX4. Install the battery 3 AA batteries (not included) and touching the button for 2 seconds to turn on / off.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>3, COMAPTIBLE Widely</strong><strong> -</strong><strong> </strong>foaming hand sanitizer can be loaded directly into the automatic hand soap dispenser. Non-foaming hand sanitizer should be diluted before loading the automatic hand soap dispenser, and the dilution ration is 1: 4 or 1: 5., It can also help save more than 50% soap.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>4, Wide-APPLICATION - </strong>Style Simple and portable design, easy to integrate into any style or place such as kitchen sink, bathroom, hospital, hotel, bathroom clinic, dispensary, office etc. Also work with liquid hand soap, shower gel, dishwasher soap, etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>5, \"After-sales service\" </strong>If you have any dissatisfaction or suggestion during using, please contact us and we will make the best solution for you within 24 hours</p>\r\n\r\n<h2> </h2>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Note: Battery and liquid are not included, please note. Thank you</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specification – </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Characteristic : Foam soap dispenser</li>\r\n <li>Liquid Soup Dispenser Type : Automatic soap dispenser</li>\r\n <li>Type : Soap Liquid Dispensers</li>\r\n <li>Main Material : ABS</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,'1',0.31751,22.34,11.14,12.41,50,45,'25','1','1','2','16093529724135Foam_Dispenser.jpg','16093529724135Foam_Dispenser1.jpg','16093529724135Foam_Dispenser2.jpg','16093529724135Foam_Dispenser3.jpg','16093529724135Foam_Dispenser4.jpg','16093529724135Foam_Dispenser5.jpg','16093529724135Foam_Dispenser6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020