bowl.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Multifunction</span></span></strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed> - </span></span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Perfect for mixing cookie dough, brownies and cookies, or anything of consistency like that.But</span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed> (</span></span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>NOT For Heavy Mixes</span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>)</span></span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Care and Warranty</span></span></strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed> - </span></span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Top-rack dishwasher safe, hand wash also easy. One year for a refund or replacement if any quality issue. Buy With Confidence.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Edge beater is made of non-stick coated metal construction and flexible silicone edges for heavy duty and high durability.</span></span></span><br>\r\n<span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>This beater blade can continuously beats, scrapes and mixes ingredient side and bottom ensure mixing is done thoroughly without scratching your mixing bowl and cuts mixing time by as much as 50%.</span><br>\r\n<span xss=removed>This mixer paddle is made of food-grade hige density, silicone rim, which is safer and healthier than a traditional mixer paddle. Perfect for healthy cooking.</span><br>\r\n<span xss=removed>Dishwasher safe: After you have done with the beater, just set it in the dishwasher. It&#39;s safe and easy to clean.</span><br>\r\n<span xss=removed>Multifunction flat beater: Perfect for thin cookies dough, compound butters, pie pastry, creamed frostings, mashed potatoes and more, but NOT for hard dough. Do not use blade in a dry bowl.</span><br>\r\n<span xss=removed>Compatible with: Works with Kitchen Aid 4.5-5 quart tilt-head stand mixer bowls</span><br>\r\n<span xss=removed>size:16*15.5cm</span><br>\r\n<span xss=removed>Material: Silicone& Metal</span><br>\r\n<span xss=removed>colour: ray + white</span><br>\r\n<span xss=removed>Package Contents:</span><br>\r\n<span xss=removed>1 * mixer paddle</span><br>\r\n<span xss=removed>Only the above package content, other products are not included.</span></span></span></span></span><br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Note: Light shooting and different displays may cause the color of the item in the picture a little different from the real thing. The measurement allowed error is +/- 1-3cm.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n',0,'1',0.181,15.75,14.99,4.32,35,30,'25','1','1','2','160939589640084_5-5_Quart_Flat_Beater_Blades.jpg','160939589640084_5-5_Quart_Flat_Beater_Blades1.jpg','160939589640084_5-5_Quart_Flat_Beater_Blades2.jpg','160939589640084_5-5_Quart_Flat_Beater_Blades3.jpg','160939589640084_5-5_Quart_Flat_Beater_Blades4.jpg','160939589640084_5-5_Quart_Flat_Beater_Blades5.jpg','160939589640084_5-5_Quart_Flat_Beater_Blades6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-12-31 06:24:57'),(993,'Chair Back Support Massage Pillow Mesh Lumbar Brace Relief Car Truck - Home Office Seat Cushion Lumbar Chair Back Support Chair',0,0,'chair-back-support-massage-pillow-mesh-lumbar-brace-relief-car-truck-home-office-seat-cushion-lumbar-chair-back-support-chair','lbrmshsupt123','https://it.aliexpress.com/item/40000