r chair and you will instantly feel the difference.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>The spring cushion effect gives valuable support and added comfort, while the mesh grill acts as a vent to keep you cool. Raised balls provide a greater special massage function, so you go from the seat to the treatment in no time at all.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Perfect for long hours of sitting, traveling, working, watching television, sewing, scrapbooking, reading and more.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>You want different, for the office, home, car and CAMPER</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,'1',0.299,42,9.5,40,32,28,'25','1','1','2','16093970486402no_massage_beads.jpg','16093970486402no_massage_beads1.jpg','16093970486402no_massage_beads2.jpg','16093970486402no_massage_beads3.jpg','16093970486402no_massage_beads4.jpg','16093970486402no_massage_beads5.jpg','16093970486402no_massage_beads6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-12-31 06:44:09'),(994,'Novelty Magic Crystal Plasma Ball Touch Lamp 220V LED Night Light - Child Nightlight Birthday Christmas Kids Decor Gift Lighting',0,0,'novelty-magic-crystal-plasma-ball-touch-lamp-220v-led-night-light-child-nightlight-birthday-christmas-kids-decor-gift-lighting','plmabllmp123','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000484552258.html?spm=a2g0o.ams_107733.c0a6caa.4.1ba15348fUkX49','China','<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong>INNOVATIVE DESIGN</strong> - When the finger touches the surface of the electrostatic ball, the light in the ball will change with the movement of the finger, and it will produce lightning-like dreamy colors. There are 4 sizes to choose from.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong>PRODUCT FEATURES</strong> - The magic ball l