</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Food grade PP+AS+Silicone, easy to clean, safe and healthy. </li>\r\n <li>The Batter Dispenser will dispense the perfect amount of batter, you just position and pull the handle for quick and easy dispensing. </li>\r\n <li>Designed with a stylish purple finish, this is the perfect addition to any baker&#39;s kitchen!</li>\r\n <li>Great for cupcakes, muffins, pancakes, waffles and more!</li>\r\n <li>Size: As the picture</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Note</strong>: Due to the difference between different monitors, the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item. We guarantee the style is the same as shown in the pictures.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package</strong>:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>1 * Batter dispenser</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,'1',0.35019,22.32,14.7,24.86,35,30,'25','1','1','2','16102957315810Baking_Tools_for_Cupcakes.jpg','16102957315810Baking_Tools_for_Cupcakes1.jpg','16102957315810Baking_Tools_for_Cupcakes2.jpg','16102957315810Baking_Tools_for_Cupcakes3.jpg','16102957315810Baking_Tools_for_Cupcakes4.jpg','16102957315810Baking_Tools_for_Cupcakes5.jpg','16102957315810Baking_Tools_for_Cupcakes6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-01-10 16:22:12'),(1028,'Microwaveable Silicone Popcorn Popper BPA Free Collapsible Hot Air Microwavable Popcorn Maker',0,0,'microwaveable-silicone-popcorn-popper-bpa-free-collapsible-hot-air-microwavable-popcorn-maker','popcnppr1234','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005001906054111.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.70292ef8hEazsP&algo_pvid=null&algo_expid=null&btsid=0bb0624616099251421882305e6d8b&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong>The Convenient Way To Make Popcorn</strong> -The Proper Popper whips up to 15 cups of popcorn in less than 4 minutes. No waiting for a slow stove top popcorn maker. No noise or breakdowns from an electric hot popper. No potentially harmful lining of microwavable popcorn bags. No picking up overflow popcorn from the floor. The lid prevents the kernels from popping out.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong>Simple To Use</strong> - Fill popcorn kernels up to the line marked inside the bowl and insert it in the microwave! The Built in handles allow you to remove the bowl from the microwave with ease. You can choose to add oil, salt or other exotic spices- whatever you prefer - either way it will taste delicious! Enjoy movie night!</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong>Lightweight & Easy to Clean & Store</strong>- You can easily collapse the bowl from a height of 5.7” to 2.2” allowing the bowl to fit in almost any kitchen drawer or pantry. Perfect for college dorms. The slim, lightweight and collapsible design makes it great for traveling or limited pantry space. The Proper Popper is super durable, eco-friendly and dishwasher safe. It’s made of high quality silicone which makes it easy to hand wash. Save yourself the trouble of rough scrubbing other popcorn makers.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong>TOXIN FREE</strong>: Why use a microwave bag when you’re ultimately going to put the popcorn in a bowl? Now you can stop using potentially harmful popcorn microwave bags and also help save the environment by not adding to the trash! The Proper Popper is made from 100% Food Grade Silicone FDA approved BPA and PVC free. This is the best popcorn popper for making a healthy treat that the entire f