rns off, recording is completed.</span></span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed>NOTE</span></strong><span xss=removed>: Best recording in a very quiet place will be the best<br>\r\n5 Playback: Press 4 can be playback</span></span></span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Features:</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><br>\r\n<span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Durable and practical<br>\r\nCan play music<br>\r\nAdjustable volume control setting<br>\r\nHaving a record and playback function<br>\r\nFoldable handle,very easy and comfortable to hold<br>\r\nPerfect for outdoors environment and any different activates<br>\r\nLightweight compact design, very convenient to transport and store<br>\r\nIdeal for using in large groups like meetings, rally&#39;s sporting events, etc<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>NOTE:</strong><br>\r\nThe color will be send at RANDOM!!(WHITE+RED OR GRAY+RED)<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Package include:</strong><br>\r\n1 x Portable Speaker</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n',0,'1',0.52,17.49,27.91,17.49,50,45,'25','1','1','2','16103713781123Hand_Megaphone.jpg','16103713781123Hand_Megaphone1.jpg','16103713781123Hand_Megaphone2.jpg','16103713781123Hand_Megaphone3.jpg','16103713781123Hand_Megaphone4.jpg','16103713781123Hand_Megaphone5.jpg',NULL,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-01-11 13:22:59'),(1036,'Yellow Paste Advance Quality Solder Flux Soldering Paste High Intensity Free Rosin',0,0,'yellow-paste-advance-quality-solder-flux-soldering-paste-high-intensity-free-rosin','sldngpst0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/32947572908.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.25084296MqTOpa&algo_pvid=null&algo_expid=null&btsid=0b0a555e16100203235038384e7ce6&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Product Name</strong> - Solder Paste. The flux is used to promote welding.</li>\r\n</u