ed and temperature with max/average/ current air velocity.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Design: portable size, large LCD display with backlight, chill indication and battery level indication.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Fast and accurate: applying advanced technology and Beauport scale, is quick and convenient</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Way to test air velocity and temperature.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Power Source: powered by 3V CR2032 battery(not included)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Auto/Manual power off </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specification – </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Item Name: GM816 Anemometer</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Air Velocity Range: 0 - 30m/s, 0 - 5860Ft/min, 0 - 55Knots, 0 - 90km/h, 0 - 65Mph</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Accuracy: ±5%.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Wind Temperature Range: -10°C ~ 45°C, 14°F~ 113°F</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Resolution: 0.2°F, 0.36°F</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Accuracy: ±2°C, ±3.6°F</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Operating Temperature: -10°C ~ +45°C (14°F~ 113°F )</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Operating Humidity: Less than or equal to 90% RH</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Storage Temperature: -40°C ~ +60°C, -40°F ~140°F</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Wind Speed Unit: m/s, Km/h, ft/min, Knots, mph</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Power: 3V CR2032 battery (not included) </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Note – </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Please allowed 1-3mm differences due to manual measurement, thank you!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Due to the difference between different monitors, please understand that the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item.</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.10433,12.54,6.06,2.8,30,27,'25','1','1','2','16106290816445Wind_Speed_Gauge_Meter.jpg','16106290816445Wind_Speed_Gauge_Meter1.jpg','16106290816445Wind_Speed_Gauge_Meter2.jpg','16106290816445Wind_Speed_Gauge_Meter3.jpg','16106290816445Wind_Speed_Gauge_Meter4.jpg','16106290816445Wind_Speed_Gauge_Meter5.jpg','16106290816445Wind_Speed_Gauge_Meter6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-01-14 12:58:03'),(1049,'Multifunctional Electric Griddle Hot Pot & Barbecue Grill All in One Machine Household Electric BBQ Furnace',0,0,'multifunctional-elect