 TIME RECORDING</strong><strong> -</strong>The digital voice recorder can record continually for 28 hours and 68 hours on standby under the full charge state. Don&#39;t worry about not remembering everything in a long meeting or lecture; it can work continuously until you close it.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>ONE-BUTTON RECORDING</strong> - Recording is simple and fast, one button to open recording, and one button to save. The voice recorder also has the function of voice activated recording. Turn on it and complete the setting according to the instruction. At voice activated state, When there is external sound, it will automatically record; when no sound, it is temporarily dormant state.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>UNIQUE DESIGN & PORTABLE</strong><strong> -</strong>Not only a recording device, but also a key chain. With unique key chain design, the mini voice recorder is small and easy to carry. You can hang it on your waistband or put it in your pocket, and it looks like an elaborate key chain. The voice recorder can be widely used for your class, lecture, speech, interview, group talking and so on. It is perfect for students, teachers, writer, and anyone who loves to record something in your life.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Product Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Shell made from metal and zinc alloy material, anti-fall strongly</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Professional recording pen chip of ATJ3315D, HD recording</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Timestamp, Name the recording files by date automatically</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. AGC function, adjusts the noise source automatically</p>\r\n\r\n<p>5. Voice Recorder,MP3player, and USB flash drive</p>\r\n\r\n<p>6. Support voice activated recording</p>\r\n\r\n<p>7. Detect low battery and save the recording files automatically</p>\r\n\r\n<p>8. Playback function: One key to record/save</p>\r\n\r\n<p>9. Plug into headphones to listen to music</p>\r\n\r\n<p>10. USB adapter</p>\r\n\r\n<p>11. Long battery life</p>\r\n\r\n<p>12. Built in rechargeable 150mAh lithium battery</p>\r\n\r\n<p>13. USB 2.0 connector, easy to upload and download files</p>\r\n\r\n<p>14. Color: Black/Silver</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specification:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Playback Formats: WMA, APE, mp3, OGG, FLAC, WAV</li>\r\n <li>External Memory: No</li>\r\n <li>With Speakers: No</li>\r\n <li>Record Audio Format: WAV</li>\r\n <li>Package: Yes</li>\r\n <li>Voice Activated Recording: Yes</li>\r\n <li>External Microphone: No</li>\r\n <li>Balanced Out: Yes</li>\r\n <li>Dimensions (WxHxD): 70*23*8 MM</li>\r\n <li>Battery: Built-in 150mAh Lithium Battery</li>\r\n <li>Feature 1: Voice Recorder</li>\r\n <li>Feature 2: MP3 Player and U-disk</li>\r\n <li>Memory Capacity: 8GB to 128GB</li>\r\n <li>Battery Support: Rechargeable</li>\r\n <li>Recording Sample Rate: 48KHZ</li>\r\n <li>Headphone Jack: USB Jack</li>\r\n <li>USB Interface: USB high speed 2.0</li>\r\n <li>Battery Recording Time: About 15 hours</li>\r\n <li>Battery Play Time: About 10 hours</li>\r\n <li>Noise-signal Ratio: 80db</li>\r\n <li>Recording Bitrate: 192kbps</li>\r\n <li>Cover Material: Metal and zinc alloy</li>\r\n <li>Color: Black, Silver</li>\r\n <li>Net Weight: About 34g</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package Included: </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1*voice recorder</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1*English manual</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1*USB data cable</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.04018,9.54,3.09,8.6,60,55,'25','1','1','2','16113319262713Portable_MP3_Player.jpg','16113319262713Portable_MP3_Player1.jpg','16113319262713Portable_MP3_Player2.jpg','16113319262713Portable_MP3_Player3.jpg','16113319262713Portable_MP3_Player4.jpg','16113319262713Portable_MP3_Player5.jpg','16113319262713Portable_MP3_Player6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-01-22 16:12:07'),(1083,'LCD Display 10kg/1g Multi-function Digital Food Kitchen Scale - Stainless Steel Weighing Food Scale Cooking Tools Balance',0,0,'lcd-di