ng>Auto On/Off</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The screen will turn into OFF condition with only clock displays on the screen if there is no signal inputs the speedometer in 5 mins . It will be automatically restart when there is signal input or by press the button.</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.13,7.59,6.09,4.01,55,50,'25','1','1','2','16115759482025Bicycle_Computer.jpg','16115759482025Bicycle_Computer1.jpg','16115759482025Bicycle_Computer2.jpg','16115759482025Bicycle_Computer3.jpg','16115759482025Bicycle_Computer4.jpg','16115759482025Bicycle_Computer5.jpg','16115759482025Bicycle_Computer6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-01-25 11:59:09'),(1096,'Bicycle Cycling Full Carbon Fiber Color Mountain Road Bike Water Bottle Holder Cages',0,0,'bicycle-cycling-full-carbon-fiber-color-mountain-road-bike-water-bottle-holder-cages','bclwbhd0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000506973654.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.57f2d64dBrBJMV&algo_pvid=1643d71e-c756-4a99-9692-b5e47c76e6dd&algo_expid=1643d71e-c756-4a99-9692-b5e47c76e6dd-23&btsid=0bb0622a16113082619838796e3eac&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>100% FULL Carbon Fibber Material - Incredible strong and lightweight(only around 30g), non-deformable and corrosion resistant.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>This carbon cage holds the bottle very steady, even on some pretty bumpy gravel rides. But as different sizes of bottles, for expected bumpier rides we suggest to use some straps to secure the bottles.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>The upper part of bottle holder is protruding d