t.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>The professional tool worth having for home electrical jobs or work daily using, include working with tiny circuit boards when installing lighting and other electric equipment installing in your work.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Operating Functions</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\nAlloy steel jaws: Suited for the wire of the specification 10-24AWG [ 0.2-6MM2]<br>\r\nCrimp insulated terminals: Suited for 10-22AWG [0.5-6.0mm2]<br>\r\nCrimp non-insulated terminals: Suited for 12-10 AWG (4-6.0MM2) / 16-14 AWG (1.5-<br>\r\n2.5MM2) / 22-18AWG (0.5-1.0MM2)<br>\r\nCrimp auto ignition terminals: Suited for 7-8mm<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Advantages</strong> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Fixed-length of stripping wire: It can adjust stripping length. If no need to use it, push it to another direction please The cutter: It can easily cut off copper and aluminum wire Durable wire cutter can last for years of hard work. Easier to control with the non slip handle. High quality alloy carbon steel to make the plier for a longer life.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Warning</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> Always take care and keep it away from children and wear safety eye protection when using tools. Always disconnect power at source before working on electrical wires. Conform to all electrical codes, the plastic handles are intended to protect user against electrical shock.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Package</strong> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 x Wire Stripper</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.38,26.9,12.9,2.4,35,30,'25','1','1','2','16117708794880Multifunctional_Stripping_Tools.jpg','16117708794880Multifunctional_Stripping_Tools1.jpg','16117708794880Multifunctional_Stripping_Tools2.jpg','16117708794880Multifunctional_Stripping_Tools3.jpg','16117708794880Multifunctional_Stripping_Tools4.jpg','16117708794880Multifunctional_Stripping_Tools5.jpg','16117708794880Multifunctional_Stripping_Tools6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-01-27 18:08:02'),(11