, over discharge, overvoltage, overcurrent, overheating and short circuit. Eliminate the safety risks that arise during use.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong>Portable</strong>: fine and smooth feeling. With fashionable and lovely appearance, and the size of just being grasped by a hand, it is also very suitable for putting into the pocket of clothes.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong>The perfect gift</strong>: this hand warmer is very suitable for giving to your family or friends as a gift. It’s the perfect substitute for a disposable hand warmer, allowing you to enjoy outdoor sports even in winter.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Features:</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>4 in 1 Function: The amazing item combines hand warmer, power bank, flashlight, massager practical modes together, providing a comfortable and smarter life for you.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Three temperature levels for freely adjustable: 104°/40°; 122°/50°; 140°/60°. Use at low temperature for 104°/40° 12 hours, constant temperature 122°/50° 8 hours, high temperature 140°/60° 10 hours, just choose the temperature as per your needs. Temperature will be displayed on the screen for a more direct known for the temperature.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=re