us shapes, Use the hexagonal disk to create any structure according to your needs, show wonderful and surprising effects and create a romantic and joyful atmosphere.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Simple design</strong> - Unique geometric design, not just lighting but also decorating your home. Wide application can be placed in the living room, bedrooms, study rooms, dining rooms, hotels, etc.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>High-quality ABS and PC lampshade materials, uniform light and strong light transmission.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Physical touch can turn the wall light on and off. When the user&#39;s body touches the surface, the capacitive sensor acts as a switch to open or close each component. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>The components can be easily spliced together by a magnet located at the edge of the product. The hexagonal shape allows these components to be nested together and provides opportunities for a variety of different structures. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Unique geometric design, not only can be illuminated, but also can decorate your house. Widely used, can be placed in the living room, bedroom, study, restaurant, hotel, etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specification:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Body material: ABS + PC</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Item color: White</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Light color: White color</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Light source: LED</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Shape: Hexagon</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Size: Hexagon side length 6cm, thickness 2cm</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Unit type: piece</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On/Off: Capacitive touch</p>\r\n\r\n<p>   </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package list:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 x LED Quantum Hexagonal Wall lamp</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 x Sticker</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Kindly Reminder - Don&#39;t mix the white set and colourfulset, the voltage is different.</p>\r\n',0,'1',1.1,15,13.5,20,60,55,'25','1','1','2','16118376144750Wall_Lamp.jpg','16118376144750Wall_Lamp1.jpg','16118376144750Wall_Lamp2.jpg','16118376144750Wall_Lamp3.jpg','16118376144750Wall_Lamp4.jpg','16118376144750Wall_Lamp5.jpg','16118376144750Wall_Lamp6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-01-28 12:40:15'),(1117,'Era Clean Refrigerator Deodorizing Disinfection Machine Food Preservation Purification and Sterilization USB Charging',0,0,'era-clean-refrigerator-deodorizing-disinfection-machine-food-preservation-purification-and-sterilization-usb-charging','rfgtddrz0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005001768940283.html?spm=a2g01.12616982.tplist001.32.701f601cCXxxHn&gps-id=5950812&scm=1007.23961.125497.0&scm_id=1007.23961.125497.0&scm-url=1007.23961.125497.0&pvid=87679eb7-dde7-4d9e-92c4-00d5c9c4fe8d','China','<p><strong>Features and specifications</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Product Name  Era clean Refrigerator Deodorizer<br>\r\nProduct Model  CW-B01<br>\r\nRated voltage  5VDC<br>\r\nCharging Time  2h<br>\r\nBattery Capacity  800mah<br>\r\nNet Weight  About 70g<br>\r\nFeature1  Mini Compac<br>\r\nFeature2  USB Charging<br>\r\nFeature3  Food Preservation<br>\r\nFeature4  Degradation Of Pesticide Residue</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Refrigerator Deodorizing Disinfection Machine<br>\r\nProfessional disinfection,bacteriostatic and deodorization are more healthy</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>There are more than 700 kinds of bacteria in the refrigerator!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Family Hygiene Report \" issued by the Global Health Council declares: They surveyed 9 countries<br>\r\nincluding Australia, India and the United States. The bathroom sealant is the dirtiest place in the house,<br>\r\nand the refrigerator is the second!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Pseudomonas</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Severe cases cause lung inflammation, common symptoms such as fever, cough and sputum</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Staphylococcus Aurous</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It can cause the decline of immunity, food poisoning in severe cases, nausea and vomiting, dizziness and<br>\r\nother food poisoning reactions<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Staphylococcus Albas</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It may cause purulent infection and become an important cause of bacterial invasion into blood and septicaemia,<br>\r\nwhich is more common in new-borns and the elderly</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Refrigerator deodorization <br>\r\nPurification and sterilization<br>\r\nDegradation of pesticide residues<br>\r\nFood preservation<br>\r\nMini Compact<br>\r\nUSB charging</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Designed for refrigerator , beautiful and not occupying space<br>\r\nThe clasp design is suspended on the inside of the refrigerator door, and the deodorant molecules release<br>\r\nto the cold storage area with better diffusion, more uniform and no dead corner</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Delicious conditions are fresh and safe ingredients<br>\r\nKeeping food freshness with scientific taste and four effects in one<br>\r\nthrough the professional sterilization test, a variety of food products can be eliminated</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Fast deodorization </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Effectively reduce the mixed door of refrigerator caused by food materials and bacteria breeding</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Prolonging preservation period </p>\r\n\r\n<p>It can inhibit ethylene and other ripening agents on the surface of fruits and vegetables and prolongthe<br>\r\nfreshness of food</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Degradation of pesticide residues</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The degradation rate of ERACLEAN refrigerator deodorant sterilizer is 30-50 times ofnatural degradation</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Space circulation disinfection</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Improve the degradation rate of pesticide residues</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Equipped with hook design, increase the circulation of the whole space, scientifically release 03 ions,<br>\r\nactively kill bacteria molecules, and effectively eliminate bacteria</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Era clean refrigerator deodorizer</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The back hook design of the product can be hung on the door frame of the refrigerator. It does not occupy<br>\r\nspace, so that ozone gas can be evenly distributed in each layer, and there is no dead angle in 360 degrees<br>\r\nacting on every corner of the refrigerator</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ordinary refrigerator deodorizer</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The back hook design can only be used on the refrigerator floor, occupying the space for food materials,<br>\r\nand ozone gas can only be evenly distributed in one layer. The effect has obvious limitations</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Give you peace of mind</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Help you explore the delicious tips</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Double disinfection mode</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Long term companion use</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mode 1</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Double click the switch for deep deodorization and disinfection</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mode 2</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Long press for 2 seconds to keep fresh and disinfect<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Authoritative certification<br>\r\nthe sterilization rate is up to 99 9%</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Effective killing rate of Pseudomonas aeruginosa> 99.98%</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Effective killing of Staphylococcus aurous>99.93%</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Effective killing of Staphylococcus aurous>99.91%</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Note: era clean. Refrigerator deodorant sterilizer meets the evaluation requirements of \"technical specification<br>\r\nfor disinfection\" (2002 edition of the Ministry of Health) - 2.1.5.7 (the killing logarithm values are all ? 3.00),<br>\r\nand the sample is qualified for disinfection of the tested strains</p>\r\n\r\n<p>According to the \"technical specification for disinfection\", if the killing logarithm value is less than 3, it is<br>\r\nunqualified, and if the corresponding killing rate is less than 999%, it is unqualified. Not all refrigerator<br>\r\ndeodorants can be qualified to kill bacteria<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p>New experience of food preservation</p>\r\n\r\n<p>More professional protection</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Fresh keeping technology can inhibit the ripening agents such as ethylene on the surface of fruits and<br>\r\nvegetables, prolong the freshness of food , and prevent the deterioration of food materials due to improper storage</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Experiment on Tomato preservation</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Two groups of fresh tomatoes were put into the test box with the same temperature and humidity. One<br>\r\ngroup was put into the effect of eras lea refrigerator deodorant sterilizer, and the other group was used as<br>\r\nthe control group under natural conditions. After 10 days, we will take a look at the preservation of tomatoes<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Shelf placement</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Small size does not occupy space</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Back buckle suspension</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Scientific use of space</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Easy to place</p>\r\n\r\n<p>No tangle<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Long lasting and convenient charging</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The built-in 800MAH battery charges for 2 hours and lasts for 30 days</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Enough capacity for your daily use</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The duration of deep deodorization disinfection mode is 48h</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Fresh keeping ,odor removing and disinfection mode lasts for 30 days</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.1,14.5,5.3,5.4,75,70,'25','1','1','2','16118391336433Deodorizing_Air_Purifier.jpg','16118391336433Deodorizing_Air_Purifier1.jpg','16118391336433Deodorizing_Air_Purifier2.jpg','16118391336433Deodorizing_Air_Purifier3.jpg','16118391336433Deodorizing_Air_Purifier4.jpg','16118391336433Deodorizing_Air_Purifier5.jpg','16118391336433Deodorizing_Air_Purifier6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-01-28 13:05:34'),(1118,'Boots Waterproof Shoe Cover Silicone Material Unisex Shoes Protectors Rain Boots for Indoor Outdoor Rainy Days Reusable',0,0,'boots-waterproof-shoe-cover-silicone-material-unisex-shoes-protectors-rain-boots-for-indoor-outdoor-rainy-days-reusable','slcsscvr0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000274724284.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.5130fc71TAqa8M&algo_pvid=b17f26ab-da47-4fe6-a061-9b5cc6395553&algo_expid=b17f26ab-da47-4fe