 or surface, avoid burnt hands.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>EASY TO USE</strong> - Lock the current temperature, the reading won’t change after pulling the probe thermometer out of the meat; Smoker thermometer with backlight display allowing you to work in dim light conditions; Auto Shut-off; Batteries Included.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>WIDE VARIETY OF USES</strong> - Food Thermometer with temperature range of -58°F ~ 572°F (-50°C ~ 300°C); Celsius/Fahrenheit selector; Perfect meat thermometer for grilling smoker BBQ indoor outdoor cooking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>PRODUCT SPECIFICS:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Model: TP101 electronic digital food thermometer</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The probe is made of stainless steel</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Weight: 0.038kg</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Product list: a thermometer, a manual</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Measuring range: water temperature, food, liquid, paste, oil temperature, milk temperature, tea, soup, beer and so on</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Temperature measurement range: -50 ° C to 300 ° C (-58 ° F to + 572 ° F) Wide range of measurement</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Pen-type structure, stainless steel probe, straight measurement, easy to carry.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Button function Description:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1, ON / OFF: switch function</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2, C / F: Celsius / Fahrenheit conversion</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3, HOLD: temperature lock function, press this button, then the temperature is locked, and then press the lock function to lift.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4, MAX / MIN: high temperature and low temperature memory, press this button to display the previous high temperature, then press the previous display of low temperature, and then restore the temperature measurement state.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Technical data:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Resolution: 0.1 °</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Accuracy: ± 1 ° (-20 ° ~ +80 °) ± 2 ° (other range)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Power saving mode: 10 minutes automatic shutdown power saving function</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Power supply: AG13 button battery 1</strong><strong>(not including)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Please specify your choosing color,ifnot, we will send color randomly(black and white)</strong></p>\r\n',0,'1',0.05,24.1,4.03,3.52,4,3,'25','1','1','2','16120013006800Digital_Temperature_Sensor_Meter.jpg','16120013006800Digital_Temperature_Sensor_Meter1.jpg','16120013006800Digital_Temperature_Sensor_Meter2.jpg','16120013006800Digital_Temperature_Sensor_Meter3.jpg','16120013006800Digital_Temperature_Sensor_Meter4.jpg','16120013006800Digital_Temperature_Sensor_Meter5.jpg','16120013006800Digital_Temperature_Sensor_Meter6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-01-30 10:08:21'),(1131,'Super Pencil Case Kawaii Large Capacity Pencil Case - School Pen Case Pencil Bag School Box Pencils Pouch Stationery',0,0,'super-pencil-case-kawaii-large-capacity-pencil-case-school-pen-case-pencil-bag-school-box-pencils-pouch-stationery','lrgcpcpnccs0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/32954348567.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.1f5c2b39zIDRL9&algo_pvid=7dbede0c-bdd3-495b-b114-18d6ee179ed0&algo_expid=7dbede0c-bdd3-495b-b114-18d6ee179ed0-7&btsid=0b0a556d16119274286796172e0c24&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Large capacity</strong> - Large capacity storage, at least 40-60 pens can store, and can hold other stationery , such as post-it notes,scissors,tape,etc.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Unique Design</strong> - 1.Opens from the top or sideways, easy to put items. 2.Hand-held band, easy to carry.3.front window design ,it can flat on the desk after opening, put some pen of frequently use.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>High Quality</strong> - 100% brand new canvas, high quality material and strong zipper makes the pencil bag more durable, scratch resistant and wea