rong> -</strong>3 in 1 soil test kit (Moisture/Light/pH soil tester for garden soil) helps you know the soil condition of your garden and lawn comprehensively. With a quick check, you can tell if you need to adjust the plant food/water and if your plants get enough sunlight.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>WARM PROMPT</strong><strong> -</strong>While using the tester, please be careful and not let the probes touch stones while inserting. Don&#39;t exert too much force, or it will hurt the probes easily. After using, please clean and wipe the probes for next use.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Color: Green</p>\r\n\r\n<p>PH Range: 3.5-8PH ( 3.5-7 Acid, 7-8 Alkaline)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Moisture Range: 1-10 ( 1-3 Dry, 3-7 Nor, 7-10 Wet)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Relative Light: 0-2000LUX ( 0-200 Low, 200-500 Low+, 500-1000 Nor, 1000-2000 High)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Probe Tip Size: 10mm×4mm×4mm / 0.4”×0.16”×0.16”</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Probe Length: 180mm / 7.09”</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Product Dimension: 255mm×62mm×36mm / 10.01”×2.44”×1.42”</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Net Weight: 58g / 2.05oz</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>How to use</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 1: Clean the surface soil layer’s all organic impurities which may affect the test results, such as the leaf or the root.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 2: Clean the probe tip with wipes or abrasive cloth.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 3: Insert the probe tip in the testing soil, the probe tip should LEVEL with root.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 4: Reading the result when the value is stable</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 5: Testing it again on the different place of the testing soil, then calculate the average value.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Note:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>If the testing value can’t be stable, it is caused by the uneven density of soil, please kindly test it twice or three times again to get a average value</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package Included:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1×3-in-1 Soil 