ce in full darkness; Day or night use(with IR off for daytime color); Operates on 8 AA batteries (not included) and power bank(not included), no worry the battery drain out for the long time monitoring</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>*Long Last: Built-in Battery or USB Charging enable to observe for a long time</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Operates on 8 AA batteries enables an observation period of approx. 6 hours . You can charge it using the included USB cable or an optional, commercially available power bank. Of course, simultaneous observation and operation with the power bank is possible.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specifications -</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Photo Resolution: 1M(1280x960)by interpolation, GA(976x580)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Video Resolution: 1080P(1080P@20FPS )by interpolation, GA(720@30FPS )</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Lens: F1.2 larger aperture, Auto IR filter</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Lens Angle: FOV=15°, calibre is 42mm</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Display Screen: Screen is 2.3” 320*240 TFT LCD</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Storage Media: Micro SD card, up to 32GB</p>\r\n\r\n<p>USB Port: Micro USB 2.0</p>\r\n\r\n<p>MIC: NO</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Speaker: NO</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Auto off: 3 min/ 5 min/ 10 min/OFF</p>\r\n\r\n<p>IR LED: 1.2 W, 850nm strong infrared spotlight</p>\r\n\r\n<p>View Distance In Complete Darkness: About 200-300 meters</p>\r\n\r\n<p>View Distance In Low Light:3meters infinity</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Digital Zoom: 4X (1x, 2x, 4x)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Power Source: 5V-6V; 8pcs AA Battery</p>\r\n\r\n<p>OSD Language: Multiple languages are optional(Up to 11 Languages include Chinese, English, Spanish, Korean, Japanese, Arabic, French, Italian, Portuguese, German, Russian)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Date Stamps: Support to set date and time. Date and time stamp on photo and video files.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Operation Buttons: 6 buttons</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Operation Temperature: -20? to +60?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Storage Temperature: -40? to +85?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dimensions. 196*154*64mm</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Weight: 850g</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package includes:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1* night vision binocular</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1* USB cable</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1* AV cable</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1* user manual</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1* carrying bag</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.9,24.5,19.5,11,355,340,'25','1','1','2','16120961412557waterproof_Night_Vision_Binoculars.jpg','16120961412557waterproof_Night_Vision_Binoculars1.jpg','16120961412557waterproof_Night_Vision_Binoculars2.jpg','16120961412557waterproof_Night_Vision_Binoculars3.jpg','16120961412557waterproof_Night_Vision_Binoculars4.jpg','16120961412557waterproof_Night_Vision_Binoculars5.jpg','16120961412557waterproof_Night_Vision_Binoculars6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-01-31 12:29:03'),(1141,'Handheld TDS Digital Water Tester Water Test Pen Water Quality Analysis Meter - Water Purity Check 0-9999 ppm Measurement',0,0,'handheld-tds-digital-water-tester-water-test-pen-water-quality-analysis-meter-water-purity-check-0-9999-ppm-measurement','dgtwtrtstr0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000068606290.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.6657218cHEYgPu&algo_pvid=9683082c-153a-4a10-a5cb-4070c5066cf7&algo_expid=9683082c-153a-4a10-a5cb-4070c5066cf7-51&btsid=0b0a555c16120255444457193ebfb8&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Digital Water Quality Tester</strong> - Can Be Used to Test TDS, EC and Water Temperature Accurately. This Water Quality Tester Is Suitable for Water Purifiers, Water Filters, Drinking Water, Drinks, Pools, Spas, Aquarium, Hydroponics, Etc.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Measurement Range</strong> - TDS: 0~9990ppm (Accuracy: ±2%). EC: 0~9990us/cm. Temperature: 0.1~80.0?/ 32.0~176.0°F (accuracy: ±0.1?).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Color Change Function</strong> - PPM Less Than 40, The Measuring Result Shows with Green Backlight. PPM More Than 40, The Measuring Result Shows with Red Backlight.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Low Power Consumption</strong> - Automatically Turn Off. Powered by 1*CR2032 Battery (Included).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Convenient Design</strong> - Data Hold Function. Large LCD Screen with Backlight to Show Water Temperature, TDS or EC Instantly.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>TDS</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Total Dissolved Solids (TDS) are the total weight of all solids (minerals, salts, or metals) that are dissolved in a given volume of water, expressed in milligrams perlite (mg/L), or in parts per million (PPM).</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specification </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Item Type: TDS Water Meter</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Material: Plastic</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Measurement Range: 0-9999 ppm</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Accuracy: +/-2%</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Temperature Range: 0-50 celsius</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Battery: 2xLR44 batteries, 1.5V (NOT Included for safety)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Size: 155x31x23 mm</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Application</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Check the performance of your water filter.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Check for hardness (1 grain = 17ppm).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Make sure you always drink pure water!</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Please refer below standard for testing water</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>0-50 ppm --------- High Purity Water</p>\r\n\r\n<p>50-100 ppm ------- Pure Water</p>\r\n\r\n<p>100-300 ppm ------ General Pure Water</p>\r\n\r\n<p>300-600 ppm ------ Fouling</p>\r\n\r\n<p>600-1000 ppm ----- Poor Taste Water,Fouling</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Above 1000 ppm --- The water is not suitable for drinking</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Feature</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Hold function: Saves measurements for convenient readign and recording</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Auto-off function: Turns off meter after 10 minutes of non-use to conserve batteries.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Measurement Range: 0-9999 ppm (When the measured value exceeds 999 ppm, please make the display value x10)</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Attention</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Batteries are <strong>NOT</strong> included for safety!</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Precaution</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Do not drop the entire TDS meter in water or dip beyond the maximum immersion level. This unit is not water-tight.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Do not store the TDS meter under high temperature or direct sunlight. This will shorten the life.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Please avoid impact, heavy pressure or drop.</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.08,19,12.2,2,12,9,'25','1','1','2','161209702546343-in-1_TDS_Meter_Digital_Water_Meter.jpg','161209702546343-in-1_TDS_Meter_Digital_Water_Meter1.jpg','161209702546343-in-1_TDS_Meter_Digital_Water_Meter2.jpg','161209702546343-in-1_TDS_Meter_Digital_Water_Meter3.jpg','161209702546343-in-1_TDS_Meter_Digital_Water_Meter4.jpg','161209702546343-in-1_TDS_Meter_Digital_Water_Meter5.jpg','',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-01-31 12:43:46'),(1142,'Metal Flame Lighter Blow Torch Cooking Auto Ignition Heating Welding Gas Burner - Outdoor Picnic BBQ Kitchen Torch Lighter',0,0,'metal-flame-lighter-blow-torch-cooking-auto-ignition-heating-welding-gas-burner-outdoor-picnic-bbq-kitchen-torch-lighter','kcntrhltr0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005001748832984.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.540d4fbcyo5WqB&algo_pvid=074033fa-2e17-4402-9abb-6fc6214b128d&algo_expid=074033fa-2e17-4402-9abb-6fc6214b128d-50&btsid=0bb0623c16120250426888800e2ad8&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Professional Culinary Torch - Safe and Durable -</span></span></strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed> With safety lock prevents accidental ignition and a wide set base helps to prevent it falling over. Long angled nozzle and burn-free finger guard keep your hand safely away from the flame. Made with durable Aluminium alloy body for long lasting use.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xs