utlet-power-analyzer','dgtlcdprmtr0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/10000399580994.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.6657218cHEYgPu&algo_pvid=9683082c-153a-4a10-a5cb-4070c5066cf7&algo_expid=9683082c-153a-4a10-a5cb-4070c5066cf7-8&btsid=0b0a555c16120255444457193ebfb8&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>High-Power Usage Monitor</strong>: Connects to household appliance and assess your electricity consumption by kilowatt hours.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Refined Accuracy</strong>: Built with the latest electricity metering chip and high precision current sensor. Ensure you the best meter accuracy-class.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Built-in Battery</strong>: 3.6VLow power consumption rechargeable batteries,no need extra batteries - allows meter to be moved (and viewed) without losing readings.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Overload Warning</strong>: displayed on LCD,easy and safe to use,allowing you to make informed decisions as to how you choose to use power at home.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specification -</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Voltage: 240V</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Current: MAX10A</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Power: 0.0W ~ 2400W</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Frequency: 50HZ</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Electricity: 0.000KWH ~ 9999KWH</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Unit price: 0.00 ~ 99.99</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Amount of electricity fee: 0.00 ~ 99.99</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Overload alarm: When the current exceeds 10A or the power exceeds 2400W, the \"overload alarm\" icon flashes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>When the detected power value is less than 1.0W, it is regarded as local power consumption, and the time is not accumulated.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Working current: ?10A</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Measurement accuracy: ± 2%</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Time display bar; Voltage / current / power / power consumption value; ? Power factor / frequency / electricity value; ? Volt: voltage; Ampere: current; (Kwh) degrees: electricity consumption; Watts: power; Overload alarm: Power overload reminder. ? Power factor: the ratio of active power to apparent power; Hertz: AC frequency; Days: cumulative days of electricity consumption; Yuan: the total amount of power consumption; Degree: Cumulative electricity consumption; Yuan / degree: unit price of electricity.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Page one: Running time: cumulative running time of electrical appliances, after 24 hours, days + 1; ? Current power: the actual power of the electrical appliance connected to it, in watts; - Cumulative electricity cost: as of now, the cost has been consumed, unit yuan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Page two: Running time - Cumulative power consumption: as of now, the cumulative power consumption, in units of degrees; ? Cumulative time: the cumulative number of days of operation with electrical appliances, in units of days.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Page three: Running time - Grid voltage: the current real-time voltage of the grid, in volts; ? Grid frequency: Grid AC frequency, in hertz.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Page four: Running time - Real-time current: the real-time current of the electrical appliance connected to it, in amperes ? Power factor: the power factor of the electrical appliance connected to it</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Page five: Running time - Minimum power: the minimum power recorded during operation, in watts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Page 6: Running time - Maximum power: the maximum power recorded during operation, in watts</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Page 7:  Running time - Unit price of electricity: set unit price, unit yuan / degree</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.3,18.6,8.4,7.8,35,32,'25','1','1','2','16121981454289Voltage_Meter.jpg','16121981454289Voltage_Meter1.jpg','16121981454289Voltage_Meter2.jpg','16121981454289Voltage_Meter3.jpg','16121981454289Voltage_Meter4.jpg','16121981454289Voltage_Meter5.jpg','16121981454289Voltage_Meter6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,N