mock.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>PRODUCTS FEATURE</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Style: Double hammock fits 2 people</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Finable Weight: 250kg</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Material: 210T nylon parachute fabric</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Use Scenes: The backpacking hammock can be used for camping, travel, beach, yard</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Package: Includes one double camping hammock 300cm (Long) x 198cm (Wide), two tree friendly straps (each 300cm (Long) x 2.5cm (Wide) and two Metal Carabineers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Package Weight: about 1kg, easy to take</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.33,21.34,13.97,7.37,100,90,'25','1','1','2','16130644032578Hammock_for_Travel.jpg','16130644032578Hammock_for_Travel1.jpg','16130644032578Hammock_for_Travel2.jpg','16130644032578Hammock_for_Travel3.jpg','16130644032578Hammock_for_Travel4.jpg','16130644032578Hammock_for_Travel5.jpg','',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-02-11 17:26:44'),(1190,'5 in 1 Rechargeable Electric Shaver Five Floating Heads Razors - Hair Clipper Nose Ear Hair Trimmer Men Facial Cleaning Brush',0,0,'5-in-1-rechargeable-electric-shaver-five-floating-heads-razors-hair-clipper-nose-ear-hair-trimmer-men-facial-cleaning-brush','5in1rcaeltsvr0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/32949547879.html?spm=a2g0o.tm800002626.8886434090.27.4abb3614swrD4Y&&scm=1007.25281.191399.0&scm_id=1007.25281.191399.0&scm-url=1007.25281.191399.0&pvid=97ff29c1-21b2-4029-a07d-db921c204885&utparam={','China','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Multifunctional 5 in 1 men grooming kit -</strong>With five detachable attachments, including beard trimmer, sideburns trimmer, nose ear trimmer and precision trimmer, and also with facial cleaning brush. Meet all your needs for shaving and facial care.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Advanced Razor Head -</strong>unique 4D rotary floating head design, automatically adapts to the contours of your face and neck, and helps to enlarge contact area and reduces irritation, giving you an efficient and comfortab