n<p>Capacity 300ml</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Color: Blue</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Standard 2 wash nose: one for adult, another for child.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package Included:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1*Nasal Irrigator</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.33,8,10,24.4,85,80,'25','1','1','2','16136543748562Nose_Cleaning_Machine.jpg','16136543748562Nose_Cleaning_Machine1.jpg','16136543748562Nose_Cleaning_Machine2.jpg','16136543748562Nose_Cleaning_Machine3.jpg','16136543748562Nose_Cleaning_Machine4.jpg','16136543748562Nose_Cleaning_Machine5.jpg','16136543748562Nose_Cleaning_Machine6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-02-18 13:19:35'),(1214,'2pcs Gliding Discs Slider Fitness Disc Exercise Sliding Plate - Abdominal Core Muscle Training Yoga Sliding Disc Fitness Equipment',0,0,'2pcs-gliding-discs-slider-fitness-disc-exercise-sliding-plate-abdominal-core-muscle-training-yoga-sliding-disc-fitness-equipment','glddcs0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000261187090.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.204427fbUCOuy2&algo_pvid=18efb07b-3486-41bd-b35c-fc9a44845882&algo_expid=18efb07b-3486-41bd-b35c-fc9a44845882-13&btsid=0b0a556b16135658645802010e0976&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>PERFECT FOR CORE -</strong>Strengthen your core with your sliding discs. Use them to target all muscles groups, from your abs to gluts and add the resistance loop bands to tone up your arms and your legs!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>DUAL SIDED FOR ANY SURFACE -</strong>Small size and lightweight, so you can easily take it anywhere. The Smooth (Plastic) Side for Carpets or Other Blanket, and The Foam Material Side for Hard Floor, Wood or Tile.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>KEEP YOUR BODY -</strong>As your hands and feet never leave the floor while exercising, the discs reduce impact and protect your tendons and joints. Toning your tummy, legs or arms will be never be an issue again while you enjoy lunges, planks, bridges or simply make up your own exercises.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>USE FOR -</strong>You can use these exercise gliding discs for sliders gym, core reinforcement, athletic conditioning, cross fit, physical therapy, yoga, dance, balance training and so on.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>SATISFACTION GUARANTEE -</strong>We’re so confident in the quality of our core sliders that we give you a 100% satisfaction guarantee. If you don’t absolutely love your core sliders, just send them back and we’ll refund you in full.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Features :</span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed>1. This gliding disc allows you to perform skills that target every muscle group.<br>\r\n2. Small size and lightweight, so you can easily take it anywhere.<br>\r\n3. You can use the gliding discs on any surface such as wood, carpet, rug or tile.<br>\r\n4. Gliding discs requires constant core stabilization which delivers an incredible core workout.<br>\r\n5. You can use these exercise gliding discs for sliders gym, core reinforcement, athletic conditioning, cross fit, physical therapy, yoga, dance, balance training and so on.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>- Product Name : Fitness Exercise Core Sliders</span><br>\r\n<span xss=removed>- Color : Multi</span><br>\r\n<span xss=removed>- Unit Weight : 7.4Oz(0.21kg)</span><br>\r\n<span xss=removed>- Quantity : 2pcs</span><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<span xss=removed>Our sliders are compact and portable; they will easily fit in your backpack or hand bag. You can use these sliders anywhere; at home, gym, office or even when you travel ensuring you always maintaining your form. These Sliders very portable for people who are constantly on the go or for athletes who like to workout when they travel!</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><strong>Package list: </strong><br>\r\n2 * Sliding Gliding Discs</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.18,18.21,18.21,2.21,7,5,'25','1','1','2','16136549513084Sliding_Plate.jpg','16136549513084Sliding_Plate1.jpg','16136549513084Sliding_Plate2.jpg','16136549513084Sliding_Plate3.jpg','16136549513084Sliding_Plate4.jpg','16136549513084Sliding_Plate5.jpg','16136549513084Sliding_Plate6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-02-18 13:29:12');
INSERT INTO `tbl_product` VALUES (1215,'High Concentration of Hydrogen Water Generator with 2 Work Mode - Self-Cleaning Mode and Can Absorb Hydrogen',0,0,'high-concentration-of-hydrogen-water-generator-with-2-work-mode-self-cleaning-mode-and-can-absorb-hydrogen','hdgwtgntbt0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000260150741.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.3d4152e2yP9Nyh&algo_pvid=ffe4d68c-a4ae-421f-810e-e250ace6f9da&algo_expid=ffe4d68c-a4ae-421f-810e-e250ace6f9da-55&btsid=0bb0623016131273833173135ea69f&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<p>Hydrogen water absorbs into your body easily to boost your metabolism and increase the body’s micro circulation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Q10 hydrogen water generator bottle makes the water in a high hydrogen concentration from 900ppb-3000ppb,ORP from -300mV to -600mV.Most Important,with its high quality of DUPONT N117 membrane, it puts only pure H2 into the water. Oxygen, Ozone and Chlorine are separated out. So the hydrogen water you get is 99.99% pure H2 and NO Chlorine,No Oxygen,No H2O2,NO Ozone. Able to attach disposable plastic drinking water bottles,portable for travel,work and office. Any kind of water can be used:Mineral Water,Pure Water,and Distilled Water iswelcomed. It can electrolyze hot water, even can directly make high purity hydrogen rich water and make a tea at the same time.Additionally,this machine uses PEM and SPE technology to make pure 99.99% H2 hydrogen. Attach a cannula and you can breathe pure Molecular hydrogen.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>We have reduced the power consumption of the electrodes and the motherboard, and equipped with a 1800mA battery, which can work longer with full charge.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>The Hydrogen Water Bottle Support you:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>  * SPE technology (Korean Titanium with Platinum Coating) with PEM membrane</p>\r\n\r\n<p>  * DUPONT N117 Membrane to remove Ozone, Chlorine,Oxygen,H2O2</p>\r\n\r\n<p>  * Hydrogen up to 900ppb to 3000ppb</p>\r\n\r\n<p>  * ORP up to -300 ~ -600mV</p>\r\n\r\n<p>  * No Ozone,No Chlorine,No Oxygen</p>\r\n\r\n<p>  * It is equipped with a 1800mAh large capacity battery.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>  * Two works mode: 3 minute mode and 10 minute mode.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>  * Dual Uses (3 in 1 design): Both Drink (Adapter with Mineral Bottle) and Breath Hydrogen.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Main features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>* Hydrogen-rich water can effectively remove toxic free radicals, prevent cell oxidation, prevent diseases, improve human metabolism, delay senility and improve skin quality.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>* Real SPE (Solid Polymer Electrolyte) + PEM (Proton Exchange Membrane) Dual Chamber technology, Korea Titanium with Platinum Coating.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>* USA DuPont NAFION - 117 Membrane, It puts only pure H2 into the water, but Oxygen (O2), Ozone (O3) Chlorine (CL2) are separated out.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>* 100% safe to drink, Hydrogen purity reached 99.99%. Oxygen, chlorine and ozone are separated out, discharged from the bottom waste gas vent device.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>* 3 in 1 design: including the Inhaler tube and PET bottle adapter, so you can use it by glass, by mineral water bottle or breath the H2 gas, stylish design with prefect function, meet all of your needs, portable for travel, work and office.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>* Able to attach disposable plastic drinking water bottles.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>* Press operation, smart and easy to use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>* Quickly produces hydrogen rich water within 10 minutes, and can be drunk directly from bottle.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>* Portable for travel, work and office.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>* 3 minute mode and 10 minute mode.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>* Self-cleaning mode.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>* Well-sealed for no water leakage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>* Able to use hot water over 95?. (We still recommend the best temperature for daily use 0~60°C)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>* Ability to attach your own 1 or even 2 litter plastic bottles.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>* Dual Use: Both Drink and Breath Hydrogen.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>* Works with All Potable Water Types- RO, tap, distilled, filtered, mineral, Cold boiled water, Warm boiled water (water temperature below 60 degree), Filtered water and purified tap water.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>*380ml Food grade high borosilicate glass material, Material of Food-grade feeding Bottles of the Same Quality in America, 100% BPA free.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>* Exclusive water-soluble hydrogen technology, after hydrogen production for 2 hours, high concentration hydrogen can still be maintained in the hydrogen water bottle</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Super-high concentration:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Super-high concentration</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3 minute mode for 1 time: 900ppb ~ 1200ppb;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>10 minute mode for 1 time: 1500ppb ~ 1800ppb;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>10 minute mode for 2 time(Use 350ml mineral water bottles): 2000ppb ~ 3000ppb; ?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>10 minute mode for more times (Use 350ml of mineral water bottles): Higher hydrogen concentration;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In daily use, please do not exceed 2 times 10 minutes mode in order to well protect the electrode system life span.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Pure hydrogen Water: Hydrogen purify up to 99.99%, only pure hydrogen water in your bottle.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Superior Electrode System:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>DuPont N117 membrane with implanted in space quantum technology, makes hydrogen concentration higher, permeability stronger, water molecules smaller.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3 minutes mode: Press the button once (Display blue light)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>10 minute mode: Press the button 2 times (Display blue light)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Self-cleaning mode: Press the button for 3 seconds (Display green light)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Stop Working: When the hydrogen water generator is working, press the button once, it will stop working, and light is off.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Mineral water bottle adapter:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bring the base unit while you are traveling and attach it to any standard water bottle you buy at the store. So you can enjoy molecular hydrogen anywhere you go. The Small transfer adapter for Mineral Bottle available for Russia, Ukraine, Germany, Holland, Belgium, USA, UK, Colombia and suitable for over 98% countries.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Simple hydrogen-absorbing equipment:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>This is just a simple hydrogen-absorbing device, the flow is only 20ml per minute, which is just an experience. For larger flow hydrogen absorption, you must use hydrogen absorption machine, please contact customer service to understand.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Many features you care about:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>No limited water quality: Mineral Water, Pure Water, and Distilled Water is welcomed. Pure hydrogen Water: Hydrogen purify up to 99.99%, only pure hydrogen water in your bottle.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>DUPONT N117 membrane with implanted in space quantum technology, makes hydrogen concentration higher, permeability stronger, water molecules smaller.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Food grade high borosilicate glass material, Material of Food-grade feeding Bottles of the Same Quality in America, No release of harmful substances such as bisphenol A.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It can electrolyze hot water, even can directly make high purity hydrogen rich water and make a tea at the same time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Puts only pure H2 into the water. Oxygen, Ozone and Chlorine are separated out.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Any kind of water can be used.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Generates much higher concentration of hydrogen water than standard electrolysis bottles.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our hydrogen rich bottle will create more H2 within 10 minutes than most bottles on the market.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Breathe pure Molecular hydrogen.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>How to use:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>3 minutes mode: Press the button once (Display blue light)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>10 minute mode: Press the button 2 times (Display blue light)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Self-cleaning mode: Press the button for 3 seconds (Display green light)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Stop Working: When the hydrogen water generator is working, press the button once, it will stop working, and light is off.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Please activate DuPont membrane before use: </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Fill the glass with 5/6 of drinking water, start the hydrogen production twice in 10 minutes mode (equivalent to hydrogen production for 20 minutes), then do not open the lid, put it for 8~10 hours, then the DuPont N117 membrane will be activated successfully.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(It is better to activate DuPont membranes with a 350ml mineral water bottle.)</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Why the new hydrogen water bottle has less bubble?</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Since the new hydrogen water bottle has not activated the DUPONT N117 membrane, sometimes it has very few bubbles when producing hydrogen. Then, we need to activate the DUPONT N117 membrane first. Please refer to the previous paragraph for the activation method.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>How to distinguish false hydrogen content?</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Recently, it has been discovered that some businesses deceive consumers by using diluted blue drops mixed with water to test the hydrogen content. They even claim that it can exceed 3000PPB in a few minutes, because they use diluted blue drops mixed with water. This is cheating and a serious deception. The distinction is simple: if the first 5 drops of blue liquid cannot be quickly dissolved in hydrogen water, it means that the blue liquid has been mixed with water and diluted, deceiving consumers. Consumers can watch the video for comparison.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package Includes:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 * Hydrogen Rich Water Generator 1* Hydrogen Breath Device 1 * USB Charging cable 1 * User Manual 1 * Small transfer adapter for Mineral Bottle available for Russia, Ukraine, Germany, Holland, Belgium, USA, UK, Colombia and suitable for over 98% countries.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Maintenance:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Long press button open Cleaning mode every 1 weeks Clean with citric acid every 2 to 4 weeks. (High TDS or Hard or Mineral Water need to clean more frequently) Keep the membrane moist daily when producing hydrogen multiple times; do not exceed the prescribed number of times.</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.6762,28,11.5,10.5,210,200,'25','1','1','2','16136564866618white.jpg','16136564866618white1.jpg','16136564866618white2.jpg','16136564866618white3.jpg','16136564866618white4.jpg','16136564866618white5.jpg','16136564866618white6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-02-18 13:54:47'),(1216,'Wireless Air Compression Leg Massager - Rechargeable Completely Wrapped Relieve Calf Muscle Fatigue Massage Relaxation',0,0,'wireless-air-compression-leg-massager-rechargeable-completely-wrapped-relieve-calf-muscle-fatigue-massage-relaxation','legmsgr0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4001044098793.html?spm=a2g0o.tm800002166.5930757380.1.5d603327M5j2Zi&&scm=1007.25281.191399.0&scm_id=1007.25281.191399.0&scm-url=1007.25281.191399.0&pvid=7385adef-a6e7-4319-9d1e-f9ac4e3e2464&utparam={\"process_id\":\"1\",\"x_object_type\":\"product\",\"pvid\":\"7385adef-a6e7-4319-9d1e-f9ac4e3e2464\",\"belongs\":[{\"floor_id\":\"16298832\",\"id\":\"438837\",\"type\":\"dataset\"},{\"id_list\":[\"3753420\"],\"type\":\"gbrain\"}],\"scm\":\"1007.25281.191399.0\",\"tpp_buckets\":\"21669#0#186385#0_21669#4190#19161#400_15281#0#191399#0\",\"x_object_id\":\"4001044098793\"}','China','<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Full Leg Massager -</span></span></strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>The leg massager can massage your feet, calves, thighs. It will provides cyclical air compression for your leg, relax your nervous muscles as well as improve leg circulation to get the pain relief.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\