oles, can pitch this tent wiin 5 minute for new user.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Double Layer: It is 2 layer tents, outer made of 210T waterproof PU 2000MM polyester. Inner is mesh layer, it design 1 door for in and out.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Aluminium Poles: Better than fiberglass poles, this tent frame is aluminium poles, more lightweight and durable.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dimension: (140+40) x210x105CM  (LxWxH)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Inner Area: 140x200cm</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Net Weight: about 1.85kg / 4lbs</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Color: Orange, Blue, Green</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Outer material: 210T waterproof anti-tear polyester  PU 2000 waterproof layer</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Inner material: 210T mesh layer</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bottom material: 210D oxford cloth water layer PU 3000MM</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Carry Bag: 50x13x13CM</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Note:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Product color in the pictures may vary slightly due to the color calibration of each individual monitor setting, please refer to the real item you receive.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Product dimension may have 1-3 cm difference. Because of measurement environment, it can be accepted if there have some difference you measured.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package Included:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 x tent</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2 x Aluminium Poles</p>\r\n\r\n<p>8 x Tent Peg</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2 x Ropes</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 x Handbag</p>\r\n',0,'1',2.27,45.1,18.7,18.6,175,170,'25','1','1','2','16137554777425Double_Layer_Camping_Tent.jpg','16137554777425Double_Layer_Camping_Tent1.jpg','16137554777425Double_Layer_Camping_Tent2.jpg','16137554777425Double_Layer_Camping_Tent3.jpg','16137554777425Double_Layer_Camping_Tent4.jpg','16137554777425Double_Layer_Camping_Tent5.jpg','16137554777425Double_Layer_Camping_Tent6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-02-19 17:24:39'),(1221,'3-Layer Polyester Breathable Waterproof Stocking Foot Fly Fishing Chest Waders Pant for Men and Women with Phone Case',0,0,'3-