er Class 4).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Materials can be engraved</strong><strong> -</strong>Wood, Paper, Leather, Fruit, Felt etc. ?Materials can&#39;t be engraved? Metals, Stone, Jewellery, Reflective Material, Silver ,white paper (astigmatism, poor effect), materials that can&#39;t be burned or focused such as metal without any coating, light-trans missive plastic, plastics with added flame retardant materials</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features:</strong><br>\r\n<br>\r\nDurable and safe: lotto Mr engraving machine with high quality lotto MrHead, nice durability, stability, long service life.<br>\r\nWork warning alarm, motion trigger stop, thermal shutdown, password lock can protect you from accidental injury.<br>\r\nCan be engraved in wood, bamboo, paper, lastics, leather, rubber, sponge, comb, wallet or other combustible lastics.<br>\r\nWide usage range: model lovers, craftsmen, cobblers, carpenters, bakers, designers, DIY enthusiasts and other beginners and professionals.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\nColor: Gold, Black, Red, Green (optional)<br>\r\nOperation Way: APP<br>\r\nLotto Mr Source: 1600mW  450mm Blue Ray<br>\r\nService Life: At Least 10000H<br>\r\nAppearance: Anodization Of Aluminium Alloy<br>\r\nBT: 4.0<br>\r\nSupport File Format: G-Code And jpg<br>\r\nAPP Connection Way: BT<br>\r\nAPP Platform: IOS9.0+/Android5.0+<br>\r\nVoltage Input: Type-C. 5V 2A<br>\r\nWork Temperature Range: 0?~65?<br>\r\nWork Humidity Range: 5%~80%<br>\r\nItem Weight: 190g / 6.70ounces<br>\r\nPackage Weight: 900g / 31.75ounces<br>\r\nItem Size: 65 * 61 * 53mm / 2.56 * 2.40 * 2.09in<br>\r\nPackage Size: 250 * 250 * 120mm / 9.84 * 9.84 * 4.72in<br>\r\nPlug: 2 Types (optional)<br>\r\n<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Note:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n   There are different plug specifications to choose from, please choose one suitable for your country.<br>\r\n   Hard materials such as metal and stone cannot be carved.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package List:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n1 * Lotto Mr Engraving Machine<br>\r\n1 * USB Cable<br>\r\n1 * Tripod<br>\r\n1 * Goggles <br>\r\n1 * Adaptor<br>\r\n1 * Mini Engraving Material Kit</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.5,20.83,18.8,11.43,750,720,'25','1','1','2','16139340665257Compact_Laser_Engraver.jpg','16139340665257Compact_Laser_Engraver1.jpg','16139340665257Compact_Laser_Engraver2.jpg','16139340665257Compact_Laser_Engraver3.jpg','16139340665257Compact_Laser_Engraver4.jpg','16139340665257Compact_Laser_Engraver5.jpg','16139340665257Compact_Laser_Engraver6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-02-21 19:01:08'),(1228,'Flipo Flip Desk Toy Rotating Pocket Toy Fidget Kinetic Spinner Birthday Xmas Gift Children Adult Stress Relief Toys ',0,0,'flipo-flip-desk-toy-rotating-pocket-toy-fidget-kinetic-spinner-birthday-xmas-gift-children-adult-stress-relief-toys','flpdskty0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005001625160013.html?spm=a2g0o.home.15002.42.3b7a2145c0J3VI&gps-id=pcJustForYou&scm=1007.13562.168240.0&scm_id=1007.13562.168240.0&scm-url=1007.13562.168240.0&pvid=3d473b54-7ee9-4f25-9453-faffb6417db4&_t=gps-id:pcJustForYou,scm-url:1007.13562.168240.0,pvid:3d473b54-7ee9-4f25-9453-faffb6417db4,tpp_buckets:668#0#131923#91_668#888#3325#15_668#2846#8108#1977_668#2717#7566#900__668#3374#15176#958','China','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>STRESS RELIEVER -</strong> This kinetic skill toy creates a mesmerizing motion that is fun, addictive, and calming at the same time. The flipo flip skill toy allows you to take a moment away from the daily rush and recharge your focus.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>POCKET SIZE-</strong> This spinning toy for adults is very small in size, so you can put it in your pocket easily and it won’t take much space. The satisfying desk toy has the ideal size for easy carrying that comes with leather pouch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>FANCY DESIGN -</strong> Kinetic spinning desk toy is a simple but well-designed shape that hides fascinating properties that are demonstrated by mastering the correct movement and the tension when pushing or pulling the object.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>STURDY AND DURABLE -</strong> The kinetic desk toy is made of zinc alloy material which makes this toy long-lasting. It is mathematically analysed to bring a motion of continuing flipping, rolling, and falling at the same time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>VERSATILE USAGE -</strong> This spinning toy pocket is suitable for adults, kids and senior citizens. The kinetic toys adults help you to increase your focus and take away your attention from the daily rush life.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>How to play</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Stop in between the motion - a trick that requires perfect timing and reaction. You can catch the in the vertical position using your finger or palm.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Throw it in the air- this trick requires quick hand movement because you need to get below the Flipo to be able to throw it up.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Reverse the flip - catch it in the perfect timing and give it a tip in a reverse direction. The most important thing here is the correct power of the reverse push.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. Spin it - you can spin Flipo vertically or horizontally.  Precise finger position when launching is the key to a successful spin.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specification – </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Shape:</strong> Hexagon&Square <br>\r\n<strong>Material:</strong> Zinc Alloy<br>\r\n<strong>Size: </strong>48m<br>\r\n<strong>Color: </strong>Silver or Gold<br>\r\n<strong>Craft:</strong> Die casting; both sides 3D Effect<br>\r\n<strong>Plating:</strong> Nickel<br>\r\n<strong>Front:</strong> Glossy surface background<br>\r\n<strong>Back:</strong> Glossy Surface</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.159,10.9,7