Y BALLS -</strong> 1 pack bouncy ball dog toys come in 3 vivid colors, blue, green, orange, 2 balls per color. It worth that get these ball toys since they are multifunctional, combine all-in-one, just like you get teething toys, squeaky toys, toss and fetch toys for dogs at the same time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>ECO-FRIENDLY & SAFE -</strong>Made of food grade, TPR (BPA free), non-toxic, no chemical smell, provide the safest toys for your puppy. Not easy to be broken to cause choke risk since spikes on the ball have a buffer. The added benefit is helping to keep her gums and teeth cleaner.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>SQUEAKY BALLS FOR DOGS -</strong>Feature a internal squeaker, hidden deeply, that means dogs are hardly to squeeze it out, no choking risks when chewing or playing. No matter how your dog bites, they will continue to make a cute sound, not too loud, but still get dogs&#39; attention.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>DOG BOUNCY BALLS FOR SMALL DOGS -</strong>The ball bounces high when thrown to the ground, suitable for tossing and fetching games. Dogs jumping, running to get the balls, that training dogs&#39; reaction and leaping ability, positively enhance the relationship between you and your dogs. Yet it can easily be squashed, it just fills back up with air and keep going.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>Product Description</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dogs love ball toys and squeaky toys, our squeaky balls are perfect combination of both.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe hidden squeaker design ensures the safety and durability.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nAt the same time, these spike ball toys have a high friction, when dogs playing with them, they won&#39;t be swallowed likes other smooth round balls.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nExercise and chew are so natural for dogs, they like to play with you, and would prefer to play with you than on their own when there is a toy around.<br>