rature resistance</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Not afraid of falling</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Four-layer folding design that can be used as a pet toy when folded, and as a pet bowl when opened</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Portable hooks for easy portability</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>Specification:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Size: 13x9x5.5cm (350ml)/17.5x13x7cm (1000ml)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Product weight: 350ml about 65g/1000ml about 120g</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Product material: silicone</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Product color: pink/ blue/ red/orange/ yellow/green/purple/white/black</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Four-layer folding design that can be used as a pet toy when folded, and as a pet bowl when opened</p>\r\n\r\n<p>More color, easy to clean, high temperature resistance</p>\r\n\r\n<p>High quality silicone material</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Portable hooks for easy portability</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>Package Included:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 x Dog bowl</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>Notes:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Real color may slightly different from pictures due to computer screen&#39;s resolution, brightness, contrast etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you have any question, please contact us before leave negative feedback, we will try our best to serve you, thank you for your understanding!</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.126,18.2,16.8,1.8,4,3,'25','1','1','2','16140191084164Foldable_Pet_Bowl.jpg','16140191084164Foldable_Pet_Bowl1.jpg','16140191084164Foldable_Pet_Bowl2.jpg','16140191084164Foldable_Pet_Bowl3.jpg','16140191084164Foldable_Pet_Bowl4.jpg','16140191084164Foldable_Pet_Bowl5.jpg','16140191084164Foldable_Pet_Bowl6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-02-22 18:38:29'),(1239,'4K*2K 3D Mini 3 Port HDMI-compatible 1.4 Switch 4K Switcher - HD Splitter 1080P 3 in 1 out Video Adapter for DVD HDTV Xbox PS3 PS4',0,0,'4k2k-3d-mini-3-port-hdmi-compatible-14-switch-4k-switcher-hd-splitter-1080p-3-in-1-out-video-adapter-for-dvd-hdtv-xbox-ps3-ps4','4kswtr0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/32989790224.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.713b7374iEjdjK&algo_pvi