ing for exterminating pest control service.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>WIDE APPLICATION &WIDE COVERAGE RANGE -</strong>An ultrasonic pest repeller with an approximate coverage area of 1200 sq. One unit for each room is recommended, so every corner of the house can be completely covered and protected. The ultrasonic bug repellent can be widely used in other places such as office, warehouse, garage, hotel, supermarket, and restaurant.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>EASY TO USE -</strong>Simply plug the mice repellent into the electrical outlet, then the electronic pest repellent will emit non-repetitive frequency ultrasound to attack the auditory and nervous systems of these pests, causing them discomfort and forcing them out for good. Please install the pest repeller near the areas where the rat or pests might visit. 10-30 inches above from the ground is recommended for crawling pest, while higher for flying pest.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Description:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>100% brand new and high quality</li>\r\n <li>Color: White + Black </li>\r\n <li>Material: ABS </li>\r\n <li>Plug Type: US/EU/AU/UK Plug  </li>\r\n <li>Power Supply: AC 90V-250V, 50-60Hz </li>\r\n <li>Power: 5-6W </li>\r\n <li>Ultrasonic Frequency: 22-65KHz </li>\r\n <li>Effective Range: 80-120 Square Meters </li>\r\n <li>Working Temperature: 0-40°C </li>\r\n <li>Product Size: 90 * 55 * 50mm / 3.54 * 2.16 * 1.97in </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Feature:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Effective Coverage Area: 80~120 square meters. The best coverage area is less than 60 square meters. Smaller the area is, greater the effect is.</li>\r\n <li>Stable and effective.</li>\r\n <li>LED display.</li>\r\n <li>Directly plug into an AC outlet, and make sure that no item blocks its emission.</li>\r\n <li>Ultra-low power consumption; without effects to electrical equipment.</li>\r\n <li>No Harmful Chemicals or Poisons, Noiseless, Safe, Easy To Use.</li>\r\n <li>Repels Bugs, Ants, Mice, Cockroaches, Mosquitoes, Spiders, Rats, etc.</li>\r\n <li>Non-toxic& Environment-friendly,Standard Wall Plug-In,Indoor Use Only</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Notes:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>1. Please allow 1-3cm error due to manual measurement and make sure you do not mind before ordering.</li>\r\n <li>2. Due to light and screen difference, the item&#39;s color may be slightly different from pictures.</li>\r\n <li>3. This machine should be installed at 80-120cm away from the floor And vertical to the floor and plug to the power socket. </li>\r\n <li>4. The installing point should be avoided to be in the back of the curtain fridge, and any other furniture that deterring or attaching frequency. </li>\r\n <li>5. It&#39;s normal that the mouse and vermin will increase at the beginning of the using days Because they are moving away from their living place after the attack of ultrasonic. </li>\r\n <li>6. Don&#39;t clean the machine by strong imp regnant, water or damp cloth Use dry and soft cloth with some neuter wash to clean it. </li>\r\n <li>7. To increase the effect, you should use several sets machines at the warehouse or goods pile-up, several rooms. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package Included:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>1 * Ultrasonic Pest Repeller</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,'1',0.08,9.8,6.5,4.3,15,10,'25','1','1','2','16142751996657Electronic_Pest_Repeller.jpg','16142751996657Electronic_Pest_Repeller1.jpg','16142751996657Electronic_Pest_Repeller2.jpg','16142751996657Electronic_Pest_Repeller3.jpg','16142751996657Electronic_Pest_Repeller4.jpg','16142751996657Electronic_Pest_Repeller5.jpg','16142751996657Electronic_Pest_Repeller6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-02-25 17:46:41'),(1258,'Fashion Women Satin Night Sleep Cap Hair Bonnet Hat Silk Head Cover Wide Elastic Band',0,0,'fashion-women-satin-night-sleep-cap