se.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Safety and Durability -</strong>This bowl is made of 100% food grade PP material, which means high safety for your kids. And also it is durable for long-time use.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Attractive Bowl with Planet Saturn and Colorful Design - </strong>As we all know that kids have unlimited imagination and they are also have a strong sensitivity to color! When kids use this to eat food, it will not only for keeping your children&#39;s mess to a minimum, but it also looks like a colorful Planet Saturn, so that it is attractive enough for kid to eat when they are picky eater.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Easy to Clean (Water or Dishwasher)</strong> - It can be easily cleaned even though with this special shape design. You can just wash it with water or dishwasher, it helps parent to save more time on cleaning!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Premium PP Material for Durability and Safe Usage -</strong>This bowl is made of 100% food grade PP material, it is FDA approved and BPA free which means high safety for your kids. The Gyro Bowl is durable and simply won&#39;t break, crack, discolour,warp,melt or flake away. It also doesn’t change the nature of the food you put in there.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Size -</strong>17cmx 17cm x 7cm (6.63\"x6.63\"x2.73\"); Package Include: 1 x Magic Gyro Bowl.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>But Please Kindly Noted- </strong>If you hold it nicely by the handles and turn it nicely it works well, but if you shake it, or turn it too quickly then it will spill out it will be better if you keep the bowl with lids when your baby reach his hand for shaking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features – </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Brand new and high quality.<br>\r\nFeatures:Not Down, 360 Rotate Spill-Proof Baby B