ent for kids and adult.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specification – </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Capacity:1.5L,2L</li>\r\n <li>Weight: 131g, 129g</li>\r\n <li>Size: 1.5L,2L</li>\r\n <li>Material: TPU</li>\r\n <li>Temperature Range: 0 to 40 degree centigrade</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,'1',0.136,31.75,19.05,1.9,45,38,'25','1','1','2','16158301971462BPA_Free_Water_Storage_Bag.jpg','16158301971462BPA_Free_Water_Storage_Bag1.jpg','16158301971462BPA_Free_Water_Storage_Bag2.jpg','16158301971462BPA_Free_Water_Storage_Bag3.jpg','16158301971462BPA_Free_Water_Storage_Bag4.jpg','16158301971462BPA_Free_Water_Storage_Bag5.jpg','16158301971462BPA_Free_Water_Storage_Bag6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-15 17:43:18'),(1305,'Clear Vinyl Application Tape w/Blue Alignment Grid for Car Wall Craft Art Decal Transfer Paper Tape Adhesive',18,18,'clear-vinyl-application-tape-wblue-alignment-grid-for-car-wall-craft-art-decal-transfer-paper-tape-adhesive','aplcttpe0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4001297225880.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.1bc243de1Sw2hi&algo_pvid=166c00d3-0c15-447a-a4f2-8e00cfd6015b&algo_expid=166c00d3-0c15-447a-a4f2-8e00cfd6015b-45&btsid=2100bdec16150117878153357e9e72&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>MEDIUM TACK -</strong>Our Clear Vinyl Transfer Paper Tape Roll not too sticky to transfer your designs, but sticky enough to easily lift your project and transfer it to your surface effortless. Just the right amount of glue will make sure your project transfer beautifully. NO MESS - NO FUSS!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>GREAT SAVINGS -</strong> Our vinyl transfer paper excellent size is so long for you to use and can achieve your various crafting needs. It is believed that our Transfer Tape for Vinyl is your best choice with attractive design and reasonable price.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>MORE PRECISE - CLEAR BLUE G