please make sure the surroundings are dark enough.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. You can enjoy the glowing pebbles,the longer the absorption time, the longer the illumination time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>100% brand new and high quality.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>High brightness, long life time expectancy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Water, acid and alkali resistant, antioxidant.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It could be used over and over again.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package list:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>10 PCSLuminous stones</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Materials:Acrylic</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Size:About 21mm*17mm*10mm</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.02,4.1,3.7,2,7,5,'25','1','1','2','16159189712814Glow_Stones.jpg','16159189712814Glow_Stones1.jpg','16159189712814Glow_Stones2.jpg','16159189712814Glow_Stones3.jpg','16159189712814Glow_Stones4.jpg','16159189712814Glow_Stones5.jpg','16159189712814Glow_Stones6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-16 18:22:52'),(1312,'3M Luminous Tape Self-adhesive Glow Emergency Logo In The Dark - Safety Stage Sticker Home Decor Party Supplies',18,18,'3m-luminous-tape-self-adhesive-glow-emergency-logo-in-the-dark-safety-stage-sticker-home-decor-party-supplies','lmnstp0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000131388870.html?spm=a2g0o.home.15002.200.650c2145SQtGTQ&gps-id=pcJustForYou&scm=1007.13562.168240.0&scm_id=1007.13562.168240.0&scm-url=1007.13562.168240.0&pvid=6756f13e-8f68-4e2b-8f6f-418096ce36eb&_t=gps-id:pcJustForYou,scm-url:1007.13562.168240.0,pvid:6756f13e-8f68-4e2b-8f6f-418096ce36eb,tpp_buckets:668#0#131923#69_668#0#131923#69_668#888#3325#15_668#888#3325#15_668#2846#8108#1977_668#2717#7566#900__668#3374#15176#958_668#2846#8108#1977_668#2717#7566#900_668#3164#9976#463_668#3374#15176#958','China','<ul>\r\n <li>High Luminance. Glow in the Dark Tape that only requires 30 minutes ambient daylight (natural/bulb) exposure for up to 10 hours of extended glow.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Ideal for labelling safety signs or reinforcing exit signs, directions, and light switches in cases of low light situations and evacuation plans. Can be applied to switches, controls, handrails, basement pavement, stairs, walls, and exit doors. Strips can be arranged on any fashion, pattern. Design and shapes-- making it a great decorative tape at home.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Surface-safe Adhesive. Bright Stage Glow Tape is rated at 7 years operational lifespan. Weather-proof, flexible and conformable to any shape. Adhesive can stick to both smooth and rough surfaces such as walls, metal railings, textile, porcelain, wood and other delicate materials-- ensuring that the surface finish will never be damaged and no sticky residue is left upon removal.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Glow Dark Tape illuminates with a green lighting providing utmost safety to you and your loved ones whether in the home or in the office especially on areas or steps where lighting is poor.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>This Glow in the Dark Duct Tape for floors, walls and stairs is made from hypoallergenic adhesive- non-toxic, non-radioactive and increases safety on workplaces and homes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features - </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Material: PVC<br>\r\nStyle: luminous wall stickers<br>\r\nOccasion: luminous party decoration, birthday party, Christmas decoration</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specification - </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Glow Supplies Type: Other Glow Props</li>\r\n <li>is customized: Yes</li>\r\n <li>Number of Pcs: 1pc</li>\r\n <li>Glowing Time: 1year</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: Wedding & Engagement</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: Christening & Baptism</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: St Patrick&#39;s Day</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: Grand Event</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: Retirement</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: Gender Reveal</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: Birthday Party</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: House Moving</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: Children&#39;s Day</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: April Fool&#39;s Day</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: Back To School</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: Chinese New Year</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: Earth Day</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: Father&#39;s Day</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: THANKSGIVING</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: Party</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: Christmas</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: Valentine&#39;s Day</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: Wedding</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: HALLOWEEN</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: Easter</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: New Year</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: Graduation</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: Anniversary</li>\r\n <li>Occasion: Mother&#39;s Day</li>\r\n <li>material: plastic</li>\r\n <li>item type: belts</li>\r\n <li>shape style: plant</li>\r\n <li>ships from: China</li>\r\n <li>glowing time: more than 5 hours</li>\r\n <li>event & party item type: party decorations,other</li>\r\n <li>glow supplies type: other glow props</li>\r\n <li>is customized: yes</li>\r\n <li>type: event & party supplies</li>\r\n <li>color: green</li>\r\n <li>occasion: party,Christmas,birthday party,Halloween,wedding & engagement</li>\r\n <li>number of pcs: 1pc</li>\r\n <li>model number: glow headband</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,'1',0.04,11.9,11.7,2,7,3,'25','1','1','2','16159193711166Luminous_Tape.jpg','16159193711166Luminous_Tape1.jpg','16159193711166Luminous_Tape2.jpg','16159193711166Luminous_Tape3.jpg','16159193711166Luminous_Tape4.jpg','16159193711166Luminous_Tape5.jpg','16159193711166Luminous_Tape6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-16 18:29:32'),(1313,'Microwave Baking Potatoes Bag Easy To Cook - Steam Pocket Quick Fast Baked Potatoes Rice Pocket Washable Cooker Bag',18,18,'microwave-baking-potatoes-bag-easy-to-cook-steam-pocket-quick-fast-baked-potatoes-rice-pocket-washable-cooker-bag','micwvptobg0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000060498251.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.1bc243de1Sw2hi&algo_pvid=f0111757-b926-40cf-a883-d42eb36c8c8c&algo_expid=f0111757-b926-40cf-a883-d42eb36c8c8c-35&btsid=2100bdf116150113945706387e246f&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Material</strong><strong> -</strong>The red microwave oven potato cooker bag is made of high-quality polyester fibre cloth. They are machine washable and reusable, environmentally friendly and harmless.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Size</strong><strong> -</strong> Our potato bag is about 18.5 * 24.5cm / 7.28 * 9.65 inches. You can load the right amount of potatoes for baking according to the size of the potatoes (regular size about 4 potatoes). Works for all types of potatoes, corn on the cob, yams and so on.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Save Time</strong><strong> -</strong>In just 4 minutes in the microwave, you can bake potatoes perfectly in the oven. Save time in the kitchen with this microwave potato bag, also great for keeping your microwave clean with less condensation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Widely Application</strong><strong> -</strong> The potato bags are perfect for potato skin, potato salad, homes fries, mashed potatoes or any of your favourite style potato. What&#39;s more, you can easily personalize the toppings on each individual potato - a good solution for the pickiest of eaters in your family.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Note</strong><strong> -</strong> After the food is cooked, it is strongly recommended to use professional insulated gloves to remove the bag from the microwave oven and take out the potatoes, or take it out after cooling down slightly, taking care to avoid burns.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Brand new and high quality.</li>\r\n <li>Cook delicious potatoes in the microwave in 4-5 minutes.</li>\r\n <li>Make of Polyester fabric fiber, re-usable and machine washable.</li>\r\n <li>Great for all types of potatoes, corn on the cob, yams and more.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> <br>\r\n<strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Material: Polyester fabric, fiber</li>\r\n <li>Color: Red</li>\r\n <li>Size: Approx. 26.5 X 19.5 cm</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> <br>\r\n<strong>Baked potato method:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Put the potatoes into the bag, seal</li>\r\n <li>Hold on the wheel into the microwave oven (especially big potatoes 5-6 minutes, in 4 to 5 minutes, small potatoes 3-4 minutes)</li>\r\n <li>Bake finished and enjoy the food</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package Included:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>1 x Cooker Bag</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,'1',0.1,25.32,10.62,4.76,12,9,'25','1','1','2','16159196371405Potato_Baking_Bag.jpg','16159196371405Potato_Baking_Bag1.jpg','16159196371405Potato_Baking_Bag2.jpg','16159196371405Potato_Baking_Bag3.jpg','16159196371405Potato_Baking_Bag4.jpg','16159196371405Potato_Baking_Bag5.jpg','16159196371405Potato_Baking_Bag6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-16 18:33:58'),(1314,'Manual Stainless Steel Noodle Maker Press Pasta Machine - Crank Cutter Fruits Juicer Cookware Making Spaghetti Kitchen Tools',18,18,'manual-stainless-steel-noodle-maker-press-pasta-machine-crank-cutter-fruits-juicer-cookware-making-spaghetti-kitchen-tools','ndlmkr0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005002008488947.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.1bc243de1Sw2hi&algo_pvid=f0111757-b926-40cf-a883-d42eb36c8c8c&algo_expid=f0111757-b926-40cf-a883-d42eb36c8c8c-49&btsid=2100bdf116150113945706387e246f&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>High Quality -</strong>Made of high quality stainless steel material, anti-rust and corrosion-resistant, durable and sturdy to use.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Main function -</strong>Make delicious noodle and extract juice. Easy operation, save time, natural and harmless, tasteless and non-corrosive, can be cleaned by water.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Perfect Gifts -</strong>Practical yet warm gifts for your lover, mother, yourself to make many types of recipes, and even for chef friends.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Easy To Use</strong> - The screw propulsion design makes it easy to screw out noodles, making it more labour-saving, time-saving, ideal for making your noodles in seconds, allows you to eat delicious noodles in a short time, the best choice for making noodles.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Manual DIY</strong><strong> -</strong> The noodles you make now are safe for your family. Easy to make delicious and healthy noodles by hand, choose different noodle raw materials as you like. Make noodles more colorful. Can also be used to extract juice, ideal for home or restaurant use.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features:</strong><br>\r\n<strong>High quality material</strong><br>\r\nThis kitchen manual noodle maker is made of high quality stainless steel material, safe, durable and rust-resistant in use.<br>\r\n<strong>Selectable mold heads</strong><br>\r\nthis noddle machine is coming with 2 or 5 mold heads, thus you can choose different mold head to make noodles of different thickness.<br>\r\n<strong>Multifunctional</strong><br>\r\nit is not just a noodle maker, this machine can used as a fruit juicer to extract juice, perfect for kitchen use.<br>\r\n<strong>Ergonomic Design</strong><br>\r\nScrew propelling rocker is labour-saving to operate and stainless steel handle is comfortable to hold in working process.<br>\r\n<strong>Portable</strong><br>\r\nthis pasta maker is small and portable, not only suitable for home use, but also easy to take with you anywhere.<br>\r\n<strong>Scopes of Applications</strong><br>\r\nthis noodle maker is a good kitchen helper, suitable for making different noodles and squeezing juice, can be used at home, restaurants, outdoor camping, travelling etc.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Specifications:</strong><br>\r\nType: Manual Noodle Maker<br>\r\nMaterial: Stainless Steel<br>\r\nQuantity: 1 pc<br>\r\nColor: Silver<br>\r\nMold heads: 2 pcs (2mm/2*6mm)<br>\r\n5 pcs (1.5mm/2.2mm/3.2mm/6*2mm square hole/Wowomold)<br>\r\nSize: 17.5*13*6cm/6.88*5.11*2.36inch<br>\r\nNet weight: 500g/17.64oz<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Packages:</strong><br>\r\n1* Manual Noodle Maker</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.751,5,5,5,45,40,'25','1','1','2','16159202109504Household_Noodle_Maker.jpg','16159202109504Household_Noodle_Maker1.jpg','16159202109504Household_Noodle_Maker2.jpg','16159202109504Household_Noodle_Maker3.jpg','16159202109504Household_Noodle_Maker4.jpg','16159202109504Household_Noodle_Maker5.jpg','16159202109504Household_Noodle_Maker6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-16 18:43:31'),(1315,'New 5-layer Fruit Dryer Household Food Dryer Fruit Vegetable Pet Meat Food Dehydration Air Dryer Small',18,18,'new-5-layer-fruit-dryer-household-food-dryer-fruit-vegetable-pet-meat-food-dehydration-air-dryer-small','5lrfrtdyr0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005001479834376.html?spm=a2g0o.tm800004107.7493588020.4.6de86b74rJaZvw&&scm=1007.25281.213892.0&scm_id=1007.25281.213892.0&scm-url=1007.25281.213892.0&pvid=c61721b4-c295-4966-a170-a1d9c65a8173&utparam={','China','<ul>\r\n <li>Fruit dryer has many functions, fast and easy dehydration and storage of vegetables, dried meat, fruits, pet snacks,nuts, flower tea, yogurt, herbs, food supplements, etc., dehydration, maintaining the nutritional value of food.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>This fruit dryer adopts advanced dehydration technology, temperature adjustable 35~75°C, 360° all round hot air, food is fully dry, and the air circulation generated by the dehydrator makes the food dry.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>The fruit dryer has large capacity and convenient adjustment, It consists of 5 spacious and detachable food grade trays, It can be adjusted as needed, It has and manual free adjustment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Low energy consumption, easy to clean food dryer is a low energy alternative health food, easy to clean, the tray is completely detachable, easy to clean.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Complete safety protection The bottom is made of solid anti slip mat, double protection design, overheat protection and automatic temperature control, making the dehydration process safer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features – </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Many advantages</p>\r\n\r\n<p>After setting the temperature, the machine will be completely air-dried, once the temperature is set, it will automatically run at low power, which is more energy efficient.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anti-noise design, low volume operation, creating a quiet and comfortable living environment</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Equipped with food grade tray, hygienic, non-toxic, odourless, high temperature resistant, dustproof, drop resistant, uniform pallet spacing, easy to disassemble and clean.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Save space, can be placed in the living room, bedroom, kitchen, you can dry the fruits or vegetables you want to dry at any time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specification – </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Fruit dehydrator size: L245 x W215 x H245mm</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Machine weight: 3KG</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Power: 247W</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Voltage: 220V</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Air drying temperature range: 35~75 °C</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Material:food grade plastic</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Number of trays: 5</p>\r\n',0,'1',3,26.5,4.15,4.45,120,110,'25','1','1','2','16159965176860Fruit_Dryer.jpg','16159965176860Fruit_Dryer1.jpg','16159965176860Fruit_Dryer2.jpg','16159965176860Fruit_Dryer3.jpg','16159965176860Fruit_Dryer4.jpg','16159965176860Fruit_Dryer5.jpg','16159965176860Fruit_Dryer6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-17 15:55:19'),(1316,'Bluetooth Wireless Digital Meat Thermometer for Food - Oven Grill BBQ Barbecue Smoker Cooking Digital Kitchen Food Thermometer',18,18,'bluetooth-wireless-digital-meat-thermometer-for-food-oven-grill-bbq-barbecue-smoker-cooking-digital-kitchen-food-thermometer','blthmtthmtr0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005001948940336.html?spm=a2g01.12617084.fdpcl001.1.350cLSy0LSy0VV&gps-id=5547572&scm=1007.19201.130907.0&scm_id=1007.19201.130907.0&scm-url=1007.19201.130907.0&pvid=dedaf8ea-4e73-472a-adf4-c7c7c51f983e','China','<p><strong>How to use</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Download the FREE APP, GrillProbeE, which is available to IOS and android.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Charge the probe about 1 hour (for better performance) before using. Usually, only charging 10min, to working 4 hours.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Insert the probe to the meat. Please mind that the insertion depth must beyond the safe line as shown.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. Press the ON button at the top of the probe, and then connect with the APP via Bluetooth.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>5. Now set temperature to Celsius or Fahrenheit degree.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>And you can set the alarm type to Ring, Vibration, or both Ring and Vibration.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>6. Barbecue Mode Settings:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>a. Recipe   </p>\r\n\r\n<p>b. Cook Degree   </p>\r\n\r\n<p>c. Timer   </p>\r\n\r\n<p>d. Temperature</p>\r\n\r\n<p>7. Alarm System:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A. Barbecue Alarm</p>\r\n\r\n<p>B. Bluetooth Disconnection Alarm</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\na. BARBECUE ALARM: When the food reaches the present temperature, the smartphone will alarm you to end the progress.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>B. BLUETOOTH DISCONNECTION ALARM: When disconnected, you will receive a message to remind you to reconnect it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>8. Using the sealing cap: To protect the probe well when cleaning or when the barbecue is smoky.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Precautions during use</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. The depth of the probe which inserted into the food should exceed the safety notch.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Bluetooth switch button on the probe head cannot be washed with water, but don&#39;t worry, there is a sealing cap (included) to protect it well when cleaning.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Please mind that the barbecue food temperature supports 185? max, and oven temperature supports 527? max.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. If the food temperature is below 122? for ten minutes, Bluetooth will be disconnected automatically, then you should press the ON button to reconnect with it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>5. It would be better to charge it for one hour for the first time. Afterwards, you only need to charge it for 5 min. If you cannot find the probe on the app, please tell us and we&#39;ll help you.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specification:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>100% Truly Wireless</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The thermometer is compatible with BLE 4.2 and Android and IOS system. So you can monitor your cooks through your iPhone or iPad or Android device via Bluetooth.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>Multifunctional APP</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>a. Provides 3 present grilled modes and 9 types of food modes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>b. Supports Celsius and Fahrenheit conversion.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>c. Supports 4 probes at the same time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>d. Supports English, Chinese and German language</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>High Temperature Resistance</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>a. Food temperature measurement range: 0?100C;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>b. Internal temperature measurement range of oven: 0?300C;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>c. Support BLE4.2 with transmission distance over 10 meters.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>Easy to grill</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can set up custom alerts/notifications based on temperature and/or time. The Bluetooth meat thermometer will help you to control the rhythm of the barbecue perfectly and cook delicious food.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>Fast-charging</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>It only takes about 5 minutes on charging, and you can use it for 5.5 hours!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>2 Sensors, 1 Probe</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dual temperature sensors can monitor internal meat temperature (0 to 100 ? /32? to 212 ?) and external stove/oven temperature (0 to 300 °C / 32 to 572 °F) simultaneously.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Easy to use and self-explanatory, you can launch your favourite cooking mode with just a couple of clicks and simultaneously monitor the core temperature for your meat, fish and poultry dishes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>Expandable to 3 Additional Probes</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The APP can monitor 4 probes at the same time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>Connectivity Suite</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Monitor your cook from a phone or tablet over Bluetooth.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>The difference between the updated version and the old version</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>A. The updated version is IP67 waterproof. The meat thermometer can be rinsed under running water;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>b. The updated version is a charging base with magnets. Can be adsorbed on grills, ovens, furnaces and other equipment;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>C. The updated version is battery powered. Only need 1x AAA battery; the old version uses USB data cable for charging</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>Three setting functions on mobile APP</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. RECIPES:with present temperatures for 9 types of meat(ground beef,ground poultry,beef,veal, check,pork, poultry,goat,fish)and their various doneness levels recommended by USDA;  In the recipe settings function menu, there are 9 types of meat and their doneness levels have already set by the system. You can also set the barbecue time and temperature by clicking the Timer and Temperature icon.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. TIMER:You can set the barbecue time according to your experience.When the set time is reached,the app will automatically alarm.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. TARGET TEMPERTURE:You can also customize the temperature at which the food is cooked,when it reaches this temperature,it will automatically alarm.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>  <br>\r\n<strong>APP Interface</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1) Bluetooth connection status, click on the Bluetooth connection.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2) Four channel numbers, click to view each probe barbecue status.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3) Click to set the barbecue mode.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4) Click to view all the barbecue probes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>5) Time left 6) Food temperature 7) Barbecue mode</p>\r\n\r\n<p>8) Start/Stop,click to start/stop the barbecue process</p>\r\n\r\n<p>9) Oven temperature  </p>\r\n\r\n<p>10) Low battery alarm, need to recharge the probe</p>\r\n\r\n<p>11) System setting interface  </p>\r\n\r\n<p>12) Click to view a single probe barbecue,Connect and disconnect the Bluetooth<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Why Choose Us</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. All of our products are under strict quality control. We test every item before shipping.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2.  Now it can work 5.5 hours after charging for 10 minutes. And it is more stable than before. Moreover, our application was also updated. Now it supports more languages.<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>F&Q</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Does it have Celsius degree?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Yes, there are both Celsius and Fahrenheit degree for you to choose.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Can we put the probe in the oven?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Of course you can. It is designed for the oven and outdoor cooking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. What temperature can the probe withstand?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>There are 2 sensors in the probe. One is at the probe handle, which supports 300?/572? max. Another sensor is at the probe, which supports 100?/212? max. It is for the food temperature. (Upgraded)</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. How many languages does the application supports?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>On August 5, 2020, we&#39;ve added German language on the application. So now it supports English, German and Chinese. We&#39;ll also add other languages in the future.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package list:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\nOption A: (Waterproof Update version) Wireless Meat Food Thermometer(1 probe + 1 charging socket)</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.113,17.78,7.37,2.79,110,100,'25','1','1','2','16159970293894Digital_Meat_Thermometer.jpg','16159970293894Digital_Meat_Thermometer1.jpg','16159970293894Digital_Meat_Thermometer2.jpg','16159970293894Digital_Meat_Thermometer3.jpg','16159970293894Digital_Meat_Thermometer4.jpg','16159970293894Digital_Meat_Thermometer5.jpg','16159970293894Digital_Meat_Thermometer6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-17 16:03:50'),(1317,'Cheese Slicer with Stainless Steel Blade Wire Making Dessert - Blade Durable Commercial Kitchen Cooking Baking Butter Cutter Tools',18,0,'cheese-slicer-with-stainless-steel-blade-wire-making-dessert-blade-durable-commercial-kitchen-cooking-baking-butter-cutter-tools','chsslr0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005001864304668.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.46afe17aRdwXyJ&algo_pvid=acad5444-4fcb-4d7f-a4f0-5cea042500f5&algo_expid=acad5444-4fcb-4d7f-a4f0-5cea042500f5-53&btsid=0b0a0ac216152848339522475ec7c3&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Durable material -</span></span></strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>It is made of aluminium alloy body. The whole body can be washed, it will not be rusted, the surface is not painted, it is safe, easy to clean and easy to store. The food grade stainless steel wire board is durable and can be cut continuously to ensure even and uniform slice thickness.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Efficient slicing -</span></span></strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Just place the ingredients on the board, press the wire board, and complete all the slices in one operation and the wide of each piece are extremely the same. This commercial cheese slicer can meet the needs of large families or restaurants. The four legs are equ