pan xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>1 * Cheese slicer</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed> </span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Note:</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>1. Size for manual measurement, there may be a 0 to 1 cm error, belongs to the normal phenomenon.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>2. Due to the difference between different monitors, the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n',0,'1',2.47,33.27,19.05,17.78,310,300,'25','1','1','2','16159985579216Cheese_Cutting_Machine.jpg','16159985579216Cheese_Cutting_Machine1.jpg','16159985579216Cheese_Cutting_Machine2.jpg','16159985579216Cheese_Cutting_Machine3.jpg','16159985579216Cheese_Cutting_Machine4.jpg','16159985579216Cheese_Cutting_Machine5.jpg','16159985579216Cheese_Cutting_Machine6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-17 16:29:18'),(1318,'2pcs/set Electric Pepper Mill Salt Pepper Grinder - Practical Spice Grinder Mills modern de pimento Kitchen Grinding Tool',18,18,'2pcsset-electric-pepper-mill-salt-pepper-grinder-practical-spice-grinder-mills-modern-de-pimento-kitchen-grinding-tool','eltpprgndr0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000589071530.html?spm=a2g01.12616982.tplist001.1.1ade601cHkCw5h&gps-id=6038561&scm=1007.23961.125497.0&scm_id=1007.23961.125497.0&scm-url=1007.23961.125497.0&pvid=8e025350-e762-4788-be1f-2f62b79762a7','China','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Automatic Operation</strong><strong> -</strong>Our pepper grinder adopts advanced gravity sensing design, No need manual grinding, no buttons to press,and great for customers suffering of Chronic Hand Pain. Simply flipped the grinder and you will have fresh ground spices.Allows you to activate the distribution of your favourite spices with one hand, while the other hand is free to handle other kitchen tasks.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Adjustable Grind Coarseness</strong><strong> -</strong> The ceramic grinder is located at the top to remove your pepper from course to fine and keep your table or countertop FREE OF RESIDUE.Rotate clockwise into fine particles and rotate counter clockwise to grind into coarse particles.Simple and fashion design, suitable for all dinner tables and kitchen countertops.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Blue LED Light</strong><strong> -</strong>Not cheap-looking and boring white light anymore, blue light is not only bright but also gentle.When you have dinner with your family or loved ones, this gentle blue light adds a warm and romantic atmosphere.The blue LED light will turn on automatically during use;you can see exactly where your seasoning is landing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>High Quality & Large Capacity</strong><strong> -</strong>The black stainless steel matte cap provides a comfortable feel for the grinder.High quality acrylic material, Non-corrosive and ant oxidative, makes spices fresh and healthy. Large capacity is easy to refill and clean, and it is more durable than glass. large capacity make you not need to refill your pepper grinder often.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Battery Powered</strong><strong> -</strong>Fill with 6 x AAA batteries as per instructions before use (batteries are not included),which provide strong power for the pepper mill, you don&#39;t have to spend a lot of manual grinding.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>FEATURES</strong>:<br>\r\n<br>\r\nIt’s composed of spice container, black body and adjustable coarseness ceramic. It can be used in the kitchen, picnic, party and more. ENJOY it!<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe black body and spice container makes it more beautiful. Looks COOL!<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>EASILY REFILL</strong>. Just remove the spice container at the bottom and refill.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe blue light will turn on when you are making a delicious food. You can see the pepper and salt you put in the food.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nIt come with a adjustable FINE ceramic rotor, you can turn the grinder knob to choose the coarseness.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>EASILY USE</strong>. Just load the spice and the battery, adjust the coarseness, then turn it over and start grind. The blue LED light will turn on when you use it.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nA powerful motor can grind any spice you want. You can taste the fresh spices at home.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Description – </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Item name: Electric Mill</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Material: Stainless Steel+ABS +Acrylic</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Size: As show in the picture</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Color : As show in the picture</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Package: 2pcs</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Please Note:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Due to hand measure, the size may have 1-3 cm error</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Due to Different Monitor, the color may have difference</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.689,21.79,14.2,7.29,65,60,'25','1','1','2','16159991154440Electric_Pepper_Grinder.jpg','16159991154440Electric_Pepper_Grinder1.jpg','16159991154440Electric_Pepper_Grinder2.jpg','16159991154440Electric_Pepper_Grinder3.jpg','16159991154440Electric_Pepper_Grinder4.jpg','16159991154440Electric_Pepper_Grinder5.jpg','16159991154440Electric_Pepper_Grinder6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-17 16:38:37'),(1319,'Girl LED Mini Skirt Glow Butterfly Light Tutu Flower Luminous Party Costume - Ball Wedding Birthday Gift Ballet Dancewear 2-8 Year',18,18,'girl-led-mini-skirt-g