rudder of the transmitter through the knob.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Input: dc4.5-6v; output: ¡Ü 15mA (5.0); output signal: 1.5ms ¡À 0.5ms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The device also can be used as a signal generator for electric speed controller (ESC), and then you can test your motor system without using a transmitter and receiver.<br>\r\nThere are 3 modes to check servos or ESC:<br>\r\nManual mode: turn the knob with different speed, check the reaction time.<br>\r\nNeutral mode: make the servo go back to the neutral point.<br>\r\nAutomatic \"window wiper\" mode: make the servo swing like a window wipers in the biggest angle.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Description:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>It can connect 1-3 servos simultaneously and test such as 1-3 servos consistency and so on.<br>\r\nYou can also connect 1-3 ESC to test and compare their reaction time respectively.<br>\r\nIt can connect 3 servos of the CCPM helicopters and select servos.<br>\r\nIt can also connect the servo of airplanes install the steering-box and adjust planes by using such as the neutral mode and so on.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Specification:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>RC Parts &Accs: Servo Accessories<br>\r\nFor Vehicle Type: Helicopters<br>\r\nMaterial: Plastic<br>\r\nVoltage consumption: DC4.8-6V<br>\r\nColor: Blue<br>\r\nItem size: 46x32x23mm</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Packet content:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 x Multi Servo Tester</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.029,7,6,3,7,5,'25','1','1','2','16168688366489RC_Servo_Tester.jpg','16168688366489RC_Servo_Tester1.jpg','16168688366489RC_Servo_Tester2.jpg','16168688366489RC_Servo_Tester3.jpg','16168688366489RC_Servo_Tester4.jpg','16168688366489RC_Servo_Tester5.jpg','16168688366489RC_Servo_Tester6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-27 18:13:57'),(1394,'Strawberry Stand Frame Holder Balcony Planting Rack Fruit Support Plant Flow