ble for easy charging. Can fly up to 7 minutes on a single charge.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>SMART SAFETY DESIGN -</strong> Intended for ages 8 and above, the Cyber Flyer has a smart auto-start and safety stop function.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>When the kid turns on the switch,the ball will be delayed for 3 seconds to fly to ensure safety.When the toy hits things, it will turn off automatically to avoid damage. Non-toxic ABS material,durable and environmental protection.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features:</strong><br>\r\n1. Recycling lithium batteries, USB fast and safe charging, red light automatic extinguishing when it finish charging.<br>\r\n2. Infrared sensing, levitation without landing, simple and funny.<br>\r\n3. Operations: Open switch, vertical placement, 3 seconds later start it. Hand induction control height.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Specifications:</strong><br>\r\nMaterial: Plastic+Electronic components<br>\r\nColor: As shown<br>\r\nProduct Accessory: Transparent ball<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Notes:</strong><br>\r\n1. Please allow 1-3cm measuring deviation due to manual measurement.<br>\r\n2. Due to the different monitor and light effect, the actual color of the item might be slightly different from the color showed on the pictures. Thank you!</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package Include:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 X Induction Flying Ball Toy<br>\r\n1 X USB Charging Line</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.07,19.3,16,5.3,30,24,'25','1','1','2','16171313513942Helicopter_Children_Toy.jpg','16171313513942Helicopter_Children_Toy1.jpg','16171313513942Helicopter_Children_Toy2.jpg','16171313513942Helicopter_Children_Toy3.jpg','16171313513942Helicopter_Children_Toy4.jpg','16171313513942Helicopter_Children_Toy5.jpg','16171313513942Helicopter_Children_Toy6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-30 19:09:12'),(1416,'ORICO 3.5 Inch Hard Drive Bags & Case HDD Protective Moisture-p