ers. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Design especially for 3.5 inch HDD</strong> <br>\r\nStylish and portable design for 3.5 inch HDD protection, easy buckle and open mechanism produce a user-friendly experience and reinforced internal and external rib design, securely protect your 3.5 inch HDD. <br>\r\nBuilt-in anti-vibration and anti-static cushioning mat for maximum HDD protection, ideal solution for 3.5 inch hard drive protection. It&#39;s anti-drop /anti-shake /water resistant and dust resistant. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Unique Marking Label Design</strong> <br>\r\nWith marking label on the front of the box for convenient HDD library management, easy labelling design makes user to label their drives clearer and easier. And then you can manage it like a book and put in your table. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Note</strong>: Item on sale is the protection box only, HDD is not included. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>What is in the box</strong> <br>\r\n1 x ORICO 3.5 inch HDD Protection Case <br>\r\n1 x User Manual <br>\r\n1 x Service Card</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Quantity: 1X</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.17015,20.03,14.7,6.06,16,11,'25','1','1','2','16171317231573Moisture-proof_Storage_Box.jpg','16171317231573Moisture-proof_Storage_Box1.jpg','16171317231573Moisture-proof_Storage_Box2.jpg','16171317231573Moisture-proof_Storage_Box3.jpg','16171317231573Moisture-proof_Storage_Box4.jpg','16171317231573Moisture-proof_Storage_Box5.jpg','16171317231573Moisture-proof_Storage_Box6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-30 19:15:24'),(1417,'BOXYM Medical Digital LCD Wrist Blood Pressure Monitor Automatic Sphygmomanometer Tonometer wrist Blood Pressure Mete Tonometer',18,18,'boxym-medical-digital-lcd-wrist-blood-pressure-monitor-automatic-sphygmomanometer-tonometer-wrist-blood-pressure-mete-tonometer','cdwtbldprsmnt0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/32884771921.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.4b4d7012KPzeCG&algo_pvid=null&algo_expid=null&btsid=0b0a0ae216170059540261738ebc6e&ws_ab_test=search