h a speed of 20-25 km/H, this high-speed boat includes a 4-channel remote control with a signal range of 120 meters to 150 meters, using a 4-channel speedboat remote control and an advanced 2.4 G frequency connection Technology, can compete with multiple RC boats without interference, so that the long-range distance of the RC boat can reach up to 150M, hope you have fun.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>2/ Low battery alarm function, the indicator light of the remote control keeps flashing and the buzzer emits a \"di\" sound. This is a warning that the battery of the remote control is low. At this time, the speedboat should be driven back to the shore to avoid losing the speedboat.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>3/ Designed for a variety of precise operations, forward, reverse, left, right, automatic capsize (180 degree flip), there are two modes of fast gear and slow gear, when the remote control is not operated, the speedboat will remain hovering On the water.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>4/Simple operation, according to the manual, it can be started in only three steps. If there is a problem, it can be solved in time according to the instructions.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>5/Excellent quality, a perfect gift for children and adults, the high-speed RC boat is one of the hardest and fastest freshwater remote-control boats for children aged 14 and above. It is relaxing and fun. Cannot be used in salt water.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Description:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Product Name:Eachine EB02</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2.4 GHz Remote Transmitters</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Battery: 7.4v 600mAh Li-Po Battery</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Boat size: 13.7 x 7 x 3.3 inch</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Package size: 14.9 x 7 x 6.1 inch</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Boat weight: 1 pound</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Remote control range: Within 150 meters</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Playing Time: 20 Minutes each battery.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Charging Time: 90 mins</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Item Weight: 839g</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>30+ KPH HIGH-SPEED REMOTE CONTROL BOAT: EACHINE EB02 RC boat equipped with the high-speed 26500 rpm motor, races across the water up to 30+ mph. This RC boat equipped with a 4-channel 2.4 GHz remote with a 150-meter signal range.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>40 Mins usage time: EACHINE EB02 Remote control high-speed boat equipped with 2 pcs rechargeable batteries, usage times up to 40 minutes, bring more fun for you and your kids.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Water sensing device: EB02 Remote control boat equipped with a water sensing device, the motor only rotating in water. When you put out the RC boat from the water, the motor will stop rotating, which is much safer to protect you?</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>The self-righting design: EACHINE EB02 Remote controlled boat is easy to control. The self-righting design keeps your boat in the correct direction when it capsizes. Double-hatch design and capsize recovery make this the best choice for any level RC enthusiast.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>LOW BATTERY ALARM FUNCTION: When your ship in low voltage, the controller will beep to remind you to let the boat ship back immediately since it will keep you from losing control of it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 x Eachine EB02 RC Boat</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 x 2.4 GHz Remote Transmitter</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 x USB Charger</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 x Instruction Manual</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 or 2 x 7.4v 600mAh Li-Po Battery (Option)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 x Protective cover</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 x wooden fram</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.76,38.5,18.5,16.3,30,26,'25','1','1','2','16172148389362Remote_Control_Boats.jpg','16172148389362Remote_Control_Boats1.jpg','16172148389362Remote_Control_Boats2.jpg','16172148389362Remote_Control_Boats3.jpg','16172148389362Remote_Control_Boats4.jpg','16172148389362Remote_Control_Boats5.jpg','16172148389362Remote_Control_Boats6.jpg',NULL,'1',NU