5 meters long cable. The soft light is great for lighting and taking pictures. Suitable for kids bedroom, living room, party, outdoor BBQ, Live background light, creating a brilliant atmosphere.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>USB Rainbow Sunset Projector Atmosphere Night Light Home Coffee Shop Background Wall Decoration Colorful Lamp.<br>\r\n </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Feature: </strong><br>\r\n1. can change the position of the lamp to adjust the size of the aperture. <br>\r\n2. The beam color temperature is bright, the spotlight is more distinct.<br>\r\n3. Thickened crystal lens, luminous angle more widely.<br>\r\n4. Thickened solid iron lamp body, durable.<br>\r\n5. Angle adjustable.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Specification: </strong><br>\r\nModel: A, B, C, D (Optional)<br>\r\nMaterial: PC + Steel<br>\r\nUSB Cable Length: 1.2m<br>\r\nApplication: lamp holder 180°adjustable<br>\r\nFunction: the farther away from the projection wall, the larger the projection<br>\r\nProduct size: 100x270mm/3.93x10.6in<br>\r\nPacking weight: 0.46kg<br>\r\nPacking size: 178x150x230mm/7x5.9x9in<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Note:</strong> <br>\r\nDue to the different monitor and light effect, the actual color of the item might be slightly different from the color showed on the pictures. Thank you!<br>\r\nPlease allow 1-2cm measuring deviation due to manual measurement.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package Include </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 X Projector Light</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.38555,33.02,12.7,12.7,65,60,'25','1','1','2','16172150906714Atmosphere_Night_Light_Lamp.jpg','16172150906714Atmosphere_Night_Light_Lamp1.jpg','16172150906714Atmosphere_Night_Light_Lamp2.jpg','16172150906714Atmosphere_Night_Light_Lamp3.jpg','16172150906714Atmosphere_Night_Light_Lamp4.jpg','16172150906714Atmosphere_Night_Light_Lamp5.jpg','16172150906714Atmosphere_Night_Light_Lamp6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-31 18:24:51'),(1430,'4.0 GPM 3600PSI Turbo Rotating Spray Nozzle 360 Degree Rotating - Turbo for Pressure Washer with 1/4 Inch Quick Connect Plug',18,18,'40-gpm-3600psi-turbo-rotating-spray-nozzle-360-degree-rotating-turbo-for-pressure-washer-with-14-inch-quick-connect-plug','trbrotgspynzl0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000831274819.html?spm=a2g0o.tm800004782.8228862420.11.103136bce4XBqZ&&scm=1007.25281.218753.0&scm_id=1007.25281.218753.0&scm-url=1007.25281.218753.0&pvid=9fcaedb8-62de-4664-9e09-bb913353eac7&utparam={','China','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Rotating Nozzle-</strong> The Turbo Nozzle is made of aluminium alloy and 1/4\" quick-connect plug with a sharp ceramic nozzle and rubber exterior for better cleaning your garden.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Quick Connect-</strong> 1/4\" quick connect design, for use with pressure washers up to 3,600 PSI, gallons per minute: 4.0?4 GPM?, nozzle orifice size: 4.0, maximum operating temperature: 114°F. Creates a powerful jet of water!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Faster Intense Cleaning-</strong> Turbo nozzle pressure washer spin in a circular motion (0 degree nozzle is a straight line)at high speeds to increase both the intensity and cleaning area of the nozzle. There is a ceramic ball inside that spins under pressure and the pattern is circular regardless of nozzle position.Turbo nozzles clean up to 40?ster than standard nozzles.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Clean Any Area -</strong> The Pressure Washer Tips are ideal for removing a large amount of dirty. Cleaning of soiled bricks, concrete, vinyl or any other large amount of dirt or heavily soiled areas. It can also strip paint, and it has the ability to damage whatever it comes in contact with.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Multi-Function Nozzle-</strong> 1/4\" Quick Connect plug. Connect to quick-connect wands or fit onto most brands of pressure washers for an intense clean. If you have any question, we will unconditionally solve for you!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specification – </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Brand Name: ROUE</li>\r\n <li>Interface Material: Copper</li>\r\n <li>Body Material: Copper</li>\r\n <li>Handle Type: Finger Type</li>\r\n <li>Water Spray Type: Fan</li>\r\n <li>With Water Pipes: No</li>\r\n <li>Nozzle Material: Copper</li>\r\n <li>Model Name: 350 Turbine nozzle</li>\r\n <li>greatest pressure: 200bar/3000psi</li>\r\n <li>Item length: 7.99cm</li>\r\n <li>Item weight: 240g</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,'1',0.26,10.92,5.59,5.08,55,50,'25','1','1','2','16172154997480Turbo_Nozzle.jpg','16172154997480Turbo_Nozzle1.jpg','16172154997480Turbo_Nozzle2.jpg','16172154997480Turbo_Nozzle3.jpg','16172154997480Turbo_Nozzle4.jpg','16172154997480Turbo_Nozzle5.jpg','16172154997480Turbo_Nozzle6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-31 18:31:41'),(1431,'Motorcycle FM Intercom BT-S2 Wireless Bluetooth inter communicator Interphone Waterproof Helmet Headset 3 Rider ',18,18,'motorcycle-fm-intercom-bt-s2-wireless-bluetooth-inter-communicator-interphone-waterproof-helmet-headset-3-rider','wtrpfhlmthdst0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/10000399109969.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.59907be74ik5ww&algo_pvid=3d90fe83-9e0c-4e84-ba52-147501ecc633&algo_expid=3d90fe83-9e0c-4e84-ba52-147501ecc633-13&btsid=0b0a187b16171813779921358e24c9&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Bluetooth Helmet Communication</strong><strong> -</strong>BT-S2 Pro intercom for helmet supports 800-1000 meters range for 3 riders pairing (2 riders talking) at the same time. Just enjoy the convenient and efficient helmet to helmet communication at high speed of 100-120km/h (60-75mph).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Multi-Functional Intercom for Helmet</strong><strong> -</strong>With Bluetooth 3.0 EDR, you can connect it with cell phone, MP3, GPS navigation system stably to enjoy hands-free call ( auto receiving, reject, last number redial), FM radio, stereo music and GPS voice prompt. You can even switch them freely with multi-tasking technology, phone call first.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Stereo Sound Motorcycle Communication System</strong><strong> -</strong>DSP noise reduction and processing technology ensures the motorcycle intercom system a clear call quality at high speed. Through the transmission over A2DP, you can enjoy the music through mobile phone or connected GPS, even control music by play/ pause/ previous song/ next song via AVRCP.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Long Lasting Bluetooth Headset for Motorcycle Helmet</strong><strong> -</strong>Built in 450mah rechargeable lithium polymer battery, the Bluetooth motorcycle helmet headset supports up to 8 hours intercom talking, 10 hours phone talking and 300 hours standby with 3 hours fully charge.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>KIND REMIND</strong><strong> -</strong>Please charge the half helmet Bluetooth headset once a month regularly if you’re not using it for a long time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Bluetooth Helmet Headset with Audio Cable for Walkie Talkie</strong><strong> -</strong>With the 2.5MM audio cable, you can connect the motorcycle helmet intercom with MP3, GPS, walkie talkie and so on. This BT-S2 Pro helmet Bluetooth intercom comes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Notice:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>If you want to talk with others,you need to buy Two this products.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Product Feature</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>1. Intercom Bluetooth:Qualcomm chip CSR chip; A2DP EDR Bluetooth technology; supports 3 people to connect and 2 people intercom, 2 people are the best; the intercom distance can reach 1000 meters.</li>\r\n <li>2. Telephone function:Automatically answer incoming calls Reject incoming calls Hang up.</li>\r\n <li>3. FM radio function:FM on/off Volume adjustment Up and down channel switching.</li>\r\n <li>4. Music function:Music playback/pause Volume adjustment Up and down song switching.</li>\r\n <li>5. Speaker sound quality & microphone:40mm high-power stereo high-definition sound quality headphones, professional wind noise-proof microphone; professional wind noise cancellation algorithm CVC technology.</li>\r\n <li>6. Battery life: 500 MAH battery, longer battery life.</li>\r\n <li>7. Other functions:Redial the last number; it can be charged while charging (charge first, then turn on the machine to operate normally).</li>\r\n <li>8. Product configuration:Two types of back clip installation methods (clip installation/3M adhesive tape Velcro); 1 microphone (full helmet/half helmet) as standard.</li>\r\n <li>9. Redial the call automatically answer the call Reject the call Hang up the call Voice dialing Music.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Parameter:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>- Bluetooth version: 3.0+EDR       </li>\r\n <li>- Frequecy:2.4GHz</li>\r\n <li>- Supports: A2DP and AVRCP</li>\r\n <li>- Supported Bluetooth Profiles: Bluetooth</li>\r\n <li>- Headset and Hands free Profiles with Automatic Detection</li>\r\n <li>- Battery Type:  Rechargeable Lithium Polymer 500mAh  </li>\r\n <li>- Charging Time: 3hours</li>\r\n <li>- Power  Adaptor: DC5V 500mA</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Please Attention: Old USB Interface, not Type C Interface !</strong></p>\r\n',0,'1',0.13608,11.2,11.2,6.8,230,224,'25','1','1','2','16172158539881Rider_Bluetooth_Headset.jpg','16172158539881Rider_Bluetooth_Headset1.jpg','16172158539881Rider_Bluetooth_Headset2.jpg','16172158539881Rider_Bluetooth_Headset3.jpg','16172158539881Rider_Bluetooth_Headset4.jpg','16172158539881Rider_Bluetooth_Headset5.jpg','16172158539881Rider_Bluetooth_Headset6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-31 18:37:35'),(1432,'7 14 20 25 I