er,bulldozer,crane and mining truck etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Brightness contrast of different sizes</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>7 inch 18W</p>\r\n\r\n<p>14 inch 36W</p>\r\n\r\n<p>20 inch 54W</p>\r\n\r\n<p>25 inch 72W</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Mother - Nature Proof</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Completely sealed for adventure</p>\r\n\r\n<p>?IP68retedwaterproof, dustproof and shockproof.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>?Oversized heat sink? full aluminium housing to withstand harsh environment</p>\r\n\r\n<p>?Pending aperture system blocks unused light for clean beam.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Incredible Bright</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>For Outstanding Clarity</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Easily see obstacles near and far Premium LED Chips High IntensityUpto33?000lumen6500K</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Brilliant White Light</p>\r\n\r\n<p>LEDTIPS</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ours 3 times of brightness longer service life</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Others Low luminance fast luminance decay</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package included:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1x LED Light Bar</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2x Mounting Brackets</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4x Screws</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2x Screw caps</p>\r\n',0,'1',1.19,69.85,19.05,12.06,20,18,'25','1','1','2','16172166458614LED_Light_Bar.jpg','16172166458614LED_Light_Bar1.jpg','16172166458614LED_Light_Bar2.jpg','16172166458614LED_Light_Bar3.jpg','16172166458614LED_Light_Bar4.jpg','16172166458614LED_Light_Bar5.jpg','16172166458614LED_Light_Bar6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-31 18:50:47'),(1433,'Clotho Lifestyle - Men\'s High Quality Half Sleeve Original 100% Pima Cotton T-shirt',21,21,'clotho-lifestyle-mens-high-quality-half-sleeve-original-100-pima-cotton-t-shirt','mentshirt00032','','India','<p>Need a T-shirt that goes with everything? Then solids are your best bet. Apart from enjoying the comfortable wear at home, you can put on a plain tee for the gym, for dates and even for work if your office dress code is flexible.  </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Half sleeves <a href=\"https://www.mensxp.com/fashion/style-guide/81300-quirky-t-shirts-for-men-under-rs-1000.html\">T-shirts</a> are the coolest of all. Instead of putting a huge label logo that can make one look like a show-off, Plain Solid color T-shirt makes you look smart.    </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Having an amazing style is easier than men think. It surely can leave a lasting impression and is a great way to feel confident. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Keep things simple and clean by adding a denim jacket over your solid color t-shirt. This will make your outfit overwhelming and trendy. Add in a pair of blue denim jeans, your favorite sneakers and you’ll be good to go.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Go big and make a statement with mono color t-shirt and keep the other things subtle. Balance the Half sleeves t-shirt with solid color items that contrast like a pair of off-white linen pants and green canvas sneakers. It’s a great way of adding color to your wardrobe.</p>\r\n',29,'1',0.35,34.54,26.67,0.51,49.99,29.99,'25','1','1','2','16194353331176.jpg','16178811795913WhatsApp_Image_2021-03-30_at_3_04_37_PM1.jpeg','16178811795913WhatsApp_Image_2021-03-30_at_3_04_37_PM2.jpeg','16178811795913WhatsApp_Image_2021-03-30_at_3_04_37_PM3.jpeg','16178811795913WhatsApp_Image_2021-03-30_at_3_04_37_PM4.jpeg','16178811795913WhatsApp_Image_2021-03-30_at_3_04_37_PM5.jpeg','16178811795913WhatsApp_Image_2021-03-30_at_3_04_37_PM6.jpeg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-04-08 11:26:24'),(1434,'Clotho Lifestyle - Men\'s High Quality Full Sleeve Original 100% Pima Cotton T-shirt',21,17,'clotho-lifestyle-mens-high-quality-full-sleeve-original-100-pima-cotton-t-shirt','mensfullsleeves 00032','','India ','<p>Need a T-shirt that goes with everything? Then solids are your best bet. Apart from enjoying the comfortable wear at home, you can put on a plain tee for the gym, for dates and even for work if your office dress code is flexible.  </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Full sleeves <a href=\"https://www.mensxp.com/fashion/style-guide/81300-quirky-t-shirts-for-men-under-rs-1000.html\">T-shirts</a> are the coolest of all. Instead of putting a huge label logo that can make one look like a show-off, Plain Solid color T-shirt makes you look smart.    </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Having an amazing style is easier than men think. It surely can leave a lasting impression and is a great way to feel confident. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Keep things simple and clean by adding a denim jacket over your solid color t-shirt. This will make your outfit overwhelming and trendy. Add in a pair of blue denim jeans, your favorite sneakers and you’ll be good to go.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Go big and make a statement with mono color t-shirt and keep the other things subtle. Balance the Full sleeves t-shirt with solid color items that contrast like a pair of off-white linen pants and green canvas sneakers. It’s a great way of adding color to your wardrobe.</p>\r\n',29,'1',0.35,34.54,26.67,0.51,49.99,29.99,'24','1','1','2','16194352047906.jpg','16182098787624WhatsApp_Image_2021-03-30_at_3_04_32_PM_(1)1.jpeg','16182098787624WhatsApp_Image_2021-03-30_at_3_04_32_PM_(1)2.jpeg','16182098787624WhatsApp_Image_2021-03-30_at_3_04_32_PM_(1)3.jpeg','16182098787624WhatsApp_Image_2021-03-30_at_3_04_32_PM_(1)4.jpeg','16182098787624WhatsApp_Image_2021-03-30_at_3_04_32_PM_(1)5.jpeg','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-04-12 06:44:40'),(1435,'JOYROOM Solar Infused Car Diffuser',21,30,'joyroom-solar-infused-car-diffuser','cardiffuser0033','','China','<p><strong>Solar Infused Car Diffuser</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Your car has a lot going on inside of it. Over time, the interior can start to retain the smells from wet clothes, mud, or even pet hair. Luckily, there are plenty of options when it comes to scent diffusers that can eliminate these unwanted odours.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/502002816.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.grabgreatdeals.com.au/upload/1166026033.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/1173015962.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Every car diffuser uses essential oils. This is what produces the scent and other aromatherapy benefits. Without it, your diffuser isn&#39;t going to do much good. Products that come with essential oils save you the time and hassle of buying them separately. Plus, buying them as one big kit will most likely be a cheaper option.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Travel Time: </strong>How long your road trips tend to be is a big factor in what type of diffuser you want. JOYROOM Solar Infused Car Diffuser does it for you. This Joyrom diffuser has a solar panel, as long as it gets enough sunlight, you don’t have to bother about charging.</li>\r\n <li><strong>Interior Space</strong>: Some diffusers require a certain amount of space. JOYROOM Solar Infused Car Diffuser is very sleek in design, occupies minimum space. So don’t need to worry about space</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/2052986947.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>This unique and stylish car fragrance diffuser is one of the best options available. The most noticeable feature is the rotating solar panel. There are two different colour options for the diffuser.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Drivers who are looking for an inexpensive yet effective product should check out these scented oil diffuser car air fresheners. The Joyroom diffusers are discrete and incredibly long lasting. The inner pad requires a few drops of essential oil, and they can leave your car smelling fresh for about a week. This car diffuser kit is a great deal. This device is a truly multipurpose option. You can use the Joyroom diffuser system in your vehicle, office, or home as long as you expose this diffuser to the sunlight. In the car, it works almost silently even though it employs high-tech sonic features to aggressively manage particles in the air. It creates easy-to-breathe air on its own; however, with essential oils, the effects are more immediately apparent. When the air is running, this car diffuser pushes the scent throughout the vehicle.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/282645663.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can get essential oils that help make you feel cooler on hot summer days. While you&#39;re waiting for the AC to power up, try eucalyptus, mint, or grapefruit scented oils.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Benefits of Car Diffusers</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Eliminating odor. </strong>The best part of having a diffuser in your car is eliminating unwanted smells in the interior. You won&#39;t have to worry about any embarrassing scents if you have passengers, and your car will feel fresher every time you get in it. </li>\r\n <li><strong>Aromatherapy</strong>. Many travel diffusers use essential oils to enhance the smell of your vehicle. Some of these oils have added benefits like stress relief. Imagine starting your day with a mood-improving therapeutic drive to work. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/425834912.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Humidifier</strong>. Automatic diffusers have the added bonus of also working as humidifiers. This can improve the air quality of your vehicle&#39;s cabin and save you from dry weather. </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>   <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/933042508.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Efficiency</strong>. The biggest drawback to old school air fresheners is how long they last. Before you know it, you won&#39;t even notice they&#39;re doing anything. Diffusers eliminate this problem as they continually provide a refreshing and long lasting scent. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',0,'1',0.1,0,0,0,99.99,49.99,'73','1','1','1','161831473226671_(2).jpg','161848229576251.jpg','1618482295762511.jpg','16184822957