oys precision tracking to help speed recovery of finds. It is ideal for the recovery of small items in a wide variety of hunting conditions, ranging from highly mineralized ground to saltwater-saturated sand.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>It features audible and vibrating alarms to indicate the presence of metal objects. The alarms increase in intensity as the GP-POINTER has moved closer to the metal target.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Easy to Operation:</span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Long Press for Power ON/OFF, click once to convert the 3 modes. It‘s very suited for kids adults and everyone who likes treasure hunting, it also great as birthday gifts, holidays present, etc.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed> </span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong>Notice</strong>: The distance between the tail of the detector and the LED flash is a safety line for waterproofing. Once the location of water exceeds led, the product will be destroyed and even dangerous!</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed> </span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Parameter:</span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>1. Audible And Vibrating Alarms:  Alarm Will Be Increased Based On The Targets&#39; Proximity Detection Distance ( The Larger Detected Metal, The Farther Detectable Distance)</span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>?</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>2. One-Touch Operation Led Flashlight.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>3. Holster And Retractable Hanging Wire Make It Convenient To Carry</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed> </span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Specification:</span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Detection methods: vibration, sound alarm</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>The working environment: temperature -20 </span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>?</span></span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed> -60 </span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>?</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Power: 9V battery (not included)</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Operating frequency: 12 kHz</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=remo