rence between different monitors, the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item. We guarantee the style is the same as shown in the pictures.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. Manual measurement may have an error of 2-3 cm</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.705,27.9,14.7,4.9,35,30,'25','1','1','1','16184110555876Colorful_Building_Blocks.jpg','16184110555876Colorful_Building_Blocks1.jpg','16184110555876Colorful_Building_Blocks2.jpg','16184110555876Colorful_Building_Blocks3.jpg','16184110555876Colorful_Building_Blocks4.jpg','16184110555876Colorful_Building_Blocks5.jpg','16184110555876Colorful_Building_Blocks6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-04-14 14:37:37'),(1443,'Pet Cat Toys Wireless Remote Control Mouse Pets Toy Interactive Plush Electronic RC Rat Mice Funny Pet Dog Cat Mouse Toy For Cat',18,0,'pet-cat-toys-wireless-remote-control-mouse-pets-toy-interactive-plush-electronic-rc-rat-mice-funny-pet-dog-cat-mouse-toy-for-cat','rmtcntmous0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/32857004917.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.cfd13187y5gqXF&algo_pvid=6366dcda-9590-4089-8619-e84066e3e42e&algo_expid=6366dcda-9590-4089-8619-e84066e3e42e-8&btsid=2100bb5116174350546798914e1a69&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>INTERACTIVE CAT TOY -</span></span></strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>The mice cat toys encourage physical play and mental stimulation by appealing to your cat’s natural instincts. Your cat is ensured a fulfilling play experience by providing them with a remote control mouse toy that exhibits realistic random movement, starting, stopping and pausing just like a real mouse.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>REALISTIC MOUSE TOY -</span></span></strong><span xss=rem