005046\"],\"type\":\"gbrain\"}],\"scm\":\"1007.25281.218753.0\",\"tpp_buckets\":\"21669#0#186385#0_21669#4190#19162#468_15281#0#218753#7\",\"x_object_id\":\"32953757437\"}','China','<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Premium Craft -</span></span></strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>The toy features the fine workmanship, which looks like a real animal, Just like a Real Fish Swim in the Ocean Freely thus bringing fun to children.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Wide Play Occasions -</span></span></strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Small Size and Light Weight, Easy to Carry, Great to Play in Fish Tank, Bathtub, Swimming Pool, etc.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Perfect in Use -</span></span></strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>The toy can swim freely in the water. And it features the realistic movement.The toy features the fine workmanship, which looks like a real animal, thus bringing fun to children.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Forward, backward, turn left; turn right, 2.4G remote control,waterproof protection. The motor fan rotates when the shark starts swimming.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Fine Shape -</span></span></strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>The remote control toy features the highly simulated ABS plastic tail, which can swing flexibly like the real fish.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed>Installation video:</span></strong><span xss=removed> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5CGL_JWZAlc&t=442s</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed>Note:</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Only Model A supports swimming in the air, Models B and C only support swimming in water, please use it in water</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>This Remote Controlled Flying Shark Or Clownfish flies through the room while imitating the movement of their undersea relatives by driving themselves with lifelike fins. A remote controls the air dwellers, moving in different directions as they avoid obstacles such as staircases. This is perfect for indoors and for home parties. This will also make a great gift! </span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Note: Inflatable sharks are filled with helium gas. Helium gas is provided in flower shops, 4S shops, and car wash shops. Due to transportation reasons, the package does not contain gas.</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed>HIGHLIGHTS:</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Made for Indoor Use </span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Flies in different directions</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Recommended for children ages 8 and up</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Types: Shark, Fish </span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Material: Plastic</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed>Main Features:</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>• Recommended for children ages 8 and up </span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>• Made of plastic material</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>• The remote control is powered by 3pcs AAA battery (notincluded) and the toy is powered by 1pc AAA battery (notincluded)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed>Product size:</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>155.00 x 100.00 x 60.00 cm / 61.02 x 39.37 x 23.62 inches</span></span></span></p>\r\n',0,'1',0.39043,24.4,18.2,15.2,50,45,'25','1','1','2','16184125154637Remote_Control_Shark.jpg','16184125154637Remote_Control_Shark1.jpg','16184125154637Remote_Control_Shark2.jpg','16184125154637Remote_Control_Shark3.jpg','16184125154637Remote_Control_Shark4.jpg','16184125154637Remote_Control_Shark5.jpg','16184125154637Remote_Control_Shark6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-04-14 15:01:57');
INSERT INTO `tbl_product` VALUES (1445,'Wood Twist Fitness Balance Board Simple Child Workout Yoga Gym Fitness Training Abdominal Leg Training Balance Exercise',18,18,'wood-twist-fitness-balance-board-simple-child-workout-yoga-gym-fitness-training-abdominal-leg-training-balance-exercise','wdnblncbrd0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005002025406849.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.1a6d2eef4ct7lM&algo_pvid=6e4fdb68-7a24-4a2b-a0f5-82f978ac90a6&algo_expid=6e4fdb68-7a24-4a2b-a0f5-82f978ac90a6-1&btsid=2100bdd816173469058947810e8370&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li>This Natural Wooden Balance Board is handcrafted to high specification and lightly finished to allow the beauty of the natural grain to shine through.This balance board was created to help children develop a sense of balance, stimulate their vestibular system, and gain a deep sense of awareness of their body and body parts.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Measures 19 inches long, 11 inches wide, and 6 inches tall at the highest point. It is 0.71 inches thick, allowing it to support 100kg/220lbs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Highest quality natural beech wood and birch wood,ecologically friendly lacquers. The wood has unique coloring, texture, grain, and mineral patterns in the outer layer. These are variations that make each board one of a kind.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>It can be a slide, Teeter-Totter Home Seesaw, tunnel, boat, rocker, stage, table, balancing pole or bridge,endless possibilities of free and creative play.Children can rock, slide, use it as a bridge, car track, doll cradle, or put their imagination to the test to create other ways to utilize the balance board.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Safety is Please DON&#39;T knocks the edge of the balance board on the ground or hard objects, and otherwise the edges will crack. Children should only use under the supervision of an adult.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features – </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\nIf you have recovered from your injury, the balance board will provide valuable treatments and help you strengthen your body.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nLet your little guy slide down the ramp and lie on his back, then lift the little guy into the air.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe durable balance plate is rugged.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specification – </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Product name: wooden balance board<br>\r\nProduct size: 90cmx30cm x 1.5cm<br>\r\nProduct material: environmentally friendly birch core, beech wrapped<br>\r\nProduct weight: 5 kg<br>\r\nProduct load-bearing: balance board can bear 220 kg | 485 pounds<br>\r\nManufacturing process: polishing<br>\r\nSurface technology: transparent environmental protection water-based paint</p>\r\n',0,'1',3.13,62.55,29.84,1.52,190,180,'25','1','1','2','16184131733911Balance_Board.jpg','16184131733911Balance_Board1.jpg','16184131733911Balance_Board2.jpg','16184131733911Balance_Board3.jpg','16184131733911Balance_Board4.jpg','16184131733911Balance_Board5.jpg','16184131733911Balance_Board6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-04-14 15:12:54'),(1446,'1 pcs Tooth Protector Boxing Mouth guard Brace Boxing Tooth Protector Tooth Guard Sports Brace Orthodontic Appliance Trainer',18,18,'1-pcs-tooth-protector-boxing-mouth-guard-brace-boxing-tooth-protector-tooth-guard-sports-brace-orthodontic-appliance-trainer','boxmthgrd0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005001671691360.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.60e95951Ej9lqu&algo_pvid=null&algo_expid=null&btsid=0b0a01f816176105014213774e6bc7&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>CUSTOM COMFORT & FIT -</strong> Gel-fit Liner Technology is easy to fit, our mold forms specifically to your teeth and gums, providing a comfortable fit for extended use, available in a variety of customized colors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>BREATHABLE -</strong> Integrated breathing channels make it easy to breathe while wearing the guard and maximize your performance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>PROFESSIONAL DENTAL PROTECTION -</strong> Heavy duty Exoskeleton Shock Frame provides full mouth protection during the hardest impacts, protects cheek and tongue, teeth grinding, and secures teeth in place.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>DURABLE -</strong> Crafted using heavy duty material, combined in our Triple Layer Design for added protection and durability.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>RECOMMENDED SPORTS -</strong> Suitable for all contact sports where a mouth guard is required or recommended including football, wrestling, boxing, and more! Includes a detachable helmet strap for football.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specification – </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>is customized: Yes</li>\r\n <li>Diameter: 5cm</li>\r\n <li>Length: 5cm</li>\r\n <li>Material: Silica gel</li>\r\n <li>Weight(kg): 50g</li>\r\n <li>Model Number: Mouth Guard</li>\r\n <li>Mouthguard: Mouth Guard</li>\r\n <li>Material: Food grade EVA</li>\r\n <li>Tooth Protector: Orthodontic Appliance Trainer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Teeth Covers: Basketball Boxing Sanda</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.015,4,24.5,14,22,18,'25','1','1','2','16184235736605Gel_Max_Mouth_Guard.jpg','16184237661229Boxing_Mouth_guard.jpg','16184235736605Gel_Max_Mouth_Guard1.jpg','16184235736605Gel_Max_Mouth_Guard2.jpg','16184235736605Gel_Max_Mouth_Guard3.jpg','16184235736605Gel_Max_Mouth_Guard4.jpg','16184235736605Gel_Max_Mouth_Guard5.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-04-14 18:06:14'),(1447,'Full-Covered Boxing Helmet Muay Thai PU Leather Training Sparring Boxing Headgear Gym Equipment Taekwondo Head Guard',18,0,'full-covered-boxing-helmet-muay-thai-pu-leather-training-sparring-boxing-headgear-gym-equipm