 xss=removed><span xss=removed>Our Head Guard is enormously solid and compressed EVA sheet delivers eventual impact resistance. The shock resistance sheet makes this head protector almost invincible, allowing you to dish out some major force with full conviction.It is designed for hard professional training.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Specification – </span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Certification: </span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>CE</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Applicable People: </span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>MEN</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Season: </span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Spring and Autumn</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Age: </span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>>14 Years</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Material: </span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Composites</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Head Circumference: </span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>55cm</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Model Number: </span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>ZTTY36</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Style: </span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Full-covered</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Type: </span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Helmet</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Sport: </span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Boxing</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Color: </span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>black,white,red,orange</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Hear Circumference: </span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>40-62cm</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>The applicable objects: </span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>male/female/the youth/lady</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Material: </span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Microfiber PU Leather</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Head Circumference: S: 40-45cm, M: 46-50cm, L: 50-62cm </span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n',0,'1',0.386,26.67,23.62,13.97,65,60,'25','1','1','2','16184241154802Leather_Training_Boxing_Headgear.jpg','16184241154802Leather_Training_Boxing_Headgear1.jpg','16184241154802Leather_Training_Boxing_Headgear2.jpg','16184241154802Leather_Training_Boxing_Headgear3.jpg','16184241154802Leather_Training_Boxing_Headgear4.jpg','16184241154802Leather_Training_Boxing_Headgear5.jpg','16184241154802Leather_Training_Boxing_Headgear6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-04-14 18:15:16'),(1448,'New Knee Plast