ieving Patch, Knee Pain Paste, and Cervical Vertebra Pain Relief.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nCondition: 100% brand new & high quality<br>\r\nWeight: 60g<br>\r\nFunction: Improve joint pain in the knee area, suitable for all seasons.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Four major principles of action:</strong><br>\r\n1, cold, hot treatment to drive cold and dampness, effective absorption of active ingredients;<br>\r\n2, activating blood, promoting blood circulation, relieving pain, and accelerating metabolic cycle;<br>\r\n3, analgesia, improve the symptoms of pain;<br>\r\n4, active, Shu Jing active.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Note: </strong><br>\r\nThere may be some subtle differences between the color of the image and the actual product.<br>\r\nThe effect varies from person to person. If you have an allergic condition, stop using it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>Package Included:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>12 X knee medical plaster</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.063,19.1,16.4,1.6,10,6,'25','1','1','2','16184251488128Knee_Plaster_Patch.jpg','16184251488128Knee_Plaster_Patch1.jpg','16184251488128Knee_Plaster_Patch2.jpg','16184251488128Knee_Plaster_Patch3.jpg','16184251488128Knee_Plaster_Patch4.jpg','16184251488128Knee_Plaster_Patch5.jpg','16184251488128Knee_Plaster_Patch6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-04-14 18:32:30'),(1449,'Baby Nasal Suction Aspirator Nose Cleaner Sucker Suction Tool Protection Baby Mouth Suction Aspirator Type Health Care ',18,18,'baby-nasal-suction-aspirator-nose-cleaner-sucker-suction-tool-protection-baby-mouth-suction-aspirator-type-health-care','nslstaptnsclnr0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005001834702078.html?spm=a2g0o.detail.0.0.3a461677cJkDWW&gps-id=pcDetailBottomMoreThisSeller&scm=1007.13339.169870.0&scm_id=1007.13339.169870.0&scm-url=1007.13339.169870.0&pvid=b1e51345-888e-4e33-abb4-f61ba7ba77f8&_t=gps-id:pcDetailBottomMoreThisSeller,scm-url:1007.13339.169870.0,pvid:b1e51