on – </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Type: Orthopaedic Supplies</li>\r\n <li>Origin: CN(Origin)</li>\r\n <li>Size: 1pair</li>\r\n <li>Material: Silicone</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package Include: </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 Pair Foot Care Tool</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.03,8,7,2,10,8,'25','1','1','2','16188115336006Bunion_Pain_Relief_Sleeves.jpg','16188115336006Bunion_Pain_Relief_Sleeves1.jpg','16188115336006Bunion_Pain_Relief_Sleeves2.jpg','16188115336006Bunion_Pain_Relief_Sleeves3.jpg','16188115336006Bunion_Pain_Relief_Sleeves4.jpg','16188115336006Bunion_Pain_Relief_Sleeves5.jpg','16188115336006Bunion_Pain_Relief_Sleeves6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-04-19 05:52:15'),(1479,'Yoga Strap Durable Cotton Exercise Straps Adjustable D-Ring Buckle Gives Flexibility for Yoga Stretching Pilates',18,18,'yoga-strap-durable-cotton-exercise-straps-adjustable-d-ring-buckle-gives-flexibility-for-yoga-stretching-pilates','ygastp0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4000002542444.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.720727fbpoJaRD&algo_pvid=2a35c855-bc06-4175-894d-9a177f452678&algo_expid=2a35c855-bc06-4175-894d-9a177f452678-25&btsid=2100bdca16179647797616999e67a4&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>MOVE EFFORTLESSLY -</strong> Stretching strap with loops for flexibility that&#39;s ready to use in a few seconds: Put the door anchor over any sturdy doorpost, close the door and pull the yoga strap through the D-ring and you&#39;re ready to take your poses to the next level. Like a portable stretch machine!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>MAKES STRETCHING MORE COMFORTABLE</strong> - Train with confidence using our yoga straps for stretching with loops. Nothing will break due to use of high quality materials: 150g cotton stretch out strap that smoothly slides through 6mm solid metal welded D-ring.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>SUITABLE FOR MOST AGES -</strong> Our stretching bands for flexibility is suitable for ladies, men, teenagers, suitable for dance, yoga, martial arts, and all kinds of stretching exercises. It helps achieve deeper stretches with every single use. From beginner to an experienced dancer trying to warm up their arms, legs or feet you’ll love this leg stretching strap.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>SUPERIOR DESIGN -</strong> Does not damage the door and stays put. This yoga stretching straps will not scratch or damage your door and won&#39;t move or slide while you&#39;re stretching your legs, feet & arms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>ACHIEVE FULL SPLITS FAST -</strong> Easy-to-use hamstring stretch strap to improve your leg flexibility, balance and range of motion in a natural body position. Just a few weeks of consistent use and your friends will notice considerable improvements to your movements.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Feature: </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Superior material in the market. Our strap is much thicker than other straps in the market. It assures the durability and comfort. It is more durable than cotton while maintaining softness and comfort. Some straps in the market are made of Nylon which is harder and too smooth to hold on.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Lovely colors and designs. Unlike other straps in the market only have plain color, we use beautiful color matching to design our straps. Moreover, we use special webbing technique to produce our straps. You can find it demonstrate delicate texture. We believe the design and color are as important as its functionality. The beauty of strap can make you more involved in your beloved yoga!</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. Easy to use. The D-ring designs make it easy to adjust any size of loop to fit your need.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> 4. Best tool for stretching. Stretching can effectively help you relax your stiff and tight muscle. We highly recommend everyone should do stretching every day. The yoga strap is a very useful tool for Yoga, Pilates, daily stretching, or physical therapy.</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.12,23,8.5,1.8,6,3,'25','1','1','2','16188120724839Yoga_Strap.jpg','16188120724839Yoga_Strap1.jpg','16188120724839Yoga_Strap2.jpg','16188120724839Yoga_Strap3.jpg','16188120724839Yoga_Strap4.jpg','16188120724839Yoga_Strap5.jpg','16188120724839Yoga_Strap6.jpg',NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-04-19 06:01:13'),(1480,'A3 Mini Digital Camera HD Flashlight Micro Cam Magnetic Body Camera Motion Detection Snapshot Loop Recording Camcorder',18,0,'a3-mini-digital-camera-hd-flashlight-micro-cam-magnetic-body-camera-motion-detection-snapshot-loop-recording-camcorder','a3mndgtcmra0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/32890148714.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.5a872abea2tOHh&algo_pvid=2317abd9-2bb6-4c95-8498-b26e714175e5&algo_expid=2317abd9-2bb6-4c95-8498-b26e714175e5-23&btsid=2100bb4716182240211911682e8594&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Excellent mini body camera -</span></span></strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>It&#39;s easy to use and hidden to anywhere you needs. Body camera in this mini size is rare, the SIZE (3.7in x 1.7in x 0.35in) you can wear this portable hidden body camera on your shirt pocket via back clip,also with magnet on the back, it can be fixed on metal surface. 1920*1080@30fps and 130 degree super wide angle rotating lens captures a larger sight during recording. The body cam is very unobtrusive but sturdy built if you feel the wearable camera at hand.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Mini body mounted camera+Voice Recorder 2 in 1 -</span></span></strong><