0'),(1481,'Bluetooth Mp3 Player Hifi Metal Portable Music Walkman with Fm Radio Recording Built-in Speaker Touch Key 1.8 Inch Tft Screen',18,18,'bluetooth-mp3-player-hifi-metal-portable-music-walkman-with-fm-radio-recording-built-in-speaker-touch-key-18-inch-tft-screen','blthmp3plr0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/4001064962417.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.1dad51d8W9BhRd&algo_pvid=null&algo_expid=null&btsid=2100bb4916182277073962598ea1e5&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>BLUETOOTH 4.2 -</strong>Enjoy wireless music without delay. Support listening radio via Bluetooth, background music playback, music fast forward/backward, playing from playlist. Support connection to Bose Color Bluetooth speaker II audio, JBL speaker/headphone and car audio.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>LARGE SCREEN WITH TOUCH BUTTONS -</strong>Equipped with large 2.4” HD color screen, the player delivers vivid and clearer HD image. 7 high-sensitivity touch buttons with backlight for night operation allow you control the player without making any noise. Turn on/off the backlight at your choice. Scratch-proof zinc alloy shell provides comfortable and smooth hand-feel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>HIFI SOUND QUALITY & VOR RECORDING -</strong> Audio formats supported MP3/WMA/WAV/OGG/APE/FLAC/AAC-LC/ACELP (MP3/WMA/WAV/FLAC/APE in Bluetooth). Supports VOR voice activated recording which will only start recording when voice detected (50-60dB) to save memory.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>50 HOURS BATTERY LIFE -</strong>It supports up to 50 hours music playback time at medium volume after fully charged for 3 hrs via wired earphones and up to 16 hours via Bluetooth headphones. Certified by CE, FCC, RoHS, more reliable and LIFELONG FREE firmware update service.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>EXPANDABLE UP TO 128GB -</strong>Built-in 8GB memory stores up to 2000 songs, support external memory card up to 128GB (not included). In addition, the player can display up to 4,000 songs, no number limitation if you choose music from the folder view.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Important Notices</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. There are 8 kinds of \"Memory Size\". Some of them have included Micro SD Card already. To avoid possible incompatibility problem, we would suggest you buy Micro SD Cards from us as well.<br>\r\n2. FM Radio can be only listened via wired earphones, not via Bluetooth.<br>\r\n3. All cargo will be packed in bubble boxes instead of retail boxes to enhance cargo protection. Please contact us or leave us a remark if you need a retail box.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Support 26 Kinds of Languages</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>English, Español, Português, Nederlands, Norsk, Polski, Deutsch, Türkçe, Dansk, Français, Italiano, Magyar, Suomi, Svenska, Japanese, Româna, Indonesian, Slovenš?ina, Chinese Simplified, Chinese Tradition.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Multiple Options on Memory Size</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>There are 8 kinds of \"Memory Size\". Some of them have included Micro SD Card already. To avoid possible imcompatibility problem, we would suggest you buy Micro SD Cards from us as well.<br>\r\n4GB means Built-in 4GB<br>\r\n8GB means Built-in 8GB<br>\r\n16GB means Built-in 16GB<br>\r\n20GB means Built-in 4GB plus 16GB Micro SD Card<br>\r\n32GB means Built-in 16GB plus 16GB Micro SD Card<br>\r\n40GB means Built-in 8GB plus 32GB Micro SD Card<br>\r\n64GB means Built-in 16GB plus 64GB Micro SD Card<br>\r\n128GB means Built-in 16GB plus 128GB Micro SD Card</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>HiFi Lossless Sound</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Music player has DSP audio decoding IC, dual DAC decoding for excellent sound reproduction. Equalizer with preset Rock, Pop, Jazz, Classic, Electronic and Custom EQ. Support CUE track decoding and all major hi-fi lossless music format including FLAC, APE, WMA, WAV, ALAC, AIFF, etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>MP3 Player with Bluetooth 4.2</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Connect to your earphones, headset or speaker easier and faster. Compatible earlier Bluetooth versions.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nImportant Notice for Bluetooth:<br>\r\n1. Can only connect to Bluetooth earphones or speakers, not to mobile phones or computers.<br>\r\n2. Cannot listen to Radio via Bluetooth. Please listen to radio via a wired earphone.<br>\r\n3. Cannot for data transmission.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>MP3 Player with FM Radio</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The radio station can be searched automatically,easy to use. It supports different regions and can be used wider (87.5 MHz ~ 108 MHz).</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>MP3 Player with Built-in Speaker</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can enjoy music, recordings without headphones. No tangled cable to trouble you anymore.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>MP3 Player with Touch Buttons</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The 5 touch buttons design allows easy operation by tapping the character. One-key lock screen help you avoid mistakenly touching while playing music.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>MP3 Player with Headphones</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Package includes:<br>\r\n1 x MP3 Player<br>\r\n1 x USB Cable<br>\r\n1 x Wired Earphone<br>\r\n1 x User manual<br>\r\n<br>\r\nNote that a wired earphone will be sent as a free gift, but will be given in random, please in kind prevail.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Multifunctional MP3 Player</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>This MP3 Player not only has music function, but features as well as E-Book (TXT format only), FM Radio, Voice Recording, Video Playback (AVI or AMV format only), Alarm Clock, Photo Playback, perfect for sports running, traveling.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nNote that it supports video play in AVI or AMV format only and videos have to be 320*240dpi. For other video formats, you can use the video converter which we have put in the music player to do the converting. Also we 