ular and variable frequency makes it more effective to drive away the most aggressive animals which may adapt and become immune to a certain frequency band.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Human & Eco-Friendly -</span></span></strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>No messy chemicals or pesticides, no traps, no dead animals. The Battery Powered Ultrasonic Animal Repeller gets rid of almost all animals through emitting a mixture of ultrasonic sounds, frightening the intruding animals and pests to leave the area.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Easy To Install -</span></span></strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Place the repeller pointed towards the area that you want to protect, select your desired mode, then just insert the spike into the ground carefully where there is plenty of sun light and switch it on. Perfect for yard, patio, driveways, garage, attics, porches, boats, gardens, farms, ponds, etc.</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Main feature</span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>The PIR motion sensor can sensitively detect moving objects, and at the same time trigger ultrasonic waves and flashing lights to prevent the intrusion of bad people and dangerous animals, thereby protecting your personal and property safety.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>People and environment friendly</span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Use ultrasound and flashing light to disperse animal invaders without harming them. There are no messy chemicals and pesticides, no traps, no dead animals, and it is environmentally friendly.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Your bodyguard</span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Just push it into the ground or hang it on the wall. Very suitable for yard, terrace, driveway, garage, loft, porch, boat, garden, farm, pond, etc. Even if it is easy to carry, it can be brought into your campsite, away from stray dogs, cats and pests.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Solar waterproof</span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Direct charging via solar or USB charging. When exposed to rain, snow and ice, its waterproof function prevents moisture, thereby protecting your garden and farm all year round.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Pay attention to protect the yard</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed>Type of pest control:</span></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>For example, get rid of deer, birds (pigeons, woodpeckers, seagulls, etc.), cats, dogs, bears, squirrels, rabbits, skunks, bats, mice, foxes, raccoons, mice, etc.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Instructions</span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Adjust the \"sensitivity\" to adjust the detectable distance, and adjust the \"frequency\" to select different frequencies for specific animals.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>The button \"frequency\" position is as follows:</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>0 gear: OFF</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Level 1: 13.5KHZ-19.5KHZ, mainly for mice, dogs, rabbits, foxes, minks and other animals.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Level 2: 19.5KHZ-24.5KHZ, mainly for cats, raccoons, badgers, skunks and other animals.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Level 3: 24.5KHZ-45.5KHZ, mainly for bats, birds, mice and other animals.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Level 4: LED strong flashing, can drive away raccoons, snakes, boars, minks and other animals.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>5th gear: LED light bursts at 5.50KHZ, full wave band drives animals and lights bursts. All functions work at the same time, and the frequency range to the fifth gear work in turn, accompanied by strong LED flashing.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Powered by</span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Built-in rechargeable battery</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Or USB rechargeable</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed> </p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><strong><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Note</span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Please turn off the switch when charging, so that you can charge faster.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>It is best to charge the animal control device in the sun for a full day before using it for the first time.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>Please do not cover the PIR sensor, otherwise it will not work.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p xss=removed><span x