nger ), quick & easy</li>\r\n <li>On & Off flow control wire</li>\r\n <li>Integrated gravel / fish strainer</li>\r\n <li>This tool is easy to install and use</li>\r\n <li>And you can use this tool freely for its high safety performance</li>\r\n <li>With this tool, you can remove the dirt from the bottom of your aquarium. Supplied with long suction pipe, it is suitable for both large and small aquariums</li>\r\n <li>Tube Length: 143cm,170cm</li>\r\n <li>Material: Plastic</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong> User Instruction:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Put the Instant Gravel Cleaner into the fish bowl instantly</li>\r\n <li>Put the other end of the tube into a bucket, then press the spring softly by your hands</li>\r\n <li>Please reduce the water inlet height, thus you can remove the dirt from the bottom of your aquarium</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Package Content:</strong><br>\r\n1 x Aquarium Cleaner Vacuum Pump for Fish Tank</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.1,10,8,6,5,3,'25','1','1','2','16190714248614.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-04-22 06:03:44'),(1493,'1pc Hot Sale Baby Accessories Soft Silicone Nipple Case Food Grade Travel Storage Pacifier Holder for New Born Baby Goods',18,0,'1pc-hot-sale-baby-accessories-soft-silicone-nipple-case-food-grade-travel-storage-pacifier-holder-for-new-born-baby-goods','bbpfrhldr0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005002367463404.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.19e32dcbWDIR3a&algo_pvid=null&algo_expid=null&btsid=2100bde316185648382927963e9127&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><strong>KEEP PACIFIERS CLEAN AND EASY TO FIND</strong> - the new-born pacifier case will keep your baby’s pacifier or small teething toy protect from dust, dirt and debris while on the go, and the unique strap design will make it easy to find 