ou easily distinguish each racket.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Perforated design enhance sweat absorption, with great anti-slip effect ensure lossless batting strength, protect and prolong the life of your racket handles, perfect for players who sweat easily.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Raised edge for enhanced grip and decreased shock,with the optimal thickness and cushion, lets you easy to hold the handle;protect your palm and feel ultra-comfortable.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Suitable for tennis, badminton, squash, racket ball racket, also fit for fishing rods, bike handlebars, motorbike handlebars, etc.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features:</strong><br>\r\nIt can be enhanced the play ability via the racquet.<br>\r\nKeep from slip of the racquet and absorbent perspiration effectively when you play.<br>\r\nImprove your control skill.<br>\r\nSuitable for Tennis, Badminton and Squash Racquet<br>\r\nMaterial: Synthetic grip wrap Polyurethane<br>\r\nSize: 110cm x 2.5cm x 0.07cm/43.31\" x 0.98\" x 0.03\" (Approx.)<br>\r\nPackage including: 1x Tennis Badminton Handle Tape</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>Note: </strong><br>\r\n1.Hand measurement will have discrepancy of about 1-3cm.<br>\r\n2.Colors may vary due to screen resolution and lighting.</p>\r\n',0,'1',0.01,5.86,4.24,2.08,9,7,'25','1','1','2','16191654801646.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-04-23 08:11:20'),(1524,'T08B - ANC High Quality True Wireless Sound Earbuds',21,30,'t08b-anc-high-quality-true-wireless-sound-earbuds','earbud00335','','India','<p>The best wireless earbuds of 2021 combine fantastic audio performance and reliable Bluetooth connectivity with compact designs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>There are countless reasons why you might want to buy yourself a pair of the best wireless earbuds. For starters, the design of the best wireless earbuds is perfect for all kinds of scenarios, including the gym, commuting, or relaxing outside on a sunny day. </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/1982137478.jpeg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>True wireless earbuds have no cord whatsoever. While wireless allows us to wear headphones a few feet away from our music players, True Wireless cuts the cord between the earbuds, giving us true freedom.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What&#39;s more, every pair of the best Bluetooth earbuds are designed to stay put in your ears , as well as to bring you high-quality sound. You&#39;ll find that they&#39;re also usually cheaper than over-ear wireless headphones, some of which might offer better audio performance but aren&#39;t half as convenient. The best true wireless earbuds you can buy today.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/1748088492.jpeg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Costing just $59.99 the  T08B are a basic pair of true wireless earbuds that could be ideal if you&#39;re on a strict budget.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> T08B - ANC High Quality True Wireless Sound earbuds come with Bluetooth 5.0 technology that provides faster pairing, more stable connection and signal transmission. The wireless earphones are widely compatible with Bluetooth-enabled devices. When you use a single earphone, just take out the second one to achieve seamless transformation between single-mode & stereo mode. Each earbud weighs only 3.5gm. With an ergonomically crafted design, these in-ear headphones offer a comfortable and snug-fitting listening experience. </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/491964753.jpeg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>These wireless earbuds allow you to enjoy clear call quality even in noisy environments. With its highly sensitive diaphragm and 10mm dynamic drivers, it delivers quality audio and hi-fi sound with strong bass. Each Bluetooth earbud has the function of answer/reject phone, switch music, and voice assistant. Simply take the earphones out of the charging case and they will automatically connect to your phone (after being paired the first time). Charge on the go. Earbuds Jets headset wireless earphones offer 5 hours of playtime, 4 hours of talk time on a single charge and the compact charging case ensures extended playtime. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Considering it&#39;s still rare to get noise-cancellation in earbuds at all, the fact that FMT has managed to pack it into a pair that are not only wireless, but <em>true </em>wireless is very impressive indeed. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>The FMT&#39;s T08B manage to offer a level of noise-cancellation that&#39;s very good for a pair of earbuds – it won&#39;t offer the same isolation as a pair of over-ear cans, but if you&#39;re after a sleek form factor then the compromise is well worth it. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>FMT&#39;s T08B is known for its high-end audio equipment, with an outstanding 45 hours of battery life, we combine the brand’s award-winning engineering with the convenience of truly wireless listening, that means these true wireless in-ear headphones will last you for a long haul flight, no problem. </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/1994629884.jpeg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>By performing with absolute confidence and assurance, they stand head and shoulders above the majority of true wireless earbuds on the market today. They extract every shred of information from digital files of your favorite music and deliver it with such authority, and in such a complete and coherent manner, that it sounds fresh even if you’ve heard it a thousand times before.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The QuietComfort Earbuds are leaps and bounds better than other earbuds. Not only is the design a lot better, but the noise cancellation is also exemplary. Sound quality is also really very good with superb clarity. They’re incredibly comfortable and well balanced too.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/1507672582.jpeg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Other specifications -</p>\r\n\r\n<p>20Hz~20KHz Frequency Response;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>32 Speaker;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>10 Meters Wireless Range (Open space);</p>\r\n\r\n<p>50mAh*2 Li-Polymer (earbud);</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1 hour Charge Time; 400mAh Li-Polymer Charging Case;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2 Hours Charging Time;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>DC 5V/1A with Micro USB Charging port;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>45 Hours Standby Time;</p>\r\n',30,'1',0.5,0.7,2.3,3.3,149.99,59.99,'23','1','1','1','16191667504919.jpeg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-04-23 08:32:30'),(1525,'Security Stamp Roller Privacy Seal Roller Type Cover Eliminator Seal Portable Self-Inking Identity Theft Protection Roller Stamp',18,18,'security-stamp-roller-privacy-seal-roller-type-cover-eliminator-seal-portable-self-inking-identity-theft-protection-roller-stamp','scrtstmrlr0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005001344697628.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.395724a4t7wl3R&algo_pvid=fd078ef7-ef2e-42c7-ac2f-6962d14a35c2&algo_expid=fd078ef7-ef2e-42c7-ac2f-6962d14a35c2-36&btsid=2100bdd016188954036474162e65f5&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li>Self-inking identity theft stamp designed with a special pattern to hide confidential information printed beneath, for use on junk mail, credit card offers, and bills.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>This identity theft protection stamp eliminates the need for a noisy and expensive shredder, or can be used in conjunction with a shredder for added security.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>100% Brand new and high quality.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Make your personal information illegible with this self inking roller stamp.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Protect your personal details on letters, bank statements, credit card bills etc with this self-inking ID rolling stamp.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specific