ound and hex shaped pencils. Tested with popular wood cased graphite and colored pencils such as those from Dixon Ticonderoga, Colore, Staples, OfficeDepot, Prismacolor, Crayola, Sargent Art, Color Doodle, Vincis and more. NOT for woodless pencils.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>PATENTED two-mode operation</strong><strong> -</strong>Battery or Manual. When batteries are dead, or you want a precision manual sharpening job, just flip the switch to hand mode and sharpen your pencils manually.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Quickly sharpen all standard 6-8mm pencils: </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Qualified pencil sharpener for colored pencils can sharpen colored pencils; suitable for round and hexagonal pencils. Use popular wooden box graphite and colored pencils (such as pencils from Dixon Ticonderoga, Colore, Staples, OfficeDepot, Prismacolor, Crayola, Sargent Art, Color Doodle, Vincis, etc. for testing). Not suitable for woodless pencils.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Automatic mode and manual mode:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>our electric sharpener has two modes for you to choose. Automatic mode: Press the pencil to start work and automatically sharpen, enough to easily sharpen each pencil to the ideal and durable position in 3-5 seconds. Manual mode: when the battery is low, you can switch to manual mode to sharpen the colored pencils, and then let us become an outstanding Pencil Sharpener Manual when drawing with children outdoors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Feature:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Multi-function electric pencil sharpener.Can replace blade. Can switch between electric mode / manual mode</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Material: plastic Size: 63*63*72mm Color: black Power: by 2 x AA batteries(not included)</p>\r\n',0,'1',8.1,8.1,9.11,0.119,28,23,'25','1','1','2','16192668684194.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'