hey are safe to clean in dishwasher, and safe to use in fridge, freezer, microwave.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Unique and Convenient Design -</strong>These ice cubes can easily put in various cups. Total 1 trays will make 37 honeycomb ice cubes at a time to satisfy your needs. It comes with the removable and leak-proof lids to prevent water spilling and freeze the excess water, and more important is that can keep the ice cubes away other smells or flavours in your freezer. The ice tray can be stacked or nested on top of another one, so that it can save the room for car refrigerator or RV / dorm mini freezer.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Easy To Release Ice -</strong>Our covered ice trays is made of soft silicone material. Recommend taking it out of refrigerator and leave it for about a few minutes to wait for the ice melting a little, then twist gently and spread out the tray, pushing from the bottom to pop up cubes easily.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Features </strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>BPA Safe Ice Cube Tray</strong>: Silicone ice cube trays with lids made of food grade silicone, baby food grade silicon, 100% BPA Free high quality materials, the silicone ice cube trays Which can used for adult & baby food. 100% confirm our freezers silicon ice cube molds and brands to bring customers whiskey ice coffee best ice experience, so you can rest assured to buy without worry.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Easy Ice Release</strong>: Our covered ice trays are made of soft silicone material. Silicone ice trays recommended leaving the refrigerator for a while easier to release the ice, and the soft silicone material will not break after freezing for a long time. Ice cube tray stackable compact size fits any home refrigerator, dormitory mini fridge.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>Stackable and Removable Cover</strong>: Our stackab