onal-waiters-corkscrew-bottle-opener-and-foil-cutter-gift-for-wine-lovers','wineopnr0001','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/32796750686.html?spm=a2g0o.productlist.0.0.70af4c9b9mMZxa&algo_pvid=7f0142d6-5ede-4b76-bb27-3f53cda93721&algo_expid=7f0142d6-5ede-4b76-bb27-3f53cda93721-21&btsid=0b0a182b16189055412854525e8b51&ws_ab_test=searchweb0_0,searchweb201602_,searchweb201603_','China','<ul>\r\n <li><strong>PREMIUM BOTTLE OPENERS CAN MEET ALL YOUR NEEDS</strong>- These manual bottle openers set can be used for wine bottles, wine vintage bottles, brandy, whiskey, and beer bottles and more.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>A PROTECTIVE CASE FOR HOME AND WORK</strong>- This item comes with a PU leather belt holster - For work, stop fishing your tool out of your pocket - For home, it can avoid hurting kids.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>All-IN-1 WOODEN HANDLE WAITERS FRIEND CORKSCREW -</strong> Made up of stainless steel double helix, serrated foil cutter, and a built-in beer bottle opener.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>VINTAGE OR BRITTLE WINE CORKS SAVER -</strong> Two-prong Ah-So wine remover which it&#39;s a saver for older or fragile corks wine bottles. Due to it would not damage corks; you could collect your corks.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><strong>A GREAT GIFT FOR WINE ENTHUSIASTS -</strong> The package includes a waiters friend, a PU case, an Ah-so wine cork extractor, a great wine opener combination for bartenders servers and more.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Relax and enjoy opening wines with ease using this deluxe heavy duty compact wine opener with the classic double hinged fulcrum and the simple foil cutter knife. It&#39;s the size of your hand and fits right into your pocket, the ultimate travel accessory. It comes in handy when you&#39;re having a fun evening with friends at your home, wine cellar or bar. Perfect for the wine lover, wine enthusiast, restaurant waiter / waitress and bartender.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The fancy wooden handle gives the wine opener an antique feel, great control and the screw / worm makes it easy to open a set of old vintage or new wines with style. The serrated foil cutter blade makes it a true multitool, much better than your basic wine- pulltap, butterfly wing, lever, stand puller and air pump pressure tool - This corkscrew contains all the parts and tools needed to make the perfect small, mini portable wine kit.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This wine opener is great for daily use, the more you use it the better it gets. When you learn the mechanics behind the double hinged fulcrum you’ll be able to remove the wine corks in seconds. Once the cork is removed you simply close the corkscrew and store it until next time you wish to open a bottle. If you want to clean the wine opener simply wipe it clean using a kitchen towel, that’s how simple it is.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Color:Natural wood</p>\r\n\r\n<p>“Looking For a Durable, Well-Built Wine/Bottle Opener That’ll Easily Open Your Bottle In Just Seconds…Without Spending A Fortune? Don’t Settle For Cheap Imitators…This Is Your Answer!”</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Opens Your Bottles In Seconds, Super Compact And Easy To Use. This Is What You’ve Been Missing.- </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Want a sleek, handy, super durable opener the next time you’re ready to dive into a bottle? Ready to prevent the hassle of cheap openers or being without one? Forget about imitators or overpriced brands that disappoint. Our compact, unique opener is made for you –nothing else compares. Lifetime warranty makes this purchase a no-brainer! </p>\r\n',0,'1',0.15,19.8,9.6,7.1,26,21,'25','1','1','2','16194213114348.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-04-26 07:15:11'),(1543,'Women\'s Triathlon Cycling Jersey Sets Short Sleeve Pro Team Jumpsuit Bike Jersey Set 2021 Summer Bicycle Race Skinsuits',18,0,'womens-triathlon-cycling-jersey-sets-short-sle