s a daily problem that any master has to solve when he is busy or away for the day. Are you one of those who also face this problem? Well then, the programmable and automatic pet feeder is an effective solution which will feed your cat or dog in a very precise way.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Electronic Pet Feeder for cats and small dogs helps you to control his food and improve his health and well-being. </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/1192780412.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><u> Features & Benefits </u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Dual power protection (3D – cell battery back-up in case of power cut)</li>\r\n <li>Anti Food Jammed Design</li>\r\n <li>Supports the intelligent setting of up to 8- 12 meals a day.</li>\r\n <li>4L food capacity, check the food remaining directly through the top cover</li>\r\n <li>Easy programming thanks to the LCD screen</li>\r\n <li>Click Feeding , Right Portion On Time</li>\r\n <li>Work with Smart App Control</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><u>Refund Policy </u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>We always put our customers first and do our best to resolve any issues that our customers may experience with their online orders. We provide a 100% money back guarantee on our products making you eligible for a full refund in case of dissatisfaction post any purchase.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Any product you return must be in the same condition you received it, in the original packaging, and must be within 14 calendar days of the delivery date. Please keep the email receipt. For more assistance, please send us an email and a customer support representative will be more than happy to help you out.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><em><u>Are you really searching for a great friendly pet feeder, then go for this 4L Pet Electronic Feeder with great WIFI remotes control!</u></em></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><u>Specifications</u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Here are the specifications of the product to make you have a better understanding of the product.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/1418460994.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Max Output: 400g</li>\r\n <li>LCD Display: Yes</li>\r\n <li>Min Output: 50g</li>\r\n <li>Voltage: 110-240V</li>\r\n <li>Volume: 4L-6L</li>\r\n <li>Product dimensions: 32*24*29 cm</li>\r\n <li>Power adapter: 100v- 240v AC 50/60 Hz</li>\r\n <li>Included Components: Automatic Feeder, Operating Guide, Stainless Steel Bowl, and Bowl Holder.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><u>DESCRIPTION </u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><u><em>Feed & Care Anytime, Anywhere</em></u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The 4L Pet Automatic Feeder lets you train and feed your pet remotely and reward yourself with the peach of mind. So, travel carefree with your furry family with this technologically advanced pet feeder and go tension-free.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/197442860.gif\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><u><em>Enjoy dual Power Protection</em></u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Enjoy feeding your pets with this Automatic pet feeder induced with 3 D-cell battery back-up. Let’s your pets too enjoy the essence of fun-filled eating.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><u><em>Count every moment with your pet with this 720p HD </em></u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Enjoy clicking pictures and capturing videos with the help of this 720p HD camera quality.  It lets you capture ever moment beautifully.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><u><em>Customize flexible portions for feeding your pet </em></u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Let’s plan a schedule to feed your pet at regular intervals. With this Electronic feeder, you can program up to 12 meals per day and the flexible meal portions allow dry and semi-moist meals from 1/8 cup - 4 cups. Happy Meal, pets!</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><u><em>Let your pet’s too enjoy the advancement of Wifi technology. </em></u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>During breaks, connect to wifi and automatically deliver food. It’s a Smartphone programming using Wi-Fi enabled app. And you’ll surely go gaga over its use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><u><em>Designed in an unique way  </em></u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>It’s a triangular appearance design, placed against the wall to save space. It includes a rotary grinding system wheel. The efficient food delivery system prevents jams and poor feeding. It’s ideal for dry food up to 10mm diameter.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/24620080.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><u><em>Versatility & Usability of the Pet feeder </em></u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The large feeding tray is removable, easy to clean. A slope design is available and there is no blocking out food outlet. Big-faced cats can eat comfortably without worry.  It has a visual sealing cover, so it’s easy to check the food storage status.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><u><em>Personalize your  automatic pet-feeder just the way you want </em></u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The best thing about this Automatic pet feeder is that, it allows you to keep regulation on the food of your pet. With the help of the unit you can control how much food your pet eats. You can go to work with no tension in your mind as you are backed with this automatic feeder for your pets of all sizes which has been programmed to dispense a desired amount of proper doses of food in frequent interval during the day. For example: Meals can be dispensed from 5g to 50g.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Set meal plan, feed anytime.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/573854508.gif\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><u><em>Button Version</em></u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Gives regular and quantitative food without being disturbed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><u><em>Great feedbacks on the product </em></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p>With its highly technological-friendly component, there are great reviews on this product, where customers have genuinely loved using it and have approved it to others as well.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><u>*<strong>Additional Notes*</strong></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p> For someone, who wants a rough guide on how to let this electronic pet feeder get access or connected to the wifi version, here’s a tour!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Dual power supply solution, can plug-in battery and power cord to access power.<br>\r\n2. Connect the power cord and turn on the power switch of the pet feeder. Make sure that the pet feeder is always powered on.<br>\r\n3. Pour dry pet food, scan the QR code with your mobile phone to download the APP, and close the lid.<br>\r\n4. Open the APP, click on Small Home Appliances, and swipe the screen to find the pet feeder, click on the pet feeder to select Wi-Fi, and enter the password.<br>\r\nNotice:<br>\r\nMake sure to use the 2.4G Wi-Fi frequency band to add devices. Wi-Fi needs to be turned on and broadcast and cannot be set to hidden.<br>\r\nMake sure that the encryption method in the wireless settings of the router is WPA2-PSK, the authentication type is AES, or both are set to automatic.<br>\r\n5. Operate according to the reminder of the product manual, search and add equipment according to the indicator light when it flashes quickly.<br>\r\n6. Develop a feeding plan for your cute pet.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><u>FAQs</u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>1. Is this time durable & friendly?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Yes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Is this item easy to use?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Yes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. What are the dimensions of this item?</p>\r\n\r\n<p> Product dimensions: 32*24*29 cm</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. Does it support all sorts of Routers for connection?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Yes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>5. Will I be able to adjust my busy work schedule?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is designed keeping in mind that even if your are extra busy, you have your control at hand to not let your schedule affect your pet’s meals. Enjoy feeding your pets today.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n',0,'1',2,32,24,29,189.99,119.99,'25','1','1','1','16381745443038.jpg',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2021-11-26 19:51:36'),(1602,'Bathroom Non Slip Shoes ',21,30,'bathroom-non-slip-shoes','antislipshoe326598','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005003021867904.html?spm=a2g2f.b13126868.0.0.59172e0eFECZXW','China','<p><u>Go for this Lovely Homey Bathroom Anti-Slip Shoes for a Great Comfy Life!</u></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><u>About this product </u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Choose 2022 Latest Cute Homey Slippers for Your Cozy Life. Elevate your style with this comfortable pair of Sliders. Featuring a contemporary refined design with exceptional comfort, this pair is perfect to give your quintessential dressing an upgrade. Order right now, get a free home life!</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/1726726240.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><u>Features & Benefits </u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li>Great Sole</li>\r\n <li>High-quality environmental materials</li>\r\n <li>Unique & Concise design</li>\r\n <li>Arch Support</li>\r\n <li>Anti-Slip Sole Design</li>\r\n <li>Release your foot burden</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><u>Refund Policy </u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>We always put our customers first and do our best to resolve any issues that our customers may experience with their online orders. We provide a 100% money back guarantee on our products making you eligible for a full refund in case of dissatisfaction post any purchase.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Any product you return must be in the same condition you received it, in the original packaging, and must be within 14 calendar days of the delivery date. Please keep the email receipt. For more assistance, please send us an