 which picks up small metal objects like screws and coins. It also has a hook to adjust that can be used to pick up some non-metallic objects.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><u><em>Waterproof </em></u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>It is IP68 waterproof camera. Ideal for intraoral camera system, underwater camera, waterproof Micro-cameras, motor vehicle detector and  so on.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/1872889090.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><u><em>Beautiful by appearance </em></u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Beautiful and stylish appearance and easy operation, and turns lights on or off. 2 in 1 design can be connected to phone or computer with one interface.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><u><em>Usability & Personalization </em></u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>It can be used for car maintenance, underwater viewing, wildlife surveillance, hard-to-reach areas and various other purposes etc. This easily adjustable structure can be used in various ways and forms to capture images and videos from places that normal camera or a phone camera cannot record.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/1755103419.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><u>*Additional Note*</u></p>\r\n\r\n<p>How to use on mobile Android phones<br>\r\n1. Download APP: Search for \"camera fi\"<br>\r\nAPP on Google Play Store, or scanning the QR code below, or enter the URL:<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://www.inskam.com/download/inskam.apk\">https://www.inskam.com/download/inskam.apk</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. Install the APP in the phone.<br>\r\n3. Connect the endoscope to the phone, and then you can use it.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nHow to use on Windows system?<br>\r\n1. Enter the URL:<br>\r\nhttp://www.inskam.com/download/camera.zip<br>\r\nto download the \"Smart Camera\" drive.<br>\r\n2. Install the drive in the PC<br>\r\n3. Connect the product to the PC, open the \"Smart Camera\" drive. You can start using thi