arent, so no issues with camera for bigger phones.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><u>Protects your privacy </u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The pouch features a simple snap and lock access, easy to keep out water, snow, dust, sand, and dirt. It has a triple zip-lock seal, super strong Velcro closure to fit in your items protected from falling off or getting misplaced.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/1422374456.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><u>Has a great Adjustable strap (Fits sizes: 33’’ to 48’’)</u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The waist strap can be adjusted through the releasable buckle to an ideal length which fits comfortably around the waist. You can even personalize your pouch as per your choice and wear it over the shoulders too, if you want to give that stylish chic and want your things at ease while you grooving in the waters. But for everyone’s safety, it’s better to roll it around the waist to keep thing intact and flexible.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><u>Perfect Compatible with devices</u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>This water proof is made to be perfectly compatible with your phone. All cutouts and buttons are precisely designed to allow access to all your device&#39;s features.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/729713881.gif\"></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><u>Light Weight </u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>This pouch is as defensive as it gets while still being light enough to comfortably carry in your hands or pocket.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><u>High Quality, Ultra Durable PVC material </u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>This phone case is designed to keep your precious Smartphone safe and in peak condition. Super sturdy, and tough, this phone cover can keep your phone safe with its layers of defensive, shockproof material. These cases are made to protect your phone from scuffs and scratches even if your phone takes a tumble.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><u>Applicable for multiple purposes </u></li>\r\n<