, etc. It serves you great purposes under one roof.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/1934029354.gif\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><u>Benefits of Cat washing-</u> According to senior veterinarians, it has been proven that proper cat bathing can help reduce the risk of skin diseases. It effectively prevents certain diseases so your cat can live a long, healthy life.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n <li><u>You own a ‘free pet Salon’</u>- Owning this cat bath bag is equivalent to owning a free pet salon, without having to spend extra money, where you can bathe, groom, and do nails for cats at home. There is no need to go to the pet salon anymore, because the cat will have a stress response when going to an unfamiliar place, which is not good for the body and mood, so you will feel safe and comfortable and happy when you bathe it at home! Be kind to your cat because he loves you too!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><u>‘Easy To Use’- Steps to follow while putting on this bath Bag</u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/648854530.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 1: Roll up the bag, pat the cat and let it calm down.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 2: Put the bag on through the head, and then tighten the front drawstring</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 3: Put the whole body into the bag, and then tighten the back drawstring.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 4: Open the zipper and take out the paw one at a time to cut nails.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 5: Apply the bath lotion on the surface of the bag to foam, and start bathing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Step 6: Dry the cat and bag together with your dryer.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><u><strong>FAQs</strong></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n <li>Is it applicable only for the cats?</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>Yes.</p>\r\n\r\n<ol start=\"2\">\r\n <li>Is this cat bathing bag easy to use?</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p