light Lamp</u></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Rotating the light can adjust the size and shape of the halo of projector night light. The greater the distance, the greater the projection that the sunset light can throw on the wall or ceiling. which allow you change the LED lights color and modes are conveniently for bedroom, ceiling, kitchen, living room, bar and party decoration.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><u>FAQs</u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n <li>Is it applicable for all purposes?</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>Yes.</p>\r\n\r\n<ol start=\"2\">\r\n <li>Can these lights be used for photography purposes?</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>Yes, they surely can be.</p>\r\n\r\n<ol start=\"3\">\r\n <li>Can I set music on with these lamps?</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>Sunset light has smart music mode. You can definitely use one.</p>\r\n\r\n<ol start=\"4\">\r\n <li>What is the app that you have to download?</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>   APP name is: iStrip+</p>\r\n\r\n<ol start=\"5\">\r\n <li>Are there various color options to explore?</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>Yes, there are.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n',36,'1',0.21,10.1,10.1,12.7,60.99,24.99,'24','1','1','1','16597796574125.png',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'1',NULL,'1',NULL,'1','1',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2022-04-08 07:13:55'),(1613,'Non–Stick Cookie Stamp & Cutter (6 pieces set)',24,24,'nonstick-cookie-stamp-cutter-6-pieces-set','NS-Cookie-cut- St-987','https://www.aliexpress.com/item/1005001692408986.html','China ','<p><strong><u>Make effortless cookies efficiently like a Pro. Get yours now!</u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.seller.grabgreatdeals.com/upload/2020511070.jpg\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><u> About the product</u></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Cookies are everyone’s favourite, isn’t right? What about baking your favourite cookies instantly in lesser time? These non-stick cookie stamp and cutter comes in a variety of designs that you can imprint on your cookies. Just stamp it on the dough