Great product , couldn\'t be happier even if it\'s expensive.','','2022-01-05 12:02:05','2022-01-05 12:02:05','1',1),(524,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ryan Brown','Excellent one','This machine certainly does exactly what it says.I had another dispenser but the cats could eat the dry food as much as they wanted too but this one just gives them a controlled amount which is exactly right. It also means if I leave the cats overnight then they are guaranteed to get food at allotted times.','16413842878646.jpg','2022-01-05 12:04:47','2022-01-05 12:04:47','1',1),(525,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Gabriel ','Just perfect for the pets ','It was reasonably easy to set up. I bought this in preparation for when I go away on holiday. It was reasonably easy to set up, and I can mix in some Dreamies which my cat loves and she thinks she\'s getting a big treat!','','2022-01-05 12:11:26','2022-01-05 12:11:26','1',1),(526,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'James Thomas ','Love using it ','Setting up the timer is easy and it is very consistent in the food delivery.\nIt is quite expensive but I\'m really pleased with it and don\'t have any complaints.','','2022-01-05 12:13:03','2022-01-05 12:13:03','1',1),(527,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wyatt ','Easily programmed ','This is a well made, easily programmed cat feeder. We have used it for about 6 months and it has never failed. The battery life is first class.','','2022-01-05 12:15:31','2022-01-05 12:15:31','1',1),(528,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Tyler ','Let\'s you adjust your busy time','Brilliant! Easy set up, received on time. I have three cats, 2 over 10 years old and 1 who is 3 years old. Also I can go away for 24 hours without worrying about food, I wouldn\'t risk any longer as a friend had one (different brand) but the battery went flat while she was on holiday, luckily someone was coming by to check every day.','','2022-01-05 12:18:26','2022-01-05 12:18:26','1',1),(529,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jose ','Very reliable ','Very good quality and works a dream, it does not fault, all instructions and operating dash is pretty easy and lockable feeding. ','16413852963464.jpg','2022-01-05 12:21:36','2022-01-05 12:21:36','1',1),(530,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Christian ','Great one! ','So far so good. It has been flawless so far, which is important to know if you are going to rely on it for feeding over a few days when you are not there to check. If it continues to work as at present then the expense is definitely worth it.','','2022-01-05 12:22:53','2022-01-05 12:22:53','1',1),(531,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Adopado ','Excellent ','POSITIVES are 1. It is quite heavy and stable so doesn\'t tip over. 2. It locks shut to resist \'break ins\'. 3. Battery life is good (6 months). EXCELLENT.','','2022-01-05 12:24:04','2022-01-05 12:24:04','1',1),(532,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Owen David ','Great reliable pet feeder ','Really good - batteries last for over a year! However, my overweight cat needs really small portions and it gives me exactly the flexible portions that are supposed. ','','2022-01-05 12:28:38','2022-01-05 12:28:38','1',1),(533,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'David ','Will always recommend ','Serves us well - dog loves it and when it\'s time for feeding, she hears it from across the house (not that it\'s extremely noisy, but it does have a certain sound when the kibble drops). Would highlight recommend.','','2022-01-05 12:29:31','2022-01-05 12:29:31','1',1),(534,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ava ','Great one! ','Product appears well made.\nSmallest quantity it delivers is still too much food for a cat if unless you just want one portion of daily dry food.','','2022-01-05 12:31:51','2022-01-05 12:31:51','1',1),(535,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sophia ','Accurate ','This is my 2nd dispenser from Grab Great Deals. \nStronger and more accurate than previous one from different brand.','','2022-01-05 12:32:34','2022-01-05 12:32:34','1',1),(536,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Mary Gomes ','Adjusting capacity ','Everything written down in the product description totally justifies it. Loved using it. ','','2022-01-05 12:33:27','2