39:50','2022-01-05 16:39:50','1',1),(545,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Paula ','Great one! ','Completely lives up to description. I recommend this one for pets. Love it. ','','2022-01-05 16:42:56','2022-01-05 16:42:56','1',1),(546,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'John ','Great Blanket ','Our dog loves his new blanket and it’s the only one he has not tried to destroy it. A bit more expensive than some similar blankets but absolutely worth it.\n','','2022-01-05 16:44:28','2022-01-05 16:44:28','1',1),(547,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Noah Jones ','So good','Easy to clean, soft, and comfy. Greatly complies the description. ','','2022-01-05 16:45:40','2022-01-05 16:45:40','1',1),(548,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Daksh Gomes ','So comfy and comfortable','Super quality. Cover can be taken off and washed. Very fast delivery. Best!','','2022-01-05 16:59:14','2022-01-05 16:59:14','1',1),(549,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aleina ','Great Delivery ','Super fast delivery (\'s days in Switzerland), good quality, best thanks! ','','2022-01-05 16:59:52','2022-01-05 16:59:52','1',1),(550,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'David ','SO GOOD I came online JUST to review these!','These are such good blankets. I’m so glad I purchased two. My senior dog had a little accident this morning which would have ruined my couch. Instead I just picked up the blanket and put it in the washing machine and then the dryer and swapped it for the other one which was already clean and ready to go. They are very waterproof and very soft so my dog loves it. I love it even more because it’s so easy to wash and tumble dry! I would highly recommend these!','','2022-01-05 17:00:53','2022-01-05 17:00:53','1',1),(551,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Benjamin','Pet approved ','Our dog loves his new blanket! You can tell it’s waterproof because it’s much thicker then a regular blanket. Lot of different colour options to choose from.\n','','2022-01-05 17:44:58','2022-01-05 17:44:58','1',1),(552,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Elijah Noah ','Best one','Will definitely buy more from Grab Great Deals. \n','','2022-