wesome for pets ','Are we sure the are for pets? This blanket is so soft and awesome! I bought this for our new puppy and to protect our sofa, Puppy and human approved.','','2022-01-05 17:58:28','2022-01-05 17:58:28','1',1),(563,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jock ','Flexible one','Got this for my dog\'s crate so he doesn\'t look so sad in there. His problem is he normally destroys blankets. And unfortunately this brand one was no exception. What was nice is that it took him a VERY long time to do it. I think he enjoyed the softness so much. Eventually though he did put a tear in it and opened it up. But the product is so high quality, it has the softness and plushness all on its own without any garbage harmful stuffing or filling. So I relocated that blanket to a new area until I can repair and bought him this one, which he\'s back to loving in his crate. Dogs destroy things at times, fact of life. Still a great product for a great price.\n','','2022-01-05 18:00:09','2022-01-05 18:00:09','1',1),(564,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ben Thomas ','Durable and Machine Friendly ','Bought two of these to help keep cats warm as winter approaches. Have one on a pet couch. The other one on a pet bed for extra warmth. The are very soft and wash up well. I would definitely recommend these blankets.\n','16414056763942.jpg','2022-01-05 18:01:16','2022-01-05 18:01:16','1',1),(565,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Owen Carter ','Quality is super good. ','I have some old dogs who are choosing to just pee in the house rather than go outside in the freezing cold to use the potty, so I had to do something. I found this blanket on Amazon and decided to try it. It is wonderful! I bought the 30X40 and it is a perfect size for the couch and my three chihuahuas. My dogs love it. It is warm and soft and hasn\'t been peed on yet, but I\'m sure it won\'t be long before that happens. I\'m not worried though. I think it will be a perfect couch protector.\n\n','','2022-01-05 18:02:30','2022-01-05 18:02:30','1',1),(566,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Emily ','Best products so far ','I was looking for an inexpensive blanket for my new senior maltese rescue - if I didn\'t know this was a pet product I would have bought this as throw for the couch or bed! The white/tan is attractive, contemporary, of nice quality and SO cuddly and soft on both sides. My partner and I sometimes fight for it to keep us warm, when the dog isn\'t using it LOL. It\'s not large and I haven\'t really had to test it\'s waterproof-ness, but it washes up nicely in the washing machine. I may just have to buy another one because I love it that much!\n','','2022-01-05 18:03:12','2022-01-05 18:03:12','1',1),(567,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sophia Christian ','Superb ','Totally worth the cost. The material is friendly af for the pets to adjust. ','','2022-01-05 18:03:50','2022-01-05 18:03:50','1',1),(568,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lynn','Happy with my purchase ','Great product and super soft! I got 2 of them so I could keep one inside and one in my car. I did end up putting both on my couch to prevent my puppy from having any accidents on it! It is water proof and it feels like a soft throw blanket, soft enough that I like having it in my bed with me when my puppy sleeps with me. I wish the ones I got were a bit bigger, I underestimated how much she moves around but it is still a great product and is holding up great in the first couple weeks! Would highly recommend so anyone with pups or potty training\n','','2022-01-05 18:04:50','2022-01-05 18:04:50','1',1),(569,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Roggers ','Perfect one!','It\'s the perfect size for our couch & our newest family member. It\'s soft, warm & though we haven\'t needed to test its waterproof capabilities, we have peace of mind that we are covered, literally. It also doesn\'t feel stiff like you might expect a waterproof blanket to feel, it looks & feels like a regular blanket. We love it, especially our four-legged.\n','16414059836785.jpg','2022-01-05 18:06:23','2022-01-05 18:06:23','1',1),(570,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Addison ','cozy and great ','I love this blanket, it is smaller than I expected but still perfect for the use I needed it for. I just wanted it to lay over my dog bed so if he licks himself or comes indoors a lil wet or dirty, I can just wash that quickly as opposed to having to take the whole dog bed cover off and wash. Bonus... besides being waterproof, it has a smooth side for when it is warmer in the house and then a thicker fluffier side for when it’s cooler (AC on) to snuggle up in. Absolutely love! And great for traveling in car too\n','16414060546450.jpg','2022-01-05 18:07:34','2022-01-05 18:07:34','1',1),(571,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Amelia','This was exactly what i was looking for!','I purchased 4 of these blankets. I have them pinned around rectangular memory foam mattresses as a protective layer. I have an elderly pug who has accidents, and my two french bulldogs chew on their bones, drooling all over these blankets. I wash them weekly, and it is a breeze to keep things clean. The sherpa side is very soft and appealing to the dogs, and they love to lay all over these blankets. I also like that they have multiple colors to blend in with the decor of the room. The only thing I would criticize would be that my dogs scratch the blanket, (a nesting thing dogs do), and some of the sherpa sheds off. Honestly, I don\'t think any blanket would not do that considering the dog\'s nails. Definitely works for my situation!\n','16414061024016.jpg','2022-01-05 18:08:22','2022-01-05 18:08:22','1',1),(572,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Olivia ','Glad to purchase this ','My furry babe thinks this was made just for him. Perfect size because he cuddles on the couch right next to my leg and we don’t have to mess with acres of throws. Must confess it feels warm and cozy on my legs too. I may just splurge on another one just for me ????\n','','2022-01-05 18:09:14','2022-01-05 18:09:14','1',1),(573,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Stephen','Get more blankets coming','Have already bought 3 new ones for my little pets. Love them. Impressed with the product description. Loved it. I would recommend it. ','','2022-01-05 18:10:35','2022-01-05 18:10:35','1',1),(574,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Clara ','Very comfortable ','Too happy, beautiful color. A 2 theme cover. They are warm and beautiful. ','16414482234825.jpg','2022-01-06 05:50:23','2022-01-06 05:50:23','1',1),(575,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Hugo ','Perfcet for my sofa','I am really delighted with my blanket because it is very beautiful and also very hot. Really great! I\'m not gonna take another one for my bed! They\'re really beautiful. ','','2022-01-06 05:51:44','2022-01-06 05:51:44','1',1),(576,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Alexander ','Fast Delivery ','Great. Perfect for my sofa. And very nice and warm. Happy with my purchase.','','2022-01-06 05:52:25','2022-01-06 05:52:25','1',1),(577,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sunny Gomes ','Instant puppy love ','I ordered two of these. My puppies love them. Super sot and looks good in the room. Watch out when washing though. ','','2022-01-06 05:57:40','2022-01-06 05:57:40','1',1),(578,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Doggy ','4.0 out of 5 stars Dog loves it! ',' Super soft, just as i had wanted. ','','2022-01-06 06:00:47','2022-01-06 06:00:47','1',1),(579,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lukas ','Great Delivery ','Arrived today big enough for both of my pets absolutely love it !!!','16414489741852.jpg','2022-01-06 06:02:54','2022-01-06 06:02:54','1',1),(580,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Julia ','Soft cuddly ',' Review asks if easy to clean.. brand new, don’t know yet and durability… don’t know yet. It is smaller than I expected but my 58 lb dog loves it. It is extremely soft and cozy! ','','2022-01-06 06:11:43','2022-01-06 06:11:43','1',1),(581,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Catalina Marks ',' Bigger than I thought. ',' Jillie, my pet  loves to bury her treats and toys in it. ','16414495991624.jpg','2022-01-06 06:13:19','2022-01-06 06:13:19','1',1),(582,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Kim ','Happily surprised ','Waited to review until I could really test it out. I got it as my cat sometimes pees on my bed. I was in love with how soft and nice it looked upon opening. It’s a very pretty and warm blanket. And am happy (or not) to say last night I found my cat had peed on my bed and the blanket did it’s job and didn’t leak through! It’s a bit of a pain to wash as it holds water so well, but overall I’m happy with it. 4 stars until it proves better or worse. ','','2022-01-06 06:15:18','2022-01-06 06:15:18','1',1),(583,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aradhana ','Fur proofy and comfy ','Just bought so clear on durability/water proofness, but it is very soft and washed well. It looks lovely on the bed and definitely keeps the animal hair off well! We bought the 90x90 in Navy and it covers our queen size bed and the sides of it nicely. If our old girl has an accident ill be sure to update on durability! ','16414498409366.jpg','2022-01-06 06:17:20','2022-01-06 06:17:20','1',1),(584,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ewa','Soft and looks great ','My dogs immediately loved this blanket and snuggle onto it every chance they get. It has already been washed and came through beautifully. ','','2022-01-06 06:20:33','2022-01-06 06:20:33','1',1),(585,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Zofia ','Excellent quality, reasonable price ','Great purchase for anyone with pets. Quite cozy and can be used as a blanket on a bed. I already have two, and have started buying more as gifts! ','','2022-01-06 06:26:44','2022-01-06 06:26:44','1',1),(586,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Oscar','Good product ','The shape of this feeder is very advanced and the design is reasonable. It can hold 8L of dog food, enough for a dog under 12 pounds to eat for two weeks. And he can connect to the charging cable, or use the battery. Use the mobile app to control the feeder, you can set the pet\'s meal time, and the feeder will feed exactly at the set time. I don\'t have to worry about my dogs eat too late anymore. ','16414507111497.jpg','2022-01-06 06:31:51','2022-01-06 06:31:51','1',1),(587,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lara M ','Super Happy ','I am super happy with this purchase. I think this is a great pet feeder that you can time for up to 12 meals。Easy setup. Very simple and works great.\r\nTank is big enough for storage.\r\nDoesn\'t scare animals when food comes out, my cats quickly got used to their new feeding schedule. ','','2022-01-06 06:32:52','2022-01-06 06:32:52','1',1),(588,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Raymond ','Excellent product ','The packaging of this product was beyond expectation. It was among the cheaper auto feeders at the time and so I was able to purchase two separate ones for each of my cats. On day one, I was impressed with the ease of set up. Took a few trials to make sure we got the portions set up properly since I had never measured my cats\' servings in teaspoons (directions say one serving equals 2.5 tsp), but I have not had to mess or adjust anything since that initial day. It has been a couple of weeks now.','','2022-01-06 06:33:55','2022-01-06 06:33:55','1',1),(589,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Melissa ','So far so good ',' I bought 2 because my boys don’t share. And I’m ultimately super happy with the purchase after doing lots of research & reading MANY reviews before deciding on this particular automatic pet feeder. ','16414509688744.jpg','2022-01-06 06:36:08','2022-01-06 06:36:08','1',1),(590,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Marks ','Best automatic pet feeder ','I can say this is by far the best and most reliable one I have tried. Extremely easy to setup, the pet feeder has a great app that is constantly receiving improvements, updates, and new features. Automatic settings are extremely easy to use.','','2022-01-06 06:37:24','2022-01-06 06:37:24','1',1),(591,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Zoe ','Very good product ','I would totally recommend purchasing it from Grab Great Deals. Superb Product description. ','','2022-01-06 06:38:57','2022-01-06 06:38:57','1',1),(592,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sammuel ','Well built ','I received this auto feeder today and I am very impressed. ','','2022-01-06 06:58:09','2022-01-06 06:58:09','1',1),(593,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'D.Z. ','Awesome product ','loved it absolutely.. ','','2022-01-06 06:59:32','2022-01-06 06:59:32','1',1),(594,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Maja ','Works with Alexa ','This feeder makes life a lot easier and if you ever forget to schedule a meal then you can easily press a button or get alexa feed your pet. ','16414525515427.jpg','2022-01-06 07:02:31','2022-01-06 07:02:31','1',1),(595,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Alender ','Very good product','I am really glad I found this feeder. Great quality and looks for its price. Feeder was easy to set up and the seller was really kind and helpful. The app is very easy to use. Instructions are provided in detail along with the feeder.','','2022-01-06 07:04:17','2022-01-06 07:04:17','1',1),(596,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Avery','Good quality ','The app is user friendly and allows you to set up a feeding schedule. There are also a button to click in the app if you would like to feed your pet outside of the scheduled times. On the front of the actual feeder there is also a feed button that can be pushed to feed your pet whenever you choose.\r\n\r\nThe feeder itself is very attractive and looks very nice in our kitchen. The feeder disassembles into several parts to make cleaning easier.We are so happy with the automatic feeder! ','','2022-01-06 07:12:59','2022-01-06 07:12:59','1',1),(597,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Moonchild ','Very nice ','Very cool! Arrived fast and well packed. Work perfectly. Was a little complicated  at first but you learn fast. Satisfied! ','','2022-01-06 08:08:38','2022-01-06 08:08:38','1',1),(598,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Moonchild ','Very nice ','Very cool! Arrived fast and well packed. Work perfectly. Was a little complicated  at first but you learn fast. Satisfied! ','','2022-01-06 08:08:38','2022-01-06 08:08:38','1',1),(599,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lisa ','Wi-fi pet feeder ','I was looking for a Wi-Fi pet feeder that would work with Homebridge and HomeKit and this one worked perfectly. I wanted a way to automate cat feeding as it’s basically impossible with our cats. We have to lock them is the basement while pouring a simple portion of dry food in their bowls because they are complete freaks about food. Its great and it works so nicely. ','','2022-01-06 08:10:05','2022-01-06 08:10:05','1',1),(600,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Bob ','Impressive ',' Delivers the right amount of food (what ever you program) without any effort at the time you decide. ','16414571342950.jpg','2022-01-06 08:18:54','2022-01-06 08:18:54','1',1),(601,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Nola Stacy ','Awesome automatic pet feeders ','These cat feeders were really easy to set up and use. I love using it. ','','2022-01-06 08:40:54','2022-01-06 08:40:54','1',1),(602,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aaria ','Loving it ','I couldn’t be happier with this purchase. I bought two because my cats do not like to eat from the same bowl. Package was nicely done, direction pamphlet was impressive, (print was too small tho) and set up was easy. I was able to “add” a second device, so I can control/monitor both feeders off the same app. ','','2022-01-06 10:49:09','2022-01-06 10:49:09','1',1),(603,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ricky C','Easy setup ','Got these for small Dog- since the food is a little bigger the portions are small and will sometimes get stuck. One added bonus works with Alexa ( WiFi setup was fast and simple ) ( requires 2.5Ghz , luckily my router is dual band so works just fine . Nice stainless steel bowls ! - if you have large dog food bigger than the size of a bean , this might occasionally get stuck . The battery backup is nice - overall pretty happy.','16414662938325.jpg','2022-01-06 10:51:33','2022-01-06 10:51:33','1',1),(604,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Emma ','Love the texture ','Very neat, very thick and cozy, very nice color. Very satisfied with my purchase Thank you!','','2022-01-07 05:46:28','2022-01-07 05:46:28','1',1),(605,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Hall M. ','Very soft ','Very beautiful and fluffy, good size for my pet, convenient to take along for traveling','','2022-01-07 05:47:22','2022-01-07 05:47:22','1',1),(606,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Linda ','Machine-friendly','I totally recommend buying this from Grab Great Deals. My pet has his its own zone now. ','','2022-01-07 05:48:52','2022-01-07 05:48:52','1',1),(607,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ivanna James ','Just as i wanted for my pet ','Exactly as the ad. Great workmanship. Delivery was very fast. very satisfied with the product. Serious seller and dedicated. ','16415346325167.jpg','2022-01-07 05:50:32','2022-01-07 05:50:32','1',1),(608,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Mary K. ','Loved it. ','Shipping is super fast. Almost everything is like in the description.the product works perfectly! Super recommend. ','','2022-01-07 05:51:33','2022-01-07 05:51:33','1',1),(609,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Andrew ','Top one ','Top! My dog loves it! Thank you! ','','2022-01-07 05:53:14','2022-01-07 05:53:14','1',1),(610,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Susan','Value for money ','Lovely buy. My pet is in love with this bed, she is a doberman and 9 yrs old. It\'s very soft and appealing. I ordered xxl and I feel it should have been slightly bigger. Though it fits my dog, but why not a little extra space. Overall am happy with the product! ','16415350434407.jpg','2022-01-07 05:57:23','2022-01-07 05:57:23','1',1),(611,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Kiwi ','Good product','Everything about it is as mentioned. My dog loves the bed. He\'s a 35kg labernard and xxl is just the right size for him. ','','2022-01-07 05:58:17','2022-01-07 05:58:17','1',1),(612,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Thomas ','Very cosy ','What I like best is that it\'s compact,bottom and outer sides are waterproof and gives it a good look.Definately money\'s worth. ','','2022-01-07 05:59:26','2022-01-07 05:59:26','1',1),(613,1603,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ingrid James ','Dogs love it ','Don\'t know if it is washable, but we vacuum every day, so far so good. ','','2022-01-07 06:00:26','2022-01-07 06:00:26','1',1),(614,1601,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wei','Good product','Very good, arrived in 10 days and works perfectly! Very useful. ','