fect design','his kitty bag has really made trimming time a non traumatic event for everyone involved. It has three cinching cables in strategically placed spots that keep him from trying to wiggle free. There is a little zipper that lets a paw pop out easily without giving him an opening for escape. The snugness of this product actually keeps him calm during the whole process. It is very well made, really easy to wash too! It was obviously designed by someone who knows cats as it keeps them calm and makes the whole process almost calming.','','2022-04-01 13:15:52','2022-04-01 13:15:52','1',1),(1220,1610,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Venessa ','Cool ','Good solution to my cat\'s medication problems.','','2022-04-01 13:17:33','2022-04-01 13:17:33','1',1),(1221,1610,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Kathy Tyler ','Quality is super good. ','Must give your pets a chance, they would surely love it!!!','','2022-04-01 13:24:54','2022-04-01 13:24:54','1',1),(1222,1610,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Yashmin Bull ','Great one! ',' this is the secret to successfully bathing your cat! Getting the cat into this bag was quite the experience. We enjoyed this. 9/10 recommend if you need to wash your cat. ','16488197503143.jpg','2022-04-01 13:29:10','2022-04-01 13:29:10','1',1),(1223,1610,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Billie ','Good product ','First off this ideas was genius and it did get the job done with some extra wrapping for security ','','2022-04-01 13:32:54','2022-04-01 13:32:54','1',1),(1224,1610,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Morris ','Great Packaging ','I ordered one pink for my cat. Pink one was folded neatly in package. Loved using this pink product!!','','2022-04-01 13:33:58','2022-04-01 13:33:58','1',1),(1225,1610,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lisa Flores ','This was exactly what i was looking for!','The product, in functionality as well as theory is great. It’s hard to get on your cat if it’s a squirmer but once it’s on - as long as your cat isn’t sent from the bowels of Almighty Hell - it should stay on. She only got her right arm out so that’s a plus but it just di