ULL,0,5,0,5,'Olcen ','Very useful ','Very useful swimsuit for a cat. The cat is delighted with the trance, but the hysterical corns are at least. The parcel is sent and delivered on time, packing without frills. I recommend to the Cats. ','16488216734885.jpg','2022-04-01 14:01:13','2022-04-01 14:01:13','1',1),(1233,1610,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Morgan ','This does work ','This was a godsend. We bathe our cats twice a year and I refuse to bathe them by myself. This tool was AMAZING. One of my cats is a hellion and he managed to get a few small rips but nothing major. I may have missed the instructions which could\'ve been in the package and the rips could\'ve been from my own doing. Somethings I\'d love to elaborate on is the drawstrings. When putting your cats in the bag secure the back 1st, then get the head through the front and secure the 1st set of drawstrings then the 2nd this is ESSENTIAL, finally secure the mid section and go from there. It was great and now i can comfortably wash my cats by myself.\r\n','','2022-04-01 14:01:55','2022-04-01 14:01:55','1',1),(1234,1610,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sodaba ','Made it easy for Cat mothers ','I didn\'t expect a lot from this product but It worked really great for me. My 8 month old kitty never liked baths and would try to run and scratch but now I can very easily bath her. She still meaows and seems scared but at least she cant run away or scratch. Some cats might try to rip it open but my cat didn\'t. Worked for me and my kitty. All the best to you. I also did her nails and brushed her teeth in this ????\r\n','','2022-04-01 14:05:58','2022-04-01 14:05:58','1',1),(1235,1610,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ida Bomm ','Game Changer ','Awesome! Absolutely wonderful!! Whoever designed this is an absolute genius!!! You really don’t know how strong your cat is, until it’s bath time. This made it much easier to control my fat, flailing cat with legs that go everywhere! This is an absolute game changer!! Highly recommended!!\r\n','','2022-04-01 14:06:32','2022-04-0