 Manhattan that makes me feel as if I\'m at Glastonbury, or time-tripped back to Woodstock, but not in a costume-party kind of way. Not see-through, just above ankles on 5\'4\" self. I could see this as a beach cover up, a demure nightgown or leisure wear, as well as suitable for the street. But then again, I dress however I want.','','2022-08-30 10:40:18','2022-08-30 10:40:18','1',0),(1496,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Mary','Excellent','Love this dress! For reference I am 5’4” small chested 138lbs. Bought size medium & it fits well with lots of room. Could probably fit into size small but was afraid that it might shrink when washed. Luckily it didn’t shrink after washing it in washing machine with cold water and hung to dry','','2022-08-30 10:42:20','2022-08-30 10:42:20','1',0),(1497,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jashmi','Very comfortable','I just received and immediately tried on my dress. LOVE IT! It\'s exactly what I was looking for! The dress is a bit sheer in the yellow print, but I own a slip and will wear it when going out. I bought it for a party and will wear it as a cover up at the beach or pool too, but without the slip!! I\'m adding another color to my cart after I write this...','','2022-08-30 10:43:48','2022-08-30 10:43:48','1',0),(1498,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Scarlett','Fancy','The colors are pretty. It is comfortable. It is not flattering though. It fits like a tent. Comfortable for a fall or spring day.','','2022-08-30 10:44:47','2022-08-30 10:44:47','1',0),(1499,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Abigail','Cool','So cute! Love the print. This is my 3rd dress of this kind and I find that size small fits me best. I’m 5ft (on a good day) and weigh 145 lbs. The dresses seem to be cut differently depending on pattern and this one would be best suited for a taller gal, but still cute nonetheless. I have a smaller bust and I’m sure that’s how I’m able to get away with the small because the dress is more snug in the bust area but not uncomfortably so. The plunging neckline gives it a bit of spice. Mission accomplished with this piece.','','2022-08-30 10:45:42','2022-08-30 10:45:42','1',0),(1500,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Abby','Attractive','I love the combination of prints and colors on this BoHo dress. I got the dark teal background print with gold and burgundy in the floral print. The length is perfect for wearing with boots or even shortie boots in fall, gladiator sandals in spring.\r\nThis vendor has elastic under the bust which makes it snug so I needed the XL even though I am only a 36c. Still, I cannot tie it at the top.\r\nI will wear it with a teal bralette underneath and leave it untied. If you are bigger than 36c you will needed a larger size. For reference I usually wear a 10 or12 in dresses and tops but a size 12 in jeans.. I purchased a similar style from the competing vendor which was not elasticized under the bust and it ran larger so I only needed the L.\r\nVery cute but I will have to hand wash in cold water and hang to air dry because I won\'t fit in it if it shrinks.','','2022-08-30 10:46:46','2022-08-30 10:46:46','1',0),(1501,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sammy','Cute',' I have a few hippie dresses in this style. i love them cause they are oh so comfortable and also look great when shortened above the knee. I didn’t have any in this color and love the contract of the mustard yellow with the pinkflowers. The yellow ties give you the option to lace up all the way to the neck if you want to but I prefer just to lace the bottom cause it was just a tad too exposed for me.\r\n\r\nThe last time I ordered one of these ( another brand) i had gotten a small and it was really tight in the chest so this time I went with medium. I am 5’4 135-140 and although the medium fit it was a but loose so I exchanged for a small which fits much better. If you are short or petite but curvy like me- go with the small cause it is roomy. I have to say out of all the dresses I have this style- this material is the softest, I have a blue one that it very crisp and this material is soft and flowy. I also LOVE that it has pockets. There are so many colors I had a really hard time deciding! Now that I know my size I will order other colors.','','2022-08-30 10:48:10','2022-08-30 10:48:10','1',0),(1502,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aria','very comfy','I am so glad I ordered this dress. The hard part was picking out a color. I ordered one in blue with small sunflower/cornflowers. I ordered a medium and usually wear a size 8 dress. It fit perfectly and there is some elastic around the bustline that gives a bit. I do not have a large chest so it didn\'t matter. The dress is not see through but I will wear a tank under it as the opening in front is pretty low. Very happy with my purchase','','2022-08-30 10:49:28','2022-08-30 10:49:28','1',0),(1503,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Scarlett','Very comfortable','I like the pattern and fit of this dress. I\'m normally a size 6 (small/medium) but bought this in large because I wanted a looser fit. It\'s as expected. Sometimes I may belt it for a more fitted look. I would recommend this dress and plan on getting more in different patterns.','','2022-08-30 10:50:12','2022-08-30 10:50:12','1',0),(1504,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Grab Great Deals user','Fancy','If you are on the fence about buying this dress, DO IT!!! You won’t be sorry!\r\n(Just be sure to order up a size).\r\n\r\nThis dress is my new summer favorite, & you can’t beat the low price! I read the reviews & ordered up a size to a XL & it fit perfectly. (I’m 5’8” & wear a size 12-14).\r\nI feel sexy & confident wearing this dress & I can wear it causally with flip flops, or dress it up with sandals, short boots, or heels. It also looks darling with a felted hat!\r\n\r\nI love this dress so much that I ordered two more in other colors. I also have to comment on just how comfortable these dresses are, I mean, I could sleep in it!\r\n\r\nJust a side note here; keep that extra bit of string that comes with the dress, you can use it to lace the bodice up with them if you’d like, I am almost positive that that is why they include the string. There are small buttonholes placed up & down the “V” of the closure of the bodice so you can lace it just the way you like it.','','2022-08-30 10:51:27','2022-08-30 10:51:27','1',0),(1505,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lily','Surprised it wasn\'t loose and flowy','This was my second UIMLK Boho Maxi Dresses, loved the first one. It was loose, this one had elastic on the sides, which I wasn\'t expecting. I still like the pattern, but when I put it on to wear out my husband and daughter thought it pushed up my breasts too much for a 66 year old woman. I still like the pattern, I just wish UIMLK had noted the difference as I would have selected a different one. On a younger woman, that wants a more shapely dress, this one would be perfect.','','2022-08-30 10:53:03','2022-08-30 10:53:03','1',0),(1506,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Grab Great Deals user','Well made, light as air!','Well made, vibrant colors, so cooling, so comfortable! Fits perfectly; I am 5”9, 180 lbs. and I ordered an XL. Hits me mid calf, envy the shorter ladies who get to have it hit ankle length.\r\n\r\nI’ve ordered four!\r\n\r\nI wasn’t sure if it would be “too much” pattern wise/age wise on me as I am a 66 year old pale skinned blond; my husband first reaction upon seeing it was “Is it Swedish?” He liked it!\r\n\r\nConsidering sewing some beads on the bodice area to highlight some of the tiny orange repeats on the band pattern there and maybe on the tassels too.\r\n\r\nMy only very minor issue is the sensation of having an elastic band gathering the wrist end of the sleeve. I’m very thin skinned; it is NOT tight, just different style than what I usually wear so I feel it. If I can’t live with it I can either stretch the elastic out or remove it.','','2022-08-30 10:54:07','2022-08-30 10:54:07','1',0),(1507,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Grab Great Deals user','Gorgeous, comfortable fabric','I now have this dress in 5 different patterns, and I\'ve been wearing them quite a bit, mostly around the house. I love the look and feel of the fabric - it is light but opaque, super soft and the colors are bright.\r\n\r\nI normally wear a M or L (10 or 12), depending on the manufacturer, but have been ordering an XL in this. I have been washing in cold water and drying on extra low, and I think there was some slight shrinkage on the first cycle, but I haven\'t noticed any after that. Overall, I think these are a great value for the price!','','2022-08-30 10:56:21','2022-08-30 10:56:21','1',0),(1508,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Scarlett','Love these','I have several of these dresses from this seller and also from other Amazon sellers. These are my favorite. The dresses from this seller not only have pockets, but the zipper allows it to be more form fitting. I do sew up the gap at the chest as you can see. 36C and I use these to mask my diastasis recti a bit. I wear an XXL, but I do also have wide shoulders and I like to have plenty of movement.','','2022-08-30 11:02:13','2022-08-30 11:02:13','1',0),(1509,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Stephne',' 4.0 out of 5 stars Best Boho Dress','I have ordered 3 boho dresses (different brands), and this brand is the superior one. The bodice is double layered, elastic insets at sides help to prevent a “tent” looking dress yet it still flows loosely, and added eyelets up the front of bodice allow adjustments to front closure (can lace the tassels). This brand also has pockets. The other brand dresses returned, this one I’ll keep and most likely purchase additional colors.','','2022-08-30 11:04:49','2022-08-30 11:04:49','1',0),(1510,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Grab Great Deals user',' Beautiful and comfortable','I\'ve ordered two of these, they are beautiful, comfortable and wash well. I had to modify the front a little as I preferred it less open, but that was easy. Just a really pretty dress for home or going out.','','2022-08-30 11:06:25','2022-08-30 11:06:25','1',0),(1511,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Grab Great Deals user',' Beautiful, light, but waist too high..','Quite flattering, not sheer. The too high waistline was my deal breaker. It was right under my breasts. I also wish it were longer. The sleeves I ???? ved. They were long but with the light material able to wear in spring; or push up with the elastic at the wrist.','','2022-08-30 11:09:24','2022-08-30 11:09:24','1',0),(1512,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aria',' Love it','GREAT dress. Much better than the R.Vivimos version. We actually get pockets AND a small zipper on the side for easy dressing. It did shrink after first wash, now I show a little more cleavage than I prefer to, so let them hang dry over the bathtub instead!','','2022-08-30 11:13:12','2022-08-30 11:13:12','1',0),(1513,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Grab Great Deals user','Love These So Much!','Nice dresses I bought four of them. One he and issue and they took care of it and paid the shipping to return I’m happy with that customer service. Thanks I hope you remake the red and black one and the right size. A tiny bit snug in Breast area and arms but very pretty dresses','','2022-08-30 11:29:39','2022-08-30 11:29:39','1',0),(1514,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Suzi','Pretty Dress','This a very pretty and comfortable dress. I do wish it had been shorter but then I\'m 5\'1\" tall\r\nso it probably is shorter on people taller then me. It hits me about ankle length if this is\r\nany help to you taller ladies out there. Take Care.','','2022-08-30 11:33:50','2022-08-30 11:33:50','1',0),(1515,1618,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Grab Great Deals user','Buy it!','This dress is my favorite. I\'ve had it for over 4 months now and I wear it everytime the weather allows. I\'m not well endowed in the chest area, so it hangs loose in some places but I use some spray tape I have not had any wardrobe malfunctions to date. I machine wash it and hang dry it and have no rips/tears/stretches of any sort. I highly recommend you buy it! There is a silky layer under the skirt that makes it feel divine even when it\'s 100+ outside.','','2022-08-30 11:38:54','2022-08-30 11:38:54','1',1),(1516,1618,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sami',' Cute and beachy','The dress is as seen yet mine came with some dirt on the front and a small ink mark. I\'m not sure what happened during packaging or shipping, yet I can wash these out','','2022-08-30 11:40:46','2022-08-30 11:40:46','1',1),(1517,1618,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Grab Great Deals user','Very pretty','It is pretty. I’m 5’3 175pounds. C busy I bought a large. The length is way to much(most the time it is cause I am short but will need it helped) the busy area leaves the weird gap on the sides. Should of gotten a medium.','','2022-08-30 11:41:34','2022-08-30 11:41:34','1',1),(1518,1618,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Abigail','Cute / Comfortable','I bought a medium and I went against the washing guidelines so I could shrink up the chest and it worked a little bit but it did fit , I just wanted it a bit more snug. Everyone loved my dress. I wore it for my bridal shower and I’ll be wearing it again. I am about 125 and 5’4 I hope this help you with the purchase.','','2022-08-30 11:42:19','2022-08-30 11:42:19','1',1),(1519,1618,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Grab Great Deals user','The perfect dress','Buying this dress was the best wedding decision I made. It’s super comfortable and flattering. I received so many compliments and I plan on keeping this dress forever. It was a little long but perfect with heels on. I am also a petite person so everything is long on me anyways.','','2022-08-30 11:42:56','2022-08-30 11:42:56','1',1),(1520,1618,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jane','Perfect!','My daughter love it ,it fits to her she was so happy on that dress for her birthday ???? highly recommended ???? just a little lingering for b. She just only 5 ft.????','','2022-08-30 11:43:45','2022-08-30 11:43:45','1',1),(1521,1618,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Grab Great Deals user','Beautiful Dress','This dress was perfect for our beach vacation! It fell slightly below my ankles. I love the crochet bodice That emphasizes the waistline. This dress ties around the neck, making it easy to adjust.','','2022-08-30 11:44:44','2022-08-30 11:44:44','1',1),(1522,1618,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Liza',' Perfect beach dress','Purchased this dress for family photos on the beach. Absolutely gorgeous and comfortable dress! I haven’t felt so confident in a dress while not wearing a bra underneath! Definitely give this dress a try if you’re considering it!!','','2022-08-30 11:45:57','2022-08-30 11:45:57','1',1),(1523,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Grab Great Deals user',' Pretty, flowing','I like most things about this dress .. it is a great lightweight, so you can dress nice in a hot climate. The color is rich/beautiful (I got the mint) and it\'s flattering in all the right places while helping to disguise a belly pooch ....\r\nWhat I didn\'t like was wishing I could wrap it just a wee bit more, to cover my cleavage .. and I wish it hit my leg where it does on the model. However, the manufacturer isn\'t responsible for my being 5\'2\" ???? but it would be nice if it were offered in shorter options','','2022-08-31 05:36:43','2022-08-31 05:36:43','1',0),(1524,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Olivia','Great dress!','I do recommend this dress. Very flattering on, received many compliments while wearing, and nice lighter fabric. Only two slightly \"down sides\". It does wrinkle easily (I traveled with it), so steaming or ironing prior to wear is a must. The other is that the neckline has a snap to keep it from being too low cut. That snap is in kind of a weird area and caused it to lay un naturally. Ended up removing the closure and wearing a cami under... which worked out great!','','2022-08-31 05:38:04','2022-08-31 05:38:04','1',0),(1525,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Grab Great Deals user','Very happy with my purchase','Love this dress. The material is soft and flowing. I am 5’7” and weighs 142 lbs. bought large and it is perfect. A wrap dress where you can adjust the waistline to suit.','','2022-08-31 05:40:35','2022-08-31 05:40:35','1',0),(1526,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Audrey','Very romantic dress','Thin enough to feel very romantic, but not see-through. Extremely flattering cute and ruffle detail.\r\n\r\nThe wrap part of the skirt will blow open a bit, so I’ve been wearing it with a safety pin.','','2022-08-31 05:54:57','2022-08-31 05:54:57','1',0),(1527,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aamber',' It\'s beautiful good for a summer day keeps you cool','I love the dress very nostalgic and classy','','2022-08-31 05:56:44','2022-08-31 05:56:44','1',0),(1528,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Willow','very pretty, fits well, a few minor issues','Overall, this is a very pretty dress. It\'s borderline see-through, so I just wore light colored undergarments and it was okay. I haven\'t tested it in really bright or other lights yet though. The snap on the top is in a weird spot so it\'s either showing when it\'s unsnapped or leaves a gap if you have a medium to large chest size. I just started leaving it unsnapped and wearing a crop tank underneath. (You can leave it otherwise, but it\'s not quite secure enough to keep me from feeling like I might have a Janet Jackson moment.) Where the tie goes through on the side also leaves a little bit of a gap. With the tank top underneath, you can\'t see the skin, but this could probably have been made better. It\'s very thin material. Apart from some of those nitpicky things, I really love how it looks. I think it\'s super pretty. For reference, I am 5\'7\" 150lbs and got a size small.','','2022-08-31 05:57:55','2022-08-31 05:57:55','1',0),(1529,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Abbreithe','Amazing dress','I ordered this dress for a Mother’s Day shoot and it’s was perfect thinking about ordering another color. I ordered it in Med.','','2022-08-31 06:00:36','2022-08-31 06:00:36','1',0),(1530,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Florence','Love it!','Looks super cute and flattering. I am 5\'2 and 139 pounds and I wear a 36C bra and the medium fits perfect! Its seriously so cute I cant wait to wear it this weekend!','','2022-08-31 06:03:45','2022-08-31 06:03:45','1',0),(1531,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Margaret',' 5.0 out of 5 stars Comfortable & Beautiful.','I love this dress. It looks even more beautiful than the pictures. Wore it all day while doing different activities and was very comfortable. I\'m 5\'2 and the size S was a perfect length.','','2022-08-31 06:04:58','2022-08-31 06:04:58','1',0),(1532,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Eleanor','Cute dress','The dress looks very cute','','2022-08-31 06:06:53','2022-08-31 06:06:53','1',0),(1533,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Betsy','Beautiful','I love it\r\nSoft natural fabric\r\nIam L size but i bought xl to have more drapes\r\nBut is good\r\nSo better buy one size bigger\r\nI got it right','','2022-08-31 06:07:48','2022-08-31 06:07:48','1',0),(1534,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Elsie','Perfect length for shorter woman.','I am 5\'2\" and the medium is a perfect length for me. I probably should have purchased the small , yet I wanted to make sure it had a loose fit. It is very breathable, and I received many compliments. The only thing I am not sure I like is where the dress plunges above the breasts . It has a small snap there and it seems a bit cheap in that area. I cannot quite place why I am not a huge fan of the chest area on it.','','2022-08-31 06:09:08','2022-08-31 06:09:08','1',0),(1535,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jacqueline','This dress is EVERYTHING!!!','Wowowow! Hit in ALLL the right places. So flattering. So comfortable. So easy to slip on and INSTANTLY feel fabulous! Just yes! Get one.','','2022-08-31 06:11:53','2022-08-31 06:11:53','1',0),(1536,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Audrey','  Cute','Really cute , I am taller with a long torso feel it would have been flattering if they had it in tall sizes proportioned correctly so it does not look as cute as in the pic as it ties higher above my waist which is why 3 stars on fit but on everyone else I feel it would look great','','2022-08-31 06:19:38','2022-08-31 06:19:38','1',0),(1537,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Audrey','  Cute','Really cute , I am taller with a long torso feel it would have been flattering if they had it in tall sizes proportioned correctly so it does not look as cute as in the pic as it ties higher above my waist which is why 3 stars on fit but on everyone else I feel it would look great','','2022-08-31 06:19:43','2022-08-31 06:19:43','1',0),(1538,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Grab Great Deals user',' Flattering and Comfortable','I love this dress! I bought the green polka dots. It\'s very comfortable and flattering. I like that it\'s a true wrap dress, but has a snap on the bust cross-over for modestly, and it\'s long enough that I don\'t have to worry about unexpected \"flashes\" when I walk, move, or sit. I did wear it to the beach and some of the breezes had me a little concerned, but I had nothing to worry about. The material is soft, breathable, and has some stretch. It does wrinkle easily, though. I definitely recommend this.','','2022-08-31 06:21:41','2022-08-31 06:21:41','1',0),(1539,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Emily',' Love this.','Got so many compliments on this dress. Wore it for thanksgiving and it’s now one of my favorite dresses that I own.','','2022-08-31 06:32:27','2022-08-31 06:32:27','1',0),(1540,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Penelope','Cute ????','Super cute sundress...I had to look up how to tie it,, but once I figured it out,, I fell in love!! Only disappointed in the fact in come in really wrinkled like maybe someone bought it, tried it on, wadded it up and sent it back. But other than that, it\'s perfect!','','2022-08-31 06:34:44','2022-08-31 06:34:44','1',0),(1541,727,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Mila',' Perfect Dress!','Love this dress, love the fit, neckline isn\'t too low, my waistline is perfect in it. I got a size small and finally, something fit properly. 5\'3','','2022-08-31 06:37:20','2022-08-31 06:37:20','1',0),(1542,1619,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Grab Great Deals user',' I love this dress!','Living in Tucson, I\'m always looking for clothing that is cool. This dress is! Made of rayon, it hangs well & has little bra strap adjustments. Hangs to mid calf on me. Although it is very lightweight, you cannot see through it .\r\nThe thing is ,I get complements every single time I wear it! The colors are bright, and hangs well. You could probably doll it up with a belt & accessories.\r\nThey offer a ton of patterns & colors. I\'m gotta get more!','','2022-09-01 11:11:44','2022-09-01 11:11:44','1',0),(1543,1619,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Rebekah',' Fantastic find!','Awsome','','2022-09-01 11:13:57','2022-09-01 11:13:57','1',0),(1544,1619,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Patricia','Great Summer dress.','Didn\'t expect this from this dress. Beautiful dress, comfortable and the fabric is awesome! My favorite go to dress! Will be purchasing a different color and pattern design for there are many. Can\'t go wrong if purchased!','','2022-09-01 11:15:12','2022-09-01 11:15:12','1',0),(1545,1619,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ramona','Cute and comfortable!','This is a very cute dress as well as being comfortable. The fit was as I expected and I feel that the value is well worth the money. Shipping time was just fine, I would recommend this seller.','','2022-09-01 11:15:59','2022-09-01 11:15:59','1',0),(1546,1619,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Boone','Beautiful sexy casual dress.','The dress was very flattering.','','2022-09-01 11:16:47','2022-09-01 11:16:47','1',0),(1547,1619,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ramona ',' Love the dress and the blue & white','The dress is a cool, light, flowy fabric. You\'ll need a slip. No fabric content tag anywhere on dress, but I\'m guessing it\'s Rayon. Made in China. I normally wear XL or XXL. I ordered an XL and easily could have gone with a L. I\'m 5\'-2\" and the dress hit me at the ankles. I didn\'t like the pockets adding too much extra fabric at the hips, so I sewed them shut and cut away the pocket fabric. Very happy with this dress and I plan on ordering more!!','','2022-09-01 11:17:44','2022-09-01 11:17:44','1',0),(1548,1619,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Helen','Great Quality Fair Price','I have been searching forever to find an affordable dress that could serve as a beach coverup or be worn as a dress. This meets and exceeds my expectations. I normally wear a size 12/14 and size large is a perfect fit...not too tent like but flatteringly loose. The ruffle on the bottom keeps the dress from being so plain. The pockets are a nice bonus as well. The fabric is light and airy but not sheer and see through. The ONLY negative I found was that the arm holes gape a bit, but I easily fixed the issue by taking them in slightly, using just a needle & thread. Seriously considering ordering another one in a different color. Great quality for a fair price.','','2022-09-01 11:19:14','2022-09-01 11:19:14','1',0),(1549,1619,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Cooper',' Very comfortable','Really nice and comfortable for staying cool.','','2022-09-01 11:20:34','2022-09-01 11:20:34','1',0),(1550,1619,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Grab Great Deals user','SO COMFY!','I LOVE this cute summer dress, as it\'s so hot in my state right now, 113 yesterday! The dress is true to size and I really don\'t feel like I\'m wearing anything. I\'m very happy with this purchase!','','2022-09-01 11:21:28','2022-09-01 11:21:28','1',0),(1551,1619,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wyatt','It is so comfortable','This dress is perfect for the beach, going shopping, running errands, birthday party, family events, it’s just so comfortable for any occasion.','','2022-09-01 11:41:42','2022-09-01 11:41:42','1',0),(1552,1619,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Gussie',' Very Cute','bought this for an end of the day relax\r\noutfit - it’s super cute / fits well / comfy / not tight …. i ordered medium - i am 5’4” 135’ish','','2022-09-01 11:42:34','2022-09-01 11:42:34','1',0),(1553,1619,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ernest','Ready for vacation!','This is a very comfortable easy to wear dress. Can be dressed up or down for any occasion. I did buy a belt but decided on its easy flow for these hot summer days.','','2022-09-01 11:43:17','2022-09-01 11:43:17','1',0),(1554,1619,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Grab Great Deals user','Wonderful Sundress.','Love this dress! Great quality and washes up nicely.','','2022-09-01 11:48:55','2022-09-01 11:48:55','1',0),(1555,1619,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Rae','Gorgeous','I love this dress! 