rt ','lovely','So cute!! I love it!!','','2022-10-10 11:13:49','2022-10-10 11:13:49','1',1),(1674,1625,NULL,0,5,0,5,' Boone ','quite good','This little costume was perfect for my cat! My cat isn\'t very difficult (luckily), so the harness was easy to put on him. He did walk a little strangely at first, but he didn\'t seem to mind the wings- he even took a nap while wearing them! The wings are lightweight and well-made, and shipping was quick as well. Thank you! ','','2022-10-10 11:15:00','2022-10-10 11:15:00','1',1),(1675,1625,NULL,0,5,0,5,' Buck','amazing','I recently adopted a 5-month-old kitten from a local rescue and wanted to get her a costume that would actually fit her (she’s only about 5 lbs.) and be comfortable for her. I messaged the seller to check that the smallest size would work, and she replied within 5 minutes! I’ve never interacted with such a responsive seller, it was amazing. The costume came quickly, and Nori looks adorable in it! Thank you so much, I will definitely be purchasing from this shop again!','','2022-10-10 11:16:26','2022-10-10 11:16:26','1',1),(1676,1625,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Calvin','very comfy','My kitty hates it. She absolutely hates it. But I LOVE I!!! LOL Due to issues with USPS, it took a little longer than I expected, but the quality is good, and my 16-year-old young kitty looks amazing. One of the reasons I got it is because she\'s been going through the metal railing/fence on my balcony so not only she will look cool, but it will also keep her safe going through the metal railing. :)','','2022-10-10 11:17:41','2022-10-10 11:17:41','1',1),(1677,1625,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Chester ','well made','Of course, my cat didn’t like it, but we had so much amusement from this costume, and it was better than anything that would have been on her head. She fit so well in it and was so cute! It was very well-made and came exactly as described!','','2022-10-10 11:18:31','2022-10-10 11:18:31','1',1),(1678,1625,NULL,0,5,0,5,' Clay',' precious',' Perfect costume for my little kitty! He was so precious in his batwings.','','2022-10-10 11:19:26','2022-10-10 11:19:26','1',1),(1679,1625,NULL,0,5,0,5,' Clayton ','love this','I love these wings! My cat attacked them for a few minutes the first time but now he doesn\'t even notice them. They look the exact same as in the photos and I love that they have wire to adjust the shape and keep them up.','','2022-10-10 11:20:12','2022-10-10 11:20:12','1',1),(1680,1626,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Cole ','fantastic','This mask is fantastic! Comfortable to wear and uber creepy. When it first arrived, it was a bit flat. I stuffed it with newspaper and within a few days, it had filled out and looked perfect. Easy to breathe in but does get a bit hot, especially in warmer climates. Doesn\'t work well with glasses as the frames hit the sides of the mask but that is to be expected. It is adjustable and can easily fit older children and adults. Overall, really pleased with this mask.','','2022-10-10 11:43:14','2022-10-10 11:43:14','1',1),(1681,1626,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Coleman','adjustable ','Perhaps if it would have some soft cloth on the edges (forehead), it would be a great addition for comfort. Besides that, it is a pretty good mask for Halloween. It has an adjustable belt for the head and the materials are good enough.','','2022-10-10 11:45:15','2022-10-10 11:45:15','1',1),(1682,1626,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Colt','great','looks great. Seems well ventilated. Easily holds appropriate form. If you really want to the historical effect, there is plenty of room for aromatics at the end of the nose of the mask. Limitations are those of wearing any mask, peripheral vision is limited, and the eye pieces are equivalent to sunglasses. Does not cover the ears, so the mask causes no limitation of hearing','','2022-10-10 11:46:18','2022-10-10 11:46:18','1',1),(1683,1626,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Edgar',' great mask','1)I like this mask a lot it’s very well-made and very cool looking. Although I wish it didn’t get too hot after a while of wearing it all in all great mask.','','2022-10-10 11:47:11','2022-10-10 11:47:11','1',1),(1684,1626,NULL,0,5,0,5,' Elijah','fantastic','Much better than expected. a touch small for my head but bought for my daughter. good visibility from inside the mask. Although the eyepieces are dark from the outside it is easy to see in the dark. Quality workmanship and overall, a fantastic product. easy to breathe in and it doesn\'t fog up.','','2022-10-10 11:48:15','2022-10-10 11:48:15','1',1),(1685,1626,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ernest ','perfect','Obviously, there\'s better out there, but for such a cheap price this is a great plague mask! Quality leather mask and straps, easily adjustable, fits great, and looks great! Definitely, the look I was going for, was simple and elegant. Eyes fog, of course, but some dish soap or glasses defogger should take care of that. Gets hot quickly, but especially in during these plague times, perfect for any outing.','','2022-10-10 11:50:37','2022-10-10 11:50:37','1',1),(1686,1626,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Eugene',' excellent','Great quality item. Visibility is excellent, easy to breathe through, and easy to adjust.','','2022-10-10 11:51:31','2022-10-10 11:51:31','1',1),(1687,1626,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Frank','recommend',' This mask was the finishing touch for my back-to-school outfit! Quality was what I expected. Not a bad product! Would recommend','','2022-10-10 11:52:28','2022-10-10 11:52:28','1',1),(1688,1626,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Gary','Buy it!','Gary, I\'m impressed with this mask. Usually masks these days are cheap and nasty but this one is quality, and it has an adjustable strap on the back for different head sizes. Try not to breathe excessively heavily also as the lenses do fog up and I could imagine it would get hard to breathe in it. Overall, amazing product and well worth the money. Worthy of a first-choice mask.','','2022-10-10 11:53:28','2022-10-10 11:53:28','1',1),(1689,1626,NULL,0,5,0,5,' George','Multi tusking',' The effect is great. It\'s very convenient to lock the refrigerator, and it has many uses. It\'s exactly what I need','','2022-10-10 11:54:21','2022-10-10 11:54:21','1',1),(1690,1627,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Harry','Great quality','Great quality, accurate with the description, for my German Spitz 4,950kg I bought size M, and fitted well. Very well sewn, very perfect. Shipping was very fast 10 days','','2022-10-11 05:33:23','2022-10-11 05:33:23','1',1),(1691,1627,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Henry','Cute ','Cute for a small cat! ','','2022-10-11 05:34:44','2022-10-11 05:34:44','1',1),(1692,1627,NULL,0,5,0,5,' Holt ','adorable',' I bought this to dress up a few of the adoptable cats in the Cat Shelter I volunteer for. As you see, they look darling.','','2022-10-11 05:43:29','2022-10-11 05:43:29','1',1),(1693,1627,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Homer','Buy it!','Love this product! We used it to dress up a dog statue we have and it’s adorable :)','','2022-10-11 05:44:13','2022-10-11 05:44:13','1',1),(1694,1627,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Howard  ','cute','Very cute outfit with good fit in collar','','2022-10-11 05:44:52','2022-10-11 05:44:52','1',1),(1695,1627,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ike','very comfy','Great quality!','','2022-10-11 05:54:01','2022-10-11 05:54:01','1',1),(1696,1627,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jasper','cute',' My cat isn’t the biggest fan of costumes, but I would say she looks very cute.','','2022-10-11 05:54:47','2022-10-11 05:54:47','1',1),(1697,1627,NULL,0,5,0,5,'John ','Buy it!','Fits not only my kitten but my rabbit as well.','','2022-10-11 05:55:34','2022-10-11 05:55:34','1',1),(1698,1627,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lawrence','Awesome','The product was delivered pretty fast, and it fit my cat very well!','','2022-10-11 05:56:40','2022-10-11 05:56:40','1',1),(1699,1627,NULL,0,5,0,5,'William ','fun loving costume','Just plain fun','','2022-10-11 05:57:29','2022-10-11 05:57:29','1',1),(1700,1628,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Bonnie','decent','The stickers seem to be decent quality.','','2022-10-11 06:30:13','2022-10-11 06:30:13','1',1),(1701,1628,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sophia ','nice',' The stickers were really cool, and the print was nice and clear','','2022-10-11 06:30:59','2022-10-11 06:30:59','1',1),(1702,1628,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Julian  ','clear design','The images are clear and cut right.','','2022-10-11 06:31:38','2022-10-11 06:31:38','1',1),(1703,1628,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Juniper ',' Pretty, flowing','Stickers are pretty cute ','','2022-10-11 06:32:18','2022-10-11 06:32:18','1',1),(1704,1628,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Addie ','lovely','I love theses!!! So cute,','','2022-10-11 06:32:58','2022-10-11 06:32:58','1',1),(1705,1628,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Kate','cool','Pretty cool designs and very happy to see','','2022-10-11 06:33:49','2022-10-11 06:33:49','1',1),(1706,1628,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lorraine  ','Multi tusking','This is truly an amazing sticker set! The printing is amazing, and they all came in packaging I could reuse to organize them! Having said that, any person with a sticker addiction like myself should know full well that when it comes to bundles like this, ESPECIALLY when they are this large, there are GOING to be copied. It\'s not laziness or just the producers not caring, it\'s just inevitable. Having said that, I was surprised at how few copies I found! Out of 300 or so stickers, there were only 17 (that I caught) stickers that doubled! Some of them however aren\'t EXACTLY the same and have small differences. In one of my pictures, you can see this. It\'s a woman with 4 eyes, but one of the prints has black eyes instead of white. Another example might be the cat with 4 eyes. Two had a background, but one was just the cat, with no background. Again, I was very happy with this sticker order and the fact that there were only a few doubles or triples makes me even happier! They really did well with making sure there was a vast variety of designs so there truly is something for everyone in here! (Everyone who has a bit of a dark side that is lol) I mean seriously, I found some in here I wouldn\'t mind giving to my grandma or younger siblings in here! (Only a few though lol) I love this and if you\'re thinking of getting this, do it! Especially if you\'re wanting to buy stickers to share with friends!!','','2022-10-11 06:36:09','2022-10-11 06:36:09','1',1),(1707,1628,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Patricia ','Fancy','Loved how the stickers looked. They met all my expectations and more.','','2022-10-11 06:36:55','2022-10-11 06:36:55','1',1),(1708,1628,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Molly ','Great product','  Great product. I got the stickers to send to my pen pals. I should have looked closer at the stickers before I bought them though because a lot of them would be considered \"occult-Ish.\" I personally do not mind, but it makes it more difficult to send them to my pen pals, as I do not want to send them something they would consider offensive. If you\'re looking for variety, this pack delivers. A great \"edgy\" set of stickers. The picture quality on a few ways to be desired but you get so many stickers... so I still consider the pack to be worth the price.','','2022-10-11 06:38:25','2022-10-11 06:38:25','1',1),(1709,1628,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Samuel','awesome','The stickers are of awesome quality and quite the selection. Only ended up with a few repeats. But with a huge pack like this, I kind of expected it. I did not expect them to be so small. They were all almost around 2 inches around, with some being even small. All in all, happy with the purchase.\r\n','','2022-10-11 06:39:24','2022-10-11 06:39:24','1',1),(1710,1629,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ryan','pretty','So, I counted 51 stickers. I got 2 of the same stickers. I say of the 50 stickers received only a handful are a bit corny nonetheless pretty decent set.','','2022-10-11 07:00:12','2022-10-11 07:00:12','1',1),(1711,1629,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Edwina ','Buy it!','Bought as a gift','','2022-10-11 07:01:01','2022-10-11 07:01:01','1',1),(1712,1629,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Porter  ','well design','Some of my stickers were cut or printed off templates. But the rest are nice and stick very well!','','2022-10-11 07:01:52','2022-10-11 07:01:52','1',1),(1713,1629,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lula','good product','I put these on my water jug for work and they\'ve stuck on pretty well. I had 1 double printout of all of them but honestly, it\'s not a huge deal-breaker for me','','2022-10-11 07:09:02','2022-10-11 07:09:02','1',1),(1714,1629,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lucinda','Buy it!',' I loved them!! I put them around my mirror','','2022-10-11 07:09:44','2022-10-11 07:09:44','1',1),(1715,1629,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Kit ','beautiful','I purchased these stickers for my water bottle (they are super beautiful and exactly what I wanted) ','','2022-10-11 07:12:37','2022-10-11 07:12:37','1',1),(1716,1629,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Edith ','cute','Lots of cute designs though. I also stuck some to my journal cover and was able to move/reposition some without any sticky residue. So that was nice.','','2022-10-11 07:13:57','2022-10-11 07:13:57','1',1),(1717,1629,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Earle ','Buy it!','I\'ve had them for more than 6 months now, they are on my laptop. They didn\'t fray, except for the one wear I touched them a lot. If you do, the topcoat will start de peel a little bit. But except this, I love the variety','','2022-10-11 07:15:23','2022-10-11 07:15:23','1',1),(1718,1629,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Rosemary','amazing',' The product was everything it said, perfect stickers with amazing print quality!','','2022-10-11 07:16:32','2022-10-11 07:16:32','1',1),(1719,1629,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Temperance','cool','Ok, I love these stickers so much! I’m actually thinking of just picking one out for just a random tattoo. The art is so good and it’s my style so cool!!','','2022-10-11 07:17:53','2022-10-11 07:17:53','1',1),(1720,1630,NULL,0,5,0,4,'Hannah','super','Super! It\'s already the second one I buy.','','2022-10-11 08:17:08','2022-10-11 08:17:08','1',1),(1721,1630,NULL,0,5,0,4,'Carson','scary','Superb hand to stick on window scary effect guaranteed ','','2022-10-11 08:17:56','2022-10-11 08:17:56','1',1),(1722,1630,NULL,0,4,0,4,'Mae ','awesome','Awesome Halloween decor that u can put anywhere.','','2022-10-11 08:18:35','2022-10-11 08:18:3