oming Halloween next month I told my kids we’re going to have a small family party (Cuz the COVID-19) at home .my kids are really excited about the Halloween decorations and costumes. And they said they want to help so I got them these stickers in advance, and they love it ','','2022-10-12 06:17:16','2022-10-12 06:17:16','1',1),(1758,1634,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Peter ','adorable','These stickers are adorable, and there are SO MANY!','','2022-10-12 06:18:04','2022-10-12 06:18:04','1',1),(1759,1634,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Hunter','impressive',' Its looks very spooky that anyone can be impressed','','2022-10-12 06:18:58','2022-10-12 06:18:58','1',1),(1760,1636,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Isabella','well packaging','Arrival 2 months before the scheduled date and very well packaged and conform to the photo thank you very much','','2022-10-12 07:17:00','2022-10-12 07:17:00','1',1),(1761,1636,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Isla','perfect','Perfectly packed, nothing crumpled, like a sticker, I\'ll add a review.','','2022-10-12 07:17:42','2022-10-12 07:17:42','1',1),(1762,1636,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Ivy','good',' I liked it effectively','','2022-10-12 07:18:34','2022-10-12 07:18:34','1',1),(1763,1636,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Jacey ','good','Delivery came in just over 2 weeks to Australia, looks good, haven\'t put it up yet. great price. Happy','','2022-10-12 07:19:21','2022-10-12 07:19:21','1',1),(1764,1636,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jade','Excellent','Excellent and packed perfectly! In a trumpet, with filler inside and in a poster.','','2022-10-12 07:20:07','2022-10-12 07:20:07','1',1),(1765,1636,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Jaena','Buy it!','Perfect just like in the picture','','2022-10-12 07:20:41','2022-10-12 07:20:41','1',1),(1766,1636,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jainy',' awesome',' awesome sticker, it made a sticker lover','','2022-10-12 07:21:40','2022-10-12 07:21:40','1',1),(1767,1636,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Jalin','good',' I’m very fond of sticker so this is one of my bucket lists','','2022-10-12 07:22:23','2022-10-12 07:22:23','1',1),(1768,1636,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Jasmine','Fancy','it looks