single controller. A few of the patterns were just too obnoxious for a holiday tree, However, the rest were fine, especially the alternating slow fade. The color of the wire blended well into the tree. Unbundling and storing is a little challenging since the 108ft strands are so long.','','2022-10-12 09:55:40','2022-10-12 09:55:40','1',1),(1777,1638,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Melanie','Fancy',' I\'m really pleased with these, and I expect to get many years of use from them. 2 thumbs up from me!','','2022-10-12 09:56:41','2022-10-12 09:56:41','1',1),(1778,1638,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Melody','perfect','These are perfect for my 7-foot slim tree. The LEDs are bright and look great. The only reason for not giving 5 stars is the remote. It can sometimes be iffy with a response when you press the buttons. Otherwise, great.','','2022-10-12 09:58:51','2022-10-12 09:58:51','1',1),(1779,1638,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Mia','excellent','I was afraid they were going to look too cold or bright and I would miss that warm Christmas tree glow. These lights did not disappoint! The various settings were an excellent feature as I like a nice steady light, but my kids love twinkling lights. The wire on these is very thick not like the cheap stuff you would buy at your big box store. I was so impressed with the quality, various settings, and convenience of a remote that I purchased two more sets. And while I hate to be wasteful, I will admit great satisfaction in throwing out all of my old-school string lights!','','2022-10-12 10:00:37','2022-10-12 10:00:37','1',1),(1780,1638,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Priscilla','Buy it!',' Easy to connect and I like all the features! Would recommend it to anyone','','2022-10-12 10:02:32','2022-10-12 10:02:32','1',1),(1781,1638,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Queenie','great','They look great on our house. We just put them up and they really go with the rest of the outdoor decor for Halloween.','','2022-10-12 10:03:29','2022-10-12 10:03:29','1',1),(1782,1638,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Quinn','lovely','Love that it has different li