ight will decrease slowly after a couple of hours. It is not a growing balloon, so you can put it everywhere you want.','','2022-10-13 07:56:16','2022-10-13 07:56:16','1',1),(1826,1643,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Larry','Nice LED balloons','Love these balloons. Good quality with led light inside the balloons. They even have a pump inside the package, so you do not need to use your mouth to inflate the balloons. It is very important for safety due to the virus. The LED light could last a few days.','','2022-10-13 07:57:30','2022-10-13 07:57:30','1',1),(1827,1643,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Justin',' I like it a lot!','Very easy to inflate and they light up very well.\r\nI am using it for kids\' Halloween parties, and they are really cute. A good item and value ','','2022-10-13 07:58:34','2022-10-13 07:58:34','1',1),(1828,1643,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Scott','excellent for socially distanced Halloween!','These will be so cute for our socially distanced Halloween in our own backyard.','','2022-10-13 07:59:23','2022-10-13 07:59:23','1',1),(1829,1643,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Brandon','Halloween lights','They were so cute','','2022-10-13 08:00:01','2022-10-13 08:00:01','1',1),(1830,1643,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Brenda','Kids love them!','Super cute!','','2022-10-13 08:00:42','2022-10-13 08:00:42','1',1),(1831,1643,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Pamela','Cute pumpkins!','Super cute and easy Halloween decor! It was a hit with the kids!','','2022-10-13 08:01:45','2022-10-13 08:01:45','1',1),(1832,1643,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Emma','Looks great.','Great idea for Halloween parties.','','2022-10-13 08:02:24','2022-10-13 08:02:24','1',1),(1833,1643,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Nicole','Great for Halloween Party','Overall great idea and cool execution. Lights lasted several days, so amazing and perfect for a Halloween weekend. However, you needed it really dark to see any kind of illumination.\r\nLoved them and so did the guests!','','2022-10-13 08:03:09','2022-10-13 08:03:09','1',1),(1834,1643,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Helen','Love these!!','The kids loved these and definitely will order them again. The lights in them lasted for days. We had to throw them away still glowing.','','2022-10-13 08:03:47','2022-10-13 08:03:47','1',1),(1835,1645,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Benjamin','Halloween outfit','Made well for the price and is perfect for my costume\r\nThank u','','2022-10-13 10:17:05','2022-10-13 10:17:05','1',1),(1836,1645,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Samuel','Decent cloak','We bought these to dress up as the Sanderson sisters and they\'re perfect!','','2022-10-13 10:18:46','2022-10-13 10:18:46','1',1),(1837,1645,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Gregory','Fantastic!','I bought this after getting my second covid vaccine and falling so ill the following day that I thought I was going to die. Now that I have it, I am much more eagerly looking forward to my next near-death experience now that I have the proper attire. For the price, I was very pleased with the quality. It has a comfortable liner on the inside that doesn’t feel “too cheap” which makes it a perfect garment for a cozy night in playing Xbox, eating snacks or slaking around the house in the dark. I am 6ft and 183 lbs., and the longer one comes perfectly to my ankles. It is not as wide as I would like it to be so it will not give you the snuggly/robe vibe so be cautious if you’re a real round one. My pet bunny named skunk also loves this, he likes when I wear it and binkies on the carpet while we watch vampire movies.','','2022-10-13 10:20:15','2022-10-13 10:20:15','1',1),(1838,1645,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Alexander','Not bad, not bad at all','She’s going to use this robe for more than just her Halloween costume. It ties a few “higher-end” outfits together quite nicely, yet is so inexpensive','','2022-10-13 10:21:06','2022-10-13 10:21:06','1',1),(1839,1645,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Frank ','Great item!','My son recently discovered a love of Dr. Doom and we ordered this to go with his Halloween costume. It is soft and he loves it! Great find!','','2022-10-13 10:21:47','2022-10-13 10:21:47','1',1),(1840,1645,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Samantha','Great for the price','This material was heavier than expected which I liked! It was plenty long. I’m 5’ 7” and it reached the floor. The green is a nice, deep green.','','2022-10-13 10:22:52','2022-10-13 10:22:52','1',1),(1841,1645,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Katherine','Fantastic value!','This is exactly what I wanted. I didn’t expect that for the price, so I was pleasantly surprised. I wish wearing capes outside of a costume was super normal because I would wear it every day.','','2022-10-13 10:23:38','2022-10-13 10:23:38','1',1),(1842,1645,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Christine','Affordable and good quality','Perfect for my costume','','2022-10-13 10:24:16','2022-10-13 10:24:16','1',1),(1843,1645,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Debra','Great closk','Beautiful rich material.','','2022-10-13 10:24:54','2022-10-13 10:24:54','1',1),(1844,1645,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Rachel','Nice Cloak for Cosplay','I bought this to complete my Doctor Doom Costume. It worked great. The quality was great, and it looks great. The length was perfect for the costume.','','2022-10-13 10:25:38','2022-10-13 10:25:38','1',1),(1845,1646,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Patrick','Awesome','These are great','','2022-10-13 11:07:50','2022-10-13 11:07:50','1',1),(1846,1646,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Raymond','Cute little jack-o\'-lantern battery candles','They are quite small but also quite cute. ','','2022-10-13 11:08:29','2022-10-13 11:08:29','1',1),(1847,1646,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Jack','Nice','Easier than a candle. Since Halloween is coming, I always buy a couple of pumpkins for my kids. In the past years, I need to buy a lot of candles cause my kids need to light up the pumpkin men every night. Now, all I need to do is prepare some AAA batteries and hope it will last a month.','','2022-10-13 11:10:15','2022-10-13 11:10:15','1',1),(1848,1646,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Dennis','pumpkin candles','These candles are so handy. Just flip the battery switch and they are on. The candles are small and very bright. My grandson spread them all over my house.','','2022-10-13 11:11:10','2022-10-13 11:11:10','1',1),(1849,1646,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jerry','Perfect','I was confused by the picture & description, but these do have an on & off switch. no timer to my knowledge. I turned one on the day I got them & they are super bright. They have the flicker like a real candle. Definitely worth the money. I turned the one on & have left it on to see how long it lasted. It is still dimly lit 4+ days later. The really bright brightness lasted about 24 hours, a decent amount of brightness still at 48.','','2022-10-13 11:11:59','2022-10-13 11:11:59','1',1),(1850,1646,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Carolyn','good value and nice and bright','the title says it all and will make another purchase','','2022-10-13 11:12:39','2022-10-13 11:12:39','1',1),(1851,1646,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Janet','Just right!','These little tealights are just perfect for that extra little bit of decorating and light. They came ready to use and are a perfect size. They are durable and the battery life was great! We were able to place them all over our haunted house and they worked great!!!!','','2022-10-13 11:13:32','2022-10-13 11:13:32','1',1),(1852,1646,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Catherine','Love how bright they are','I wish they had a timer function or remote control. However, I’m very happy with them. I put them in my “boo” house. So cute. I’m not sure about batteries yet, but they are very bright. Brighter than other battery votives that I have had. Very satisfied','','2022-10-13 11:14:19','2022-10-13 11:14:19','1',1),(1853,1646,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Maria','very cute','These will be so much fun for Autumn and Halloween! I gave half of my order to my granddaughter for her house.','','2022-10-13 11:15:00','2022-10-13 11:15:00','1',1),(1854,1646,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Heather',' Very bright & cute','VERY CUTE little lights. Very bright for how small they are & they are well made (not flimsy plastic','','2022-10-13 11:15:35','2022-10-13 11:15:35','1',1),(1855,1647,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Tyler','Better than expected','I liked the costume and was pleased to find out that it came so quickly. Decent costume for Halloween. I would remind buyers to consider their own size before buying, it is a size fits that is okay for most adults. But if you\'re 16 and quite slender like I was at the time, then it is very baggy on you.','','2022-10-14 05:19:47','2022-10-14 05:19:47','1',1),(1856,1647,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Aaron','Complete suit mid-range','for what needed it for it was awesome. the gloves were...NOT THERE but I didn\'t need them anyway\r\ngreat costume...used it 5 times now','','2022-10-14 05:21:05','2022-10-14 05:21:05','1',1),(1857,1647,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jose','Nice jacket and shirt','I am going as Harley Quinn and bought the Joker Deluxe to wear for my husband. Everything people say in the review same is true. I am happy with it as a one-day Halloween costume.','','2022-10-14 05:22:07','2022-10-14 05:22:07','1',1),(1858,1647,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Adam','The jacket was a perfect fit, enough to look great','I\'m about 6\'5\", 260lbs and this actually fit me pretty well.','','2022-10-14 05:22:50','2022-10-14 05:22:50','1',1),(1859,1647,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Nathan','Awesome product, looks brilliant and is just fantastic','Did the trick. Liked the price. Fit well and looked pretty good. ','','2022-10-14 05:23:31','2022-10-14 05:23:31','1',1),(1860,1647,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Diane','Great quality and value for money for the price','It’s not the best quality but for the price it’s quite ok','','2022-10-14 05:24:13','2022-10-14 05:24:13','1',1),(1861,1647,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ruth','Five Stars','Very good considering the low price','','2022-10-14 05:24:53','2022-10-14 05:24:53','1',1),(1862,1647,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Julie','Not bad at all','Everything but the mask was great. The clothing itself looked good, it was comfortable','','2022-10-14 05:33:55','2022-10-14 05:33:55','1',1),(1863,1647,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Olivia','Outfit was good','Everything was good','','2022-10-14 05:34:34','2022-10-14 05:34:34','1',1),(1864,1647,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Joyce','good value','ties on the vest seem a little short for the size but works','','2022-10-14 05:43:18','2022-10-14 05:43:18','1',1),(1865,1648,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sean','lots of light','\r\nI just finished changing out 72 of the old 60-watt yellow incandescent light bulbs at the church that I\'m a member of! The following picture I posted is what the church looked like after changing the lights to the new LED Energetic 12 Pack 60-Watt Dimmable LED Chandelier Light Bulb, 500lm, 5000K Daylight CA11 Filament LED Candlelight Bulb, E12 Base, CRI 90+, UL Listed. I can actually see the song books after changing the lights! Went from 4,320 watts with the old yellow incandescent bulbs too 360 watts new LED Lights!','','2022-10-14 06:15:32','2022-10-14 06:15:32','1',1),(1866,1648,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Austin','Luminous','Love that they come in a large pack. Look pretty in my chandelier','','2022-10-14 06:16:16','2022-10-14 06:16:16','1',1),(1867,1648,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Carl','Brighter than i thought','The 2 front ones are the new bulbs and man are they bright. I was concerned I got the wrong ones, but they fit perfectly.','','2022-10-14 06:46:37','2022-10-14 06:46:37','1',1),(1868,1648,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Arthur','Good value','Just put them in, look good and seems pretty bright.','','2022-10-14 06:47:45','2022-10-14 06:47:45','1',1),(1869,1648,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lawrence','Perfect with dimmer + tip on removing the writing','These bulbs work perfectly with a dimmer - zero flickering and are so smooth. This was my second time purchasing and replacing 18 bulbs in my dining room in one go, so this time decided to rub off the ugly writing on the bulbs. First started rubbing off one by one, which was harder than I thought it should be. Halfway through, I figured out a trick. Soak a paper towel with enough alcohol, and then wrap the writing portion of the bulb with the towel. Then, after a minute, the writing just wipes off! No rubbing is required. Great bulbs - my first batch in other parts of the house is still going strong 3+ years in.','','2022-10-14 06:49:38','2022-10-14 06:49:38','1',1),(1870,1648,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Teresa','Great quality and lighting','Did not see the black text on the bulbs and am impressed with how it looks compared to traditional incandescent bulbs.','','2022-10-14 06:50:23','2022-10-14 06:50:23','1',1),(1871,1648,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ann','Black lettering Solution!!','For those commenting that the black writing around the base of the glass bulb detracts from their beautiful shape, you can solve the issue. I just removed (effortlessly) the black writing by using a fingernail polish remover that contains acetone. Dap a little of remover on a cotton ball and wipe the letters around the light bulb. It doesn’t damage the bulb!','','2022-10-14 06:51:20','2022-10-14 06:51:20','1',1),(1872,1648,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sara','WOW Amazing deal!!!','Finally found a reasonably priced LED replacement for the classic incandescent chandelier bulb. Much better looking than the LED chandelier bulbs with the bottom third covered in plastic! Love the fact that they are daylight! They work with my existing dimmer. The 16-bulb chandelier is so bright works great and set to a minimum on the dimmer! The price is AMAZING!!! Like $1.50 per bulb including tax. Less than 1/3 of the price from other manufacturers!','','2022-10-14 06:52:54','2022-10-14 06:52:54','1',1),(1873,1648,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Madison','Just as Beautiful as a Flame Candelabra, Really Beat Incandescent Bulbs','These look so much more like real candelabra than my old incandescent bulbs did. They also dim perfectly, with no flashing or blinking, and give a fantastic mood at lower brightness levels. Since they are LEDs, they also use less energy and emit noticeably less heat than incandescent do. This especially matters as we have 15 bulbs in our dining room chandelier, and it would make the whole room hot in summer (no kidding).','','2022-10-14 06:54:21','2022-10-14 06:54:21','1',1),(1874,1648,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Frances','So far so good','They look really nice and stylized; I don’t care about the black print of the name on the bulbs- it’s not noticeable in a chandelier so who cares.\r\n\r\nThe brightness is as advertised and the value for the 12pack is well worth it.\r\n\r\nI actually changed to these from GEENI smart bulbs because those damned things are WAY too unreliable. Kept disconnecting from me.\r\n\r\nHappy with my purchase so far. I’ll update the review if the bulbs die prematurely','','2022-10-14 06:55:45','2022-10-14 06:55:45','1',1),(1875,1649,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Dylan','Nice garland','I wrapped the garlands around my front door pots. Worked great. I do wish they had timers so I wouldn\'t have to turn them on and off. Otherwise, I am happy with them.','','2022-10-14 07:24:05','2022-10-14 07:24:05','1',1),(1876,1649,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jesse','Best thing to brighten up my mom\'s ASSITED living apartment','Awesome choice for Halloween','','2022-10-14 07:24:52','2022-10-14 07:24:52','1',1),(1877,1649,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jordan','Very nice-looking leaves ','The leaves look very nice on the mantle','','2022-10-14 07:25:46','2022-10-14 07:25:46','1',1),(1878,1649,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Bryan','Perfect','Bought these for Thanksgiving decor. I placed them on the fireplace hearth. They were perfect without the lights. With the lights it was amazing. Worth it!','','2022-10-14 07:26:30','2022-10-14 07:26:30','1',1),(1879,1649,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Billy','Very Pretty!','Perfect for the time between Halloween and Christmas. The leaves look pretty and light my walkway well.','','2022-10-14 07:27:16','2022-10-14 07:27:16','1',1),(1880,1649,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Kathryn',' Fall is here!','It looks great on my mantle. Bringing fall colors into my home.','','2022-10-14 07:29:40','2022-10-14 07:29:40','1',1),(1881,1649,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Janice',' Very nice','The product arrived quickly and well-packed. Very\r\nFull and festive. The only downfall is I wish the battery pack had a timer ','','2022-10-14 07:30:37','2022-10-14 07:30:37','1',1),(1882,1649,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jean','great garland','Very generous foliage, beautifully colored, lights are sized just right (tiny) and have perfect brightness!','','2022-10-14 07:31:44','2022-10-14 07:31:44','1',1),(1883,1649,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Abigail',' Perfecto','Excellent product, well presented & durable. Highly recommend sparking the season in the home.','','2022-10-14 07:32:33','2022-10-14 07:32:33','1',1),(1884,1649,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Alice','Very Pretty!','The lights are bright and through the fall leaves, very colorful. I have them around my front door for Halloween and plan to keep them up for Thanksgiving. Sturdy and the fall leaves are full enough that they do not appear skimpy. Very happy with this purchase.','','2022-10-14 07:33:18','2022-10-14 07:33:18','1',1),(1885,1650,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Joe','beautiful','Beautiful, happy with purchase','','2022-10-14 07:50:31','2022-10-14 07:50:31','1',1),(1886,1650,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Bruce','Excellent Chain!','Really pleased with the quality, packaging, and weight. Will buy again from the supplier!','','2022-10-14 07:51:19','2022-10-14 07:51:19','1',1),(1887,1650,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Gabriel','Very nice','Needed to be a little longer for me. But was good for making for others','','2022-10-14 07:52:35','2022-10-14 07:52:35','1',1),(1888,1650,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Logan','product was exactly what I needed for a project.','I used this product in a jewelry repair and have kept the remaining ones for future projects.','','2022-10-14 07:53:12','2022-10-14 07:53:12','1',1),(1889,1650,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Albert','Great dainty','Only purchased because the price was right, and they are beautiful dainty chains','','2022-10-14 07:53:48','2022-10-14 07:53:48','1',1),(1890,1650,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Julia','Worth the $$','These are great chains for jewelry. They come individually packaged so you don\'t have to worry about tangles','','2022-10-14 07:54:29','2022-10-14 07:54:29','1',1),(1891,1650,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Judy','Would Recommend to Anyone!!','Can’t believe 30 chains for £8.99!!\r\nI thought surely, they can’t be any good, but they are the best chains I’d ever purchased for my business.\r\nWill 100% be buying again!!','','2022-10-14 07:55:28','2022-10-14 07:55:28','1',1),(1892,1650,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sophia','The best ever!!','I have been using these for my business for over a year, have purchased them over 5 times, and have never ever had any issues. They’re great quality and in the 6 months I’ve had one on my neck every day, it has never tarnished after this long. They’re the best purchase I’ve ever made','','2022-10-14 07:56:49','2022-10-14 07:56:49','1',1),(1893,1650,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Grace','Exactly as described','I love these so much, I\'ve bought them multiple times. They\'re sturdy and I\'ve only had 1 that was broken. 1 out of 150 isn\'t bad. I highly recommend these.','','2022-10-14 07:57:38','2022-10-14 07:57:38','1',1),(1894,1650,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Denise','Surprisingly amazing!','I bought these in hopes I can use them if I ever accidentally break a chain/ get a knot that’s too terrible to undo. And these are perfect! I was skeptical at first about how the quality would be, but I love them! I highly recommend','','2022-10-14 08:00:04','2022-10-14 08:00:04','1',1),(1895,1651,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Willie','Nice costume for the price','Nice costume for the price. I didn’t realize it didn’t come with the glove','','2022-10-14 09:11:05','2022-10-14 09:11:05','1',1),(1896,1651,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Alan','This is okay','This will work. The mask is terrible, but I actually bought this for the \"sweater\" which is thin nylon, polyester feel top','','2022-10-14 09:12:08','2022-10-14 09:12:08','1',1),(1897,1651,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Juan','Good, I\'d order again from here...','Awesome','','2022-10-14 09:12:56','2022-10-14 09:12:56','1',1),(1898,1651,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wayne','it does the job','The cloth is made from a simple polyester so don’t expect something fancy, it does the job for a cosplay. The mask is cheap stuff of course.','','2022-10-14 09:13:41','2022-10-14 09:13:41','1',1),(1899,1651,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Elijah',' Four Stars','Very good thank you.','','2022-10-14 09:14:17','2022-10-14 09:14:17','1',1),(1900,1651,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Amber','My 17-year-old is in heaven.','The shirt has a tie back at the neck so even my 240-pound son can wear this shirt and be comfortable. It is a bit thin so he will wear a shirt under it.','','2022-10-14 09:15:35','2022-10-14 09:15:35','1',1),(1901,1651,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Doris','Satisfied Son','My son loved the costume for Halloween. It came with a mask and shirt, as described. It came on time, as I ordered on Tuesday to get it on Friday.','','2022-10-14 09:16:16','2022-10-14 09:16:16','1',1),(1902,1651,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Marilyn','Great Costume','This costume was better quality than I expected. It was perfect for a tweens costume for Halloween. It has also held up well with three boys.','','2022-10-14 09:17:04','2022-10-14 09:17:04','1',1),(1903,1651,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Danielle','Trick or Treat','Hit of the party','','2022-10-14 09:17:46','2022-10-14 09:17:46','1',1),(1904,1651,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Beverly','Exactly what I wanted','The amazing costume you get what you pay for awesome','','2022-10-14 09:18:45','2022-10-14 09:18:45','1',1),(1905,1653,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Randy','Halloween bats!','I loved them... we will see how well the adhesive holds but on a side note','','2022-10-14 09:44:12','2022-10-14 09:44:12','1',1),(1906,1653,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Roy','I love these bats','These are so cute! They have a matte finish and stick on easily. I got a LOT of use out of just one pack. The adhesive leaves residue on walls but if you just run your finger over it, it will ball up and fall off. Highly doubt it’s strong enough to remove any paint.','','2022-10-14 09:45:06','2022-10-14 09:45:06','1',1),(1907,1653,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Vincent','Really nice bat decor','I put some of these around my apartment for Halloween decor and some just for keeps','','2022-10-14 09:46:00','2022-10-14 09:46:00','1',1),(1908,1653,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ralph','Bats','Love this','','2022-10-14 09:49:26','2022-10-14 09:49:26','1',1),(1909,1653,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Eugene','Good For my indoor Halloween Project','Good for what I wanted them for on my indoor Halloween project. ','','2022-10-14 09:50:17','2022-10-14 09:50:17','1',1),(1910,1653,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Isabella',' Nice','The bats are nice, they looked good with my Halloween decoration.','','2022-10-14 09:51:12','2022-10-14 09:51:12','1',1),(1911,1653,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Theresa','Fun Decorations','Work really well and I love the variety you get in the pack. My only issue is that I had a hard time getting the adhesive off of my walls.','','2022-10-14 09:51:59','2022-10-14 09:51:59','1',1),(1912,1653,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Diana','So cute','These bats are a great easy way to decorate any space and make it a little spooky. I wasn\'t crazy about the adhesive that came with them, so I just used tape.','','2022-10-14 09:54:14','2022-10-14 09:54:14','1',1),(1913,1653,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Natalie',' Great addition to Halloween decor','Received a large package of bat stickers, and come with a lot of double-sided adhesives, the bats look thick and durable, can be reused, super valuable for the money! These bat stickers can be used almost everywhere! The different sizes look amazing!','','2022-10-14 09:55:25','2022-10-14 09:55:25','1',1),(1914,1653,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Brittany','Best bat decor I\'ve ever purchased','High-quality bat! Would purchase again definitely. A few have fallen off the wall but different adhesive other than what was provided would fix that.','','2022-10-14 09:56:14','2022-10-14 09:56:14','1',1),(1915,1654,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Russell','Realistic Raven','I had so much fun using this for Halloween decor. After I unboxed it and turned the corner with it to show my husband, he completely freaked out. It was hilarious! I used it on top of a prop near my jack-o-lantern. It is durable and didn\'t shed any feathers. I\'ll be using this for many seasons to come','','2022-10-14 10:56:51','2022-10-14 10:56:51','1',1),(1916,1654,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Bobby','received on time and as expected','Worked for my Halloween project','','2022-10-14 10:57:30','2022-10-14 10:57:30','1',1),(1917,1654,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Mason',' Beautiful and realistic','I love it! It\'s large and detailed. Perfect Halloween decoration','','2022-10-14 10:58:08','2022-10-14 10:58:08','1',1),(1918,1654,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Philip','good','Sturdy Halloween decoration. ','','2022-10-14 10:58:43','2022-10-14 10:58:43','1',1),(1919,1654,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Louis','The crow is nice','I love it','','2022-10-14 11:00:31','2022-10-14 11:00:31','1',1),(1920,1654,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Charlotte','Polyresin Crow','Realistic crow. Will make a great Halloween decoration.','','2022-10-14 11:01:39','2022-10-14 11:01:39','1',1),(1921,1654,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Marie','This turned out to be so pretty!','Sparkly and fun this little guy is really a cute little thing. I think it is a great buy.','','2022-10-14 11:02:33','2022-10-14 11:02:33','1',1),(1922,1654,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Kayla',' Kids gift','She loves it','','2022-10-14 11:03:07','2022-10-14 11:03:07','1',1),(1923,1654,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Alexis','Looks real!','I love it around Halloween!','','2022-10-14 11:04:09','2022-10-14 11:04:09','1',1),(1924,1654,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lori','Is excellent for building a Mur der','If you\'re like me I\'d like to hyperfocus on different activities this is great for your next bird watching endeavor trying to get a murder in your yard, use this bird and a crucial you\'re good to go','','2022-10-14 11:05:08','2022-10-14 11:05:08','1',1),(1925,1655,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Oliver','Nice!','Work just fine','','2022-10-14 11:26:11','2022-10-14 11:26:11','1',1),(1926,1655,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Jake','Too scary for Grandkids','My grandchildren were ages 1 and 3 this past Halloween. The clings were easy to use and cute, but a little scary for my Grands.','','2022-10-14 11:27:10','2022-10-14 11:27:10','1',1),(1927,1655,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Noah','Wash your windows before!',' We got these for our office to get ready for the holidays. At first, they all started to fall off then we realized the windows and glass had literally never been cleaned. So, we cleaned the class and wiped down the stickies, and reapplied and they’ve stayed on for 5 days now! Comes with a lot.','','2022-10-14 11:28:50','2022-10-14 11:28:50','1',1),(1928,1655,NULL,0,5,0,5,'James','Great variety and quality for the cost, much better than what is at the super market','Great variety and quality for the cost, much better than what is at the supermarket.','','2022-10-14 11:29:52','2022-10-14 11:29:52','1',1),(1929,1655,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jack','Great','Great','','2022-10-14 11:30:30','2022-10-14 11:30:30','1',1),(1930,1655,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Connor ','Beautiful','Got these for at work and my boss has raved about them every morning! Love them','','2022-10-14 11:31:18','2022-10-14 11:31:18','1',1),(1931,1655,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Liam','very pretty on the windows',' I put these and another brand that was a bit more delicately cut design, on the windows for Christmas. I mixed the two sets to get more diversity. you might have an occasional snowflake fall but then stick right back on again. no glue just static cling.','','2022-10-14 11:32:21','2022-10-14 11:32:21','1',1),(1932,1655,NULL,0,5,0,5,'John','Great value!','8.These clings were a great value and generally very pretty! They were cut well, very little effort needed to separate the cling from the plastic edges. They aren\'t the highest quality plastic, but for the price, I have no complaints. They should keep them for next year, though they weren\'t a huge investment either way. Some of the patterns are a little wacky, had to ignore the 8-sided snowflakes, but I have plenty of ones to choose from since I\'m a snowflake purist.','','2022-10-14 11:33:12','2022-10-14 11:33:12','1',1),(1933,1655,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Harry','Very pretty decals!','We put these decals all over our office - on the outside surface of our back door window, panes in the office doors, on beveled glass surfaces in the office, and on mirrors in the bathrooms. There are many different designs and sizes of snowflakes. They do best on a totally flat surface, but stayed up pretty well, even on beveled glass. I would recommend these to anyone.','','2022-10-14 11:34:12','2022-10-14 11:34:12','1',1),(1934,1655,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Callum',' Very Good, I am impressed!','It is easy to peel and clings to the window. I am happy with this product. I have used it on the outside and it is holding fine. I am impressed! The only comment I have, it would have been better if the base paper would be a different color than white to make the peeling even better.','','2022-10-14 11:34:56','2022-10-14 11:34:56','1',1),(1935,1672,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Li','Worth buying it','Good product ','','2022-10-15 08:12:46','2022-10-15 08:12:46','1',1),(1936,1672,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Smith','Good ','Its quite good for Halloween ','','2022-10-15 08:13:23','2022-10-15 08:13:23','1',1),(1937,1672,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jones','Buy it!','I can say that I am not feeling regret to buy it','','2022-10-15 08:14:19','2022-10-15 08:14:19','1',1),(1938,1672,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wilson','Fantastic ','It\'s really amazing and looks so creepy ','','2022-10-15 08:14:58','2022-10-15 08:14:58','1',1),(1939,1672,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Lam','Good product ','Good product ','','2022-10-15 08:15:29','2022-10-15 08:15:29','1',1),(1940,1672,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Williams ','Spooky ','It\'s really spooky that my daughter got scared ','','2022-10-15 08:16:30','2022-10-15 08:16:30','1',1),(1941,1672,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Martin','Very creepy ','Very creepy and good for Halloween ','','2022-10-15 08:17:13','2022-10-15 08:17:13','1',1),(1942,1672,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Brown ','Fancy ','It\'s perfect for Halloween ','','2022-10-15 08:17:52','2022-10-15 08:17:52','1',1),(1943,1672,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Gelbero','Buy it!','I recommend!!!','','2022-10-15 08:18:16','2022-10-15 08:18:16','1',1),(1944,1672,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Roy','Four star','Four star ','','2022-10-15 08:18:49','2022-10-15 08:18:49','1',1),(1945,1672,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Taylor','Good ','It\'s really good in affordable price ','','2022-10-15 08:19:26','2022-10-15 08:19:26','1',1),(1946,1672,NULL,0,5,0,5,