 say they are really stain resistant, not sure if it\'s because they\'re so colorful or if it\'s the fabric but with 3 kittens and 4 kids plus friends I can\'t see a stain that we\'ll stained. I hope they have a Christmas collection because I will be first to order.','','2022-10-17 05:43:14','2022-10-17 05:43:14','1',1),(1957,1657,NULL,0,5,0,5,' Olivia','Beautiful and durable Halloween Pillow covers','These pillow covers were very soft, and the colors were quite vivid. They washed well without the colors fading or shrinking. Will definitely purchase pillow covers from this company again.','','2022-10-17 05:44:00','2022-10-17 05:44:00','1',1),(1958,1657,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Samantha','Awesome covers',' I enjoyed these pillowcases immensely. The quality and feel are great for the price, especially including how many come in this pack.','','2022-10-17 05:44:39','2022-10-17 05:44:39','1',1),(1959,1657,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Patricia','Well-made and perfect for our needs!',' I love that there was a nice variety of prints, and the price can\'t be beaten! Delivered on time and in perfect condition.','','2022-10-17 05:45:43','2022-10-17 05:45:43','1',1),(1960,1657,NULL,0,5,0,5,' Isla ','Spooky','They\'re very soft, nice for the holidays! The material is an animal hair magnet! They included a free big dead bug in the packaging...\r\nAfter washing them I will say they look very cute! The pillows were a bit hard to stuff in because the zipper is small, but you can stuff them in.','','2022-10-17 05:47:52','2022-10-17 05:47:52','1',1),(1961,1657,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Bethany','Love!!','These have been the best pillow covers I\'ve ever bought! So much better than the usual linen and there has been no pilling! Definitely recommend!!!','','2022-10-17 05:48:56','2022-10-17 05:48:56','1',1),(1962,1657,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sophia','Beautiful graphics','These covers are beautiful! The fabric is soft fabric, and I prefer the burlap sack cloth…. but the colors are vibrant and beautiful!','','2022-10-17 05:49:48','2022-10-17 05:49:48','1',1),(1963,1658,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jack','My toddler’s favorite stuffed animal','I originally bought this as a Halloween decoration for the couch, but my toddler has since claimed it as his own! It’s pretty cute and well made.','','2022-10-17 06:24:27','2022-10-17 06:24:27','1',1),(1964,1658,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Ella','The Biggest Fuzzy Spider!','My three-year-old decided he needed to be a spider in a spider web for Halloween this year. This spider backpack is PERFECT for that purpose and loads of creative activities and plays later. The legs are VERY long and adjustable. My son\'s smile is ear to ear over this fuzzy woozy spider!','','2022-10-17 06:25:36','2022-10-17 06:25:36','1',1),(1965,1658,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Grayson','Made great Halloween costume','My son decided to be a spider, so I purchased this, loved the fact that the string was adjustable.','','2022-10-17 06:26:23','2022-10-17 06:26:23','1',1),(1966,1658,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Scarlett','Good deal for the $$','I bought this for my granddaughter for Halloween to supplement her costume and it turned out really cute. She added spider eyes to a black hoodie and spider feet. She loved it. The spider\'s arms are long enough that they can wrap around, and you can bend them in different positions. It comes with straps that you can tighten. I also have a large spider web, so I plan to use the spider next year at Trunk or Treat.','','2022-10-17 06:27:15','2022-10-17 06:27:15','1',1),(1967,1658,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Carter',' fun costume addition','this thing is HUGE! We wrapped my 5 yr. old up in the spiderweb stuff and put this on his back like a backpack--to make him into a spider\'s nest. It lasted the whole night--even with him running, bouncing, and bumping into things with his legs. I had to tighten up the straps every so often, but it held up well! It\'s lightweight and HUGE like I said- We wrapped it around the light fixture over the dining room table for decoration. Money well spent :-)','','2022-10-17 06:28:38','2022-10-17 06:28:38','1',1),(1968,1658,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Hazel','have used for past 2 years and still holding strong','my 4-year-old constantly plays with it, and it still holds strong.','','2022-10-17 06:29:34','2022-10-17 06:29:34','1',1),(1969,1658,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Hudson','Better for decoration','This is a giant, fuzzy spider that\'s great for Halloween decoration but wasn\'t suitable for wearing on my son as he was terrified! So, it passed the test of a scary spider for sure!','','2022-10-17 06:30:17','2022-10-17 06:30:17','1',1),(1970,1658,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Willow','Daughter loves it!','My daughter is a spider for Halloween, and this is working great for her legs, and she loves the look and size of it!','','2022-10-17 06:30:58','2022-10-17 06:30:58','1',1),(1971,1658,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Madison','Very cute','Very cute and big.\r\nWorth the money','','2022-10-17 06:31:35','2022-10-17 06:31:35','1',1),(1972,1658,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Maverick','Love this spider!','This spider is great, and I love the price!! We are using it for a Halloween costume but it’s also great for decorating. The legs are long and bendable.','','2022-10-17 06:32:13','2022-10-17 06:32:13','1',1),(1973,1659,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jaxon','Perfect Halloween decor','This cauldron was just what I needed for my Halloween project. Not too big and seems to be pretty sturdy.','','2022-10-17 07:20:46','2022-10-17 07:20:46','1',1),(1974,1659,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Addison','My FAVORITE new Halloween item!!','This cute cauldron is my favorite new Halloween addition. It fits our discussed perfectly!!! Love it!','','2022-10-17 07:21:28','2022-10-17 07:21:28','1',1),(1975,1659,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Waylon','Not for Liquids!','Looks great! Was hoping to use this as a punch/potion bowl, but there’s a hole at the bottom! Really only suitable for holding candy','','2022-10-17 07:22:14','2022-10-17 07:22:14','1',1),(1976,1659,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Alice','Cool','Made my perfect cauldron','','2022-10-17 07:22:52','2022-10-17 07:22:52','1',1),(1977,1659,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Colton','Perfect planter','Purchased this cauldron for my kiddo to plant their zombie seeds in. It’s perfect for our aesthetic. It’s a perfect size too.','','2022-10-17 07:23:42','2022-10-17 07:23:42','1',1),(1978,1659,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Hailey','This has a whole at the bottom!','I would give it a 5-star but I bought it so I could put water in it. There is a hole in the bottom of it. Most likely people are buying this to put candy in it but if you are putting water don\'t do it, I had to hot glue the hole','','2022-10-17 07:24:38','2022-10-17 07:24:38','1',1),(1979,1659,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Landon','Little black cauldron perfect for Halloween cosplay.','I needed a solo black cauldron for my Halloween costume \'22. This was the best one I saw for the price. I 10/10 recommend it, it is sturdy, plastic, and lightweight.','','2022-10-17 07:25:49','2022-10-17 07:25:49','1',1),(1980,1659,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Hunter','Pretty good','It\'s hard to find a good quality cauldron that you probably use once for Halloween, this one is one of those few ones, it\'s big enough for a nice decoration and pretty sturdy. Would buy it again.','','2022-10-17 07:26:43','2022-10-17 07:26:43','1',1),(1981,1659,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Christian','Hole in the bottom','It’s fine. Small. Will work for a window display Halloween decoration. I wish I looked into it more because I’m going to use this with the mister thing to do a smokey cauldron but there’s a hole in the bottom. I’ll seal it or figure out a different solution for holding water, but it would have been nice to not have to do that Haha.','','2022-10-17 07:27:37','2022-10-17 07:27:37','1',1),(1982,1659,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Audrey','Cute and practical','Probably could have gotten this item in the store much cheaper if I waited for Halloween time. However, I\'m using it for a certain purpose. It\'s a decent size and very sturdy. Overall, I\'m satisfied with this product even though I spent a little extra money.','','2022-10-17 07:28:20','2022-10-17 07:28:20','1',1),(1983,1660,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Brooklyn','Better than I thought','These are perfect! About half an inch thick and very sturdy! I will by more if they have different signs','','2022-10-17 07:51:30','2022-10-17 07:51:30','1',1),(1984,1660,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Charlie',' Very well made and perfect size','Perfect for dining table, Mante or even small entertainment center','','2022-10-17 07:52:34','2022-10-17 07:52:34','1',1),(1985,1660,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jaxson',' Nicer than the picture.','These wooden centerpiece signs are really nice! To see them in person makes a big difference. They are well-made, sparkly, shiny, and very vibrant in color. They will add festivity on display for Thanksgiving. I\'d recommend buying them for anyone interested.','','2022-10-17 07:53:25','2022-10-17 07:53:25','1',1),(1986,1660,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Kingston','Great signs','These wooden signs are very nice. In my first shipment, one of the signs was broken, but I was able to get a quick replacement. The next shipment was all good and enjoyed having them up for Thanksgiving month.','','2022-10-17 07:54:26','2022-10-17 07:54:26','1',1),(1987,1660,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Sadie','Very Nice Signs','Overall, very pleased with the signs - they are easy to store away too. Sturdy and bright colors. It\'s a nice way to decorate indoors without having too much work.','','2022-10-17 07:55:08','2022-10-17 07:55:08','1',1),(1988,1660,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Weston','Beautiful signs','I love them. I wish they had been double-sided. I had to put two together so there would be a visual on both sides of my display.','','2022-10-17 07:55:58','2022-10-17 07:55:58','1',1),(1989,1660,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Piper','Adorable Decor','These are absolutely adorable. They are bigger than I expected and of great quality. I can\'t wait to put them out for Thanksgiving!','','2022-10-17 07:56:41','2022-10-17 07:56:41','1',1),(1990,1660,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Parker','Pretty and a great price','They look beautiful on my counter which is decorated for the harvest season. I\'m glad I made this purchase. A great value!','','2022-10-17 07:57:27','2022-10-17 07:57:27','1',1),(1991,1660,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Bryson','Spicing up the season with these signs!','These were a real surprise. They’re much larger than I expected. Very colorful, festive, & sturdy!','','2022-10-17 07:58:01','2022-10-17 07:58:01','1',1),(1992,1660,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Brooks','These are pretty!','These are great for the price! I would have paid more for these!','','2022-10-17 07:58:40','2022-10-17 07:58:40','1',1),(1993,1661,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wesley','Very well made. Loved it!','The web stretches really long. The spiders come with it, and they stay on the web so good. I would buy this again for sure.','','2022-10-17 09:42:46','2022-10-17 09:42:46','1',1),(1994,1661,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Emmett','Awesome','Worked fantastically! Will be buying two packets next year - fantastic stuff, really easy to design a scary yard with!','','2022-10-17 09:43:25','2022-10-17 09:43:25','1',1),(1995,1661,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Hadley','Will buy again','Beautiful product and description were exactly as the product!! Very happy with the price!! Definitely purchasing again!','','2022-10-17 09:44:14','2022-10-17 09:44:14','1',1),(1996,1661,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ayden',' Love it','So stretchy. Love it. Scored many trees with one pack.','','2022-10-17 09:44:51','2022-10-17 09:44:51','1',1),(1997,1661,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Josephine','Great Stuff!','This was a great value and the spiders included were Great plus they had little hooks on the back that make them easy to attach the only thing that was hard was spearing the layers and stretching it but other than that it was great and looks real.','','2022-10-17 09:45:40','2022-10-17 09:45:40','1',1),(1998,1661,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ryleigh','Great Product!','Wanted to give this a try since it was so affordable and seemed like a great overall product. :) I was very impressed; the quality of the web is great and has lots of spread and length so you can put it all over the door or windows of your house.','','2022-10-17 09:46:34','2022-10-17 09:46:34','1',1),(1999,1661,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Parker','Useful, Quality Product Arrived as Described','My daughters love it :)','','2022-10-17 09:47:04','2022-10-17 09:47:04','1',1),(2000,1661,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Summer',' Very Stretchy!','One bag covered the area better than 3 of the grocery store kind I usually get. It does come in a strip, as others rated poorly, but if you know how to work the material it’s great!','','2022-10-17 09:48:06','2022-10-17 09:48:06','1',1),(2001,1661,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Bentley',' Pretty legit','High-quality fake webbing. When it came time to them down, had found numerous spiders had taken up residence in it.','','2022-10-17 09:48:46','2022-10-17 09:48:46','1',1),(2002,1661,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Arabella','Spiderman would approve!','Not much to expect from fake webbing, but this was a good buy! Lots of material and stands in rain Well!','','2022-10-17 09:49:24','2022-10-17 09:49:24','1',1),(2003,1662,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wade','They\'re well-made and we\'ll painted','Great value for the $$ super happy with them did not expect them to be so nice so ty!!! Very satisfied!!! I will recommend and buy more! :)','','2022-10-17 10:29:02','2022-10-17 10:29:02','1',1),(2004,1662,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dave','Very cute','These are very cute and will look perfect on my Halloween tree.','','2022-10-17 10:29:41','2022-10-17 10:29:41','1',1),(2005,1662,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Seth ','Very nice Halloween Ornaments','Super nice quality and well-made ornaments. Its great attention to detail and looks wonderful hanging from the tree. Add some black crows and you have a truly spooky Halloween tree. Love these, very reasonable at price, Highly Recommend them!','','2022-10-17 10:30:53','2022-10-17 10:30:53','1',1),(2006,1662,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ivan ','Very Satisfied!','These ornaments are very well-made, and imaginative and look great on our Halloween tree. Would definitely buy it again.','','2022-10-17 10:31:38','2022-10-17 10:31:38','1',1),(2007,1662,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Riley ',' Very cute and fun','Nice