ostly good','Decent decoration fillers for outside. Would buy it again.','','2022-10-18 05:40:11','2022-10-18 05:40:11','1',1),(2027,1664,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Julian','Pretty cool','Great value!','','2022-10-18 05:40:57','2022-10-18 05:40:57','1',1),(2028,1664,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Aidan ','Fast ship',' Its a great price just was hoping for them to be a little bit bigger. But oh well they work.','','2022-10-18 05:42:02','2022-10-18 05:42:02','1',1),(2029,1664,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Harold','They hang easy',' They are fun and spooky. The kids love them.','','2022-10-18 05:43:16','2022-10-18 05:43:16','1',1),(2030,1664,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Conner ','Good deal','I have nothing to complain about the Grim Reapers. I did not expect the Grim Reaper to exude “warmth” ...','','2022-10-18 05:44:16','2022-10-18 05:44:16','1',1),(2031,1664,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Peter ','I would purchase again',' I think they are a great item for the cost! Mine are hung Up now inside and are super cute','','2022-10-18 05:44:58','2022-10-18 05:44:58','1',1),(2032,1664,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Hunter','Definitely buy','Cute for Halloween decor','','2022-10-18 05:45:34','2022-10-18 05:45:34','1',1),(2033,1665,NULL,0,5,0,5,'JOHNSON ','Creepy cloth','These will be perfect for my Halloween party. They should hold up for a few years of use (indoors). Like others have said, they are easier to deal with than the spider web stuff. There\'s not much else that can be said about them.','','2022-10-18 06:28:25','2022-10-18 06:28:25','1',1),(2034,1665,NULL,0,5,0,5,'WILLIAMS','Halloween fun time',' Easier to hang than the cotton spider webs. Really creates a dramatic look for Halloween. This is reusable and will hold up for many years over and over again. Love the look and vibe it gives.\r\n','','2022-10-18 06:29:15','2022-10-18 06:29:15','1',1),(2035,1665,NULL,0,5,0,5,' BROWN','Perfect for a variety of decorative or a spooky display',' I have several of these clothes I will be using for my Halloween party! Versatile item and I love it.','','2022-10-18 06:30:07','2022-10-18 06:30:07','1',1),(2036,1665,NULL,0,4,0,5,'JONES','Spooky Spooky','Not too much to say here. These are nice \"tattered cloth\" sheets that you can drape around the house or yard for a spooky Halloween effect. I like these so much more than that fake spider web cotton stuff that you drape in places because you won\'t spend the next 3 months trying to get it all out of whatever you attached it to. These hold up outside even in the rain, though you should let them dry completely before storing them if you want to make them reusable.','','2022-10-18 06:31:03','2022-10-18 06:31:03','1',1),(2037,1665,NULL,0,5,0,5,' GARCIA ','Thin and creepy!','These sheets are very thin, but it adds to their creepiness of them. It’s almost like a bit of webbing. It was very easy to separate the sheets and then drive them over things for an easy creepy Halloween look','','2022-10-18 06:31:53','2022-10-18 06:31:53','1',1),(2038,1665,NULL,0,4,0,5,' MILLER',' Creepy Gauze...',' The black gauze is exactly what I need to help achieve the graveyard look I\'m going for this year. The 5 separate pieces are large and cover a good-sized area (in my case, it covers the entire porch railing of our Park Model camper).','','2022-10-18 06:32:46','2022-10-18 06:32:46','1',0),(2039,1665,NULL,0,5,0,5,' MILLER','Creepy Gauze...','The black gauze is exactly what I need to help achieve the graveyard look I\'m going for this year. ','','2022-10-18 06:33:55','2022-10-18 06:33:55','1',1),(2040,1665,NULL,0,5,0,5,' DAVIS',' Love the black!','Spooky black fabric, excellent quality material. ','','2022-10-18 06:34:28','2022-10-18 06:34:28','1',1),(2041,1665,NULL,0,4,0,5,' RODRIGUEZ ','Spooky','So amazing for the spooky season!\r\nInexpensive and great quality easy to work with.\r\nYou can really customize it and manipulate the cloth with rips and runs.','','2022-10-18 06:35:09','2022-10-18 06:35:09','1',1),(2042,1665,NULL,0,5,0,5,' MARTINEZ','An easy decoration that goes a long way','The blood stains are very light, almost pinkish in color, however, if used well, you can cover a lot of space with these pretty easily.','','2022-10-18 06:35:40','2022-10-18 06:35:40','1',1),(2043,1665,NULL,0,5,0,5,' HERNANDEZ','Awesome!','These were awesome for my Halloween Decor. The colors were perfect. They seem a little fragile but have kept up well with Chicago weather.','','2022-10-18 06:36:26','2022-10-18 06:36:26','1',1),(2044,1666,NULL,0,5,0,5,' LOPEZ','Strong & Thick, Easy to Place, Stay in Place Well. The Grand Kids Approve! Fun Halloween Decor','These Glow in the Dark Evil Eyes Halloween Stickers are pretty cool. When I first saw them on the two sheets of paper, I was thinking, \"Okay, these are okay.\" However, when I tried them on the wall and hit them with a flashlight beam for a few minutes, THEN I could really see how cool they are. I tried three out in the hallway, but I\'m going to put the rest of them somewhere where they will get lots of light all day and then glow even brighter and longer. They are easy to work with and placed on the wall, thick and plastic, not thin paper. These are also a hit with the grandkids, who noticed they were \"being watched\" right away! A fun addition to our Halloween decor!!','','2022-10-18 07:12:20','2022-10-18 07:12:20','1',1),(2045,1666,NULL,0,5,0,5,'GONZALEZ ','Easy to remove','The eyes worked great! They got sunlight most of the day and glowed brightly at night. I put them on a dark green wall in between white birch tree decals I had put up last Christmas... it looked terrific!\r\n','','2022-10-18 07:13:19','2022-10-18 07:13:19','1',1),(2046,1666,NULL,0,4,0,5,' WILSON','Fun Project','I purchased this for me and my 4-year-old to do. It was a lot of fun and honestly came with everything we needed. No trouble with anything not working, no broken pieces, really no complaints. We spent maybe an hour putting everything together and then we hung them up as our Halloween decorations. It was fun and cute. I recommend this :)','','2022-10-18 07:14:22','2022-10-18 07:14:22','1',1),(2047,1666,NULL,0,5,0,5,' ANDERSON','Overall Good','Overall, very nice stickers but don\'t really glow much. Still, look nice though, and are of nice quality.','','2022-10-18 07:15:15','2022-10-18 07:15:15','1',1),(2048,1666,NULL,0,5,0,5,'THOMAS ','Great product','My daughter loved these. They stick well and last a long time.','','2022-10-18 07:15:47','2022-10-18 07:15:47','1',1),(2049,1666,NULL,0,5,0,5,'TAYLOR','Easy and enjoyable Halloween craft','This was a great Halloween craft! My 3-year-old was able to easily makes tons of faces and designs. They were all peel and stick and we went through all of them in a couple of days and hung them around the house.','','2022-10-18 07:16:35','2022-10-18 07:16:35','1',1),(2050,1666,NULL,0,5,0,5,' MOORE','The children loved making these','My students loved making these. Quick craft when time is limited. They are big and easy to do. Worth the money. I usually end up buying a variety of materials and cutting different eye shapes and mouths out of foam. I teach twenty-five 4-5-year-olds to create jack-o-lanterns, very time-consuming. It almost costs me the same shopping at Michaels\'s craft stores. I bought 2 sets. Enough for all!','','2022-10-18 07:17:39','2022-10-18 07:17:39','1',1),(2051,1666,NULL,0,5,0,5,'JACKSON ','Super cute',' I like the idea of having the kids use their fingers more often. I think watching her little fingers move around is such a fun thing. I got this DIY kit for my 2-year-old girl. These are cute and colorful. She loved it. I was feeling great to see her picking up the diamond with her little fingers and putting it on the foam. Happy with how well she is doing.','','2022-10-18 07:18:40','2022-10-18 07:18:40','1',1),(2052,1666,NULL,0,5,0,5,' MARTIN','Cute and easy',' Very cute. Easy for a 3 4- or 5-year-old to make. I made these with my Grandson, and then he hid them in the cupboards so when his parents opened a cupboard, they had a cute little creature staring at them. Fun little activity!','','2022-10-18 07:19:30','2022-10-18 07:19:30','1',1),(2053,1666,NULL,0,5,0,5,'LEE ','great craft for kids!','my grandkids loved this!! it gave them a lot of fun I just wish it had more stickers with it!','','2022-10-18 07:20:15','2022-10-18 07:20:15','1',1),(2054,1667,NULL,0,5,0,5,'PEREZ ','The whole family can use it, great, scary and fun','These were great, my husband got scared that I really jammed a nail through my finger lol. The only issue was that one of them had a missing piece that holds it in place. I can try putting crazy glue to help secure it in place. Otherwise, everything else works great and at a good price.','','2022-10-18 10:43:53','2022-10-18 10:43:53','1',1),(2055,1667,NULL,0,5,0,5,'THOMPSON',' Fun',' it seemed to take longer to get than I thought.','','2022-10-18 10:45:00','2022-10-18 10:45:00','1',1),(2056,1667,NULL,0,5,0,5,'WHITE ','Just awesome!','These are perfect.','','2022-10-18 10:45:31','2022-10-18 10:45:31','1',1),(2057,1667,NULL,0,5,0,5,' HARRIS ','GREAT Party Favors!',' Birthday Party. Friday 13th themed!','','2022-10-18 10:46:13','2022-10-18 10:46:13','1',1),(2058,1667,NULL,0,5,0,5,' SANCHEZ','So realistic',' I love this it\'s so realistic. I have to put it up every time I take it all, just in case so my three-year-old won\'t break it. It\'s perfect for a house or office, and my oldest can wear it to school.','','2022-10-18 10:47:09','2022-10-18 10:47:09','1',1),(2059,1667,NULL,0,5,0,5,' CLARK ','good quality','These are awesome! We have had so much fun with them & are going to use them for the haunted garage this year!','','2022-10-18 10:47:43','2022-10-18 10:47:43','1',1),(2060,1667,NULL,0,5,0,5,'RAMIREZ',' Lots of fun stuff',' A lot of fun. Interchangeable parts. The syringe coming out of my head was a big hit on Halloween in the hospital I work in.','','2022-10-18 10:48:22','2022-10-18 10:48:22','1',1),(2061,1667,NULL,0,5,0,5,'LEWIS ','Hilarious','Great grouping and choices','','2022-10-18 10:48:5