ay rings','these rings were perfect for kids\' holiday parties. There were various cute designs','','2022-10-19 06:07:56','2022-10-19 06:07:56','1',1),(2087,1670,NULL,0,5,0,5,'EDWARDS ','good','Kids loved them','','2022-10-19 06:08:41','2022-10-19 06:08:41','1',1),(2088,1670,NULL,0,4,0,5,'COLLINS','They were the hit of the Party','great for goody bags','','2022-10-19 06:09:15','2022-10-19 06:09:15','1',1),(2089,1670,NULL,0,5,0,5,'REYES',' Awesome!','Bought these to go in a prize bucket for me\r\nson’s Halloween party at school. They are super cute and very detailed. They were a huge hit!','','2022-10-19 06:10:06','2022-10-19 06:10:06','1',1),(2090,1670,NULL,0,5,0,5,'STEWART','These were the biggest hit! Next yrs. I’ll buy way more.','Best Halloween treats I gave out…they didn’t care about their ring pops, airheads, etc... they loved the rings. Need to buy a lot more next year!','','2022-10-19 06:11:00','2022-10-19 06:11:00','1',1),(2091,1670,NULL,0,4,0,5,' MORRIS','Nice and bright!','Love these little rings, they fit perfectly on, and the light is bright. Can’t wait to wear these out for Halloween!','','2022-10-19 06:11:40','2022-10-19 06:11:40','1',1),(2092,1671,NULL,0,5,0,5,' MORALES','Cool','I bought these to wear to Lady Gage\'s Chromatics Ball - one hand I covered with clay and made look super cool like bones and claws. I have yet to wear this one to the concert','','2022-10-19 06:36:18','2022-10-19 06:36:18','1',1),(2093,1671,NULL,0,4,0,5,'MURPHY','Decent product for the price!','So, I won\'t buy something unless it has at least 3 reviews I can go off of. This one unfortunately did not have any reviews and I needed something quick and spooky to complete my costume this year! So, I took the chance and spent the $25. I must say, I was pretty skeptical about these but they\'re actually pretty cool! The ensemble was easy, just wish the fingers were marked to indicate which finger they belong to.','','2022-10-19 06:37:40','2022-10-19 06:37:40','1',1),(2094,1671,NULL,0,5,0,5,'COOK','Super cool!!!!',' I am going as Jack Skellington for Halloween.\r\nMy wife is going as Sally and it’s a proper Halloween Ball. So, we want to get it right.\r\nI saw these and my jaw dropped.\r\nThese are articulated and are exactly as advertised.\r\nWithin a few minutes, I had assembled them and was wearing them.\r\nThey are really cool and a lot of fun.\r\nI recommend them. Good bang for the buck.\r\nSo, if you need creepy hand extensions, I recommend these.\r\nBe aware- they are not white but a beige but still close enough.','','2022-10-19 06:38:49','2022-10-19 06:38:49','1',1),(2095,1671,NULL,0,5,0,5,'ROGERS','Awesome spooky claw hands','Love these, they look cool, they work well, and they do require a little bit of assembly because you have to string the elastic yourself, but this allows them to fit your hands just right. The color is off-white/cream, not crisp white. Going to be a really cool addition to the Halloween costume.\r\n','','2022-10-19 06:40:00','2022-10-19 06:40:00','1',1),(2096,1671,NULL,0,5,0,5,'GUTIERREZ','My granddaughter loved them',' The finger puppet toy was for my granddaughter\'s birthday. All the kids liked playing with them. My granddaughter loves them.','','2022-10-19 06:40:50','2022-10-19 06:40:50','1',1),(2097,1671,NULL,0,4,0,5,'ORTIZ','Fingers','I have to say I really love these and have been testing how well they are made. I\'m very pleased.','','2022-10-19 06:41:36','2022-10-19 06:41:36','1',1),(2098,1671,NULL,0,4,0,5,'MORGAN','Medium sized, absolutely awesome',' Medium gloves fit me perfectly. These claws are incredible. Definitely thought they were going to be junky but bought them anyways at the low price point. Yes, they\'re just molded plastic, but they\'re durable and the mechanics are smooth. Thank you, Gary Fay, for your contribution to the Thing verse, but 300 dollars is steep for anything 3D printed for most of us poor folk. If you have smaller hands, wear knit gloves underneath, it makes it super comfy and fits even better.','','2022-10-19 06:42:38','2022-10-19 06:42:38','1',1),(2099,1671,NULL,0,4,0,5,'COOPER','Creepy fingers','Really love being jack skeleton. Little overpriced but really great for costumes. Only for looks not great for functionality.','','2022-10-19 06:43:25','2022-10-19 06:43:25','1',1),(2100,1671,NULL,0,5,0,5,' PETERSON','Great for my dementor costume',' Look great work great.','','2022-10-19 06:43:52','2022-10-19 06:43:52','1',1),(2101,1671,NULL,0,5,0,5,'BAILEY','Wonderful product!',' I can\'t wait to dazzle the parties!!! Love them!','','2022-10-19 06:44:26','2022-10-19 06:44:26','1',1),(2102,1673,NULL,0,4,0,5,'REED','Cute',' Admittedly these decals are super cute','','2022-10-19 07:19:45','2022-10-19 07:19:45','1',1),(2103,1673,NULL,0,5,0,5,'KELLY','Love these!!','Love these for Halloween. Got a lot of compliments already and people thought it was drawn on! Wish they came with more sheets, only comes with three as shown.','','2022-10-19 07:20:30','2022-10-19 07:20:30','1',1),(2104,1673,NULL,0,5,0,5,'HOWARD','Super cute','These are so cute. Can\'t wait to use them','','2022-10-19 07:21:09','2022-10-19 07:21:09','1',1),(2105,1673,NULL,0,5,0,5,' RAMOS','Very cute','These are super cute and add a nice, elegant touch to my gel manicure.','','2022-10-19 07:21:57','2022-10-19 07:21:57','1',1),(2106,1673,NULL,0,5,0,5,'KIM ','Beautiful','Beautiful stickers. Love them! You definitely need a clear coat on top because if you don\'t, the design rubs off.','','2022-10-19 07:22:55','2022-10-19 07:22:55','1',1),(2107,1673,NULL,0,5,0,5,' COX','Great If Applied Properly',' I love the gold, silver, and white aspects of the designs. There are 10 different sheets but double the amount, so you get 20 sheets.','','2022-10-19 07:23:51','2022-10-19 07:23:51','1',1),(2108,1673,NULL,0,4,0,5,' WARD','nice',' good product','','2022-10-19 07:24:25','2022-10-19 07:24:25','1',1),(2109,1673,NULL,0,5,0,5,'RICHARDSON','Pretty good!','Very good and very cute ','','2022-10-19 07:25:03','2022-10-19 07:25:03','1',1),(2110,1673,NULL,0,5,0,5,' WATSON ','Great quality','Packaging is adorable the stickers are great Quality, and it comes with an application tool','','2022-10-19 07:25:44','2022-10-19 07:25:44','1',1),(2111,1673,NULL,0,4,0,5,' CHAVEZ','beautiful',' easy to apply','','2022-10-19 07:26:22','2022-10-19 07:26:22','1',1),(2112,1674,NULL,0,4,0,5,'WOOD','Overall, pretty good','Easy to apply, tips to not get sheerness is to use enough water and really load the brush. I do recommend adding a white or black base underneath the lighter colors and metallics. Only smears/blends with hard pressure or if you touch while drying. The metallics do transfer more than the other colors. if you want to make it last longer, I think setting it with a powder or spray should help. Removes great does stain just a lilt Tho. The metallics do leave a little glitter behind but you can’t really stop that glitter doesn’t like to leave. It also doesn’t crack which is great. ','','2022-10-19 09:46:22','2022-10-19 09:46:22','1',1),(2113,1674,NULL,0,5,0,5,'JAMES','These were great','I was just looking for a set to do some free-will donation face painting at some craft shows for different organizations and as a beginner, these worked great for me. I\'ve tried a few others, and these were the best I tried out of them all','','2022-10-19 09:48:14','2022-10-19 09:48:14','1',1),(2114,1674,NULL,0,5,0,5,'BENNETT','Great!','This is awesome face paint! I highly recommend this for beginners like me. One issue I had was the red stains, but I found a way to fix it so don\'t let that sway you! Just put a little dab of lotion on the spot you are planning to put your red. It also helps with removal! Awesome product! Thank you!','','2022-10-19 09:49:20','2022-10-19 09:49:20','1',1),(2115,1674,NULL,0,5,0,5,'GRAY','Amazing!','This stuff works wonders! It\'s just like a watercolor paint pallet, but it gives a very opaque and easy-to-apply makeup, you can even mix the pigments to get new colors. Goes on easy and doesn\'t leave a residue or cause any itching or discomfort, and it stayed on consistently for over 12 hours (in a sweaty Las Vegas convention), but then washed off with just a simple wet wipe. I think this is a must-have for any cosplayer who travels since it\'s very compact and won\'t cause any TSA trouble in a carry-on bag since it\'s a solid cake of pigment. Cannot recommend it enough, especially for the price. Get some nice soft paintbrushes and you\'re ready to go','','2022-10-19 09:51:18','2022-10-19 09:51:18','1',1),(2116,1674,NULL,0,5,0,5,'MENDOZA','My favorite!!','Of all the face paint I own-this is my FAVORITE!!! Easy to lather up a nice thick color that will stand out and go on well. Usually, it’s a mess finding the perfect water-to-paint ratio needed to activate…with this, I just dipped the brush with water, mixed, and it was good to GO!! It lasts and is easily removed.','','2022-10-19 09:52:22','2022-10-19 09:52:22','1',1),(2117,1674,NULL,0,5,0,5,'RUIZ','Worked wonders!','I used this for a barbeque event, and it worked so well! It was very vibrant and dried nicely, and if I accidentally made a mistake, I could quickly take it off with a water cloth without ruining the rest of the design. I painted around 150 kids and there was still lots of paint left to use again.','','2022-10-19 09:54:06','2022-10-19 09:54:06','1',1),(2118,1674,NULL,0,4,0,5,'HUGHES','100% Worth it!','My daughter is a makeup fanatic, but I don\'t appreciate it on my walls, counters, sinks, etc. that\'s when I decided to look into getting her face paint instead. This one is great if you have the same problem I used to have! Obviously, it still makes a mess, but the cleanup takes me no time at all now as is removed with just water with no harsh cleaners needed!','','2022-10-19 09:55:29','2022-10-19 09:55:29','1',1),(2119,1674,NULL,0,4,0,5,' PRICE ',' Not a bad product','It’s fine, most of the colors are good however the light blue is transparent, just add some white to it and it’s fine,\r\n\r\nThe product is good for kids\' parties easy to use\r\n\r\nValue for money is good','','2022-10-19 09:56:34','2022-10-19 09:56:34','1',1),(2120,1674,NULL,0,5,0,5,'ALVAREZ','IMPRESSIVE!','Wasn’t expecting much, but it delivers!','','2022-10-19 09:57:06','2022-10-19 09:57:06','1',1),(2121,1674,NULL,0,4,0,5,'CASTILLO','Good quality and affordable','I wanted to make a rainbow skull look. So, I used this product, and it came out pretty good in my opinion.','','2022-10-19 09:57:50','2022-10-19 09:57:50','1',1),(2122,1675,NULL,0,4,0,5,'SANDERS','Easy to put on',' Product was easy to use and stayed on better than expected. I wish the colors were more vibrant, but overall, it did its job.','','2022-10-19 10:30:34','2022-10-19 10:30:34','1',1),(2123,1675,NULL,0,5,0,5,' PATEL','Excellent','Excellent','','2022-10-19 10:31:13','2022-10-19 10:31:13','1',1),(2124,1675,NULL,0,4,0,5,'MYERS','Nice face gems',' These are great','','2022-10-19 10:31:49','2022-10-19 10:31:49','1',1),(2125,1675,NULL,0,5,0,5,'LONG','Worked great for a concert!!!','I wore these out to a concert recently and they were amazing!! I did use eyelash adhesive to keep them on over my makeup and it worked like a charm. They stayed on for 14 hours and through all of my sweat! (Definitely use eyelash glue!!). It came off easily and after using makeup remover on the plastic, I can definitely reuse these! The larger designs are one piece of plastic just FYI, but it still looked great! Overall, very pleased!','','2022-10-19 10:32:50','2022-10-19 10:32:50','1',1),(2126,1675,NULL,0,5,0,5,'ROSS','Bought them for Halloween. Got 5 sets for','Was surprised that there were 5 sets in a box. Bought them for Halloween so have not used them yet. Great price for 5 sets. The package did say to use eyelash adhesive to make sure they stay on. Had to buy extra adhesive desperate.','','2022-10-19 10:33:44','2022-10-19 10:33:44','1',1),(2127,1675,NULL,0,5,0,5,'FOSTER ','Super fun and super cute','I loved all the options it comes with. Different patterns and colors. I bought them for San Diego pride and my friends, and I all used them. They were super easy to use but they did end up peeling off throughout the day. I think maybe it was the mixture of the rhinestones being put on, on top of makeup plus sweating from being outside. Maybe for extra grip, you can use eyelash glue.','','2022-10-19 10:34:41','2022-10-19 10:34:41','1',1),(2128,1675,NULL,0,5,0,5,'JIMENEZ ','Great value.',' I wore these embellishments to a carnival theme party. I’m a makeup artist so I was excited to do everyone’s makeup and apply these appliqués to everyone. They were very easy to apply, however, I noticed that they didn’t work well with makeup. A few hours into the night, they started to roll off. That’s the only reason I gave them a 4. Other than that, everything else was perfect.','','2022-10-19 10:35:26','2022-10-19 10:35:26','1',1),(2129,1675,NULL,0,5,0,5,'POWELL','Great Item!','I suggest using these on a clean face. These suck really well on my daughter\'s face that didn\'t have makeup, but they fell off of my face. It was still a great product, and you get several sets for a great price.','','2022-10-19 10:36:16','2022-10-19 10:36:16','1',1),(2130,1675,NULL,0,5,0,5,'JENKINS','Awesome!',' I wore one of the sets so far for a party.\r\nSuper easy to apply and remove.\r\nStayed on my face the whole night.\r\nI haven’t really checked if it was glowing in the dark, but I’ll recommend it anyway','','2022-10-19 10:37:11','2022-10-19 10:37:11','1',1),(2131,1675,NULL,0,5,0,5,' PERRY ','Fun face jewelry!','Fun sticker jewels with pretty colors. Easy to use, but some areas didn\'t want to stick to my face.','','2022-10-19 10:39:06','2022-10-19 10:39:06','1',1),(2132,1676,NULL,0,5,0,5,'RUSSELL','Love them!',' I absolutely love the way they look! They do come a little small, but the metal is easy to bend out to make them fit a little bigger.','','2022-10-19 12:10:45','2022-10-19 12:10:45','1',1),(2