bring me joy.','','2022-10-20 05:53:29','2022-10-20 05:53:29','1',1),(2144,1656,NULL,0,4,0,5,' McDONALD','Cute decorations','Some were bent.... but nice product','','2022-10-20 05:54:23','2022-10-20 05:54:23','1',1),(2145,1656,NULL,0,5,0,5,'WOODS','Cute','These decorations were adorable','','2022-10-20 05:55:09','2022-10-20 05:55:09','1',1),(2146,1656,NULL,0,5,0,5,' WASHINGTON','Adorable decorations',' Super cute and can be folded up and saved for next year!','','2022-10-20 05:55:57','2022-10-20 05:55:57','1',1),(2147,1656,NULL,0,5,0,5,'KENNEDY','Looks great and most importantly is pre-assembled','So cute and loved that it\'s pre-assembled. Made it super easy to put up which is so important when you are already on a time crunch trying to get everything done to prepare for a party. Looked great.','','2022-10-20 05:56:56','2022-10-20 05:56:56','1',1),(2148,1656,NULL,0,5,0,5,'WELLS','Good on walls',' My older children love this. They said they don\'t want to take it down. It is good for parts and forever use up on your wall','','2022-10-20 05:57:40','2022-10-20 05:57:40','1',1),(2149,1656,NULL,0,5,0,5,' VARGAS ','Festive fun garland',' I love this garland! It is festive and eye-catching. I received several compliments. It held up well for the few weeks I had it up in my office.','','2022-10-20 05:58:21','2022-10-20 05:58:21','1',1),(2150,1656,NULL,0,5,0,5,' HENRY ','perfect','cute decors. really make the house feel Halloween-y, perfect for a party','','2022-10-20 05:59:07','2022-10-20 05:59:07','1',1),(2151,1656,NULL,0,5,0,5,' CHEN','Pleasantly surprised',' Super cute!! Much more Tumblr Halloween is aesthetic than I was expecting so I am quite pleased with that as I was concerned, they were going to be more kid\'s Halloween party-Esqueda.','','2022-10-20 06:00:31','2022-10-20 06:00:31','1',1),(2152,1635,NULL,0,5,0,5,' FREEMAN','Good variety and fun',' Good variety. Fun product.','','2022-10-20 06:16:12','2022-10-20 06:16:12','1',1),(2153,1635,NULL,0,5,0,5,'WEBB','Impressive!','These stickers are so much larger than I thought they were and that’s amazing. I can’t wait to stick them on for Halloween decorations.','','2022-10-20 06:17:36','2022-10-20 06:17:36','1',1),(2154,1635,NULL,0,5,0,5,'TUCKER','Highly recommend!!','Great quality. Easy to apply. I stuck them on my windows and garage door. Make sure to clean the surface and they stick on great.','','2022-10-20 06:18:21','2022-10-20 06:18:21','1',1),(2155,1635,NULL,0,5,0,5,'GUZMAN',' Great for the price','Very easy to apply and easy to take off! We live in a high-traffic apartment complex, and they withstood a lot of traffic. The only issue we encountered was that they must be applied to a smooth service so popcorn walls or any type of texture will not stick too well if it all.','','2022-10-20 06:19:47','2022-10-20 06:19:47','1',1),(2156,1635,NULL,0,5,0,5,' BURNS','Awesome decor','These were awesome! I received a lot of compliments about the \"Bloody footprints\" and hands on the wall. The only thing that was tricky was the removal from glass/mirrors or linoleum. It was really hard to get off, but it came off the walls very nicely.','','2022-10-20 06:20:47','2022-10-20 06:20:47','1',1),(2157,1635,NULL,0,5,0,5,'CRAWFORD','Made the party even better','This made the Halloween party I had a pop. It was easy to use and easy to remove.','','2022-10-20 06:21:33','2022-10-20 06:21:33','1',1),(2158,1635,NULL,0,5,0,5,'OLSON','Fun for party\'s','I had a good experience with my purchase. So, fun in the restroom, and pealing is so easy','','2022-10-20 06:22:33','2022-10-20 06:22:33','1',1),(2159,1635,NULL,0,5,0,5,'SIMPSON','Great','Great quality product!','','2022-10-20 06:23:16','2022-10-20 06:23:16','1',1),(2160,1635,NULL,0,5,0,5,' PORTER','Great!',' Great selection of stickers (not clings!)! I put them on our garage doors and loft windows and hours later, I was still able to remove them without issue and stick them to different locations if I wanted to. They are pretty sticky so be careful when you take them off the paper, if part of the sticker touches another they will NOT come apart. Otherwise, love them and they did the job!','','2022-10-20 06:24:11','2022-10-20 06:24:11','1',1),(2161,1635,NULL,0,5,0,5,' HUNTER','love ALL options!','OMG, so inexpensive and you get hands, feet, weapons, blood spatter galore! My house looks amazing!','','2022-10-20 06:25:03','2022-10-20 06:25:03','1',1),(2162,1633,NULL,0,5,0,5,'GORDON','Looks real','Looks real in my window with a light behind it!','','2022-10-20 07:03:16','2022-10-20 07:03:16','1',1),(2163,1633,NULL,0,5,0,5,'MENDEZ',' So cute and easy!','These decals are very easy to use- you can remove them easily and move them around- very toddler friendly, and super cute! They leave no residue and require no work and it changes the spirit of the house instantly, which my small kids love, and easily, which I love!','','2022-10-20 07:04:10','2022-10-20 07:04:10','1',1),(2164,1633,NULL,0,5,0,5,'SILVA','Great Quality & Vibrant','Love it! Exactly as described and packaged perfectly.\r\nVery is to peel and the colors are vibrant.\r\nI plan to use half around my house and the rest at my salon. Will be buying more','','2022-10-20 07:04:53','2022-10-20 07:04:53','1',1),(2165,1633,NULL,0,5,0,5,'SHAW','Best company I\'ve used for window clings!','Love this window clings!','','2022-10-20 07:05:56','2022-10-20 07:05:56','1',1),(2166,1633,NULL,0,5,0,5,'SNYDER','Super cute','I buy fall or Halloween window clings every year because birds fly into our west-facing window this time of year. These were the cutest clings I’ve used. Would definitely buy it again','','2022-10-20 07:06:53','2022-10-20 07:06:53','1',1),(2167,1633,NULL,0,5,0,5,'MASON','Great product!!!','The graphics are awesome on both sides!! Not flimsy like some other brands! Will be buying more!!\r\n','','2022-10-20 07:08:04','2022-10-20 07:08:04','1',1),(2168,1633,NULL,0,5,0,5,' DIXON','big hit in our family','yes, the grandkids loved them, nice size buy two','','2022-10-20 07:09:02','2022-10-20 07:09:02','1',1),(2169,1633,NULL,0,4,0,5,' MUÑOZ','Got it for work and home',' Always a little difficult for me to take off the paper…but once I remembered to wash the windows first, they clung perfectly! My son loves them! Work tomorrow! Awesome price perfect amount!\r\n','','2022-10-20 07:09:48','2022-10-20 07:09:48','1',1),(2170,1633,NULL,0,4,0,5,' HUNT','They\'re cute',' Kids enjoyed putting them up.','','2022-10-20 07:10:52','2022-10-20 07:10:52','1',1),(2171,1633,NULL,0,4,0,5,'HICKS','Cute!',' Super cute! I love how large the stickers get.','','2022-10-20 07:11:29','2022-10-20 07:11:29','1',1),(2172,1652,NULL,0,5,0,5,'HOLMES',' Much better value than average party store','These packages were almost double the amount I got from Party City and had nearly identical material. The fabric takes a bit of work but makes a cool Halloween decoration.\r\n','','2022-10-20 08:15:44','2022-10-20 08:15:44','1',1),(2173,1652,NULL,0,5,0,5,'PALMER','Perfect for Halloween!','This was perfect for decorating for Halloween! I cut it and hung it around our windows and chandelier. Highly recommend!','','2022-10-20 08:16:44','2022-10-20 08:16:44','1',1),(2174,1652,NULL,0,4,0,5,'WAGNER','Fast delivery','My daughter loves these','','2022-10-20 08:17:24','2022-10-20 08:17:24','1',1),(2175,1652,NULL,0,4,0,5,'BLACK','good','good','','2022-10-20 08:18:04','2022-10-20 08:18:04','1',1),(2176,1652,NULL,0,5,0,5,'ROBERTSON','Great Halloween Decoration','Wonderful material, great value, and perfect for Halloween. This will complement my black cloth like this perfectly! There\'s so much material and it\'s the perfect amount of sheer that makes any setting instantly creepy when you put this cloth down. Great price, too!','','2022-10-20 08:19:11','2022-10-20 08:19:11','1',1),(2177,1652,NULL,0,5,0,5,'BOYD','Great for making cobwebs','This \"creepy cloth\" is great for making DIY cobwebs, and because it\'s just a thin mesh fabric, it could potentially be reused. ','','2022-10-20 08:19:50','2022-10-20 08:19:50','1',1),(2178,1652,NULL,0,4,0,5,'ROSE','Works for my purpose',' I had a hanging ghoul/reaper that I got last Halloween that looked pretty good\r\n','','2022-10-20 08:20:31','2022-10-20 08:20:31','1',1),(2179,1652,NULL,0,4,0,5,' STONE','Big!','This is a big piece of cloth! It’s perfect for draping over lights, you can customize the sheerness by folding it over itself or gathering it up with ties. Definitely, a great item to have on hand when creating your Halloween display!\r\n','','2022-10-20 08:21:23','2022-10-20 08:21:23','1',1),(2180,1652,NULL,0,5,0,5,'SALAZAR','Spooky season',' I put this around my projector screen and added some leaves to it. I may end up keeping it up all year! It’s just too awesome!\r\n','','2022-10-20 08:22:04','2022-10-20 08:22:04','1',1),(2181,1652,NULL,0,5,0,5,'FOX',' So easy to use and hang','I was actually a little intimidated by this material at first. I wasn\'t sure if I was going to be able to make it spooky enough, but it\'s actually really easy to work with. Just hang it loosely and change the direction of the material every so often.\r\n\r\nThe other cool part is that the material in the picture was only some of what is included in a pack. The rest I was able to weave over the top of our fireplace mantle to spook it up. We are all set for Halloween!','','2022-10-20 08:23:04','2022-10-20 08:23:04','1',1),(2182,1677,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Copeland','Good quality!','Garland really liked it and bought a size of 2*3 meters by the width of the window. It shines very brightly, there is a remote control that you can change many modes. Battery not included, need CR 2025 battery. You can also change modes with a button on the Garland. Garland shines with bright beautiful flowers, from the minuses it is flimsy thin wires, and taken off you need to care that it would not break. Delivery of the goods was fast; the goods were delivered in three weeks and the parcel was tracked all along the way. The product fully corresponds to the description and picture in the store\'s application. I bought a box with a garland that was very crumpled, and because I bought the goods at a discount, I do not reduce the evaluation. The seller has supplied 5 stars for a good and quality product, and I advise everyone and recommend the store and the seller. ','','2022-10-28 09:15:51','2022-10-28 09:15:51','1',1),(2183,1677,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Davis ','very nice','I ordered 2 sets but 1 string wasn’t working. The seller refunded and was done quickly. The other one works fine and has very nice lights. I am happy with the service, and they corrected it.','','2022-10-28 09:16:47','2022-10-28 09:16:47','1',1),(2184,1677,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dixon','L-O-V-E','Goods is consistent with the description, recommend','','2022-10-28 09:17:19','2022-10-28 09:17:19','1',1),(2185,1677,NULL,0,5,0,5,' Duncan','Beauty','very stunning item, it also has the IR controller without the battery.','','2022-10-28 09:17:53','2022-10-28 09:17:53','1',1),(2186,1677,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Easton ','Nice little light set','Fantastic. Very beautiful. They arrived earlier than stipulated','','2022-10-28 09:18:35','2022-10-28 09:18:35','1',1),(2187,1677,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Finley','These lights are amazing!','Very cool and atmospheric! 8 blinking modes, up to epilepsy. Convenient to eat hooks. Powered by the USB power supply. Does not cling and the tulle does not tear. ','','2022-10-28 09:19:16','2022-10-28 09:19:16','1',1),(2188,1677,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Gibbs','Looks great!','Good item, but the shipping used by the store is the worst. Shipments go to another country long and after so long they send it to the right address. That Shipping from AliExpress Standard Shipping is the worst thing to Costa Rica. Faster it would be for Cainion Super Economy Global, but the seller doesn\'t answer the reasons','','2022-10-28 09:20:15','2022-10-28 09:20:15','1',1),(2189,1677,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Griffin','My granddaughter love them','Garland working, in the remote inserted the battery, also works. The battery is flat. As we hang, I will try to complement the review. On the connector, there is a button on and off. Took with a coupon 3 by 2 meters. The box is a little crumpled ','','2022-10-28 09:20:54','2022-10-28 09:20:54','1',1),(2190,1677,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Hendrix','Lovely','Ordered May. 21 2022. The seller sent the order the next day. On June 24, he took the parcel to the post office. The track was full tracking. At the shipment stage from China to Russia, 3 of my parcels were combined into one and assigned a new track number with full tracking. The completeness of the parcel corresponds to the declared. The vertical part of the Garland is made of a single-wire wire with a parallel strip of LEDs. Ordered 3x2 m, the length did not measure, but it looks like it. LEDs glow all. Total, wires with LED-10. the remote is standard, on a CR2025 battery (not included). Programs work. The timer didn\'t check. Brightness is not adjustable. The button on the Garland driver includes it and consistently changes programs. I did not communicate with the seller. ','','2022-10-28 09:21:47','2022-10-28 09:21:47','1',1),(2191,1677,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Hutton','My daughter loves them!','All great, and well packed, Garland works in all modes. Thank you for your quality products!','','2022-10-28 09:22:28','2022-10-28 09:22:28','1',1),(2192,1678,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Penn','Overall working really well, a little dull but otherwise love them!','Very beautiful garland, quite large, send everything whole. ','','2022-10-28 12:19:14','2022-10-28 12:19:14','1',1),(2193,1678,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sawyer','Every thing is good','Very beautiful Garland! Thank you, I\'m happy. Shipping fast. ','','2022-10-28 12:19:45','2022-10-28 12:19:45','1',1),(2194,1678,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Shaw','Just what I wanted','Well packed. Everything has come. Works. ','','2022-10-28 12:20:13','2022-10-28 12:20:13','1',1),(2195,1678,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Smith ','A charming addition to our campsite','Honestly, I bought these because I needed to buy some small additional things to get free shipping on another order. I figured what the heck, they might be a cute way to add a low-brightness ambient light to our campsite. They really did the job beautifully. The strand was long enough to go around the front and one side of our tent’s “patio cover.” We used little office binder clamps to attach them. They gave off just enough light to let us find our way around, but not so much as to be obnoxious and blinding. We will definitely be packing them on future camping trips.','','2022-10-28 12:21:12','2022-10-28 12:21:12','1',1),(2196,1678,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Stone','Expensive upkeep','These are really awesome lights I just wish they didn\'t go through batteries so fast. Doesn\'t matter the brand of batteries I use they still dim out within a week. They are kept on all night every night and serve as a nightlight. I may have to get a plug-in night light instead.','','2022-10-28 12:21:46','2022-10-28 12:21:46','1',1),(2197,1678,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sullivan ','Perfect for my classroom','I hung these around a small bulletin board in my classroom. Perfect for my space theme! My students really enjoy them','','2022-10-28 12:22:15','2022-10-28 12:22:15','1',1),(2198,1678,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Thompson','Exactly what I wanted!','I purchased these to wrap around the roll bars in my Jeep while we camp in it. They are perfect! Nice warm glow so it doesn’t hurt your eyes but plenty of light to see what you need. ','','2022-10-28 12:22:50','2022-10-28 12:22:50','1',1),(2199,1678,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Walker','Before you hang lights, figure out what the battery case will sit on or be suspended from','Just as good as other fairy or twinkle lights, but a fraction of the cost.','','2022-10-28 12:23:23','2022-10-28 12:23:23','1',1),(2200,1678,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wiley','Great for lighting up a kid\'s lair/fort/hideout','We got a small space under the staircase that can’t fit much of anything for storage. But we transformed it into a great kids\' hideout, Harry Potter style. But there are no plugs or lights in these spaces, so these provided great battery-powered lighting. I used a bunch of small 3M Christmas hooks to hang them and also surrounded the battery pack/switch (see pic) to create a holder for it over the baseboard for easy access to turn it on/off.','','2022-10-28 12:24:20','2022-10-28 12:24:20','1',1),(2201,1678,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wilson','Love them!','I decorate my house with stars and love the different ways to display them.','','2022-10-28 12:24:51','2022-10-28 12:24:51','1',1),(2202,1679,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Adair ','Lighted Christmas ribbon','fast delivery, packing well, beautiful colors, work, nice, I will recommend it, thank you, the seller.','','2022-10-31 06:28:34','2022-10-31 06:28:34','1',1),(2203,1679,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Bardot','Perfect','Not tested yet but complies with the description. Quick reception.','','2022-10-31 06:29:16','2022-10-31 06:29:16','1',1),(2204,1679,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Bailey','Really Pretty Lighted Ribbon','beautiful can\'t wait to decorate my house for Christmas ','','2022-10-31 06:29:56','2022-10-31 06:29:56','1',1),(2205,1679,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Blaine','Very pretty','Great item, and quick delivery too.','','2022-10-31 06:30:35','2022-10-31 06:30:35','1',1),(2206,1679,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Ashley ','As pictured','So if described as very beautiful and clear ','','2022-10-31 06:31:13','2022-10-31 06:31:13','1',1),(2207,1679,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Cameron','Super cute','Very fast delivery. About 1 week. The only thing that\'s made it a little difficult for me to open the box to fit the 3 AA batteries it uses. It didn\'t work out the way. Now to wait to see what he looks like in the tree','','2022-10-31 06:32:04','2022-10-31 06:32:04','1',1),(2208,1679,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Campbell','Incredibly beautiful','Thank you... Excellent ','','2022-10-31 06:32:45','2022-10-31 06:32:45','1',1),(2209,1679,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Delaney','So pretty!','This Christmas ribbon is really nice. There are 32 feet of ribbon so you will have enough for most trees. The lights are LED and very bright. They run on 3 AA batteries which are not included. You could use this lighted ribbon on your tree, around a banister, on a mantle, or around a desk. You could even use it for decorations at a wedding as it has that elegant look.','','2022-10-31 06:33:41','2022-10-31 06:33:41','1',1),(2210,1679,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Ellis','As pictured','I got this ribbon to use on my Christmas tree when it came in I was so curious to see the quality I unwrapped some of the ribbons and I was really impressed it takes two AA batteries and the entirety of the ribbon lights up. I will update this photo when I put my Christmas tree up!!','','2022-10-31 06:34:31','2022-10-31 06:34:31','1',1),(2211,1679,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Emerson','Super cute','Really pretty ribbon for my tree this year! Can\'t wait to put it up. My only complaint is I wish it had a timer function so I don\'t have to turn it on and off all the time. Overall I do really like it though even off.','','2022-10-31 06:35:35','2022-10-31 06:35:35','1',1),(2212,1682,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lincoln','Really Cute!',' I love this star. I am tall so the little switch is easy for me to reach - not sure if someone is shorter. I have only had it for about 10 days so I don\'t know how long the batteries will last yet. I am willing to use batteries for this - it is cute and easy to use','','2022-11-01 10:32:24','2022-11-01 10:32:24','1',1),(2213,1682,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Stone',' Absolutely gorgeous reach look','I love it but the batteries went off in 3 days ... nice look for this price!','','2022-11-01 10:33:07','2022-11-01 10:33:07','1',1),(2214,1682,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ashley','Lighted Christmas Tree Topper',' It is very pretty and thank goodness the batteries lasted as long as they did because the cord is very short, and our tree is very tall. My only suggestion is to attach a longer cord. I plan to use it again next year I think my husband can rig something up. It was inexpensive enough that either way I’m happy with the purchase.','','2022-11-01 10:33:59','2022-11-01 10:33:59','1',1),(2215,1682,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Kennedy','Made my tree look amazing!',' I was nervous when I saw the size of the star, hoping it would not weigh the tree down at the top and it didn’t. I also did not know that it lit up, which made my tree look 10x more amazing. Very happy with my purchase!','','2022-11-01 10:34:50','2022-11-01 10:34:50','1',1),(2216,1682,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Rowan','Pretty but could use more lights',' I wish their cord was a little more discreet and that there were a few more lights inside, but otherwise a pretty tree topper','','2022-11-01 10:35:24','2022-11-01 10:35:24','1',1),(2217,1682,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Riley','Pretty Star but no remote','In order to turn it off you must reach up to the top of the tree.','','2022-11-01 10:36:04','2022-11-01 10:36:04','1',1),(2218,1682,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ethan','It\'ll do','I liked it, just wish it had more lights in the star','','2022-11-01 10:36:40','2022-11-01 10:36:40','1',1),(2219,1682,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Julian','Perfect addition to our decor!','The last star topper we had was a pain. This one went on very easily and is nice and bright. Shipped quickly and works great.','','2022-11-01 10:37:16','2022-11-01 10:37:16','1',1),(2220,1682,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aaron','Very pretty','Love the look but smells like oil or gasoline.','','2022-11-01 10:37:49','2022-11-01 10:37:49','1',1),(2221,1682,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Joey','Twinkly and sparkly','This star looks very sparkly, even without turning it in. Beautiful tree topper!','','2022-11-01 10:38:25','2022-11-01 10:38:25','1',1),(2222,1690,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jennings','Love these!','The order came to St. Petersburg in 10 days. Excellent garlands, packed very well. I will wait for the new year and check them in. Many thanks to the seller for the gift) ','','2022-11-02 12:18:49','2022-11-02 12:18:49','1',1),(2223,1690,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jones','Totally Worth It','Garland is cool, everything works. Came in time with two separate parcels. The seller put a gift)','','