nd endurable.','','2022-11-17 07:54:40','2022-11-17 07:54:40','1',1),(2233,1680,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Garcia','Pop of Happy','Added pillows to outdoor living space to give some added color to our taupe furniture. Very welcoming!','','2022-11-17 07:55:35','2022-11-17 07:55:35','1',1),(2234,1680,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Harlow','Cute farmhouse print for spring',' Great value for the price. Fabric is durable but a little rough, but not an issue for me. The zippered opening is a little challenge to get the pillow stuffed into, but works. Very cute!','','2022-11-17 07:56:19','2022-11-17 07:56:19','1',1),(2235,1680,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Harper ','They are vibrant and add more joy to your decor! Mine Anyways lol','44. I actually bought pillow inserts to go inside these covers and I\'m using them for my Spring decor throughout my front room Furniture!','','2022-11-17 07:56:50','2022-11-17 07:56:50','1',1),(2236,1680,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Kennedy ','Good Quality',' The product has a very good color and seems to be of a good, durable quality.','','2022-11-17 07:57:28','2022-11-17 07:57:28','1',1),(2237,1680,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Kim','Just as Pictured!','The pillows look just like the picture. The colors were not faded. They look really nice on my porch!','','2022-11-17 07:58:04','2022-11-17 07:58:04','1',1),(2238,1680,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Langley',' Extremely good',' Highly recommend','','2022-11-17 07:58:36','2022-11-17 07:58:36','1',1),(2239,1680,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Luna','Nice pillow covers','They are really well made we have only had them for a couple of days but so far really happy with them','','2022-11-17 07:59:15','2022-11-17 07:59:15','1',1),(2240,1680,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Madigan','Love them!',' Love them but didn’t receive four different ones! Missing the trees! The zipper doesn’t go all the way across so be careful when stuffing in the pillow - one did rip but you can’t really tell.','','2022-11-17 07:59:50','2022-11-17 07:59:50','1',1),(2241,1680,NULL,0,4,0,5,'McKenna','Nice','It has a great design and fit, not soft as I wish!','','2022-11-17 08:00:34','2022-11-17 08:00:34','1',1),(2242,1720,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Graham',' Quite pleased','Delivery was a bit too long but finally, it came on time. ','','2022-11-17 10:05:25','2022-11-17 10:05:25','1',1),(2243,1720,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ellie','Great quality','Great dress, super cute, and great quality. I was worried it would be really thin and cheap, but it’s a nice, thick woven sweater dress. The tulle on the bottom is thick and sewn in very well. I did not; however, like the tulle around the wrists. I thought it looked really odd and hung over my daughter’s hand. It was very easy to pick the sticking and remove them.','','2022-11-17 10:06:27','2022-11-17 10:06:27','1',1),(2244,1720,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Bennett','Gorgeous and so warm',' We own three of these dresses. Each one is a little different in material, but I personally adore them. They look like a dress on my little one, they don’t look like a top. I never put them in the dryer, never, but I do wash them in the regular setting and hang them to dry and so far they have all kept their shape.\r\nI am planning on buying more colors and I wish they made them for adults. So feminine and warm for the horrible winters.\r\nGreat purchase in my opinion.','','2022-11-17 10:08:40','2022-11-17 10:08:40','1',1),(2245,1720,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Beckett','Great quality!','Only taking a star off because the head hole is a little small. It did come off a little easier than it went on and the second time she wore it it wasn\'t as bad. overall this is a great sweater that fit my daughter really well. She did say the material at the ends of the arms is a little scratchy but she only complained once. She is 4 and tiny if that helps!','','2022-11-17 10:09:20','2022-11-17 10:09:20','1',1),(2246,1720,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Jane','Adorable dress, Gray is Gray no lavender',' The gray color looks as if it has a lavender tone to it in the advertised picture. I bought lavender shoes for my daughter in anticipation of this. Not disappointed though, as the dress is so soft, and beautiful and fits my daughter perfectly. The lavender shoes still match, just something to be aware of.','','2022-11-17 10:10:04','2022-11-17 10:10:04','1',1),(2247,1720,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Madison','Good buy!',' It looks really cute! Quality is good, could be My niece is skinny and short so this did fit true to size. However, it is a fitted style, so I get why some may say it’s snug or too small. This item can be worn as a sweater or a dress on her. It’s pretty thick like outerwear for a calm winter night, so she didn’t need to wear another sweater/jacket. Her mom paired it with some leggings and boots. Delivery was on time and the dress was packaged in a plastic Ziploc bag. I’d buy it again.','','2022-11-17 10:10:45','2022-11-17 10:10:45','1',1),(2248,1720,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Juliet',' Buy it!','This is absolutely adorable! We got it for my daughter for Valentine\'s day and it was perfect. Would definitely buy it again!','','2022-11-17 10:11:32','2022-11-17 10:11:32','1',1),(2249,1720,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Cleo',' Beautiful sweater',' Beautiful sweater dress, great quality and hefty too! I ordered the gray thinking the chiffon ruffle on the bottom will be light blue..it is not blue it’s a dark gray but still nice so I kept it. The only con is the chiffon at bottom of the sleeve can get annoying as it is a bit too long but that may be according to your child’s size as well. Preferably without the chiffon on the sleeve but that’s my opinion\r\nThe value is a steal! Would recommend','','2022-11-17 10:12:28','2022-11-17 10:12:28','1',1),(2250,1720,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Madeline','Cute and well made','Adorable. Runs a little large, but that’s fine bc she’ll get longer wear out of it.','','2022-11-17 10:13:02','2022-11-17 10:13:02','1',1),(2251,1720,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Harper','Very cute',' Bought for my 2-year-old. It’s kind of large and stretchy but so cute.','','2022-11-17 10:13:38','2022-11-17 10:13:38','1',1),(2252,1717,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Oakley ','Nice','A bit small, but very nice...of note you can\'t put a lot of pressure on the part to press, my kid, broke one when she pressed it a bit hard, it doesn\'t seem flimsy but also not super sturdy if u have young kids using it','','2022-11-17 10:55:41','2022-11-17 10:55:41','1',1),(2253,1717,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Brooke ','easy to use','nothing wrong','','2022-11-17 10:56:19','2022-11-17 10:56:19','1',1),(2254,1717,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Heath','Great for playdoh','My son wanted to make dinosaurs out of playdoh. These work great! I highly recommend them. The cutter is separate from the stamp part, so you can just stamp or cut and stamp as you need.','','2022-11-17 10:56:57','2022-11-17 10:56:57','1',1),(2255,1717,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Auden',' SOOO CUTE','Obsessed with these cutters. The stampers make life so easy! I used them to make cute unicorn-themed sandwiches for my daughter\'s lunch','','2022-11-17 10:57:33','2022-11-17 10:57:33','1',1),(2256,1717,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Marlowe','Perfect for Playdough Playtime!','I bought this set to use for playdough cutouts at my library\'s summer reading program\'s shark party. They were sturdy and fun for the kids to use. The kids loved the option of cutting out a shape, making an impression, or both. They were easy to clean afterward and I expect we\'ll use them many times for this purpose in the future. Highly recommended!','','2022-11-17 10:58:21','2022-11-17 10:58:21','1',1),(2257,1717,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Kinsley','Sensory play',' I used them for sensory play with playdough. They are great and easy to use. 100% approved by a 3-year-old toddler.','','2022-11-17 10:59:00','2022-11-17 10:59:00','1',1),(2258,1717,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Reign','They are very easy to use and clean with just soap and water',' I\'m making them for my Granddaughter\'s 2 nd Birthday.\r\nI\'m very happy with these cutters and will buy the sea creature ones for fun.','','2022-11-17 10:59:40','2022-11-17 10:59:40','1',1),(2259,1717,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Reed',' LOVE these!','I\'m using these for my business to make gluten-free \'Animal Cookies. They are really cute, well-made, and easy to re-press if I found the image not as imprinted as I like. The cookie dough came out of the pressed image easily enough (just use your flour generously on the imprint part) and cleaned easily. Love them and am getting lots of compliments!','','2022-11-17 11:01:11','2022-11-17 11:01:11','1',1),(2260,1717,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Foster ','Grandson loves these','My grandson loves to bake with me, but cookie cutters with details always stick. You also have to make them thick to see the details. These two-part cutters are so much easier to use! I will be looking for more like these. They are also the perfect size for a toddler snack, not too big.','','2022-11-17 11:01:50','2022-11-17 11:01:50','1',1),(2261,1717,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Avery','Cute!','These are great! They make good size cookies (not too small, not too large). They do a good job of stamping the picture into the cookies and they\'re very cute!\r\n','','2022-11-17 11:02:26','2022-11-17 11:02:26','1',1),(2262,1718,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Romilly','Beautiful','I love this cup, it is beautiful and will be used all year round','','2022-11-18 06:23:56','2022-11-18 06:23:56','1',1),(2263,1718,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Rosie','Cutest mug!',' Adorable mug, great quality!','','2022-11-18 06:24:27','2022-11-18 06:24:27','1',1),(2264,1718,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Easton','Unique!','Cup is gorgeous and large, a full gift really beautiful!','','2022-11-18 06:25:11','2022-11-18 06:25:11','1',1),(2265,1718,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Barnaby','Love these mugs','It\'s beautiful, and it came very well protected so it wouldn\'t break up in transportation. ','','2022-11-18 06:25:48','2022-11-18 06:25:48','1',1),(2266,1718,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Robin','perfect Xmas mug','Really happy with my purchase (ordered 2) So glad I bought these to enjoy a cup of Joe, eggnog, and hot choco for the holidays!!!! Cup only holds 8oz (def pre make coffee with added creamer in another larger cup then pour it into this mug). I bought it for aesthetics ',