022-11-18 07:49:01','2022-11-18 07:49:01','1',1),(2277,1716,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Sophia ','good',' Easy to make multiples for projects. ','','2022-11-18 07:49:34','2022-11-18 07:49:34','1',1),(2278,1716,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Isabella ','Love these molds!',' I used these molds ','','2022-11-18 07:50:03','2022-11-18 07:50:03','1',1),(2279,1716,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Mia ','Amazing little molds',' These little molds are high quality and quite well made.','','2022-11-18 07:50:40','2022-11-18 07:50:40','1',1),(2280,1716,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Evelyn','Holiday awesomeness','Loves these for my collection','','2022-11-18 07:51:11','2022-11-18 07:51:11','1',1),(2281,1716,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Harper','Super cute',' Loved them!! Recommend!!','','2022-11-18 07:51:44','2022-11-18 07:51:44','1',1),(2282,1715,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sunny',' Perfect',' They are exactly what I wanted.','','2022-11-18 08:12:24','2022-11-18 08:12:24','1',1),(2283,1715,NULL,0,4,0,5,'River ','Big enough for making ',' I made ','','2022-11-18 08:13:33','2022-11-18 08:13:33','1',1),(2284,1715,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Remington','Great!','These are really nice\r\nI made Hot Cocoa Bombs. They are plenty big where you don\'t need double sides. I put a flat chocolate square on the back and just cut around the shape.\r\nI painted with colored chocolate where it needed different colors. Some are a little difficult to get the Chocolate in all the small areas without spilling out. But it just takes patience. Of course who makes Coco bombs like this? Lol peeling the mold off is easy but do it very slowly if you have a thin layer of chocolate.\r\nRice Krispy treats were easy as well, put them in warm and peel the mold off.\r\nThe best way I found to use all molds is to cut them into single ones.','','2022-11-18 08:14:43','2022-11-18 08:14:43','1',1),(2285,1715,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Gray ','Came fast easy to use','Great product','','2022-11-18 08:15:15','2022-11-18 08:15:15','1',1),(2286,1715,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wade','Great holiday molds!','Nicely defined holiday molds give you lots of options for making memorable holiday treats and fun decorating projects for children. Easy to work with and clean.','','2022-11-18 08:16:29','2022-11-18 08:16:29','1',1),(2287,1715,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Walker',' Good Value','Very impressed with the quality. I can not wait to use them on my Christmas baking.','','2022-11-18 08:24:30','2022-11-18 08:24:30','1',1),(2288,1715,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Ned ','christmas vibed','it’s a little hard but cute','','2022-11-18 08:25:04','2022-11-18 08:25:04','1',1),(2289,1715,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Blue','Very good product','This will work very well','','2022-11-18 08:25:40','2022-11-18 08:25:40','1',1),(2290,1715,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jenna',' Good quality molds and easy to use!',' Great molds! They\'re stiff enough that they don\'t flop around and leak if ever you need to move it while there\'s something cooling in them, but they\'re still soft enough that whatever you have in there pops right out. ','','2022-11-18 08:26:13','2022-11-18 08:26:13','1',1),(2291,1715,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Tatum','Flexible','Haven\'t used this yet but looks like it\'s very flexible....will update it.\r\n','','2022-11-18 08:26:49','2022-11-18 08:26:49','1',1),(2292,1714,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Preston','Amazing product','Really incredible. Honestly, it worked so much better than I thought it would. The only reason it got a 4/5 was that I couldn’t find many instructions on how to use it, and it was hard to push the cookies off of the device. But it’s pretty quick to learn and the last one was resolved as we pushed it with wooden chopsticks lol. But I used this to make Strawberry jammed Linzer Cookies with my dad and little sister. And honestly, it was such a fun and exciting activity that all 3 of us enjoyed, and plan to do again. It was just amazing and the assembly is fairly easy. I will be taking this to college with me for making cookies with friends (I graduated this year).','','2022-11-18 09:31:09','2022-11-18 09:31:09','1',1),(2293,1714,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Faith','Great results',' I love the uniformity of the cutter. It was very easy to use. The inner cutter is held in by two plastic flaps. I worry that it may break some day if used too much. But for now, I look forward to using it.','','2022-11-18 09:31:54','2022-11-18 09:31:54','1',1),(2294,1714,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Edgar',' Easy to use and made beautiful cookies!','These were great! Really good size, variety of shapes, and is so easy to use. I wanted to try making Linzer cookies for a long time and finally decided to for Valentine’s Day. A few tips - I made the dough off an online recipe and took time to make sure the dough was chilled and rolled out evenly (I measured 1/4” with a ruler). I used nonstick spray on the cookie cutter to make sure the little shape and big circle were easier to get out. Other reviews said it was cheap and fell apart, and it did not do that for me at all. It’s a little fragile, if you messed with it too much it would break like anything else but when used properly it was great! The shape inserted into the circle made it so quick and easy, and then you can push the cookie out of the cutter which helped keep the scalloped edge nice and even. Again, use nonstick spray on the cutter to help with the center shape removal. If you take the time to do all of the above, your cookies will turn out great, too. It’s a good price and I was pleasantly surprised. Would recommend it!!','','2022-11-18 09:33:25','2022-11-18 09:33:25','1',1),(2295,1714,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Kate',' Love em work great','Work well','','2022-11-18 09:34:15','2022-11-18 09:34:15','1',1),(2296,1714,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Legend','Have gratefully received this','I have yet to use it but am thrilled it is in my home ready for use. I feel it is well made and will make a nice sharp cut in the dough. I did not know such a set was available. I bake a lot and handle a lot of different dough so am sure, sure I will be pleased. I ordered it too late for Christmas, but it can be used all year, especially for special events. Now I want to use it today, but it is snowing out, so no trip to the store for raspberry filling. Will add to this soon when I put it to work.','','2022-11-18 09:35:06','2022-11-18 09:35:06','1',1),(2297,1714,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lyle','No other tool can make them so perfect','Creating Linzers the tastiest cookies','','2022-11-18 09:35:43','2022-11-18 09:35:43','1',1),(2298,1714,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Araminta','Easy to use','My cookies look so professional','','2022-11-18 09:36:16','2022-11-18 09:36:16','1',1),(2299,1714,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Josie','My cookies look so professional',' I like this cookie-cutter set. I\'ve recently retired and have some time on my hands and so have been getting into baking.\r\nThis set performed exactly like it was supposed to. It just took me a little while to develop my technique but that was no fault of the set. When I take the time to make these cookies they come out beautifully.','','2022-11-18 09:37:04','2022-11-18 09:37:04','1',1),(2300,1714,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Clay','Superb','My mum loves them.','','2022-11-18 09:37:38','2022-11-18 09:37:38','1',1),(2301,1714,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Waylon','Ok','Ok','','2022-11-18 09:37:57','2022-11-18 09:37:57','1',1),(2302,1713,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dorothy ','Cuts good','Perfect for Christmas cookies','','2022-11-18 10:10:12','2022-11-18 10:10:12','1',1),(2303,1713,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ford ','Perfect for gifting fudge!',' I purchased these specifically to gift various fudge flavors. They worked perfectly for that. The bags were an even bigger bonus- the pre-glued flaps were so convenient and I ended up using those more than the twist-tie ones. Will purchase it again next year!','','2022-11-18 10:11:11','2022-11-18 10:11:11','1',1),(2304,1713,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Harris','Perfect size','We are in love with these cookie cutters! They are perfect for cookies to decorate and salt dough Christmas ornaments!','','2022-11-18 10:11:50','2022-11-18 10:11:50','1',1),(2305,1713,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Augustine','Great cutters, Requires the right recipe','The cutters work fine. I just need to find a sugar cookie recipe that doesn\'t rise. The \"slots\" filled in and made a mess trying to open them up again. No recipe on the box... Suggestions?','','2022-11-18 10:12:29','2022-11-18 10:12:29','1',1),(2306,1713,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Anne','Love these Cookie Cutters!','These are just perfect to enhance my gingerbread house for Christmas. My house is kinda small, and these cutters are the perfect size for making additions to my gingerbread house scene. Can\'t wait for December!!','','2022-11-18 10:13:20','2022-11-18 10:13:20','1',1),(2307,1713,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Azalea','Small but cute','These were easier to put together than the gingerbread house after cutting the pieces out. Grandkids have fun making trees and snowmen and deer. They are durable enough. Looked cute under a domed glass cake plate sitting in the (icing) snow.','','2022-11-18 10:13:55','2022-11-18 10:13:55','1',1),(2308,1713,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wilfred','These are awesome',' I made cookies this Christmas and these were the cutest cookies ever. A bit awkward and hard to get out of the cutter, I sprayed them with a bit of oil and kept the dough cold. perfect!','','2022-11-18 10:14:43','2022-11-18 10:14:43','1',1),(2309,1713,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Lane','Tricky at first, but very nice',' Tricky to find the right cookie batter to make them at first. Used regular Betty crockery sugar cookie mix and followed directions for cutouts. Make sure to chill the dough for quite a bit of time. After you cut them, separate them a punch them out a little bit to avoid them closing together too much during cooking.','','2022-11-18 10:15:33','2022-11-18 10:15:33','1',1),(2310,1713,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Huxley','Buy it!','3-D cookie cutters are such a great idea! I had so much fun mixing up my usual Christmas cookie cutters with these. Very easy to use. Be sure to use a dough that doesn’t expand that much while baking, to ensure the pieces fit together. They’ll make an adorable me presentation for my Christmas party','','2022-11-18 10:16:11','2022-11-18 10:16:11','1',1),(2311,1713,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Warren','Super cute and very affordable!!','We got these as a gift for my mom and she made our kids 3D cookies to decorate. They came out SO cute! Some didn’t fit together as well as others but it was a really easy fix to shave a little off to make them work. Overall, we are very satisfied!!','','2022-11-18 10:16:52','2022-11-18 10:16:52','1',1),(2312,1712,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Stefan','Would buy again',' The material feels high quality and is easy to cut with scissors. Looks great on gifts!','','2022-11-18 10:48:25','2022-11-18 10:48:25','1',1),(2313,1712,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Robin ','Excellent quality',' It is a beautiful, high-quality ribbon. Can\'t wait to use it!','','2022-11-18 10:49:02','2022-11-18 10:49:02','1',1),(2314,1712,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Clarence','Best Christmas grosgrain ribbon for the money',' I buy this particular roll of ribbon every year for Christmas. The value is outstanding and it looks beautiful on packages.','','2022-11-18 10:49:41','2022-11-18 10:49:41','1',1),(2315,1712,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sandy','Good Looking Ribbon',' I like the red Merry Christmas ribbon a lot. Looks smart and perfect for what I need it for.','','2022-11-18 10:50:26','2022-11-18 10:50:26','1',1),(2316,1712,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ernest','Lot of it',' Loved this ribbon for Christmas wrapping. There was a lot of it and added a nice touch to lots of gifts.','','2022-11-18 10:51:04','2022-11-18 10:51:04','1',1),(2317,1712,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Samuel','Very good quality. Much more inexpensive than the big craft ...','Very good quality. Much more inexpensive than the big craft stores. Very pretty ribbon. Bought two rolls for next Christmas.','','2022-11-18 10:51:51','2022-11-18 10:51:51','1',1),(2318,1712,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Benjamin','Gave a nice finishing touch to gift',' Great color','','2022-11-18 10:52:26','2022-11-18 10:52:26','1',1),(2319,1712,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Luka','Very deep red. Love it','Love this color','','2022-11-18 10:53:20','2022-11-18 10:53:20','1',1),(2320,1712,NULL,0,