53','1',1),(2330,1711,NULL,0,5,0,5,'James','It\'s beautiful Santa','I just love it','','2022-11-18 11:21:33','2022-11-18 11:21:33','1',1),(2331,1711,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lucy',' Enjoying Santa',' Great to have equal representation for holidays. Santa is cute and makes everyone smile and giggle. It operates smoothly and I can\'t wait for the rest of my family arrives for Christmas.','','2022-11-18 11:22:19','2022-11-18 11:22:19','1',1),(2332,1710,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Craig','Beautiful nordic stars','Just what I was looking for that Scandinavian nordic star tradition, hanged them together in from of my window.','','2022-11-21 07:41:57','2022-11-21 07:41:57','1',1),(2333,1710,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Philip','Great addition for decorating!',' I bought these stars for a bachelorette party, and they were perfect. I was a little nervous that they were going to be cheaply made, but they weren\'t. They fold down and \"attach\" with a piece of velcro inside the star points to keep them together. The bachelorette loved them so much and thought they were so cool that after the party she folded them down and took them home with her. Would definitely buy more again!','','2022-11-21 07:42:50','2022-11-21 07:42:50','1',1),(2334,1710,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jimmy','Beautiful and easy :-)','Beautiful and so easy to assemble!!!! You open it up and Velcro it and done!!','','2022-11-21 07:43:39','2022-11-21 07:43:39','1',1),(2335,1710,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Arthur','Beautiful ornaments',' This product is really pretty and easy to assemble. The Velcro is useful so you can undo it and reuse which is a plus. Really pretty!','','2022-11-21 07:44:18','2022-11-21 07:44:18','1',1),(2336,1710,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jaime','So cute!!','So cute and just like the picture! Really impressed with them. Lightweight too! Looked perfect for my daughter\'s frozen birthday party!','','2022-11-21 07:45:04','2022-11-21 07:45:04','1',1),(2337,1710,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Perry','Recommend','Used for decoration. Supper cute. Good size','','2022-11-21 07:45:36','2022-11-