only took a small amount of glue. Great value.','','2022-11-21 09:29:58','2022-11-21 09:29:58','1',1),(2349,1709,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Christopher',' I love these','Super happy, saved them to re-use to decorate for next year —- love love\r\nUsed to decorate wreaths and put on tables and window-stills— a really great purchase','','2022-11-21 09:30:31','2022-11-21 09:30:31','1',1),(2350,1709,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Mark',' Nice looking!','These holly berry ties made a perfect addition to my gift bag. Easy to twist on, adding a holiday flair to any gift! I recommend this product!','','2022-11-21 09:31:48','2022-11-21 09:31:48','1',1),(2351,1709,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ron','Great for Holiday Decor',' Added to our garland & the light hit it perfectly!','','2022-11-21 09:32:21','2022-11-21 09:32:21','1',1),(2352,1708,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Oliver','Really nice!!',' Only 2 came not working but the rest are great quality, they are bright and very comfortable. A little tight but not bad','','2022-11-21 10:24:00','2022-11-21 10:24:00','1',1),(2353,1708,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jake ','Cute for kids',' Cute & warm hat for kids. The battery pack slips out a little too easily, so better for walking than running while wearing it.','','2022-11-21 10:24:38','2022-11-21 10:24:38','1',1),(2354,1708,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Noah',' Love my Christmas beanie',' Love how it has lights! Brings Christmas cheer to those around me! Next year I will be ordering more so everyone in my family can wear one!','','2022-11-21 10:25:13','2022-11-21 10:25:13','1',1),(2355,1708,NULL,0,4,0,5,'James','High quality, low cost','Purchased for a one-time use family group photo, I was pleasantly surprised by such a well-constructed hat that was far higher quality than I expected for the price. The only problem, this one [of 9] had a damaged battery case that took a little ingenuity to cobble up and get working. For the price, I expected a lot less though, so still a great purchase.','','2022-11-21 10:27:18','2022-11-21 10:27:18','1',1),(2356,1708,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jack