ights are really cute and a decent size too. Two out of the three I purchased worked perfectly. I received a no-hassle replacement for the third one the following day which worked. They come with a remote and are battery-operated which you must add (3AA). Definitely satisfied and can\'t wait to hang them for the holidays!','','2022-11-21 11:05:45','2022-11-21 11:05:45','1',1),(2367,1707,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Kyle ','Cute Snowman Lights',' Wow, these snowman lights are cuter than I expected. There are remote control and have 8 lightning modes and dim modes. It\'s very convenient and great for holiday decor. They are made from durable materials. I think these will hold up for a long time. They are well worth the price.','','2022-11-21 11:06:33','2022-11-21 11:06:33','1',1),(2368,1707,NULL,0,5,0,5,'William','Great Extra to My Xmas Lights','This was a super cute light string. Added lots of holiday charm to our room.','','2022-11-21 11:07:16','2022-11-21 11:07:16','1',1),(2369,1707,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Thomas',' love this Thank you','such QT Santa lights ,, love it , thank you Amazon, and great Costumer service happy to buy this items ,,, thank you all','','2022-11-21 11:08:07','2022-11-21 11:08:07','1',1),(2370,1707,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Joe ','Great Lights','The lights look great. Very bright. Love having the remote and lightning options.','','2022-11-21 11:08:45','2022-11-21 11:08:45','1',1),(2371,1707,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ethan','Santa has a good looking face','Liked it all, very happy and brilliant','','2022-11-21 11:09:21','2022-11-21 11:09:21','1',1),(2372,1706,NULL,0,5,0,5,'David','Perfect decoration!','This banner fits perfectly on our brown fence. Extremely satisfied!','','2022-11-21 11:51:45','2022-11-21 11:51:45','1',1),(2373,1706,NULL,0,5,0,5,'George','Great','I put it on the fence and looks amazing.','','2022-11-21 11:52:44','2022-11-21 11:52:44','1',1),(2374,1706,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Reece','As Expected','Nice Banner. It was just as expected.','','2022-11-21 11:53:17','2022-11-21 11:53:17','1',1),(2375,1706,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Michael','Loved them',' Loved them but use something strong to tide them','','2022-11-21 11:53:46','2022-11-21 11:53:46','1',1),(2376,1706,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Richard',' Nice banner','Pair it with a collapsible tree and a snowman. I would recommend to iron before hanging.','','2022-11-21 11:54:24','2022-11-21 11:54:24','1',1),(2377,1706,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Oscar','Easy and nice decoration','I love it overall. Looks nice and hangs easily.','','2022-11-21 11:58:10','2022-11-21 11:58:10','1',1),(2378,1706,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Rhys','This banner is perfect',' I love this banner. It is very pretty.','','2022-11-21 11:58:48','2022-11-21 11:58:48','1',1),(2379,1706,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Alexander ','Excellent product','I like the product...','','2022-11-21 11:59:28','2022-11-21 11:59:28','1',1),(2380,1706,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Joseph ','Bold, Beautiful Colors','Just received this item today and I love it! The colors are so bold and pretty and really stand out on the white background. The material is nice and sturdy and easy to keep clean. Great item for a great price!','','2022-11-21 12:00:07','2022-11-21 12:00:07','1',1),(2381,1706,NULL,0,5,0,5,'James','I like it','Could\'ve been bigger but I liked it','','2022-11-21 12:00:55','2022-11-21 12:00:55','1',1),(2382,1705,NULL,0,5,0,5,' Oliver','Good little berries for the price',' Nice little red berries for Christmas decorations. It would be nice if the wires were a little longer to make it easier to attach them to the sprigs in a wreath, etc.','','2022-11-22 05:46:18','2022-11-22 05:46:18','1',1),(2383,1705,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ethan','Super cute for my small tree!','Kurt the little extra something that it needed. These are cute! Fyi: they do not come in a bouquet like pictured. They come in individual single sticks. I had to bunch them together and twist the words to make the small bouquets. I made 10 since there were 100 sticks','','2022-11-22 05:47:42','2022-11-22 05:47:42','1',1),(2384,1705,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Amelia','Small but pretty holiday berries','These berries are really pretty but much smaller than I thought they would be. I added them in small bunches of three to five to my garland. They look nice.','','2022-11-22 05:50:38','2022-11-22 05:50:38','1',1),(2385,1705,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Mia','Great product','Soooo many berries, and a good variety of shades of red, they have wire to twist one a trying, I added them to a garland and my tree they were a great subtle addition','','2022-11-22 05:51:32','2022-11-22 05:51:32','1',1),(2386,1705,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Lucas','Cute but small','If you are looking for accents on your tree these holly berries are small but cute. Not sure if you can see them in the picture. I should have done more research prior to purchasing them they do not really stand out not unless you are right on the tree. They are ok period.','','2022-11-22 05:52:21','2022-11-22 05:52:21','1',1),(2387,1705,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Chloe','Ok quality, but looks nice','Not prime quality but ok for the price. Nice addition to your crafts. Does not look super fake like some you see, looks pretty nice to me and it seems to be a darker color in person, which helps','','2022-11-22 05:53:02','2022-11-22 05:53:02','1',1),(2388,1705,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ava','Better than I thought!','I love them! They can easily be clustered together by winding their stems or they can be placed on branches because their stems are so flexible.','','2022-11-22 05:53:46','2022-11-22 05:53:46','1',1),(2389,1705,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Noah','Worked Great!','They worked perfectly to add to my tree and I added them to my regular green wreath in my home, it made it Christmas festive! They are easy to put in and remove.','','2022-11-22 05:54:44','2022-11-22 05:54:44','1',1),(2390,1705,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Enzo','Lovely','Love color and I can do my own creation, nothing that I dislike. I used it for decorations on my Christmas Tree and wreath and garland it brought the item to life','','2022-11-22 05:55:54','2022-11-22 05:55:54','1',1),(2391,1705,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lea','perfect!','I used to be able to buy these at Michael\'s but they don\'t have them anymore so I was glad to find them here. Bought them to put on my little Christmas tree and they\'re just what I was looking for!','','2022-11-22 05:56:41','2022-11-22 05:56:41','1',1),(2392,1704,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Mathias','Love it','It’s great but when she gets her teeth into them they rip easily lol but they look great!','','2022-11-22 06:20:04','2022-11-22 06:20:04','1',1),(2393,1704,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Clara','Super cute',' We purchased these to dress up holiday name badges for a Christmas party and they worked out adorably.','','2022-11-22 06:20:55','2022-11-22 06:20:55','1',1),(2394,1704,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Nathan','exlecent quality',' what a great buy, 2 of each, and looked so professional, I even made necklaces for the girls with these over the clasp.','','2022-11-22 06:21:34','2022-11-22 06:21:34','1',1),(2395,1704,NULL,0,5,0,5,' Ines','Beautiful Bows!','My daughter is a professional dog groomer and I purchased these for her to use during the holidays. They were beautiful and very well made. The pictures don’t do them justice. I will be ordering more bows from this company. Very, very pleased.','','2022-11-22 06:22:19','2022-11-22 06:22:19','1',1),(2396,1704,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jade','Good quality bows that are great for dogs','Great for groomers and your moong-haired dogs. Well made and there are several pairs for dogs with pigtails!','','2022-11-22 06:23:05','2022-11-22 06:23:05','1',1),(2397,1704,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Oceana','Lots of nice variety!',' I liked the variety and styles. I was going to order more but there was a long arrival time. Too late for the holidays!','','2022-11-22 06:23:47','2022-11-22 06:23:47','1',1),(2398,1704,NULL,0,5,0,5,' Manon','Beautiful!!!!','Beautiful!!!\r\nExactly like the picture. They are sewn and well-secured. Will buy it again next year !!!','','2022-11-22 06:24:37','2022-11-22 06:24:37','1',1),(2399,1704,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Hugo','Beautiful Christmas dog bows',' These bows 