 a few seconds and can be mixed and matched at will. Very happy, good quality. There is no problem here.','','2022-11-22 07:13:22','2022-11-22 07:13:22','1',1),(2409,1703,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Cora',' I used it at Christmas','The quality of the product is very good, I used it at Christmas','','2022-11-22 07:14:01','2022-11-22 07:14:01','1',1),(2410,1703,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Maximilian','cute',' cute','','2022-11-22 07:14:30','2022-11-22 07:14:30','1',1),(2411,1703,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Vicente','good','good garland','','2022-11-22 07:15:03','2022-11-22 07:15:03','1',1),(2412,1702,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Constanza',' Ornaments are very tiny but cute',' Did not return these ornaments, but wished they were a little bigger for my 4-foot tree. Maybe better for a 2-3 foot tree. Also what was used to hang ornaments was quite long making them hang too low from the branch. This may not be an issue for some people.','','2022-11-22 07:50:35','2022-11-22 07:50:35','1',1),(2413,1702,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Catalina','works','For the price these are great. Don\'t complain!','','2022-11-22 07:51:12','2022-11-22 07:51:12','1',1),(2414,1702,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Valentina','These mini decorations brings back memories',' I loved these mini decorations for my tree','','2022-11-22 07:51:48','2022-11-22 07:51:48','1',1),(2415,1702,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Diego','Nice decorations','Cheaply made, but good enough for the price','','2022-11-22 07:52:22','2022-11-22 07:52:22','1',1),(2416,1702,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Juan','New traditions!','The kids loved these! Affordable, well made, and makes any tree look sophisticated!','','2022-11-22 07:53:02','2022-11-22 07:53:02','1',1),(2417,1702,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jose','So pretty','Just gorgeous','','2022-11-22 07:53:36','2022-11-22 07:53:36','1',1),(2418,1702,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Cristobal',' Lost simular pieces on small Woden three these were perfect replacements.','Perfect for small trees.','','2022-11-22 07:54:31','2022-11-22 07:54:31','1',1),(2419,1702,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Fernanda','Great for craft project','Tree in progress with the resin ornaments. Perfect for these gift trees. Have made 5 different ones with these ornaments and everyone loved them. Will be making more with these. Great value and oh so perfect size.','','2022-11-22 07:55:17','2022-11-22 07:55:17','1',1),(2420,1702,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Javiera','Very cute','They will work perfectly for the advent calendar I bought for my granddaughter to help her know when Santa will be coming & she can put them on her little tree. They are crafted very well & look very cute.','','2022-11-22 07:56:01','2022-11-22 07:56:01','1',0),(2421,1702,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Antonia',' Cute ornaments','There was a problem with the shipping initially... the item includes two boxes of twelve ornaments each, with different ornament designs in each box. My order arrived with only one box. Amazon fixed the problem quickly. The ornaments themselves are cute, and a good value. I used them as gifts in an advent calendar.','','2022-11-22 07:56:46','2022-11-22 07:56:46','1',1),(2422,1701,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Katarzyna','Beautiful Words, Giftable Art!!','I love everything about these Laser cut wood Ornaments!! Intricate, perfect carvings, of Words we all hold dear to Heart! Such incredible, and meaningful keepsakes or Gifts! I gave it to all my loved ones for Christmas. They have little satin ribbons included; but one could easily add other cords, string, plaids or gold ribbons, thin leather strips, etc. Easily be painted, but I left it natural. Thank you! Smiles.','','2022-11-22 09:30:12','2022-11-22 09:30:12','1',1),(2423,1701,NULL,0,5,0,5,' Jan','Very popular gift','I have these for the people in my church choir at Christmas. They were very popular.','','2022-11-22 09:30:57','2022-11-22 09:30:57','1',1),(2424,1701,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ewa','Versatile Light Weight Ornaments','Great to decorate Christmas presents & you get to give an ornament to hang on top of your presence! Lightweight so no stress on branches, you can paint them too as a holiday craft with the kids!','','2022-11-22 09:31:45','2022-11-22 09:31:45','1',1),(2425,1701,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Zofia','Great gifts for large groups','I used these for gifts in 2 of my study groups','','2022-11-22 09:32:23','2022-11-22 09:32:23','1',1),(2426,1701,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Elzbieta',' I really like these!!!','I bought these for a small Christmas tree in my kitchen. My husband and I painted them with white chalk paint. So pretty and stood out on the green tree.','','2022-11-22 09:33:15','2022-11-22 09:33:15','1',1),(2427,1701,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Marek','Simple yet elegant','These ornaments are a beautiful accent to my tree.\r\nPackaging - They came in compact packaging. After the season is over. I know I won\'t need a lot of space to put them away.\r\nWeight - only 0.10 oz each with the string. This makes it easy to strategically put on the tree, weighing down the leaves and covering other ornaments.\r\nFlexible theme - Go for rustic or modern or glittery. I didn\'t color mine but depending on the theme you want on your tree, you can oil paint or watercolor on these ornaments. They are made of wood and it seems they will absorb color very well.\r\n\r\nI loved them so much that I bought another pack for the kids\' art class in our Sunday School. I\'m very excited about how that one will turn out.','','2022-11-22 09:34:44','2022-11-22 09:34:44','1',1),(2428,1701,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Marcin','Used in craft project','Very good item for the money. Used in a craft project for Christmas gifts! Very pleased. Kept a few for my Christmas tree! Would purchase it again.','','2022-11-22 09:35:33','2022-11-22 09:35:33','1',1),(2429,1701,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Tomasz','Perfect','They were the perfect thing for a tree to look the best','','2022-11-22 09:36:18','2022-11-22 09:36:18','1',1),(2430,1701,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Krzysztof','Gift Bag Treat','These were the perfect addition to the Christmas gift bags given at my ministry. Just the right special touch!','','2022-11-22 09:37:11','2022-11-22 09:37:11','1',1),(2431,1701,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Anna','Perfect gifts for a large crowd!','Great product for a great price. Made a great little gift for each lady at my lady\'s Christmas party.','','2022-11-22 09:37:53','2022-11-22 09:37:53','1',1),(2432,1700,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lucas','The packaging let this good product down','The signs themselves are very nice and I have spray-painted them for my Christmas crafting projects. However, the packaging let this product down as 3 were broken.','','2022-11-22 12:00:23','2022-11-22 12:00:23','1',1),(2433,1700,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Oscar','Very Delicate','These are very nice but very delicate. They break easily. There were several broken in the package. But they look nice on my project.','','2022-11-22 12:01:10','2022-11-22 12:01:10','1',1),(2434,1700,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Elias',' Really nice','I was a little apprehensive about getting these because the reviews weren\'t great but decided to take a chance. I got them today & already have used several of them in crafts. None of them were broken & I love them. They add to my Christmas crafts. They also take staining very well.','','2022-11-22 12:01:54','2022-11-22 12:01:54','1',1),(2435,1700,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Maja','Great add-on to gifts after painting','Great quality! Will paint and add to handmade Christmas gifts.','','2022-11-22 12:02:37','2022-11-22 12:02:37','1',1),(2436,1700,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Alva','The right touch','These were perfect for adding the finishing touch to some smaller wooden Christmas trees that I made as gifts for family members.','','2022-11-22 12:03:17','2022-11-22 12:03:17','1',1),(2437,1700,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ida','Perfect and not broken.','296. These are perfect for hanging from a small wreath maybe 4 to 6 inches. I\'m a real person who shops on Amazon a lot. Yes, they are tiny. But I needed the tiny size. You can paint them, hang alone or position them between stuffed animals\' paws or a doll\'s hands.\r\nNot one was broken. However, Amazon should put on the outside of the pkg to the USPS the pkg should not be folded, bent, or thrown.\r\nAgain, none of mine were broken and they were stuffed in my mailbox.\r\nIf u need a small one, go for it.','','2022-11-22 12:11:22','2022-11-22 12:11:22','1',1),(2438,1700,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Elin','Merry christmas','Great for crafts','','2022-11-22 12:12:05','2022-11-22 12:12:05','1',1),(2439,1700,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Alice','Perfect size for the Tree',' I love the size and shininess of these Merry Christmas Ornaments. The only thing I didn\'t like was it had two holes for hanging which is fine if not on a tree. However, I was able to sit them nicely on the branches of the tree without any hooks. So it worked out great anyway','','2022-11-22 12:12:54','2022-11-22 12:12:54','1',1),(2440,1700,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Isak','Good size','A lot bigger then I thought they’d be','','2022-11-22 12:13:35','2022-11-22 12:13:35','1',1),(2441,1700,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Emil','Creative and perfect!',' As advertised! I love it! Wish they could and would create personalized signs!! Only thing was the string was difficult to attach','','2022-11-22 12:24:25','2022-11-22 12:24:25','1',1),(2442,1699,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Ethan','Nice','The size is good enough. I like it.','','2022-11-23 05:27:32','2022-11-23 05:27:32','1',1),(2443,1699,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aaliyah',' Nice bags','Very impressed with these bags, they were very strong and the design was adorable, I love each of them.','','2022-11-23 05:28:07','2022-11-23 05:28:07','1',1),(2444,1699,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Avery','As good as described','The product looks good online and is as described. I am happy. Not a flimsy plastic bag. Good size for about 1/2 to 1 lb. Cookies or homemade candy.','','2022-11-23 05:28:49','2022-11-23 05:28:49','1',1),(2445,1699,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aidan','Convenient!','Super convenient for Holiday goodies because it has a built-ribbon that you can tie up yourself. No need to get ribbons or fasteners! Perfect!','','2022-11-23 05:29:36','2022-11-23 05:29:36','1',1),(2446,1699,NULL,0,5,0,5,' Zoey','A little Christmas cheer for all you do','Cute Christmas bags. I use them to give to the mailman, hair stylist, service workers, and sanitation workers as a small token of my appreciation for their excellent service. Also good for kids\' parties and small gifts for their friends. Teach the art of giving to your kids.','','2022-11-23 05:30:41','2022-11-23 05:30:41','1',1),(2447,1699,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Layla','treat bags','The size and drawstring worked well!','','2022-11-23 05:31:27','2022-11-23 05:31:27','1',1),(2448,1699,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dylan','Great quality','Highly recommend. I had bought some from QVC and they cost more, were so much thinner and too sheer, but these were thicker, not sheer, and perfect to reuse. Will be buying more of these going forward.','','2022-11-23 05:32:23','2022-11-23 05:32:23','1',1),(2449,1699,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aria','Super Good!','Super good bags. So easy. Well made and sturdy!','','2022-11-23 05:32:59','2022-11-23 05:32:59','1',1),(2450,1699,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Zoe','Sturdy and pretty','Very happy with these gift bags. The colors are vibrant and the multiple sizes worked well for some of my odd-shaped gifts. The drawstring is sturdy. Would buy it again.','','2022-11-23 05:33:43','2022-11-23 05:33:43','1',1),(2451,1699,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aaron','Ho Ho doh','I love these bags so much that I order them every Christmas! They are not only charming, but they are also quite sturdy, too!','','2022-11-23 05:34:30','2022-11-23 05:34:30','1',1),(2452,1698,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jorge','Awesome tips!','These are perfect for big borders and cupcakes. Good sturdy quality. Will buy more from this seller in the future','','2022-11-23 06:14:46','2022-11-23 06:14:46','1',1),(2453,1698,NULL,0,5,0,5,' Alberto','Little to big things happening now','GOOD','','2022-11-23 06:15:28','2022-11-23 06:15:28','1',1),(2454,1698,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ricardo','Great Quality & Perfect Set','Excellent quality tips and the perfect setting for a variety of designs!','','2022-11-23 06:16:11','2022-11-23 06:16:11','1',1),(2455,1698,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Marta','Very easy to use and to wash','Using for cakes and cupcakes decorations, saving a tongue of money','','2022-11-23 06:16:54','2022-11-23 06:16:54','1',1),(2456,1698,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Rosa','good',' So good, it\'s easy to make cream cakes. Buy a large piping tip, the small cream cannot be squeezed out','','2022-11-23 06:17:38','2022-11-23 06:17:38','1',1),(2457,1698,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Silvia','Love For Piping',' Works as Expected... Love that they are Very Sturdy. Be Careful when inserting in Piping Bag edges or very Sharp.','','2022-11-23 06:36:24','2022-11-23 06:36:24','1',1),(2458,1698,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Graciela','Really loved','The sizes were good and they make beautiful icing designs','','2022-11-23 06:36:59','2022-11-23 06:36:59','1',1),(2459,1698,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Beatriz','Wow!!!','I don\'t have enough words to describe this set. It is perfect!!','','2022-11-23 06:37:43','2022-11-23 06:37:43','1',1),(2460,1698,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Norma','Does exactly what it shows',' I bought these to use for quick flowers in cake decorating at my job. Quick easy way to make sunflowers. Love the larger tips to quickly cover a cupcake','','2022-11-23 06:38:20','2022-11-23 06:38:20','1',1),(2461,1698,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Carlos','great product','easy to use and clean','','2022-11-23 06:38:56','2022-11-23 06:38:56','1',1),(2462,1697,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Sarah','Cute idea but not durable for toddlers','This was a gift to me 5 and 3 years from mom. They love it and were super excited to decorate it themselves. I will say it comes folded up with some bad creases but they are easily ironed out. The only downside I see is the velcro on the back of the ornaments has already started falling off of a couple of pieces. I’ve superglued them back on but the little pom ball ornaments aren’t going to last very long. Naturally, my kids want to take it off and on and rearrange the ornaments multiple times so the glue holding the velcro on is failing. But again it’s an easy fix. Still a cute thing for my kiddos. \r\n','','2022-11-23 07:07:24','2022-11-23 07:07:24','1',1),(2463,1697,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Hannah','Fun','Grandkids love decorating and redecorating trees. The tree needs to be ironed before use.','','2022-11-23 07:08:13','2022-11-23 07:08:13','1',1),(2464,1697,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Vanessa','Great for almost 4 year old',' This is a hit at our house! Great for my almost 4-year-old. Keeps him busy','','2022-11-23 07:08:55','2022-11-23 07:08:55','1',1),(2465,1697,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Julian','Quick Delivery, Occupies the little one','I bought this to distract my little one from my actual Christmas tree whenever we put it up. Delivery was fast, the felt tree and attachments seem sturdy enough for repeated use, and it kept my little one occupied for a good bit. Mission accomplished (for now). My only \"gripe\" is about how the tree was folded - the edges stay folded inward after unpackaging, which is annoying, but I\'m sure an iron and/or time laying flat and weighted down will fix that.','','2022-11-23 07:09:53','2022-11-23 07:09:53','1',1),(2466,1697,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Florian','Something cheap and fun for my kids','My kids are going to love it','','2022-11-23 07:10:40','2022-11-23 07:10:40','1',1),(2467,1697,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Anton','Well received by the toddler set!!','Bought this a few years back for a grandson and it’s still being used. Bought again for another new grandson!','','2022-11-23 07:11:16','2022-11-23 07:11:16','1',1),(2468,1697,NULL,0,5,0,5,' Milan','Super fun for toddlers!','My daughter is only 1.5, so she had more fun taking the ornaments off the tree and leaving them all around the house.. however, for a child a little bit older, I think this is perfect! It’s so much fun! I just didn’t have fun picking the ornaments up off the floor 24/7 lol! I suggested this to my friend who has a daughter a little over 2 and she loved it! You can also add battery-pack lights to the tree to give it some extra decor! Just watch little ones with batteries around if the battery pack doesn’t have a screw. The tree itself is felt, so it came all folded and it was difficult to get the creases out of the tree once hung on the wall. I debated rolling some tape to put on the back of the branches to get them to stick flat to the wall, but my daughter would’ve just pulled them off, so I left it be. The creasing worked itself out a little bit over time on its own.','','2022-11-23 07:12:04','2022-11-23 07:12:04','1',1),(2469,1697,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Arthur','Fun but need a little straightening out before hanging',' If you\'re like me, you want your items to be ready to hang the minute you get them out of the package. I bought 2 - one for each grandchild. But the way they were packaged, the boys couldn\'t hang them up right away. The sides were folded inwards and we had to lay them upside down and stack books on them overnight, then iron the sides before they were ready to hang. Once they were up, they were great and the boys loved them.','','2022-11-23 07:13:05','2022-11-23 07:13:05','1',1),(2470,1697,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Mohamed','Endless December play','My 2yo loved it and we will get good use for next year too. Best to unpack and try to bend into shape for a day or 2 before hanging. We used command strip hooks and it was perfect. Kids love this thing - neighbors and cousins too','','2022-11-23 07:13:57','2022-11-23 07:13:57','1',1),(2471,1697,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Simon','Price and to watch a childs face light up',' I loved it I watched my great-granddaughter have such fun putting the ornaments on the tree and moving them she’s two years old and had so much fun and was so happy she has it hanging on her door and loves it it is such a good thing to see a child use their imagination','','2022-11-23 07:14:50','2022-11-23 07:14:50','1',1),(2472,1696,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Maxime','Beautiful',' Looking good.','','2022-11-24 05:48:14','2022-11-24 05:48:14','1',1),(2473,1696,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Camille','Decent quality','Well made for acrylic ornaments and pretty. No roughness on the edges. I’ll be taking these apart to make customized ornaments.','','2022-11-24 05:49:07','2022-11-24 05:49:07','1',1),(2474,1696,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Veeti','Lovely! Safer than glass','These are exactly what I hoped for - clear, faceted, acrylic snowflakes and twirled icicles. Each item hangs by a small silver-colored ring, similar to a key ring but smaller and thinner, with a ribbon on the top. I might change the ribbons for the fishing line. The different parts of multi-part ornaments are connected by the same type of ring. I purchased larger acrylic reindeer sculptures in the past and have been very happy with them - they are much safer than real glass and have held up nicely. I\'ve had about a dozen different glass icicles. Yes, they are fancier and a bit prettier, but only 4 or 5 of them are still unbroken. Acrylic ornaments are much safer and more durable. My review is based on one 18-ornament package. I ordered 1 package to check them out and will order more for a holiday tree. I read reviews that complained that the ornaments weren\'t real crystals. Seriously? To expect 18 glass crystals of any size for $23 is unrealistic. And the description clearly states \"acrylic\".','','2022-11-24 05:50:12','2022-11-24 05:50:12','1',1),(2475,1696,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Eetu','So very pretty',' I always dress the garland across the mantle differently. This year I went with crystal and silver, it looks gorgeous!','','2022-11-24 05:50:51','2022-11-24 05:50:51','1',1),(2476,1696,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ella','Christmas ornaments','The ornaments are still unopened, They look a lot prettier than in the pictures online.','','2022-11-24 05:51:28','2022-11-24 05:51:28','1',1),(2477,1696,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Siiri','Fast delivery','I like this product, I use this for my Christmas decoration.','','2022-11-24 05:52:04','2022-11-24 05:52:04','1',1),(2478,1696,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aleksi','Excellent','Very very pretty.','','2022-11-24 05:52:37','2022-11-24 05:52:37','1',1),(2479,1696,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Juho','Real looking',' Looks real. Not like acrylic','','2022-11-24 05:53:16','2022-11-24 05:53:16','1',1),(2480,1696,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lauri','Just lovely. Order now. Great deal!',' I’m doing a glam Christmas this year. These are perfect!','','2022-11-24 05:53:55','2022-11-24 05:53:55','1',1),(2481,1696,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Arttu','Good quality for price','These will look great on my Christmas tree this year but could be used elsewhere!','','2022-11-24 05:54:33','2022-11-24 05:54:33','1',1),(2482,1694,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Leevi','Good filler ornaments',' I bought these ornaments for decorating my tree for New Year\'s when I couldn\'t bring myself to take my tree down after Christmas. The ornaments were nice but cheaply made. However, they fit my needs because I just needed to fill in spaces with other decorations. Plus, there was a variety of colors/styles, so they added to the seasonal décor. Also, they are plastic so no need to worry about them being broken by pets or clumsy humans.','','2022-11-24 06:42:14','2022-11-24 06:42:14','1',1),(2483,1694,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lida','Plastic','All the same size. There are two different colors of gold. One is a light yellow shiny gold and the other is a more traditional gold. Silver string for hanging. Cheaply made but do the job!','','2022-11-24 06:43:03','2022-11-24 06:43:03','1',1),(2484,1694,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aada','Pay attention to description','I didn\'t pay attention to the size in the description. These ornaments are small. Not a 2ft tree is small, but if you have a large tree, maybe taller than 4ft, you may want to reconsider. Luckily I purchased one New Year tree and there are 36, which are enough to go around a 4ft tree and not look sparse.','','2022-11-24 06:44:12','2022-11-24 06:44:12','1',1),(2485,1694,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Venla','Good!','Purchased these for our small \"Star Wars\" themed Christmas tree. They were perfect, the colors looked great on the tree. The ornaments were sturdy (we dropped a few more than once). And the price point was appropriate. Would recommend.','','2022-11-24 06:44:59','2022-11-24 06:44:59','1',1),(2486,1694,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Anni','Watch for size',' I like the colors true indeed but they are tiny. I think these are meant for a personal tree.','','2022-11-24 06:45:36','2022-11-24 06:45:36','1',1),(2487,1694,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aino','Close!','There are so many comments saying they’re too small, but no images to confirm if it’s smaller than advertised or not, so here (image) - They are indeed 2.4”, just as advertised. Yes, this means they’re small, but they’re not tiny and should work with a mix of similar-sized ornaments on a tree. They’re def shatterproof bc I accidentally dropped one and it bounced like a ball. Mine also came with strings attached which were appreciated. The only reason I’m removing a star is that the yellow was more of a dull mustard yellow and not as bright a yellow as the image advertised. This includes my picture shown; My camera brightens the image but it is darker and duller than anticipated. The other colors however were as advertised. I have to return these since I was going for a bright yellow but if you don’t mind a mustard yellow and the size, then go for it!','','2022-11-24 06:46:31','2022-11-24 06:46:31','1',1),(2488,1694,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Gunnar','Good quality','They were a little smaller than I thought but they are very nice only gave a 4 for the size of them I guess I should have read the details closer','','2022-11-24 06:47:13','2022-11-24 06:47:13','1',1),(2489,1694,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Olafur',' perfect for my project.','so cute , perfect for my project','','2022-11-24 06:48:02','2022-11-24 06:48:02','1',1),(2490,1694,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Guorun','Perfect size','Using these for party centerpieces. They are a good size. They take up a good amount of space so I don’t have to use as many glass beads.','','2022-11-24 06:48:48','2022-11-24 06:48:48','1',1),(2491,1694,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Telma','Make my cat happy','Well, have used these for 2 Christmases. They are cheaply made and will probably eventually have the little mirror pieces fall off, but look pretty for now. Our tree rotated in front of a window, so the little disco balls reflect little fits of light all through Aaron’s living room. Our cat just loves to watch the dots go around! I bought these just for him to enjoy. It is fun to watch him as he follows the spots!','','2022-11-24 06:49:37','2022-11-24 06:49:37','1',1),(2492,1693,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Troy','Awesome','The stockings have measurements listed but they still seemed bigger when they arrived. Amazing size and strong! Great for the price. I stuffed stockings for my kids\' classroom Xmas parties!','','2022-11-24 06:55:00','2022-11-24 06:55:00','1',1),(2493,1693,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Tommy','BEAUTIFUL',' Everyone Loved these Christmas Stockings, I gave them as gifts, filled with goodies.','','2022-11-24 06:55:52','2022-11-24 06:55:52','1',1),(2494,1693,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Rick','Perfect Size for Grandchildren\'s Christmas Gifts',' I have 10 grandchildren to gift for Christmas. I needed a stocking that could hold a gift card along with some candy treats. In prior years, I bought stockings that were too small; however, this year I found DIYASY mini stockings and they are the right sizes to hold for candy bars, candy kisses, candy canes, and a gift card.','','2022-11-24 06:56:46','2022-11-24 06:56:46','1',1),(2495,1693,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Victor','Cute & a good value','These are perfect to put gift cards & a few other treats at Christmas. I wrote people’s names with glue & glitter on the top white part & everyone who got one thought they were so cute! Can’t beat them for the price & quantity.','','2022-11-24 06:57:21','2022-11-24 06:57:21','1',1),(2496,1693,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jessie','Cute gift bags','I used these as gift bags for coworkers and they loved them. A little bigger than what I needed but I stuffed them with tissue paper. Great buy.','','2022-11-24 06:57:57','2022-11-24 06:57:57','1',1),(2497,1693,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Neil','My favorite little Christmas stockings!','These were bigger than I thought they’d be but turns out it was a good thing as I could put more in them. Well made. Would buy it again.','','2022-11-24 06:58:35','2022-11-24 06:58:35','1',1),(2498,1693,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ted','Good quality',' I used these for decoration on my chicken coop. They were good quality for how cheap they were and the perfect size. Not too tiny','','2022-11-24 06:59:16','2022-11-24 06:59:16','1',1),(2499,1693,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Nick','Great value','Perfect for little gift stuffers for co-workers- easily holds 8 oz lotion bottles','','2022-11-24 07:42:42','2022-11-24 07:42:42','1',1),(2500,1693,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wiley','Group Xmas Stockings',' Look cute and perfect size.','','2022-11-24 07:43:12','2022-11-24 07:43:12','1',1),(2501,1693,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Morris','Awesome product','Great item','','2022-11-24 07:43:49','2022-11-24 07:43:49','1',1),(2502,1692,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Birta','Nice',' Happy','','2022-11-24 08:12:16','2022-11-24 08:12:16','1',1),(2503,1692,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Helga','Can’t wait to use them','I can not wait to use these to make a garland! And hang a few on my tree!','','2022-11-24 08:12:54','2022-11-24 08:12:54','1',1),(2504,1692,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Bjarni',' Sturdy','These are durable products that are very cute.','','2022-11-24 08:13:39','2022-11-24 08:13:39','1',1),(2505,1692,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Bjorn','Gnome ornaments','Very cute','','2022-11-24 08:14:11','2022-11-24 08:14:11','1',1),(2506,1692,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Einar','Gnomes galore! Adorable addition to Christmas gift wrap','I like to add a little ornamentation to my gifts at Christmas. Often I bake and wrap my cookies in clear plastic gift baggies. These darling little Gnomes were the perfect addition to my neighborhood gift this year! They are surprisingly light and yet look very nice with bright ribbons on a plain sack. I will likely order more next time I need a little additional treat to a package.','','2022-11-24 08:15:08','2022-11-24 08:15:08','1',1),(2507,1692,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Magnus','Cute little gnomes!','You get a lot of them, they’re very small so they’re perfect for a mini tree or for little ones to put in the tree. Sturdier than plastic or glass and the kids love them.','','2022-11-24 08:15:49','2022-11-24 08:15:49','1',1),(2508,1692,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sigurour','Cute, lightweight, versatile','Very cute. Went well with my gnome them around the house.','','2022-11-24 08:16:26','2022-11-24 08:16:26','1',1),(2509,1692,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Shun','great for gift giving for children class rooms','gave my grandson them as gifts for students in class, Great substitute for other gifts. children have unknown allergies, Would recommend these,','','2022-11-24 08:17:22','2022-11-24 08:17:22','1',1),(2510,1692,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Kaito','Soo cute','Cute little decorations. I used them as gift tag decoration','','2022-11-24 08:17:53','2022-11-24 08:17:53','1',1),(2511,1689,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Daiki','How to use the Scrap Crazy 6','I liked the templates very much and have used them a lot.','','2022-11-24 10:45:21','2022-11-24 10:45:21','1',1),(2512,1689,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Yu','Easy to use perfect every time','Cutting out was easy and even seams matched perfectly.','','2022-11-24 10:46:09','2022-11-24 10:46:09','1',1),(2513,1689,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Kenta','Great','Beginner quilter, and I love the ease of use and versatility of this set!','','2022-11-24 10:46:45','2022-11-24 10:46:45','1',1),(2514,1689,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sota','Fantastic','Easy to use fits perfectly','','2022-11-24 10:47:30','2022-11-24 10:47:30','1',1),(2515,1689,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ren','Easy to use','Quilt squares','','2022-11-24 10:48:08','2022-11-24 10:48:08','1',1),(2516,1689,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Takumi','Template makes easy cutting','The quilting template made cutting the material easy and fast with a rotary cutter. Corners were trimmed so they were easy to make even when sewing the pieces together.','','2022-11-24 10:48:56','2022-11-24 10:48:56','1',1),(2517,1689,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Misaki','Totally worth the purchase!',' I was not sure it would be worth spending money on another quilting gadget, but I decided to take the chance. These ruler handles improved my control of the ruler when I cut a long piece of fabric and reduced the stress on my hand/arm to hold the ruler in place. It is better than putting cans on the ends of the ruler to keep it in place when cutting fabric.','','2022-11-24 10:50:01','2022-11-24 10:50:01','1',1),(2518,1689,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aoi','Fantastic!!','I use this grip on my quilting ruler for cutting fabric, I suffer from tremors so this tool offers me a way to make very stable and accurate cuts.','','2022-11-24 10:50:53','2022-11-24 10:50:53','1',1),(2519,1689,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Nanami','This ruler gripper holds tightly and is easy to use','This tool is great for holding a long ruler in place while cutting fabric. It grips securely and does not slip. It makes cutting easier.','','2022-11-24 10:51:29','2022-11-24 10:51:29','1',1),(2520,1689,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Miu','Quality','I use this to hold down my fabric when cutting it. I have arthritis in my hands, and this gives me the strength I need.','','2022-11-24 10:52:03','2022-11-24 10:52:03','1',1),(2521,1688,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Eli ',' Great!',' Easy to use. Holds a knot or bow nicely!','','2022-11-24 11:42:52','2022-11-24 11:42:52','1',1),(2522,1688,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Alberto',' Perfect!','I wanted burlap-looking ribbons to make bows for treat bags and this was just what I was looking for! Thin enough to make a bow but still sturdy enough to hold its shape and doesn’t unravel. Already ordered another set!','','2022-11-24 11:43:39','2022-11-24 11:43:39','1',1),(2523,1688,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Carlosn','Great price for a versatile ribbon','Used this ribbon for napkin rings with a piece of wheat and a leaf for Thanksgiving. Turned out beautiful','','2022-11-24 11:44:17','2022-11-24 11:44:17','1',1),(2524,1688,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Shane','Raffia ribbon','Perfect for my needs in many ways','','2022-11-24 11:44:54','2022-11-24 11:44:54','1',1),(2525,1688,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aaron','Gives a simple touch',' Love the width of this ribbon. Gives whatever you do with it that simple look.',