the money I paid they\'re very pretty. The timer is nice the battery life for it to be nice and bright was only a few weeks then it dimmed for me but not an issue','','2022-12-01 06:44:00','2022-12-01 06:44:00','1',1),(2536,1691,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Johnny','Looks good','You have to fluff it but once that is done it looks nice','','2022-12-01 06:45:17','2022-12-01 06:45:17','1',1),(2537,1691,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Charlie','Excellent purchase',' It’s a very beautiful Garland. The light is beautiful n it looks really good in my living room','','2022-12-01 06:46:18','2022-12-01 06:46:18','1',1),(2538,1691,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Scott','Perfect accent for my small Christmas tree','I have a small Christmas tree beside my fireplace that has never been decorated during the holiday season… I wanted to find some red beaded accent for the tree and this 9-foot strand worked perfectly! The red color is vibrant and they feel durable and well-made. The 9-foot strand works great for small tree decorations but FYI, this would be too short for a larger standard Christmas tree. I think it would also be cute in a glass vase with some greenery or holly! Anyway, it was much more affordable than the strand I had originally looked at my local craft store and I am overall very pleased with the product! I am including a few photos just to provide a closer look at what to expect. I hope that helps!','','2022-12-01 06:47:36','2022-12-01 06:47:36','1',1),(2539,1691,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Martin','Christmas beads',' I expected a little bit bigger in diameter of beads...','','2022-12-01 06:48:12','2022-12-01 06:48:12','1',1),(2540,1691,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Tristin','Accurate color',' Color','','2022-12-01 06:48:41','2022-12-01 06:48:41','1',1),(2541,1687,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ramon','Super cute! They\'re going to decorate my bathroom mirrors','They\'re super cute. They\'re cartoonish without being childish or completely silly.\r\n- They stick well to the surface, but I am using them on my bathroom mirrors. I took a snowflake to try out, and it was fine. I also pulled the snowflake off of the mirror to check it out. After a few hours, there was no residue, and it re-stuck to the mirror just fine.\r\n-You don\'t have to use water. Just peel and stick.','','2022-12-01 07:13:30','2022-12-01 07:13:30','1',0),(2542,1687,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Miles ',' The Kids Love these Decorations',' I let my grand children decorate the windows and patio doors with these stickers. They love them so I buy them every year for their enjoyment.','','2022-12-01 07:14:18','2022-12-01 07:14:18','1',0),(2543,1687,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Liam ','Cute for home and office','I have these for my home windows and at work, and they are really cute.\r\n\r\nGreat for December decor and would be fun for kids and adults, alike.\r\n\r\nEasy to peel off, put up, and remove.','','2022-12-01 07:15:49','2022-12-01 07:15:49','1',0),(2544,1687,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Nathaniel','GREAT value and soooo cute!!!',' Every year I get Christmas window stickers from the dollar store but not anymore! These stickers are way better quality than the dollar store (they don’t fall off!) and are still a steal compared to buying them at a place like the local grocery or hardware store. I love how these are double-sided. They look just as great on the inside of my windows as they do on the outside so they can be adored from all places! The quality and amount of stickers for the price are awesome. A great buy for sure!','','2022-12-01 07:17:11','2022-12-01 07:17:11','1',0),(2545,1687,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ethan','Perfect Decoration for fall','The product was better than I expected.','','2022-12-01 07:17:45','2022-12-01 07:17:45','1',0),(2546,1687,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lewis','Great quality',' These are so well made and very durable. This is my 5th order.','','2022-12-01 07:18:36','2022-12-01 07:18:36','1',0),(2547,1687,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Milton','ok',' These won’t transfer colors as cheaper ones will.','','2022-12-01 07:19:54','2022-12-01 07:19:54','1',0),(2548,1687,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Claude','Liked the product','I liked the product very much. Should be used only on the glass window, if used on paper it will make an oily mark.','','2022-12-01 07:20:50','2022-12-01 07:20:50','1',0),(2549,1687,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Joshua','Great for toddlers','My 1.5yr old loved these. They are reusable and she loved peeling them off the window and putting them all over the house--and no messy residue left behind!','','2022-12-01 07:21:29','2022-12-01 07:21:29','1',0),(2550,1687,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Glen','1.5 year old obsessed','These clings have ended up ALL OVER our house! I love that they don’t leave a trace and my 1.5-year-old can easily stick them just about anywhere (window, cabinet, fridge, wall, etc)! He’s been playing with them for about a week and they’re holding up well!','','2022-12-01 07:22:18','2022-12-01 07:22:18','1',0),(2551,1686,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Harvey','Christmas fun for grandkids!','Came as described, and looks like decorations for the tree. Looks good. It does have creases if you like, you\'d have to iron them out. Can\'t wait to help grandkids decorate! Good value!','','2022-12-01 07:37:24','2022-12-01 07:37:24','1',1),(2552,1686,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Blake','The cutest!!',' Our toddler loves it! He loved it so much we had to leave it up for him to play with all year round! It’s even cuter in person and great for the kiddos!','','2022-12-01 07:38:23','2022-12-01 07:38:23','1',1),(2553,1686,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Antonio','Nice','Fun','','2022-12-01 07:38:56','2022-12-01 07:38:56','1',1),(2554,1686,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Connor','My grandkids love it!','Easter.','','2022-12-01 07:40:24','2022-12-01 07:40:24','1',1),(2555,1686,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Julian','fun','as shown delivered on time very satisfied','','2022-12-01 07:40:57','2022-12-01 07:40:57','1',1),(2556,1686,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aidan',' Excellent','Excellent and pretty','','2022-12-01 07:41:32','2022-12-01 07:41:32','1',1),(2557,1686,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Harold','perfect for christmas',' this tree was perfect for my preschool class, they enjoy getting to decorate the tree. convenient Christmas tree to wipe out and hang on the wall while not taking up a lot of room and easy storage.','','2022-12-01 07:42:27','2022-12-01 07:42:27','1',1),(2558,1686,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Conner','Super cute!','My baby enjoyed watching momma put up her own Christmas tree with all the lights and ornaments. Not only do the lights turn on but they also flicker to give it a different perspective! It is super cute and awesome for the kiddos! Can’t wait for next year to see my baby decorate her tree.','','2022-12-01 07:43:18','2022-12-01 07:43:18','1',1),(2559,1686,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Peter','Fun for a while','My 13-month-old loved sticking the “ornaments” on the tree. But with so much up and down and messing with them the Velcro part came off at least 10 of them in the first week it was up and I will need to glue them back on before next year.','','2022-12-01 07:44:09','2022-12-01 07:44:09','1',1),(2560,1686,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Hunter ','Saved Christmas for my little one',' I was so busy with work that I hadn’t gotten the chance to put up the Christmas tree. To be completely honest, I didn’t want to lug the box from the basement including the ornaments. I had no energy, but I didn’t want to not celebrate since my son was the only one. This saved not only Christmas but he was very ','','2022-12-01 07:45:00','2022-12-01 07:45:00','1',1),(2561,1685,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wade','Cute gnome family!','I have 3 kids and every year I get them a matching ornament. Got these as a set of 5 so I added myself and dad in this year :-) wrote their names on the back w sharpie and it wrote as you\'d expect sharpie would on fabric. They\'re really cute little gnomes all hanging on the tree together. Well made too and light so they don\'t bend the branches down','','2022-12-01 09:42:38','2022-12-01 09:42:38','1',1),(2562,1685,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dave','Nice',' I was pleased with the quality of these little gnomes. They were packaged well arrived on time and the quality is and their quality is Better than expected. I would recommend this product.','','2022-12-01 09:43:17','2022-12-01 09:43:17','1',1),(2563,1685,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Seth','Super cute and well made','Great Christmas tree decoration','','2022-12-01 09:44:01','2022-12-01 09:44:01','1',1),(2564,1685,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ivan ','Christmas Gnomes',' These are so cute! I am obsessed with Gnomes! Thought they were V-Day ones though.','','2022-12-01 09:44:43','2022-12-01 09:44:43','1',1),(2565,1685,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Riley','Gnome Love','So cute, a nice size, and a good price','','2022-12-01 09:45:37','2022-12-01 09:45:37','1',1),(2566,1685,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Gilbert','So cute!','The order arrived quickly and was just as described.','','2022-12-01 09:46:17','2022-12-01 09:46:17','1',1),(2567,1685,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jorge','Cute!','Good price and very cute. Using as ornaments but would make good individual gifts as well.','','2022-12-01 09:46:52','2022-12-01 09:46:52','1',1),(2568,1685,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dan',' Gift','I gave this as a gift to a gnome lover and she loved it!','','2022-12-01 09:47:30','2022-12-01 09:47:30','1',1),(2569,1685,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Brian','The best','They made my Christmas tree this year','','2022-12-01 09:48:03','2022-12-01 09:48:03','1',1),(2570,1685,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Roberto','Very adorable!','Great to use as decorations or stocking stuffers.','','2022-12-01 09:48:37','2022-12-01 09:48:37','1',1),(2571,1684,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Liam ','Great BUY!','Awesome time baking cookies with my grandkids for the Holidays! Great product!','','2022-12-01 10:31:10','2022-12-01 10:31:10','1',1),(2572,1684,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Noah','Very cute','These are very cute','','2022-12-01 10:31:46','2022-12-01 10:31:46','1',1),(2573,1684,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Oliver','Have no problem with them at all','Love them','','2022-12-01 10:33:07','2022-12-01 10:33:07','1',1),(2574,1684,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Elijah','CUTE','Very cute. Made a good gift.','','2022-12-01 10:33:43','2022-12-01 10:33:43','1',1),(2575,1684,NULL,0,5,0,5,'James','Nice kitchen set of potholders and Oven mitts','You can’t beat the price, are not overly bulky, and do the job.','','2022-12-01 10:34:29','2022-12-01 10:34:29','1',1),(2576,1684,NULL,0,5,0,5,'William','Fast and exactly like the picture',' I had these in less than 24 hrs and they were exactly like the pictures','','2022-12-01 10:35:24','2022-12-01 10:35:24','1',1),(2577,1684,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Benjamin','Good set','A good set of pot holders! Thick enough to keep your hands safe. Would buy it again.','','2022-12-01 10:35:59','2022-12-01 10:35:59','1',1),(2578,1684,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lucas',' These work','Very pleasant product, nicely made. The gloves are a little short for a large hand, but they are nice and clean, something my old ones were not.','','2022-12-01 10:37:37','2022-12-01 10:37:37','1',1),(2579,1684,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Henry','Work perfectly','Whether I need to use the holders or the glove, they all performed as described.','','2022-12-01 10:38:11','2022-12-01 10:38:11','1',1),(2580,1684,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Theodore','Fine','They get the job done, what else is there to say?','','2022-12-01 10:38:45','2022-12-01 10:38:45','1',1),(2581,1683,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Oliver','Enjoy','Very securely packed','','2022-12-13 05:23:40','2022-12-13 05:23:40','1',1),(2582,1683,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jake','Love it',' Clean to spoil as a gift','','2022-12-13 05:24:23','2022-12-13 05:24:23','1',1),(2583,1683,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Noah','It mader a fantastic gift - it was a big hit!','Great gift','','2022-12-13 05:25:02','2022-12-13 05:25:02','1',1),(2584,1683,NULL,0,5,0,5,'James',' Perfect gift for a wine lover',' We gave this wine glass for a birthday gift… our friend is a wine enthusiast and has worked at several wineries on the central coast…..He knows his stuff and this is not a “ cheesy” gift… well made','','2022-12-13 05:25:57','2022-12-13 05:25:57','1',1),(2585,1683,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jack','Great gift for wine drinker','Good gift for a wine drinker on a budget','','2022-12-13 05:26:37','2022-12-13 05:26:37','1',1),(2586,1683,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Connor','A good gift for a wine connoisseur',' I bought these for gifts for Christmas for friends they\'re very fun and unique especially if your friend is a kind of sort of wine which makes it definitely a conversation piece and a unique gift specifically for that kind of person I was very pleased with the product and hopefully they enjoyed their gift for many years to come','','2022-12-13 05:27:26','2022-12-13 05:27:26','1',1),(2587,1683,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Liam',' Love It!!','A wonderful gift for anyone. I bought two - one for my husband and one for me. I will get more for family gifts as well. Works with all wine bottles we have tried thus far and glass soda bottles.','','2022-12-13 05:28:29','2022-12-13 05:28:29','1',1),(2588,1683,NULL,0,5,0,5,'John','Bestever',' Easy to use and very easy to hold','','2022-12-13 05:28:59','2022-12-13 05:28:59','1',1),(2589,1683,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Harry','good gift','birthday gift','','2022-12-13 05:29:33','2022-12-13 05:29:33','1',1),(2590,1683,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Callum','Gift','My friend loves her wine, I saw these and it looks like a great gift. The package is very nice and keeps it protected.\r\n','','2022-12-13 05:30:24','2022-12-13 05:30:24','1',1),(2591,1681,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Monroe ','It looks so good!','Loved this! Fit perfectly on my large wall. It has stayed up. A lot of wall art seems to stick for a couple of days and fall off. But these stickers stay!','','2022-12-13 05:39:51','2022-12-13 05:39:51','1',1),(2592,1681,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Quinn','Easy to put on','My wife ordered it and attached it to the wall; if she can do it, anyone can. Very easy and it looks great on our wall','','2022-12-13 05:40:45','2022-12-13 05:40:45','1',1),(2593,1681,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Riley ',' Easy to use','Love this Christmas double-view window clings. Follow the instructions and you can use these every year. Kids loved the stockings. They are adorable and reusable. Very happy I bought the stockings.','','2022-12-13 05:41:33','2022-12-13 05:41:33','1',1),(2594,1681,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Rose','Good quality','Removed from one location to another and remains in a new location. Great adhesive','','2022-12-13 05:42:33','2022-12-13 05:42:33','1',1),(2595,1681,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Rowan','Happy with this decoration','I like everything about it. Very, very pretty even though it’s not very visible at night it adds a lot to a window.\r\nTo make it a lot easier to apply it should be open and unrolled as soon as it arrives. Weigh it down unrolled with something heavy and flat, and keep checking until it no longer curls up when you pick it up. Also when applied to the glass do not press too hard so that if the pieces have to be moved it will be easier to pull off and reapply.','','2022-12-13 05:43:39','2022-12-13 05:43:39','1',1),(2596,1681,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sutton','Love em!','I love how the clings are numbered so you can create the image shown!!','','2022-12-13 05:44:22','2022-12-13 05:44:22','1',1),(2597,1681,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Taylor','Good product','Good quality product','','2022-12-13 05:44:57','2022-12-13 05:44:57','1',1),(2598,1681,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Peyton ',' Love it','These are lovely! My daughter loves all things planets, and these are a very nice addition to her ceiling.','','2022-12-13 05:45:41','2022-12-13 05:45:41','1',1),(2599,1681,NULL,0,5,0,5,'West ','Love it','Easy to use, can be used more than once','','2022-12-13 05:46:34','2022-12-13 05:46:34','1',1),(2600,1681,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jasmin','yeah','these glow pretty well and they’ve stayed up and are super cute','','2022-12-13 05:47:16','2022-12-13 05:47:16','1',1),(2601,1478,NULL,0,5,0,5,'James','My feet already feel better!!!','I was skeptical about these at first and I\'ll admit my bunions are not as pronounced as some people\'s....BUT guys, I haven\'t had this very long and my feet already feel better! It\'s not going to correct anything overnight, but it\'s been a week of consistent night time use and I an already seeing a difference. I wish I had thought to take before pictures because it seems my toe is already a little bit straighter and the knuckle (toe knuckle? Is that a real word...I think you know what I am talking about) is a little less bent / pronounced. I was worried they were going to be too uncomfortable to sleep in, but they are not. I put them on as soon as I get finished with dinner. They are easy enough to adjust and use and comfortable enough to walk around, wash the dishes and watch TV. I wear them all night and just take them off in the morning. I will try to remember to post updates to this review as time passes, because again...I don\'t expect these to correct my feet completely over night when it took years of high heels to ruin them in the first place. BUT I am definitely encouraged with the difference I have seen so far. Try them out... I don\'t think you will be disappointed.','','2022-12-14 05:44:43','2022-12-14 05:44:43','1',1),(2602,1478,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Mary','Best product in market','( Best product in market)\r\nBest product in market and price.\r\n\r\nReview it now after few years using this just to get a better review and I can say it’s still good a new except wears and tears, but compare to many I previously brought this product did not break and very strong even when use daily.\r\n\r\nAll I can say I wasted lots of money when I could only spend it on this product. Top class','','2022-12-14 05:45:38','2022-12-14 05:45:38','1',1),(2603,1478,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Robert','Helpful and comfortable!','Already less pain within 2 weeks after trying many type of bunion correctors . It’s comfortable to use during the day and night as well. The instructions are clear and easy to understand. I know that 2 weeks not enough to fix my bunions but I really recommend this product.','','2022-12-14 05:46:36','2022-12-14 05:46:36','1',1),(2604,1478,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Patricia','Bunion corrector','Many likes regarding this bunion corrector. I can wear it at night and it has been helping. I noticed since I had hip surgery my bunion and toes were turning and crowding! I can wear the rubber pieces during the day. So far after 3 weeks, I am very happy with this purchase. Soft and sturdy construction. A little fuzzing on the part that attaches to the Velcro.','','2022-12-14 05:47:44','2022-12-14 05:47:44','1',1),(2605,1478,NULL,0,5,0,5,'John','A great product which does what it says.........','I brought this product in mid-July and having tried others before I was a little skeptical. I can say after 2 weeks I have found a product that does what it says. I found it comfortable to wear and pulls my big toe into a better position. Making the pain and discomfort go.\r\nI must admit it felt strange at first, but the product is comfortable.\r\nJust follow the instructions and you can’t go wrong.\r\nI also wish to comment on the customer support from this products team. I buy a lot on Amazon and they only really contact you to try and sell you Insurance etc…… however the team from Not emailed to check I got the product, checked I was happy, and if I had any problems or suggestions for them. Have received a second email as more of a check-in to make sure all is going well with the product. I am 100% confident if I had any questions or problems they would be all over it.','','2022-12-14 05:49:00','2022-12-14 05:49:00','1',1),(2606,1478,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jennifer','Easy to wear','I have a bad case of a bunion on my right and a bunion starting on the left. I have read really good reviews and some bad ones. The result is this is a good product easy to use and I like it very much. I will post the results in 3 months.','','2022-12-14 05:50:02','2022-12-14 05:50:02','1',1),(2607,1478,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Michael','It works','What a brilliant package and the price is great, took a bit of time getting used to the foot strap, but stay with it as it works, the silicone supports 3 different types for each foot, which I found very useful when out running, and general walking about, also a great easy to follow booklet, I highly recommend this product, it’s not an overnight fix but sticks with it and the results come, the complete fix in one package','','2022-12-14 05:51:41','2022-12-14 05:51:41','1',1),(2608,1478,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Linda','Works as Advertised',' I was looking for something to help correct my big toes from turning toward my second toe (due to RA). This is very comfortable to use and comes with several \"extras','','2022-12-14 05:52:36','2022-12-14 05:52:36','1',1),(2609,1478,NULL,0,5,0,5,'David','Seems to be working','I\'ve only had this product for about a week but early indications are promising. I\'m faithfully following the instructions and certainly, every day walking is less painful. I haven\'t managed to go a whole night wearing the splints. Starts OK but I wake up with pain in my right foot. Maybe I\'m trying to rush the process.','','2022-12-14 05:54:50','2022-12-14 05:54:50','1',1),(2610,1478,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Elizabeth','Finally relief!!!','Bunion\'s pain was bad. Wore a splint to bed every night for a week with great relief! Now only wear it when needed','','2022-12-14 05:55:38','2022-12-14 05:55:38','1',1),(2611,1224,NULL,0,5,0,5,'William','Honestly, wow. Had to come back to write a review.','So, I\'ve had my eye on these for a couple of years because I initially liked the little groove for the spine. Other stuff like this hurts me. I finally got one during the prime day event. Admittedly, I meant to get the 10-in wheel and accidentally ordered the 6-in. I was bummed when I realized this, but when it arrived I gave it a try.','','2022-12-14 07:01:23','2022-12-14 07:01:23','1',1),(2612,1224,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Richard','Wowowowowowow','My gym has a generic version of the 10” wheel so I wanted to buy this and try it out. I accidentally ordered the 6” and was going to return it for the bigger wheel but tried it out first. Wow. It hurttttt at first bc I had so much tension in my lower back and neck. However I’ve been using it daily now and I have the relief I haven’t had in years, my neck and back feel so much better. Wow, I haven’t had this relief in so long and didn’t even really know this could provide it. I would say don’t try to save a few bucks and get the generic one, buy the chirp wheel, and definitely at least get the 6” if not all of them. If you have lower back and neck pain, I highly recommend trying this.','','2022-12-14 07:02:19','2022-12-14 07:02:19','1',1),(2613,1224,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Joseph','Exceeded Expectations','I was very skeptical of these at first. Before I purchased it, I read hundreds and hundreds of reviews. Upon receiving it, it did take a little getting used to. Your back will be a bit sore for the first few times you roll. The discomfort is normal, but as I read in other reviews, stay with it. The discomfort does go away. Once you get the hang of rolling on it consistently, you will find that your back will pop, stretch, and decompress wonderfully. Are used to going to a chiropractor every couple of weeks. I have not been in a few months now, and I feel great. again, it does take some getting used to, and it is a little uncomfortable at first, but once the muscles in your back, get used to the roller going against them, it will get better, and then you will hardly notice it. I am very impressed with them. Also, go to YouTube to watch videos of people properly rolling if you are having trouble with it.','','2022-12-14 07:03:06','2022-12-14 07:03:06','1',1),(2614,1224,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Thomas','Chirp the pain away','My wife has been struggling with back pain for years. She should try chiropractors\' massage tens machines. Every gimmicky massage or back product is available and nothing has done anything like the chirp wheel. After a recommendation from a co-worker, I decided to surprise her with this and it has changed her life. The first time she used it. I could hear her back popping into place. Today I came home from work and she told me that she doesn\'t have any back pain which is huge because she would try stretching it out and have the pain come back later that day. I\'m so happy for her that she can finally live without pain in her back.','','2022-12-14 07:03:45','2022-12-14 07:03:45','1',1),(2615,1224,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Charles','BUY THIS NOW','I could cry for joy right now. I NEVER write reviews, but I had to come on here and share my feedback. I have chronic upper back pain and issues with knots. I get a monthly 90m deep tissue massage, sometimes two a month if it\'s a bad month. I\'m a mother of two young kids and work full time and am constantly run down. I have had a tension headache for 5 days and couldn\'t get in for a massage. I bought the 6-inch wheel in desperation and OH MY GOSH!!!!!!!!!!!! so much cracking and popping and I can feel the tension leaving my body. It has been amazing!','','2022-12-14 07:04:25','2022-12-14 07:04:25','1',1),(2616,1224,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Barbara','Great for upper back soreness after a few hours of working in the yard or garage...','I have a wide foam roller and was looking for something to focus more along the spine. This is the one! At first, I ordered the large, but I was constantly tipping side to side. I ordered this small one and it\'s perfect. It\'s the same size as my other foam roller. After doing some yard work, after the gym, or working in the garage, I tend to get a little sore. I roll on this for about 30 seconds and then just rest against it. Very satisfied and I\'d recommend it, but have a friend help you when you start off','','2022-12-14 07:05:37','2022-12-14 07:05:37','1',1),(2617,1224,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Susan','Just what I needed','I\'ve had a ton of pain between my shoulder blades that no matter what I did, nothing would release the tension and make it pop. Not a foam roller, stretching tricks, or even my boyfriend pushing on my back. So I bought this hoping it can make it finally pop, and IT DID!! Within 2 minutes of using it, I got 2 LOUD pops between my shoulder blades and a few smaller ones along my spine. I finally got the relief I\'ve been trying to get and so glad I bought this!','','2022-12-14 07:06:20','2022-12-14 07:06:20','1',1),(2618,1224,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jessica','This does what its supposed to','After using this to straighten my spine, it does what it suppose to and I have a better back posture!','','2022-12-14 07:07:02','2022-12-14 07:07:02','1',1),(2619,1224,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sarah','Works as promised','Good investment. Make sure you read the instructions and start slowly. can be used for the back, arms, or legs.','','2022-12-14 07:07:51','2022-12-14 07:07:51','1',1),(2620,1224,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Karen',' Sciatic nerve pain relief','I don’t typically write reviews, however, I have been very impressed with this product. I heard about it through my brother who finally got relief from his slipped disc with the chirp wheel (after months of seeking chiropractic care, I might add). As a pediatric/special needs hygienist, I am constantly putting my body through a lot of stress and I too go to the chiropractor every month. It feels so good to stretch out on these things and I love feeling my back pop (it took a couple of days of rolling to get my back to pop as my muscles were so tight). The best benefit so far has been the relief of the sciatic nerve pain that I have had for the past 2 years since having my 3rd kid. I would have lower back pain down through my buttocks several times a week. I rolled out my lower back and then sat on top of the two smaller wheels and rocked back and forth. I was a different person in the morning! I have had these wheels for 2 months now and have only had about 2 minor flare-ups, which for me is pretty life changing! Also, as a busy Mom, I don’t have much time for myself at home. I can roll out on these wheels for less than 5 minutes and I get so much relief. It’s not something I force myself to do, rather it is something I look forward to doing as it feels so good! Definitely worth the money spent, especially since I have not been to the chiropractor since I purchased this product. I took it to a girls\' camp weekend and to work to show people as I enjoy using these so much. Several different people of different shapes and sizes have used my wheels and the chirp wheels have proven durable! (I just wish I could get a commission off of the sales that were made afterward','','2022-12-14 07:08:57','2022-12-14 07:08:57','1',1),(2621,1735,NULL,0,5,0,5,'dfgdf  e etfefef','sefef efefsdf erg arg',' rewgg ea efewdfasd fe ewafefawsdfaw ewr aerew efdfgzdf erfefef d fregfgaa cvcz erfaewf  dvs gvasdfxzccxv dvsaefe wfae fe gdgfd rtrweikjyuumm j muyjyu juyj','16715362679131.jpg','2022-12-20 11:37:47','2022-12-20 11:37:47','1',1),(2622,1735,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wade ','Great buy','Such a nice way to make cute festive foods or decorations for fall.','','2023-01-03 05:53:31','2023-01-03 05:53:31','1',1),(2623,1735,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dave ','Adorable!','Super cute. Cutters held their shape well and we’re not flimsy. Makes a great size turkey','','2023-01-03 05:54:05','2023-01-03 05:54:05','1',1),(2624,1735,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Seth','Adorable','Adorable','','2023-01-03 05:54:30','2023-01-03 05:54:30','1',1),(2625,1735,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ivan ','Large beautiful centerpiece!','These cutters were very well made and easy to use! My cookies turned out beautifully!! Very large cookies and would make a beautiful centerpiece!!','','2023-01-03 05:55:14','2023-01-03 05:55:14','1',1),(2626,1735,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Riley',' Such a cute turkey cookie platter!','This set is adorable! Makes a very large turkey cookie platter. Recommend!','','2023-01-03 05:56:08','2023-01-03 05:56:08','1',1),(2627,1735,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Gilbert','Well made',' These cutters are well-made, sturdy, and super cute.','','2023-01-03 05:57:06','2023-01-03 05:57:06','1',1),(2628,1735,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jorge','Super Cute Cutters','Ordered this turkey cookie cutter set yesterday and received it today. I couldn\'t wait and immediately mixed up a batch of sugar cookie dough. The cutters arrived in perfect shape, were sturdy, and were cut cleanly. The product posting says that they are dishwasher safe, but I would suggest washing by hand and drying in a warm oven to prevent any rust around the seams.','','2023-01-03 05:58:29','2023-01-03 05:58:29','1',1),(2629,1735,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dan',' Such fun',' I wanted a turkey cookie cutter for Thanksgiving to use with my grandkids while they visited, which turned into a family cookie decorating fun time! Everyone got in on the game! The cookie cutters were such great shapes - even the weird turkey leg! My granddaughter loved the squirrel and acorn - though the acorn was as big as the squirrel! She joined them together for one big cookie!','','2023-01-03 05:59:12','2023-01-03 05:59:12','1',1),(2630,1735,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Brian','Good Quality Cutters','Love these cookie cutters. They seem to me to be of very good quality not thin, or flimsy and easily bent out of shape like cheaper ones are. I also love the size I bought which I would call a large or medium size if you know what I mean. They come in a larger size than the one I bought, but those must be very large or jumbo, judging by the size I bought. I\'m sure taking care of these cutters will last a lifetime. So happy I bought them.','','2023-01-03 06:02:02','2023-01-03 06:02:02','1',1),(2631,1735,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Roberto','Great selection','Baked these cookies for my grandchildren & they loved them.','','2023-01-03 06:02:37','2023-01-03 06:02:37','1',0),(2632,1736,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ramon','Fun for your puppy or cat','Fun for your cat. Overall my puppy loved these fish for some reason he seems to prefer dark colors over bright colors.','','2023-01-05 06:36:55','2023-01-05 06:36:55','1',1),(2633,1736,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Miles','Dog enjoys it','We had one that broke so we had to replace it. Our new dog loves to play with it.','','2023-01-05 06:37:37','2023-01-05 06:37:37','1',1),(2634,1736,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Liam ',' I love these toys','OMG, they were perfect! I wanted a toy bigger than my kitten, and she loves them! I turn it on, throw it on the floor, and she runs for it. Thank you!','','2023-01-05 06:38:34','2023-01-05 06:38:34','1',1),(2635,1736,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Nathaniel','Cats love them','Our youngest kitten will not share the trout. Way funny.','','2023-01-05 06:39:08','2023-01-05 06:39:08','1',1),(2636,1736,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ethan ','Gift for 9 month old','Got these floppy fish for our 9-month-old grandchild. Huge hit!','','2023-01-05 06:39:53','2023-01-05 06:39:53','1',1),(2637,1736,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lewis','Cat Entertianment','The cats seem to be enjoying these.','','2023-01-05 06:40:33','2023-01-05 06:40:33','1',1),(2638,1736,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Milton','GREAT PRICE AND THEY WORK!','Very happy with this item. ','','2023-01-05 06:41:06','2023-01-05 06:41:06','1',1),(2639,1736,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Claude','Rechargeable','Kitten loves to play with them. They are very sensitive to movement because even if you are walking by them they go off.','','2023-01-05 06:42:05','2023-01-05 06:42:05','1',1),(2640,1736,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Joshua',' I am pleasantly surprised!','I got these for my medium size dog who isn’t a destructive chewer. She enjoys playing with them and playing keep away with me.','','2023-01-05 06:42:42','2023-01-05 06:42:42','1',1),(2641,1736,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Glen','Funny toy for cat.','My cat was afraid at first, but now she has it in bed with her.\r\n','','2023-01-05 06:43:22','2023-01-05 06:43:22','1',1),(2642,1737,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Harvey','Good value and durable','Great product but slowly stretch the finger band and do not fully send at first','','2023-01-05 06:45:20','2023-01-05 06:45:20','1',1),(2643,1737,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Blake ','Great for people in therapy for their hand','I can do almost all my therapy in hotel rooms! ','','2023-01-05 06:46:01','2023-01-05 06:46:01','1',1),(2644,1737,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Antonio','Good assortment',' I like the assortment of workouts included with this','','2023-01-05 06:46:53','2023-01-05 06:46:53','1',1),(2645,1737,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Connor ','Great value grip set','The grip set is a nice value.','','2023-01-05 06:47:28','2023-01-05 06:47:28','1',1),(2646,1737,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Julian','Nice little pack','Helped my aunt get her hand strength back after being in a coma','','2023-01-05 06:48:02','2023-01-05 06:48:02','1',1),(2647,1737,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aidan',' A must have after surgery','great','','2023-01-05 06:48:45','2023-01-05 06:48:45','1',1),(2648,1737,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Harold','Great very useful product','I love the cleats it going to make a great Christmas gift for my son. The product is exactly how the seller describes it. Cleats are very durable to use.','','2023-01-05 06:49:36','2023-01-05 06:49:36','1',1),(2649,1737,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Conner','Good product','I\'m excited to have received these items! They are good quality and will be helpful. ','','2023-01-05 06:50:14','2023-01-05 06:50:14','1',1),(2650,1737,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Peter','great item','for the price is a nice set.','','2023-01-05 06:50:56','2023-01-05 06:50:56','1',1),(2651,1737,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Hunter','awesome','awesome','','2023-01-05 06:51:33','2023-01-05 06:51:33','1',1),(2652,1734,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Eli ','My Cat LOVES it','I don\'t normally write reviews, but I have to for this one. My cat is crazy for this fish. We have named him Mack the Mackerel. He always plays with him, carries him around when the battery dies, and always keeps him around. Easy to charge and clean, one of my best purchases ever.','','2023-01-09 05:28:21','2023-01-09 05:28:21','1',1),(2653,1734,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Alberto','Perfect toy','I bought this for my cat but they pretty much ignore it. But my dogs........OMG, they love it (they are small dogs, a large dog would probably break it quickly).','','2023-01-09 05:29:04','2023-01-09 05:29:04','1',1),(2654,1734,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Carlos ','Battery operated catnip fish toy for cats','My cat plays with this toy often. You can use the catnip that comes with it or without it, either way, my cat was entertained by it.','','2023-01-09 05:30:08','2023-01-09 05:30:08','1',1),(2655,1734,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Shane','Well made','Well made, cats are entertained by it, charge lasts Long. It does take some good sweating to keep it moving.','','2023-01-09 05:30:49','2023-01-09 05:30:49','1',1),(2656,1734,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aaron ','Great toy!','The product works great, pets love it!','','2023-01-09 05:31:32','2023-01-09 05:31:32','1',1),(2657,1734,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Marlin','Cats give this 5 paws up for fun!','I, Binx, and my brother Salem received this fish thing for Xmas..like really a fake fish...ha like we would be interested in such a thing...we hate to admit this..but we love it, it takes all our kitty kicks and bites and keeps on flipping....this is the perfect gift...','','2023-01-09 05:32:45','2023-01-09 05:32:45','1',1),(2658,1734,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Paul ',' Cat loves it!',' I love almost everything about this toy; its vibrant colors, it\'s softness, durability, and ease of charging. The flopping motion is dramatic and not too noisy unless the cat presses it up against a door or something, then it sounds like knocking. I love that it has a time-out feature, so when it\'s not being played with, it doesn\'t waste battery. Even with that, it\'s no match for an active young cat who wants to play with it for hours.','','2023-01-09 05:33:45','2023-01-09 05:33:45','1',1),(2659,1734,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ricardo ','My hands and feet couldn’t be happier','I was skeptical but this is exactly what we needed. I found my 5-month-old kitten abandoned by a barn when she was about 4 weeks old. My dog and I have been all she has known since then as far as playmates go. My hands and feet became the targets of her high prey drive and I was at a loss on how to break that. She was a little leery of this fish at first but after about 15 minutes she was rolling around on the floor with it. Now she chooses it over all of her other toys regularly and will play herself right into a nap with this thing. The best part… my hands and feet are no longer as interesting! I love that it is easy to wash and that I can recharge it rather than change batteries too! Couldn’t be happier! I will be purchasing some of the others available! For the price, it is worth a try!!','','2023-01-09 05:34:57','2023-01-09 05:34:57','1',1),(2660,1734,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Hector ','A+ customer service','The first one I ordered was defective, I contacted customer service and received a replacement in just a couple of days. Vicky was great! She responded very quickly to my email asking for my order number and address to send a replacement. No hoops to jump through, she was kind, helpful, and efficient. The second fish works great, though my cat is confused why it all of the sudden moves lol. I would not hesitate to buy any other product from this seller in the future.\r\nAs far as the toy goes, it is working as expected. It activates pretty easily when it\'s touched. Stops moving after 30 seconds or so. My cat has never been interested in cat nip but seems to love this one. Happy with this purchase.','','2023-01-09 05:35:54','2023-01-09 05:35:54','1',1),(2661,1734,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Alexis',' MiniMe loves it',' I was really surprised because my kitty who usually only likes her laser toy loves this fish. Her brother plays with it too but not like her. She digs at it with her feet and throws it around. Hides it too. I had a little trouble at first trying to unzip it to charge it. I thought it had a short zipper but it was just kinda stuck. It’s fine now. The charge seems to last a while too. I’m not sure why when leaving a review it asked about remote control, mine didn’t come with one. Maybe there was that option but I didn’t see it when purchased.','','2023-01-09 05:36:49','2023-01-09 05:36:49','1',1),(2662,1733,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Adrian','It’s really pretty','My son loves it','','2023-01-09 06:13:16','2023-01-09 06:13:16','1',1),(2663,1733,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Kingston','Exactly what I wanted','Love this case. It’s pretty, not clunky, and exactly what it was looking for','','2023-01-09 06:14:44','2023-01-09 06:14:44','1',1),(2664,1733,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Douglas ','True Words','The phone case is true in words and fits nicely.','','2023-01-09 06:15:28','2023-01-09 06:15:28','1',1),(2665,1733,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Gerald','Love it','It’s beautiful and fits just right','','2023-01-09 06:16:08','2023-01-09 06:16:08','1',1),(2666,1733,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Joey','My favorite iPhone case maker','My third Bentoben case (iPhone 11, 12, & 13): is sturdy, attractive, and inexpensive.','','2023-01-09 06:16:57','2023-01-09 06:16:57','1',1),(2667,1733,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Johnny','It glows soft',' I love that I can find my cell phone in the dark. The cover is ok. Love it cool colors. And So far my cellphone has survived a few falls.','','2023-01-09 06:17:47','2023-01-09 06:17:47','1',1),(2668,1733,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Charlie','Glow in the Dark','I like this case. It’s pretty and glows in the dark. I get a lot of compliments. ','','2023-01-09 06:18:38','2023-01-09 06:18:38','1',1),(2669,1733,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Scott ','Glows in the dark','This case does its job of protecting the phone.','','2023-01-09 06:19:35','2023-01-09 06:19:35','1',1),(2670,1733,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Martin','Good case','it protects the phone so it does its job.','','2023-01-09 06:20:17','2023-01-09 06:20:17','1',1),(2671,1733,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Tristin','Great!','Very light weight and covers up ','','2023-01-09 06:20:48','2023-01-09 06:20:48','1',1),(2672,1732,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Troy','It stays on','The adhesive lasted longer than the leaf.','','2023-01-09 07:09:20','2023-01-09 07:09:20','1',1),(2673,1732,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Tommy ','Very pretty','Very cute, good price','','2023-01-09 07:09:55','2023-01-09 07:09:55','1',1),(2674,1732,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Rick','Cute','Love these!! ','','2023-01-09 07:11:40','2023-01-09 07:11:40','1',1),(2675,1732,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Victor','You get Bang for your bucks',' I\'m a plant lover and I have mostly all of these in my indoor garden I\'ve seen these other places 1 for up to 14$. I love them, so realistic. Hope they keep making different ones, I\'ll keep collecting them.','','2023-01-09 07:13:04','2023-01-09 07:13:04','1',1),(2676,1732,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jessie ','Cute','These are simply ADORABLE!!!!!','','2023-01-09 07:13:49','2023-01-09 07:13:49','1',1),(2677,1732,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Neil ','Exactly as pictured','Exactly as pictured, perfect','','2023-01-09 07:14:34','2023-01-09 07:14:34','1',1),(2678,1732,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ted ','Cute for a plant lover !','I bought this not realizing it came as a 2 pack. One green leaf and one green and pink leaf! They are adorable. These sell on Etsy for easily double the price so this is a great value.','','2023-01-09 07:15:20','2023-01-09 07:15:20','1',1),(2679,1732,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Nick',' Perfect','I got this for the back of my kindle and my love for Plants!','','2023-01-09 07:16:03','2023-01-09 07:16:03','1',1),(2680,1732,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wiley','Super Cute','The design was beautiful','','2023-01-09 07:16:58','2023-01-09 07:16:58','1',1),(2681,1732,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Morris','Worth it!','Love this, even more, beautifully than the pictures. Easy to hold with my iPhone can be expanded twice and at different angles. Be sure to use the small square of the film first to the back of the phone or case. I didn\'t even see it in the package at first so I didn’t use it when I first applied the leaf to my phone. Needless to say, the leaf kept falling off and I was totally upset and ready to send it back. When I went to put it back in its original packaging when I found the adhesive square so I applied that and wow no problems with adhesion now! Just love this product!! Would buy it again!','','2023-01-09 07:18:04','2023-01-09 07:18:04','1',1),(2682,1738,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wade ','Beautiful','I bought this for my mom. It’s absolutely beautiful!','','2023-01-20 09:43:59','2023-01-20 09:43:59','1',1),(2683,1738,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dave ','Nice','My mom loved it','','2023-01-20 09:44:34','2023-01-20 09:44:34','1',1),(2684,1738,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Seth ','Beautiful necklace','I brought this for my aunt as her birthday gift.\r\nI am a little worried about the message, aunts like you are precious, and few can be read after seeing so many reviews that said that it is too small to read. However, my worry disappeared when I get it. The message can be read easily because the letters are engraved with black ink. So don\'t worry about the message.\r\nAs for the shape, oh my god, it is so beautiful. The heart-shaped pendant is delicate and the diamond is shining. My aunt loves it so much, and says that this is the most beautiful necklace she had ever gotten!','','2023-01-20 09:46:06','2023-01-20 09:46:06','1',1),(2685,1738,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ivan','Big & Beautiful','This would be perfect if it came on a longer chain. I think the size of the pendant calls for a longer chain. It would look more balanced. Other than that it is a very nice gift.','','2023-01-20 09:46:47','2023-01-20 09:46:47','1',1),(2686,1738,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Riley','Beautifully made','I ordered \"Mother and Son Forever Love\" for my 12-year-old great-grandson to give to his mom on Christmas morning. He searched all over the net and he chose your necklace. He worked hard for his money and paid for it himself. He said you had the best for his money and after receiving it today, I have to agree with him. He was delighted that it came with a beautiful blue gift box. His mom\'s favorite color. Thanks for that. He wants me to tell you he will be back.','','2023-01-20 09:47:48','2023-01-20 09:47:48','1',1),(2687,1738,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Gilbert ','Love Mother necklace','Love it, but it\'s a little bigger than I thought it would be.','','2023-01-20 09:50:18','2023-01-20 09:50:18','1',1),(2688,1738,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jorge','Great gift','The product was great, but the packaging could be better.','','2023-01-20 09:51:02','2023-01-20 09:51:02','1',1),(2689,1738,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dan','Definitely would recommend','My mom has had this product for a couple of years now and still loves it. It still is in perfect condition and has no defects. I am very satisfied with my purchase.','','2023-01-20 09:51:44','2023-01-20 09:51:44','1',1),(2690,1738,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Brian','INVASIVE but WORTH IT','Both my grandmas loved their necklaces! The packaging was a bit tacky though. It came in a jewelry box with the pendant and the chain in separate plastic packaging. I had to take both out and put the necklace together before securing it into the box and gifting it. Worth it for the price but it was rather obnoxious.','','2023-01-20 09:52:28','2023-01-20 09:52:28','1',1),(2691,1738,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Roberto ','Cute for the price, lovely gift','This is an adorable necklace. My son gave it to me for Christmas. The chain is a little shorter than expected. I wouldn’t expect anything expensive from him (he’s only 9). But it was perfect.','','2023-01-20 09:53:26','2023-01-20 09:53:26','1',1),(2692,1739,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ramon','Beautiful','This was a gift my son gave his mom and she loves it!','','2023-01-20 09:55:41','2023-01-20 09:55:41','1',1),(2693,1739,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Miles','My wife likes it','SHE LIKES WHAT IT STANDS FOR IN HER MIND. SHE SAID I WAS THOUGHTFUL. That makes me feel good.','','2023-01-20 09:57:03','2023-01-20 09:57:03','1',1),(2694,1739,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Liam','Very nice','Very nice','','2023-01-20 09:57:39','2023-01-20 09:57:39','1',1),(2695,1739,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Nathaniel ','Very satisfied','I purchased this as a Christmas gift for a very nice lady who loves cardinals and what they stand for. I can\'t wait to give it to her! I keep you posted!','','2023-01-20 09:58:25','2023-01-20 09:58:25','1',1),(2696,1739,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ethan','Perfect','This cute little piece was given to my friend as a gift after the loss of her mother. She loves it. It came just as pictured.','','2023-01-20 09:59:02','2023-01-20 09:59:02','1',1),(2697,1739,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lewis ','My mother loved it!','Great quality, and an overall beautiful piece.','','2023-01-20 09:59:58','2023-01-20 09:59:58','1',1),(2698,1739,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Milton ',' Beautiful!','I was very surprised and excited when I received my necklace! I didn’t expect it to be so beautiful since it was so inexpensive! It’s a very lovely piece of jewelry!!','','2023-01-20 10:00:49','2023-01-20 10:00:49','1',1),(2699,1739,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Claude','I got when I was promised','I used it for myself and I am enjoying it. Thanks','','2023-01-20 10:01:43','2023-01-20 10:01:43','1',1),(2700,1739,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Joshua ','Perfect',' Got this item for my mom and she wears it all the time','','2023-01-20 10:02:38','2023-01-20 10:02:38','1',1),(2701,1739,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Glen','Pregnant','The pendant was very nice for the money','','2023-01-20 10:03:12','2023-01-20 10:03:12','1',1),(2702,1740,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Harvey ','Perfect!','LOVE THIS RING! Mine is the 1/4 carat size and it\'s perfectly believable for my modest lifestyle! The band is comfortable to fit and even though the stone is \"low profile\" it sits well with my stack. The size is true to fit. An affordable replacement for my real engagement ring which broke after years of wear. Thanks, Amazon!','','2023-01-20 10:19:40','2023-01-20 10:19:40','1',1),(2703,1740,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Blake','Beautiful and just the ticket','I was just searching for a costume diamond solitaire because I couldn\'t care less if it\'s real. I\'m not a jeweler and can\'t tell the difference anyway.','','2023-01-20 10:20:14','2023-01-20 10:20:14','1',1),(2704,1740,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Antonio','Perfect.','3. Gallery sits low enough for wear while working yet has enough height to allow light to pass through the stone adding shine. Not large, gaudy, or overly sparkly to reveal its non-natural gemstone status. The metal likely will need special care and gentle handling regarding water, soap, and such to ward off potential negative changes, however, I still am very pleased with this ring as a supplement to my wedding band and highly recommend it if you\'re looking for a very realistic smaller than one carat sized stone.','','2023-01-20 10:21:04','2023-01-20 10:21:04','1',1),(2705,1740,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Connor ','Very pretty','It’s hard to find “normal” sized stones on here. I wanted a tasteful, realistic look. I did not want the giant, Anna-Nicole, 2 and 3-carat tacky rocks. This is pretty and the perfect size. It fits as it should. And has a beautiful shine.','','2023-01-20 10:22:05','2023-01-20 10:22:05','1',1),(2706,1740,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Julian ','Gorgeous','This ring is so pretty! Love it.','','2023-01-20 10:22:51','2023-01-20 10:22:51','1',1),(2707,1740,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aidan','Beautiful','Beautiful','','2023-01-20 10:23:25','2023-01-20 10:23:25','1',1),(2708,1740,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Harold ','Pretty','Very nice low profile, beautiful setting, and is comfortable. But it’s almost too sparkly to look like a real diamond.','','2023-01-20 10:24:13','2023-01-20 10:24:13','1',1),(2709,1740,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Conner ','Meh','Sturdy with an unobtrusive low profile. The band thickens near the stone which I didn\'t like. I found that it didn\'t look elegant on my finger because of the thickness. I couldn\'t wear it with my ring guard because the band became too wide for the guard to surround the stone properly. It\'s not a bad ring, though - just didn\'t work for what I bought it for.','','2023-01-20 10:24:58','2023-01-20 10:24:58','1',1),(2710,1740,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Peter ','pretty and true to size','my boyfriend ordered this for me because it has been sitting on my wishlist for some time. my friend had just received the $167 2cttw platinum plated, but I, being the bargain hunter I am, found this one for only $19! I compared both and found zero differences. she\'s had hers for almost five months with no discoloration or cloudiness and the durability has been up to par. I\'ve had mine for a week and I work with my hands a lot and haven\'t found any problems with wear and tear. of course, I will update you in a few months as to how the sustainability holds up but thus far it\'s done much justice. it looks like a Swarovski diamond reflects light beautifully, and is just beautiful. unlike other reviews, I think it looks pretty real considering I own other real diamond rings and can\'t tell the difference. it also hasn\'t left me with any green hues on my ring finger even if my hands are clammy. love this! updates to come.','','2023-01-20 10:25:47','2023-01-20 10:25:47','1',1),(2711,1740,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Hunter ','very beautiful','My 84-year-old Mother in Law loves it','','2023-01-20 10:26:31','2023-01-20 10:26:31','1',1),(2712,1741,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Silas','Pretty','It’s a nice necklace','','2023-02-08 06:01:40','2023-02-08 06:01:40','1',1),(2713,1741,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Eloise','Lovely bit of Luck','This piece of jewelry was just as lovely as advertised. I think it would make a great gift for anyone.','','2023-02-08 06:02:26','2023-02-08 06:02:26','1',1),(2714,1741,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Royal','My friend loved it!','This was a gift…my friend loved it','','2023-02-08 06:03:11','2023-02-08 06:03:11','1',1),(2715,1741,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Eleanor','I love it','I love the pink lucky charms','','2023-02-08 06:03:49','2023-02-08 06:03:49','1',1),(2716,1741,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Miles','Beautiful and sturdy','Love this necklace! Came packaged in a unique, cute box - I knew it was going to be great with such detail to just the box. I was not disappointed. The shamrock was larger than expected, very distinctive, great sparkle. I wore it all week and got many compliments. The chain is amazingly sturdy - often the chains on most necklaces are flimsy not so with this one. The chain has a lobster claw clasp and an extension chain which allows for flexibility in where the pendant lays depending on what you are wearing. A great purchase especially if you buy earrings that match.','','2023-02-08 06:04:53','2023-02-08 06:04:53','1',1),(2717,1741,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lucy','My daughter loves this necklace!','I found this necklace in my daughter\'s wish box and noticed it was put there in December 2012. She has four daughters and I took a chance and ordered it and had it shipped to their house. I did call Amy and tell her that something was coming to her and that SHE needed to open it in case she meant for it to be present for one of her girls. It came, the shoe opened and fell in love with it all over again. I saw it on her the next day and it is beautiful. The chain is awesome too and she said that is another reason why she had it on her Wish List. She recommends this to others.','','2023-02-08 06:05:47','2023-02-08 06:05:47','1',1),(2718,1741,NULL,0,5,0,5,'James','Good Quality Costume Jewelry','If you haven\'t ever seen Swarovski crystals before, they are beautiful and are MUCH higher quality than what is typically found in costume jewelry. The chain has nice details with a box-type link that adds a touch of class to the necklace. The four-leaf clover pendant is refreshingly whimsical. Wearing this necklace is a little like being able to take a slice of the outdoors and spring sunshine indoors with you. Now I\'ve always got something beautiful to wear on St. Patrick\'s Day!','','2023-02-08 06:06:30','2023-02-08 06:06:30','1',1),(2719,1741,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Mae','Pretty!','The backside is solid. A very nice director the money!','','2023-02-08 06:07:18','2023-02-08 06:07:18','1',1),(2720,1741,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Hazel ','Beautiful piece of jewelry','I liked everything about the piece of jewelry.\r\nI gave it as a gift.','','2023-02-08 06:07:54','2023-02-08 06:07:54','1',1),(2721,1741,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Scarlett','This four leaf clover necklace/ pendant is beautiful and I am very pleased','This four-leaf clover necklace/ pendant is beautiful and I am very pleased. I get a lot of compliments when wearing it. The only thing I would like to change is the ability to remove the charm from the necklace. Because I have a nickel allergy I cannot wear many necklaces & I had to break the necklace to remove the charm so I could place it on one of my sterling nickel-free necklaces. The necklace it came with was beautiful & I would have liked to be able to give it to my daughter to wear.','','2023-02-08 06:08:58','2023-02-08 06:08:58','1',1),(2722,1742,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lily','Great little light','I bought this for my granddaughter and she loves it.','','2023-02-08 09:39:26','2023-02-08 09:39:26','1',1),(2723,1742,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Everett','For birthday','My granddaughter loved it','','2023-02-08 09:40:06','2023-02-08 09:40:06','1',1),(2724,1742,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Audrey','This is a very soothing and easy to use night light','This is a very soothing and easy-to-use night light. There are several light modes and looks like real 3D.Great product! I like it!','','2023-02-08 09:41:01','2023-02-08 09:41:01','1',1),(2725,1742,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ellis','Super cute. Batteries drain fairly quickly and the usb ..','Super cute. Batteries drain fairly quickly and the USB cord isn’t very long, so I’ll purchase a longer USB cord and we should be good. My daughter loves it.','','2023-02-08 09:41:55','2023-02-08 09:41:55','1',1),(2726,1742,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Graham','Nice color changing bear design lamp','Nice color-changing bear design lamp. I use it as a night light and a decoration for the bedroom. It is kids friendly.','','2023-02-08 09:42:37','2023-02-08 09:42:37','1',1),(2727,1742,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Emmett','Great price for an excellent product','Great price for an excellent product','','2023-02-08 09:43:28','2023-02-08 09:43:28','1',1),(2728,1742,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ella','better than flowers','wife loved it so much','','2023-02-08 09:44:08','2023-02-08 09:44:08','1',1),(2729,1742,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Edith','Very good quality','Very good product, recommend it to everyone','','2023-02-08 09:44:49','2023-02-08 09:44:49','1',1),(2730,1742,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Olive','My granddaughter loves it','My granddaughter loves it.','','2023-02-08 09:45:22','2023-02-08 09:45:22','1',1),(2731,1742,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Daisy','Cute Nightlight','This teddy bear nightlight changes','','2023-02-08 09:46:02','2023-02-08 09:46:02','1',1),(2732,1743,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wade','Cute and worth it','I bought the black version of this as well and luckily this one comes as a pair. They\'re super cute and fit to size.','','2023-02-17 06:34:46','2023-02-17 06:34:46','1',1),(2733,1743,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dave ','Love it','So cute and I would buy it again.','','2023-02-17 06:35:40','2023-02-17 06:35:40','1',1),(2734,1743,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Seth ','Beautiful','They look great and beautiful next to each other.','','2023-02-17 06:36:15','2023-02-17 06:36:15','1',1),(2735,1743,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ivan','The Perfect Promise Rings','I got this for my boyfriend on New Year\'s (almost 10 months ago) and they\'re still in the same condition we received them in. We wear them everywhere we go; neither ring has shown any sign of tarnish or anything, and the engraved letters are still perfect. They\'re very resilient. And the hearts fit together so perfectly. I\'d very much recommend them.','','2023-02-17 06:37:17','2023-02-17 06:37:17','1',1),(2736,1743,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Riley','so pretty!','bought this for my boyfriend and me since we just recently started dating. they’re so cute & so far seem durable! def recommend. (update: boyfriend was shitty but the ring is still pretty!)','','2023-02-17 06:38:07','2023-02-17 06:38:07','1',1),(2737,1743,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Gilbert ','love these!','these rings are so cute!','','2023-02-17 06:38:42','2023-02-17 06:38:42','1',1),(2738,1743,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jorge','rings are very nice','Nice to match with my partner for sure','','2023-02-17 06:39:19','2023-02-17 06:39:19','1',1),(2739,1743,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dan','Absolutely love!','These rings are perfect promise rings! They are beautiful and simple well made rings. They fit perfectly and arrived on time.','','2023-02-17 06:39:58','2023-02-17 06:39:58','1',1),(2740,1743,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Brian','Perfect promise rings','The rings are made of great quality. We love them so much! The small heart fits inside the empty cut-out heart. You can read the message inside perfectly. It’s been a month and we were them 24/7. They haven’t tarnished or gotten scratched up.','','2023-02-17 06:40:40','2023-02-17 06:40:40','1',1),(2741,1743,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Roberto','Company doubled the price','My man and I love them both. Great buy','','2023-02-17 06:41:13','2023-02-17 06:41:13','1',1),(2742,1744,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ramon','It makes for a great soft night light','What a great way to leave a note or share a wish. Very sturdy and durable. Love the design. Easy and fun to use. Highly recommend it, especially at this low price!    ','','2023-02-21 07:08:08','2023-02-21 07:08:08','1',1),(2743,1744,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Miles','great',' I love them. My grandchildren, young adults, began writing messages and pictures right away. My granddaughter just called and asked if the one they had was hers, her brother took it. I ordered more fun','','2023-02-21 07:09:45','2023-02-21 07:09:45','1',1),(2744,1744,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Liam','Great item','They work great','','2023-02-21 07:10:19','2023-02-21 07:10:19','1',1),(2745,1744,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Nathaniel','Nice and cute','My kid loves it','','2023-02-21 07:10:56','2023-02-21 07:10:56','1',1),(2746,1744,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ethan','a clever, unusal gift','Gave this note light to my two adult nephews & they liked it!! So useful, unique & fun. The seller also gave excellent customer service','','2023-02-21 07:12:40','2023-02-21 07:12:40','1',1),(2747,1744,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lewis ','Wow! Great Decor Piece!','This is a great and special piece around my place these days. There is always a reason it seems to get out the white pen and set up another point on this multi or single-colour lighted note holder! I love this thing and recommend it thoroughly to anyone who likes personal or personalized greetings, etc. for their friends and loved ones!\r\n\r\nA great party or other notable day item requiring a great personal message, I urge you to get one of these because it is such a wonderful thing to have for making something special for an event or someone’s special day.\r\n\r\nReally a Super and Special way to display something special to someone special!','','2023-02-21 07:14:08','2023-02-21 07:14:08','1',1),(2748,1744,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Milton',' I LOVE This!','What a great idea. A light and dry-erase board combined. The size is plenty big to write or draw on. So many ways to use it, be it as a reminder, a To Do List, or an affirmation. I wrote a big HELLO on mine the minute I got it out of the box. Amazingly, that one word brings warm fuzzies. Would be a great way to greet guests or set out for a special occasion, like brunch. When the lil ones visit, I can have them wake up to a sweet message. Will be a fun and heartwarming way to let anyone know we\'re thinking of them. Lots of colours to choose from, and can be used plugged in or with a battery cordless, which are wonderful features.','','2023-02-21 07:15:03','2023-02-21 07:15:03','1',1),(2749,1744,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Claude ','love it','This is such a cute decoration to add to any room! The colour-changing option is great and the brightness itself is amazing. It includes two markers and a cloth to clean it. This could make a great housewarming gift or any gift in general.','','2023-02-21 07:15:52','2023-02-21 07:15:52','1',1),(2750,1744,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Joshua ','Cute message board','The board is very cute and looks even better when you turn the light on. I only wish it would have come with a box for the cable.','','2023-02-21 07:16:30','2023-02-21 07:16:30','1',1),(2751,1744,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Glen','Very cute','I got this for my wife and she loves it! The lights are very pretty and The messages I leave her each day make her day. This makes a great gift!','','2023-02-21 07:17:10','2023-02-21 07:17:10','1',1),(2752,1759,NULL,0,5,0,5,'James','Absolutely Adorable!','My girl looks adorable in these Jammies! I was iffy about sizing, but I think I chose the best size for her. ','','2023-02-22 06:15:53','2023-02-22 06:15:53','1',1),(2753,1759,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Mary','Perfect Fit','My pup is between Large and XL based on both her back length at 24in and weight at 65lb. We purchased a large and it fits her perfectly','','2023-02-22 06:16:25','2023-02-22 06:16:25','1',1),(2754,1759,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Robert','Cute and fits!','I measured our Cordy to make sure I got the right fit. I rolled up the back legs a bit but otherwise, it\'s a great fit and she seems to like the little extra warmth it brings.','','2023-02-22 06:17:01','2023-02-22 06:17:01','1',1),(2755,1759,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Patricia','Love these for my ebt!','These are some of the best pj\'s for my boy. He is wearing a 30\". He weighs about 75 pounds. They are quite snug, but not tight..more like you put on little kids fit. They feel cottony, like t-shirt material and it is nice quality','','2023-02-22 06:17:47','2023-02-22 06:17:47','1',1),(2756,1759,NULL,0,5,0,5,'John','Great pair of pajamas for the pup that won\'t break the back','5. I have 2 rescue dogs and one of them is a pebble. She came complete with skin allergies that we have to fight against in the summer. This past summer has been very bad, and we have to keep her from licking her paws and legs to let everything heal, and long socks that go up to the elbow/knee joint are not working for her. So we decided to try long-sleeved pyjamas and short ankle socks for when she won\'t leave her paws alone. After researching, puppy pyjamas are VERY expensive, the average is around $40-$50 for 1 pair. So when I found this one (and a few others) for about $25, I jumped at the product with the thought that this might wind up not being a good product (sometimes things are more expensive for a reason).\r\n\r\nI am very happy to announce that this is not so. These pyjamas are great! They are not super soft right out of the box, but they are not scratchy at all either (she loves them). A quick wash with some safe fabric softener will help. They are sewn so smartly with the crotch area open to allow the pup to potty without having to take them off, and they do not get soiled (she has done both with them on, with no issues). It is also very easy to get them on her. The main fabric is also very lightweight. Winnie runs hot (a little heater) and these are not causing her to overheat.\r\n\r\nThe biggest thing to remember is to MEASURE YOUR DOG. This product has a chart of the three areas and where they are to measure, and a chart to help you find the best size so it fits. My Winnie is a mutt (though mostly Am. Staff) and she fell squarely in between 2 sizes. I erred on the side of going higher because she is a smaller dog but she has long legs and larger paws, and I wanted there to be enough room to get her legs and paws through without changing or hurting her with openings being too small. It is larger, and because of the way, she curls up when she sleeps, her back legs can come out of the sleeves when she gets up. It has not hindered her in pottying though (it does not get in the way). I may try for another style and go the size smaller and see how that is on her.\r\n\r\nBottom line, if you are thinking of trying this out, whether to keep the pup warm or to stop them from licking their skin, this is a great starter. You won\'t break the bank trying to find the right size, and just to see if the dog will handle wearing the garment (some dogs just don\'t like wearing clothes).','','2023-02-22 06:18:52','2023-02-22 06:18:52','1',1),(2757,1759,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jennifer','Great item as advertised','My dog had surgery on her hip and kept breaking the cone on the dog door, after she got healed to a certain point put in this, which she loved. It didn’t seem to mind or bother her incisions.','','2023-02-22 06:19:39','2023-02-22 06:19:39','1',1),(2758,1759,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Michael','was alittle snug but im expecting it to stretch out alittle and its comfortable for my aussie','was a little snug but I\'m expecting it to stretch out a little and it\'s comfortable for my Aussie','','2023-02-22 06:20:29','2023-02-22 06:20:29','1',1),(2759,1759,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Linda','My dog loved her pajamas','Fit great but it could\'ve had a little more stretch to it.','','2023-02-22 06:21:06','2023-02-22 06:21:06','1',1),(2760,1759,NULL,0,5,0,5,'David','Adorable!!!','I adore these pyjamas!!! The material is pretty nice and the fit is great. I chose an XL for my Chocolate Labrador (female, 70 lbs). Her back leg muscles have suffered from arthritis so it fits bigger there, but that was to be expected. No complaints!','','2023-02-22 06:38:36','2023-02-22 06:38:36','1',1),(2761,1759,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Elizabeth',' Pleasantly surprised','We ordered the 32 for our 65 lb, 14+-year-old treeing walking coonhound. I will say, we scoffed when we first saw it as no way in heck was going to fit her but it did. Stretched right out and was easy to get on (our hound is calm and sweet). She likes wearing it around the house as she is getting on up there in years but we usually only put it on for walks. She wears this with a camo hoody and boots as she is prone to frostbite or gets so cold she\'ll just give up. Don\'t know about you, but I don\'t care much for carrying 65 lb dogs home on long walks. Ironically, I hate camo but hounds pull it off well. Ultimately, we found some much cheaper ones on aliexpress (a Chinese site) that are 1/3rd the cost and fleece and I think the dogs like that more, but for our walks, this camo one is perfect for lighter weather (like, 15 degrees, Michigan weather.)','','2023-02-22 06:39:41','2023-02-22 06:39:41','1',1),(2762,1761,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Grayson','Better than a bowl? Not by much','This is a novel idea and works but only to an extent. Essentially the \"paw print\" opening is designed to provide access for the dog to drink. The opening is ok, but really should be larger so that the dog has better access to the water while still not getting wet or sloppy. The video and other material in the reviews are not clear on how the water level rises. Yes, your little FIDO can press down on the floating device (as depicted in the video), but it is not realistic to think that your dog will do that. Maybe the way it is shown in the video is a joke? This has helped with regulating the water so that my dog does not get wet, or drink to the point where he belches or vomits. It also helps that he does not drink so much at one time that he has to take a pee 30 mins later. Small and steady sips of water seem to be a great way to keep him hydrated while not overdoing it. It\'s a nice design, well executed and now that I have it I will keep it, not sure I would go running to replace the matching food bowl for such little payoff and benefit. (PS I tried to upload a picture but for whatever reason AMAZON is not allowing it. There is nothing in the picture that gives you any additional information that I did not share above.)','','2023-02-23 05:37:59','2023-02-23 05:37:59','1',1),(2763,1761,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Scarlett','It helps keep our dogs chin drier!','We were excited to receive this water dish. Our golden doodle went diving every time he took a drink and would come up with a mouth full of water and a chin dripping wet!! We were tired of mopping the floor and wiping his chin every time he got a drink.\r\n\r\nHe had no trouble getting used to using this new dish. We showed him how to get the water and he went right to it. He still gets his chin hairs wet, but not like before. We are doing much less mopping!! I think with a chin hair trim even that might cease.\r\n\r\nThank you for this product.','','2023-02-23 05:38:47','2023-02-23 05:38:47','1',1),(2764,1761,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ella','Helped my dog drink water after a stroke!','This water bowl is exactly what my dog needed after her stroke. Her brain couldn\'t understand to keep her nose out of the water when drinking, so she was unable to drink and would keep trying to breathe in the water. She would sneeze into the bowl and stop trying after a while. Once we got this, game changer! She was able to drink unassisted and for being 13 years old, adapted to it VERY easily. I have even used it for chicken broth water to entice her to drink. I would recommend this to anyone whose dog might need more help drinking water from a disability standpoint. Helpful and easy to dismantle and clean.','','2023-02-23 05:39:44','2023-02-23 05:39:44','1',1),(2765,1761,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Jack ','Doesn’t slow my fur baby down','Our boxer tends to get excited when people come over so he rushes to his food bowl and water bowl, eats and drinks fast, runs around and then pukes. I thought this water bowl would slow down his drinking (and puking) - no such luck! He was a little unsure about the water bowl at first but within a day or so he “figured it out”. The instructions included a “tip” of placing a small treat in the centre so the dog can see that their tongue activates the water dish. It is super easy to take apart to clean. My fur baby seems to be drinking more water since he got this new dish.','','2023-02-23 05:40:38','2023-02-23 05:40:38','1',1),(2766,1761,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Hudson ','No more water all over the floor','This dog bowl is the answer to my prayers. Our dog used to get water everywhere when he drank from his water bowl. Now there is no longer a water mess all over when he drinks. We added a little peanut butter to the divider plate to teach him how to use it and just like that he was drinking like a pro from it. This bowl is one of my best purchases.','','2023-02-23 05:41:22','2023-02-23 05:41:22','1',1),(2767,1761,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Willow','Great for \"flat faced\" dogs','Most reviews were for \"sloppy dogs\" My 2 little part pugs (therefore flat Faced) would inhale water when they drank and then choke and sputter for a while and then try and wipe their faces on the nearby rug. This is truly amazing. In the 5 days we\'ve been using it, there was only one very small episode in the beginning which was quickly resolved. I think they drink more water now. And there was no learning period. They figured it out right away. I definitely would recommend this without hesitation.','','2023-02-23 05:42:24','2023-02-23 05:42:24','1',1),(2768,1761,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Hazel','Drip Free Doggo','This bowl is amazing! My doodle used to water my floor with his beard every time he took a drink. But for the last 3 days I haven\'t had to wipe his face nor have I had puddles in the kitchen!\r\nThe reason for 4 stars, not 5 is that it is not dishwasher safe and is kind of a pain to wash. You have to take the \"floating\" top apart to wash. Not fun!','','2023-02-23 05:43:18','2023-02-23 05:43:18','1',1),(2769,1761,NULL,0,3,0,5,'Maverick','Almost leak proof','Bought this to replace our dogs\' water bowl that was making a mess everywhere. I love the way this new bowl functions. It is not quite a mess proof but a huge improvement. The water bowl is easy to put together and seems well made. There is one piece that fastens the middle piece in place that seems a bit fragile but so far so good. I love how easy it is to refill. You can just pour the water right on top. Our dog took to it right away and there is no more mess every time he drinks.','','2023-02-23 05:44:16','2023-02-23 05:44:16','1',1),(2770,1761,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Carter','Life Saver!','I never write reviews but I cannot express enough how thankful I am that this product is on the market. My Pomeranian has a collapsing trachea and would choke every time she drank water. It was heartbreaking to see all the coughing spells and this was exactly what she needed. A SLOW DOWN bowl so she stops gulping down so much water at once. I was a little worried that it would be too big for her, but she figured it out and is now using it with no issues. And no coughing.\r\n\r\nWith that being said, I could see how it may not work if you are more concerned about your dog playing in its water dish and making a mess. But for a collapsing trachea 10/10.','','2023-02-23 05:45:24','2023-02-23 05:45:24','1',1),(2771,1761,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Waylon','Dog dish','Works well and helps reduce water splash onto the floor. UPDATE: Centrepiece which floats to assist in reducing water splash is now filling with water. See how long it lasts. Has been about a month and a bit of use. Update #3, 4 stars, a Google search resulted in how to remove the water inside the floating part of the dish. Removed the water and now working like new.','','2023-02-23 05:46:13','2023-02-23 05:46:13','1',1),(2772,1762,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wade ','Superior quality! 4+ Uses. Extremely affordable! PERFECT for EVERY LEVEL of yoga. Thank you TUMAZ!','The Tumaz yoga strap is so so incredibly fantastic! I don\'t even know where to start. An incomparable hidden gem that\'s so unique that I will NEVER stop being grateful that I found it and it\'s now a part of my everyday life! It\'s absolutely everything I could possibly need or even think to want from a yoga strap, and still SO MUCH MORE! My husband got it for me, the genius, but since I\'m only 5\'5\", I should probably have the 6 ft length instead of the 8 ft, but it still works like a charm, just as it should ;) ... (Although the extra length hasn\'t cause me any trouble yet so far, plus I can just fold it half if I REALLY need it to be shorter). It was most definitely designed AND created with the ACTUAL customer in mind which becomes so apparent when you learn all of its uses and functions, they definitely thought A LOT about how best it could be made to meet as many needs of as many people as possible. I\'m just one person and use it every single day in every way possible, for example, yoga of course, AMAZING stretch sessions whether it be pre-workout, as a relaxation technique, a part of your daily routine simply because it FEELS Good and is GOOD FOR YOU.. It also keeps your blood flowing and has been proven to aid in healthier, better circulation, you could be less likely to suffer any muscle injury(s) if they\'re kept typically warmed up, limber and stretched out, and the list could go on... Also obvious? The additional care and thoughtfulness put into making it the highest quality possible, which you can feel (quite literally) in the strap when you hold it and work with it. It feels truly outstanding which means EXACT, perfect amount of what I call \"a straps stretch and slide\" across and around my hands and my body, leading to far more balanced and NATURAL body movements when it\'s in your hands as well as increased fluidity and enhanced stretches, poses, and flexibility as it moves with you, with precision, right where you want and/or need it to go and it takes you along. The more often and longer you use it, the more it will become an extension of you and your movements, feels as natural as walking and eventually as breathing. Even when you\'ve become stretch, yoga, and flexibility goddesses and gods, you\'ll still find yourself going for that strap. BUT! Definitely don\'t misunderstand my meaning... Because it\'s not so flawlessly smooth that it\'s texture is overly \"silky\" like some straps can be, so that your constantly loosing your grip or positions in poses, long or tight stretches, etc etc. Or even worse, it\'s most definitely NOTHING AT ALL like those rough and tough nylon straps of good ol\' days (lol) which was almost exactly the same material of the first yoga strap I used my first time in 2004, back when you were bullied for doing yoga instead of praised... Crazy how quickly things can change, isn\'t it? Those old straps, after a hard go, could make your hands feel like you spent the day digging holes with a splintered shovel instead of taking an extended yoga class. So YES, definitely, this strap is TRULY one of the top 2 best straps I have ever used or worked with or laid my hands on, ever since my very first time on a yoga mat, with my first strap in my hands, exactly 15 years ago... Along with my wandering mind, that was wondering what the heck was wrong with me (nothing at all is the answer to that - at the time it was without a doubt, all societies fault) and not the slightest idea what I was even supposed to even be doing lol. I really wish I\'d had this back then!... This yoga strap truly is ABSOLUTELY BRILLIANT! SO... Whether your new to it or have been practicing for years, an actually GOOD, TRUE quality, and seriously STRONG yoga strap is something you\'ll always want to have with you if you\'ve got yoga on your mind. You wouldn\'t practice without your mat right? Trust me when I say that you WILL, at some point, walk upon different yoga occasions, classes, teachers, friends, peers and most definitely some very intense yet personally challenging online classes and believe me when I say your really gonna want your strap then and wish you actually had it. And after my time spent with this strap so far, it\'s become an extension of me, when I need it, or even just want to use it. And it happened so easily and quite honestly, very quickly as well, the bond, how in sync we are. It\'s never slipped a foot, leg, nothing, sending me rolling to or across the floor. It didn\'t even moan or groan in complaint when it was my swing and then my upside down lumbar support, (which, actually, was only one of the times the extra length has come in handy now that I think about it). A few extras benefits I forgot to mention in more detail that were also added to the TUMAZ yoga strap, (with obvious care in mind), are that it\'s made from polyester cotton, so it has a great grip but also still the perfect softness, not to mention a decent stretch to the entire strap, which only adds to the many benefits and features of it. Like how it can be used not just for yoga but is also great for pilates as well.. I\'ve yet to try that, so won\'t speak to it. And it\'s incredible for good, full body stretches like I mentioned above. One of my favorite times to stretch is alone before I meditate, I feel so much more calm and relaxed when I\'ve finished a great, full body stretch and my muscles are super relaxed, and any stress or tension fades almost entirely (and before I\'ve even meditated!) and as a result I get so much more out of my personal meditations. On each end of the strap it also has a 4 mm, each WELDED together, D-ring buckle. The D-rings on most yoga straps break easily so the safety of these was quite literally \"put to the test\" to try them out.. A REAL \"maximum load\" test! And naturally, both rings can together and simultaneously, hold over 2,300 pounds. Although I\'m not quite sure of the point of that. Just even more evidence of the time they took to truly see to EVERY ASPECT of the quality of their straps, if I had to guess :). For anyone still \"thinking about it\". And if all of that isn\'t enough to convince you, they can also be used in physical therapy exercises and treatments where they actually proved to be impressively helpful. We haven\'t been together too awful long yet, my new strap and I that is, but I already know I will be keeping a TUMAZ YOGA STRAP (or more likely two) in my life, forever! So, HANDS DOWN, LADIES AND GENTS! IT IS FAR AND AWAY A WINNER! :) SO. If your shopping for a yoga strap or just want a new one or a back up... I 100%, ABSOLUTELY Recommend THIS ONE! AND IF I WAS ON THE FENCE, WHICH STATISTICALLY, A LOT OF YOU ARE, I\'D BUY ONE OF THESE AND ASAP! Cause y\'all... There just ain\'t a chance in yoga that this purchase COULD EVER or WOULD EVER be a purchase that you\'d be capable of regretting. THAT, in my obviously overly excited, yet humble, yoga loving and zen positive opinion, would be beyond inconceivable! -It\'s available in 15 sweeeet colors, to satisfy everyones favorite color necessities, of course. -it comes in 3 lengths -ECO FRIENDLY DYEING! One of my favorite parts... And this is long enough. Go to the ad on Amazon and read the product features and product description yourself, I\'ve already said far more than enough. Oh also their only $5.49-$8.95 each, free shipping if you have prime too. WHAT?! What are you waiting for? I got the 8 ft in the pretty \"pink match\" color. It cost $7.95. The price varies a bit depending on what length and color you buy. Happy strap shopping, I hope you all buy one!','','2023-02-27 05:09:29','2023-02-27 05:09:29','1',1),(2773,1762,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dave','Works','Cute color and durable','','2023-02-27 05:10:11','2023-02-27 05:10:11','1',1),(2774,1762,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Seth','Perfect length','As expected. 8 feet is the perfect length for all kinds of exercise.','','2023-02-27 05:11:06','2023-02-27 05:11:06','1',1),(2775,1762,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ivan','five stars','This strap is just right. It feels sturdy but it isn\'t too stiff. The colour is very pretty and the fabric feels comfortable against my skin. The texture is just right as well. The buckle works well and holds the strap in the chosen position without slipping.','','2023-02-27 05:11:52','2023-02-27 05:11:52','1',1),(2776,1762,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Riley','Yoga Strap','Using this in my yoga practice. Soft, good length, and durable.','','2023-02-27 05:12:37','2023-02-27 05:12:37','1',1),(2777,1762,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Gilbert','It\'s a yoga strap','It seems to be a good strap and functions as intended. Appears to be durable except for that little piece of elastic. Within a couple of uses, I noticed the elastic starting to break and don\'t expect it to last long. It\'s a nice little feature but there\'s no reason you couldn\'t use a hair elastic, rubber band or velcro strap. I certainly would not buy it just because it has elastic sewn into it.','','2023-02-27 05:13:23','2023-02-27 05:13:23','1',1),(2778,1762,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jorge','Just order it','This is a very, very good strap. Sturdy, thick, good texture (soft but not slippery), made well, heavy weight bearing. You won’t regret ordering multiple of these!','','2023-02-27 05:14:12','2023-02-27 05:14:12','1',1),(2779,1762,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dan','Soft, Heavy Duty, Will Last','The strap material is soft and non-abrasive. The stitching and D rings are heavy-duty. This will last.','','2023-02-27 05:15:05','2023-02-27 05:15:05','1',1),(2780,1762,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Brian ','Great resistance workout belt','Just right, and easy to use for those resistance exercises. Along with a large foam roller I\'ve managed to correct a problem with my SI joint which I\'ve suffered with for a few years. Very pleased.','','2023-02-27 05:15:46','2023-02-27 05:15:46','1',1),(2781,1762,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Roberto','Great strap','This is a great length for me - I\'m 168cm tall. I use it for physio on my leg/foot and find it a good product. The material is soft and it\'s well stitched. Plus a little holding band to keep it neatly folded. I\'m pleased I chose this strap','','2023-02-27 05:16:35','2023-02-27 05:16:35','1',1),(2782,1760,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ramon ','Spill proof','Searched all over the place for this dog mat my dog is disabled and cannot walk properly and is able unable to urinate on her own so she has many accidents this was the perfect answer to that problem I put this in the washing machine every other day it still does the job easy to clean large enough for a French bulldog if you\'re looking for a mat to repel urine and accidental elimination problems this is the answer by it.','','2023-02-27 06:45:00','2023-02-27 06:45:00','1',1),(2783,1760,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Miles','Pup Blanket / Pad','This pad is exactly what I was looking for. We are training our little rescue pup to be “portable” so we can take him to restaurants and other outdoor venues (we are in San Diego so lots of dog-friendly options) I am not too keen on him laying on the ground in restaurants etc. because it’s gross so this works well, especially because the bottom is dark and waterproof.\r\nOf course, I wash it regularly, but it lays on the ground which is dirty and will transfer that dirt to the pad being waterproof the fabric is less absorbent but not “plastic” feeling so still comfy for him to lay on. Thank you for taking this in mind when designing this product! So many other pads are light on the bottom layer and waterproof, which means it will be gross in no time- also love that it’s waterproof because he has flipped over his water bowl and the water wicks right off. I love the bag that comes with it which is also waterproof and compact enough to tuck into a tote but roomy enough to pack his portable feeding containers so his stuff is “all in one” overall great product and a great price! Thank you!','','2023-02-27 06:45:59','2023-02-27 06:45:59','1',1),(2784,1760,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Liam','Handy','It was okay for travel, and handy too. But was expecting it to be a little firmer but seemed so soft that if you lay it on a rocky surface, you will feel the discomfort.','','2023-02-27 06:48:12','2023-02-27 06:48:12','1',1),(2785,1760,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Nathaniel','Happy I bought this portable dog bed!','Great size and rolls easily into the bag that comes with it.','','2023-02-27 06:49:09','2023-02-27 06:49:09','1',1),(2786,1760,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ethan','Good for my service dog','My service dog, as you can guess, goes everywhere with me. I use this mat for all the crazy places we go. In restaurants, people drop food under tables and it isn’t always get up between customers. My dog would have to lay near or on all that. And no, he’s not allowed to nibble, as it could be toxic to him! It is rather long for restaurant use but it folds in half neatly! This mat is great for cold floors like hospitals or the tire company, basically anywhere I need to spend some time and he needs a place to lay. I wouldn’t use it as a crate mat as it doesn’t have the loft my dog likes. And being water resistant it’s not snuggly. He likes snuggly stuff in his crate! This mat is great for travel, camping, picnics and things like that. I haven’t had to wash it yet but I seldom have issues on that point. I love the green grass, but it is also a color ride that a dog can perceive. But his ability to pick it out by sight isn’t necessary for our application. For me, this is a good buy! Satisfied! I haven’t had it long enough so I’m leaving the 5th star till we’ve used it for a while.','','2023-02-27 06:50:30','2023-02-27 06:50:30','1',1),(2787,1760,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lewis','Bought for front of kayak','I bought this mat to lay on the front of my kayak so my pup had a bit of comfort on longer-day paddles. It is well-made and has just enough padding to make the platform a little comfier without being too bulky. I am happy with this purchase.','','2023-02-27 06:51:11','2023-02-27 06:51:11','1',1),(2788,1760,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Milton ','Love it',' My dog has gotten sick on a day last week and just so happened to vomit on it and it was so easy to clean and has yet to be stained!','','2023-02-27 06:52:05','2023-02-27 06:52:05','1',1),(2789,1760,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Claude','Easy cleaning','This is great. Purchased for our new pup who is still being potty trained. Durable and can handle several piles of washing.','','2023-02-27 06:52:45','2023-02-27 06:52:45','1',1),(2790,1760,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Joshua','Excellent quality','Such a great product. We love putting this out in the backyard while we have coffee and our dog wants to sit with us but doesn\'t enjoy dry grass. Yes, she is spoiled. Really good quality and super soft.','','2023-02-27 06:53:20','2023-02-27 06:53:20','1',1),(2791,1760,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Glen','Liked it so much Ordered Two More','My dog is a therapy dog so it’s great how it folds up in a little bag and I can take it on visits. She loves it and it’s super comfortable.','','2023-02-27 06:53:58','2023-02-27 06:53:58','1',1),(2792,1759,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Harvey ','They are adorable','There\'s enough stretch my dog is a pear head chihuahua around 3 lbs he looks so cute in them and it helps keep him super warm since he is always cold. They are so soft. I just love everything about them!!','','2023-02-27 07:20:42','2023-02-27 07:20:42','1',0),(2793,1758,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Harvey','Love this','Love this piece but it’s barely been two months and I have three stones missing','','2023-02-27 08:11:26','2023-02-27 08:11:26','1',1),(2794,1758,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Blake ','Infinity Bracelet','This bracelet is very beautiful. It’s perfect.','','2023-02-27 08:12:30','2023-02-27 08:12:30','1',1),(2795,1758,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Antonio','Really like the design','I like the design and it\'s very sparkly and pretty.','','2023-02-27 08:13:11','2023-02-27 08:13:11','1',1),(2796,1758,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Connor','Beautiful ','Beautiful','','2023-02-27 08:13:41','2023-02-27 08:13:41','1',1),(2797,1758,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Julian','Quality gift','This was beautiful and the gift well received','','2023-02-27 08:14:16','2023-02-27 08:14:16','1',1),(2798,1758,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Aidan','Elegant Happiness','Got this as a Christmas gift for my wife looks great and she loves it.','','2023-02-27 08:14:47','2023-02-27 08:14:47','1',1),(2799,1758,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Harold ','Simple, but elegant',' I’m not to wear a bracelet casually. But I like it. Very simple design, but means a lot','','2023-02-27 08:15:25','2023-02-27 08:15:25','1',1),(2800,1758,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Conner','Eye catching','This dazzling necklace is so pretty and interesting w the dangly bead in the front I always get compliments on it. The chain is adjustable so it can be worn as a choker or a little looser on the clavicles.\r\nIt adds a nice touch of sparkle and easily coordinates w my other pieces- would recommend it!','','2023-02-27 08:16:14','2023-02-27 08:16:14','1',1),(2801,1758,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Peter','Excelente','Fit excelente','','2023-02-27 08:16:45','2023-02-27 08:16:45','1',1),(2802,1758,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Hunter','So very pretty','Love this bracelet as it just looks very pretty and works well for my rather small wrist','','2023-02-27 08:17:19','2023-02-27 08:17:19','1',1),(2803,1763,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wade','Fun shapes for Easter candy','Variety of shapes and easy to use','','2023-03-02 06:14:11','2023-03-02 06:14:11','1',1),(2804,1763,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dave','Super cute and worth it!',' I bought these to make chocolate eggs for my kids at easter but thought I should give them a test run first. They were all I had hoped for and easy to use and clean. I would recommend them!','','2023-03-02 06:15:10','2023-03-02 06:15:10','1',1),(2805,1763,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Seth','Good molds',' I ended up using these moulds to make chocolates and gummies. Both came out well! Easy to use and popped right out of the mould.','','2023-03-02 06:15:56','2023-03-02 06:15:56','1',1),(2806,1763,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ivan','Easter fun',' Made grandkid\'s Easter baskets with some homemade candy','','2023-03-02 06:16:39','2023-03-02 06:16:39','1',1),(2807,1763,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Riley','I love it',' I made candy with it','','2023-03-02 06:18:04','2023-03-02 06:18:04','1',1),(2808,1763,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Gilbert','My order is just what I ask for. Thanks','I love my items I will be Making sweets for Easter','','2023-03-02 06:18:47','2023-03-02 06:18:47','1',1),(2809,1763,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jorge','Love these molds! Perfect!!',' These moulds were so easy to use. Also, a big hit for Easter treats!','','2023-03-02 06:19:24','2023-03-02 06:19:24','1',1),(2810,1763,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dan','Fab silicone moulds','Arrived quickly, were a great size, and were fun to use, I used chocolate and they didn\'t take long to set, would recommend','','2023-03-02 06:20:56','2023-03-02 06:20:56','1',1),(2811,1763,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Brian ','Easter molds','I have not used these yet but they are the exact size I was looking for. Perfect for children\'s Easter baskets.','','2023-03-02 06:21:38','2023-03-02 06:21:38','1',1),(2812,1763,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Roberto ','Easy to use and adorable','Easy to use','','2023-03-02 06:22:10','2023-03-02 06:22:10','1',1),(2813,1766,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wade','Good price','Grandkids enjoyed painting them. Everything you needed came with a kit. Nice purchases for the price.','','2023-03-09 07:11:16','2023-03-09 07:11:16','1',1),(2814,1766,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dave','Cute and fun to make','My students had a fun time decorating and making these!','','2023-03-09 07:11:50','2023-03-09 07:11:50','1',1),(2815,1766,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dave','Cute and fun to make','My students had a fun time decorating and making these!','','2023-03-09 07:11:50','2023-03-09 07:11:50','1',1),(2816,1766,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Seth','7th grade Easter project','We painted these with acrylic paints and gave them to our kindergarten classes. They looked cool.','','2023-03-09 07:12:32','2023-03-09 07:12:32','1',1),(2817,1766,NULL,0,5,0,5,'We painted these with acrylic paints and gave them to our kindergarten classes. They looked really cool.','Great project for kids','Purchased for 5 and 3-year-olds. They had the best time painting and decorating these. Great fun!','','2023-03-09 07:13:10','2023-03-09 07:13:10','1',1),(2818,1766,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Riley','Really good pieces! I had so much fun painting them!','They all came in sets of two of each and me and my family painted them differently so it came out great! I can\'t believe it took so long for us to paint them (family members have super shaky hands) and it\'s hard to find something worthwhile that\'s not either childish or too intricate to paint. So I\'m very glad to have found these for such a good price for so many! Loved doing these and had an amazing time! Thanks for the cute time killer and anxiety outlet!','','2023-03-09 07:14:53','2023-03-09 07:14:53','1',1),(2819,1766,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Gilbert','Fun for Children AND Adults. Festive and Fun Decorations. Generous Supply! ','This set of 48 Pieces of Unfinished Wooden Eggs, Bunnies, and other spring/Easter Crafts/Ornaments/Decorations brought the grandchildren much joy (and is still bringing). They love crafts and painting. We\'re going to hang these from our archway between the kitchen and living room for Easter/spring. We have a couple of months to get them all painted and on their strings. We\'ve got quite a good start, as the kids did not want to stop painting on them. There are so many fun shapes to choose from. Great craft project, however, you decide to use them. The grandkids LOVE these, and finding ways to celebrate the holidays is always fun.','','2023-03-09 07:15:44','2023-03-09 07:15:44','1',1),(2820,1766,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jorge','Beautiful!',' I got these as an Easter craft activity to keep my child entertained - it turns out that we spent hours colouring these with markers and they turned out beautifully! If you use markers, there is a tiny little bit of spreading that occurs from where you put the pen marks, giving a slight watercolour effect. Even my husband loved working on these! I was mesmerized by all of the intricate details on the ornaments - and none of the ornaments had even the slightest defect. Highly recommend!','','2023-03-09 07:16:30','2023-03-09 07:16:30','1',1),(2821,1766,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dan','Fun project with great value','Super quick delivery, well-cut pieces, and a large variety. We have had several painting sessions with four generations. The variety allows all skills to make great art!','','2023-03-09 07:17:07','2023-03-09 07:17:07','1',1),(2822,1766,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Brian','Nice quality','We coloured with markers to decorate an Easter tree. They would be lovely stained, painted, or coloured with markers.','','2023-03-09 07:18:35','2023-03-09 07:18:35','1',1),(2823,1766,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Roberto ','Small, but nice','Cute and well-made for the price. Smaller than expected, but made cute gifts for my kid\'s classmates','','2023-03-09 07:19:16','2023-03-09 07:19:16','1',1),(2824,1767,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ramon','The glow doesn’t come easy','The price is great for four nice-looking moon necklaces. I got them for my wife and she loves them. The only thing I wish was better is that to get them to glow, you have to have some bright light on the “stone” portion for some time to see any glow after. It isn’t going to inherently get enough light to glow that often. Aside from that, the style is very appealing. Each of the four had a different coloured stone as well.','','2023-03-10 07:17:19','2023-03-10 07:17:19','1',1),(2825,1767,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Miles','It takes time. IN THE SUN','My husband bought these for me. So I ran to the darkest room in the house, no glow. I hung allb4 in 5he w8ndow I. The sun all glowed pretty bright after that.\r\nI like the moon design\r\nIt was welcome. e sweet gift. I love them.','','2023-03-10 07:18:19','2023-03-10 07:18:19','1',1),(2826,1767,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Liam ','Nice glow','The reviews were right about the blue ones being the most visible. My purple one came with the chain tangled and hooked in the wrong spot. Also, the purple one doesn’t glow at all, like literally. It was a pain to put back together but overall cute.','','2023-03-10 07:20:06','2023-03-10 07:20:06','1',1),(2827,1767,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Nathaniel ','Got what I paid for','Excellent and on-time delivery as promised','','2023-03-10 07:21:16','2023-03-10 07:21:16','1',1),(2828,1767,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ethan','Beautiful Design & Glow','I loved the design and its glowing in the dark is another thing I\'m obsessed with. The purple takes the longest to charge with a normal lightbulb,\r\nI held it to the bulb for a minute only to get a soft glow. I used a handheld blacklight for 30secs and worked great! The green charge is the quickest and has the brightest glow with either light. The two blues are also quick charges too. Sunlight gives all the colours a supercharge!! I gifted them to my best friends and kept one for myself. I did break the chain of my necklace by the moon getting hung on the armrest of my computer chair reaching for something on the floor, the moon did not bend or break at all, so it has a very sturdy charm! I\'m very rough with chains though, I always need a strong chain or end up changing them out with hemp cord.','','2023-03-10 07:22:21','2023-03-10 07:22:21','1',1),(2829,1767,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lewis','Pretty','Not very bright, but cool','','2023-03-10 07:23:38','2023-03-10 07:23:38','1',1),(2830,1767,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Milton','very good gift!','i love love love this, all the negative reviews didn\'t apply ','','2023-03-10 07:24:12','2023-03-10 07:24:12','1',1),(2831,1767,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Claude','good/okay','I didn’t think they would glow but after around ten minutes of leaving the light on it, it stayed for a while the moon was a lot bigger than I expected','','2023-03-10 07:25:15','2023-03-10 07:25:15','1',1),(2832,1767,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Joshua','Great gifts','These are for my grandchildren for Easter. They are perfect','','2023-03-10 07:25:50','2023-03-10 07:25:50','1',1),(2833,1767,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Glen','Easter Present For My 1st Older Sister','These are for my grandchildren for Easter. They are perfect\r\nGlen (Easter Present For My 1st Older Sister) My Older 1st Sister Tonya Fitzpatrick Will Love This For Easter I Can\'t Stop Spoiling My Sister Cause I Love Her too Much Also She And I Give Each Other Space And Respect','','2023-03-10 07:26:39','2023-03-10 07:26:39','1',1),(2834,1769,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Oliver ','Granddaughter plays with it year round','Granddaughter plays with year round!','','2023-03-16 07:00:42','2023-03-16 07:00:42','1',1),(2835,1769,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Jake','Good quality for the price','I had seen a similar product on another site for nearly double the price. I wasn\'t expecting much but was pleasantly surprised by the quality. The wood is thicker than I expected and everything looks good together.\r\nThe only negative thing I would say is that it gives off a strong odour that caused some lightheadedness initially. I don\'t know if it\'s the paint or varnish or what. The smell eventually dissipated after being out of the packaging for some time.\r\nWould buy it again and recommend it!','','2023-03-16 07:01:30','2023-03-16 07:01:30','1',1),(2836,1769,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Noah ','Well done!','Very nicely made','','2023-03-16 07:01:57','2023-03-16 07:01:57','1',1),(2837,1769,NULL,0,5,0,5,'James','Easy to do','Got them for school kids to do over February break. All the kiddos had a blast. Even those under five could do it.','','2023-03-16 07:02:34','2023-03-16 07:02:34','1',1),(2838,1769,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jack','Great product but needs more quality controll','I ordered a very large quantity for a kid\'s craft event. They were perfect except quite a few were missing roofs.\r\nThe kids enjoyed the craft.','','2023-03-16 07:03:23','2023-03-16 07:03:23','1',1),(2839,1769,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Connor','Perfect return gift','Got this for my daughter\'s birthday party return gift and it worked out perfectly. All the kids liked them.','','2023-03-16 07:03:50','2023-03-16 07:03:50','1',1),(2840,1769,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Liam	','Great deal!','Used these as a party activity! Very good quality and a great price!','','2023-03-16 07:04:19','2023-03-16 07:04:19','1',1),(2841,1769,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Liam	','Great deal!','Used these as a party activity! Very good quality and a great price!','','2023-03-16 07:04:19','2023-03-16 07:04:19','1',1),(2842,1769,NULL,0,5,0,5,'John','Excellent','We purchased multiple packages and used them for a craft project at a family reunion. The youngest children used the supplied paints and stickers. Older children and adults used the craft paint we purchased. We reinforced them with dabs of hot glue. They aren\'t meant for real birdhouses. We had a lot of fun!','','2023-03-16 07:05:07','2023-03-16 07:05:07','1',1),(2843,1769,NULL,0,5,0,5,' Harry ','Cute activity for kids','The kids loved decorating these. ','','2023-03-16 07:05:38','2023-03-16 07:05:38','1',1),(2844,1769,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Callum ','Great class project!','I loved how each house is packaged with its instructions, paint, stickers and brush. This made this class project run so much smoother. The design was easy for my first graders to complete on their own with a quick demonstration. The paintbrush, stickers and paint are made of good-quality materials. ','','2023-03-16 07:06:14','2023-03-16 07:06:14','1',1),(2845,1770,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Amelia ','Thought they were going to be larger but that is okay they look just perfect in my centerpiece','They were fine','','2023-03-20 05:43:40','2023-03-20 05:43:40','1',1),(2846,1770,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Margaret','Cute','These are super cute and a great add-on for spring home decor.','','2023-03-20 05:44:26','2023-03-20 05:44:26','1',1),(2847,1770,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Emma','Cute','Cute','','2023-03-20 05:45:32','2023-03-20 05:45:32','1',1),(2848,1770,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Mary','Very nice','It\'s nice.','','2023-03-20 05:46:00','2023-03-20 05:46:00','1',1),(2849,1770,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Olivia','Love them!','Perfect addition to my spring decor with fast shipping!!♥️','','2023-03-20 05:46:44','2023-03-20 05:46:44','1',1),(2850,1770,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Samantha','Really cute','Very happy with the bunny! It\'s resin but made to look like carved wood. Good detail. Bought 2 larger bunnies from the same company to make a \"family\"','','2023-03-20 05:47:39','2023-03-20 05:47:39','1',1),(2851,1770,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Patricia ','Very cute and perfect for Easter!','I bought this for my sister for Easter. It’s very cute and well-made. My sister loved them. I would have given it 5 stars if it had not been for the smell. It had a strange and strong odour upon opening them, like paint or glue or similar. Other than that, they’re lovely to have.','','2023-03-20 05:48:49','2023-03-20 05:48:49','1',1),(2852,1770,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Isla','SO charming!','I can\'t even express how exactly perfect these were added to my Easter decor! I love the flavour or theme they exude...so much! Beautifully made, sturdy, and perfect accent size!!','','2023-03-20 05:49:34','2023-03-20 05:49:34','1',1),(2853,1770,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Bethany','These bunnies is a must have','The product was delayed a day, but worth the wait. The quality is so much better than expected. I especially love the sparkle on the vests. I had a hard time deciding on these and another set…so glad I settled on these lovely bunnies.','','2023-03-20 05:50:25','2023-03-20 05:50:25','1',1),(2854,1770,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Sophia','Very cute','These are well made. Wood that is painted. They are small I put them on an end table. Very cute Easter decoration or gift. They are a little pricey for the size.','','2023-03-20 05:51:04','2023-03-20 05:51:04','1',1),(2855,1771,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Smith','These turn out great. Just one problem….','I love the ice cube result! The only thing that sucks is once you add the water to freeze them, it’s very flimsy and difficult to carry to the freezer without spilling. I wish they came with lids.','','2023-03-21 06:17:50','2023-03-21 06:17:50','1',1),(2856,1771,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Murphy','Easy to Clean','I loved everything about this merchandise, Very sturdy and it\'s Easy to Clean.	 ','','2023-03-21 06:18:40','2023-03-21 06:18:40','1',1),(2857,1771,NULL,0,4,0,5,'Smith ',' To small',' I ordered this to make some soap, but the size of the butterflies is too small.','','2023-03-21 06:19:28','2023-03-21 06:19:28','1',1),(2858,1771,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jones','Awesome. Ought to come with some food coloring, though','Our ice maker broke in a very expensive fridge so we were going to buy ice trays but the wife loves butterflies - so now she gets butterfly ice in her coffee every morning. It\'s a nice little smiling thing to start the day.','','2023-03-21 06:20:07','2023-03-21 06:20:07','1',1),(2859,1771,NULL,0,5,0,5,'O\'Kelly','It Does An Amazing Job','I picked up the hobby of making candles and wax melts. Wanted to try something new to make wax melts and came across this mould. The butterflies turned out beautiful. As far as using soy wax, it is super easy to remove and sturdy. I love it and recommend it to anyone making wax melts.','','2023-03-21 06:21:14','2023-03-21 06:21:14','1',1),(2860,1771,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Johnson',' HUGE','I thought they would be smaller but they’re HUGE. And deep','','2023-03-21 06:21:59','2023-03-21 06:21:59','1',1),(2861,1771,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Williams','Butterfly mold','As per the description thank you','','2023-03-21 06:22:43','2023-03-21 06:22:43','1',1),(2862,1771,NULL,0,5,0,5,'O\'Sullivan','Very cute!','This is a very cute butterfly mould.','','2023-03-21 06:23:19','2023-03-21 06:23:19','1',1),(2863,1772,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jacob ','Pretty',' I love this sundress. It fits perfectly. The top is very stretchy but fits well without the fear of slipping down. The fabric is soft, almost silky and not see-through, I purchased the black one with white designs. Bought for our anniversary trip to Hawaii for a quick cover-up or night out.','','2023-03-23 06:30:18','2023-03-23 06:30:18','1',1),(2864,1772,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Michael','Love it','The dress looks exactly like it did in the picture. Love it','','2023-03-23 06:31:05','2023-03-23 06:31:05','1',1),(2865,1772,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Charlie','Amazing dress!','This dress is amazing! I’m a bit curvy, and it fits perfectly. The elastic is snug enough, so it doesn’t roll off your chest. The colours are amazing. And the material is perfect for the beach. I’m ordering one in at least one other colour. Highly recommend!','','2023-03-23 06:31:54','2023-03-23 06:31:54','1',1),(2866,1772,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Kyle','Cute',' I bought this for my vacation in jamaica, it looked great because it\'s a bright colour! Overall cute dress.','','2023-03-23 06:32:35','2023-03-23 06:32:35','1',1),(2867,1772,NULL,0,5,0,5,'William','Awesome material and really pretty',' I have not used it yet. It will be for a trip coming up in a couple of weeks. Looks very nice and I know I will use it a lot!	 ','','2023-03-23 06:33:38','2023-03-23 06:33:38','1',1),(2868,1772,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Thomas ','Beautiful dress','This is a beautiful dress	','','2023-03-23 06:34:14','2023-03-23 06:34:14','1',1),(2869,1772,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Joe','Sexy dress','The dress fits so well and is so sexy','','2023-03-23 06:40:59','2023-03-23 06:40:59','1',1),(2870,1772,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ethan','Nice color','The colour is gorgeous.','','2023-03-23 06:41:26','2023-03-23 06:41:26','1',1),(2871,1772,NULL,0,5,0,5,'David','cute','Cute summer dress','','2023-03-23 06:41:55','2023-03-23 06:41:55','1',1),(2872,1772,NULL,0,5,0,5,'George','Cover up review',' Love the vibrant colour of orange and the fabric. Will be the perfect cover-up','','2023-03-23 06:44:27','2023-03-23 06:44:27','1',1),(2873,1772,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Reece','Thank you!','Love the colour!','','2023-03-23 06:45:02','2023-03-23 06:45:02','1',1),(2874,1768,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Li','Easter Silicone Molds for candy making','I purchased these to make glass candy lollipops. They work fairly well except the brown mould is very thin and doesn\'t lay very flat or even, making it hard to get an even product. Also one of the bunny moulds doesn\'t always come out correctly with the ears. I\'ve learned you must pour really slowly to get them to fill correctly. These moulds might be a better fit for someone making chocolate candies. Overall though I would probably purchase again from the seller. They ship super fast.','','2023-03-27 07:04:00','2023-03-27 07:04:00','1',1),(2875,1768,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Smith ','Flower silicone molds','These make super cute flowers. I used Ruby Red juice, froze them, and placed them in glasses with Prosecco wine. Adorable! Make sure to place it on a hard tray of dirt before filling and putting it in the freezer.','','2023-03-27 07:04:51','2023-03-27 07:04:51','1',1),(2876,1768,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jones','Great',' Easy to use\r\nEasy to clean\r\nLove it	 ','','2023-03-27 07:12:20','2023-03-27 07:12:20','1',1),(2877,1768,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wilson','Great for melting crayons','We used this as a mould for melting small crayon pieces. Worked perfectly.','','2023-03-27 07:12:57','2023-03-27 07:12:57','1',1),(2878,1768,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Lam','Pawkers','The moulds are cute. Fit multi-purposes. I used them for a Paw Patrol sucker. Easy to clean with wipes and warm water. since the moulds don’t have a flat bottom, they sometimes didn’t sit level enough to cover all points of the sucker sticks.','','2023-03-27 07:13:41','2023-03-27 07:13:41','1',1),(2879,1768,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Williams','good','good','','2023-03-27 07:14:06','2023-03-27 07:14:06','1',1),(2880,1768,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Martin','cute','awesome for making lollipops','','2023-03-27 07:14:47','2023-03-27 07:14:47','1',1),(2881,1768,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Brown','Perfect!','Perfect for my twin\'s paw patrol party. My only issue is that the candy has bubbles/holes pretty much wherever the silicone was but I think that was a technical issue on my behalf. Nonetheless, they were a hit at the party','','2023-03-27 07:15:29','2023-03-27 07:15:29','1',1),(2882,1768,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Gelbero','cute','cute','','2023-03-27 07:15:49','2023-03-27 07:15:49','1',1),(2883,1768,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wilson','recommended','perfect','','2023-03-27 07:16:17','2023-03-27 07:16:17','1',1),(2884,1764,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wade ','Loved / easy to use','Easy to use, Loved them for my sugar cookies for my dipping frosting.','','2023-03-27 08:16:41','2023-03-27 08:16:41','1',1),(2885,1764,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dave','Fun fun!','We had a great time using the cutters!','','2023-03-27 08:17:21','2023-03-27 08:17:21','1',1),(2886,1764,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Seth ','Easter cookies',' Easter cookies','','2023-03-27 08:17:52','2023-03-27 08:17:52','1',1),(2887,1764,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ivan ','Great product','Perfect size','','2023-03-27 08:18:21','2023-03-27 08:18:21','1',1),(2888,1764,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Riley','A family tradition lives on','They\'re super cute and make adorable cookies. My family had 3d cookie cutters similar to these when I was growing up, and now I have them.\r\nIt is slightly annoying that they\'re two pieces so you have to match them up (sounds simple but there\'s an awful lot of them to dig through), but they\'re still super cute, fun and festive. Glad I bought them!','','2023-03-27 08:18:58','2023-03-27 08:18:58','1',1),(2889,1764,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Gilbert','So cute','These were perfect for no-spread sugar cookies. You have to press hard on them to get the picture to imprint but as long as you flour the cutter they don\'t stick and peel right off onto a cookie sheet.','','2023-03-27 08:19:29','2023-03-27 08:19:29','1',1),(2890,1764,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jorge','Love love love these',' I bought these to take on a trip to my great-grandkids\' home so we could bake together without a lot of trying to shape dough into something.\r\nI tried them at home first and what a surprise, the imprints are beautiful\r\nI love them','','2023-03-27 08:20:23','2023-03-27 08:20:23','1',1),(2891,1764,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dan ','Worked amazingly','As shown in the picture, it worked amazingly! Loved it!','','2023-03-27 08:20:54','2023-03-27 08:20:54','1',1),(2892,1764,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Brian','Great cookie cutter','Worked well for my fondant project and cupcakes!','','2023-03-27 08:21:23','2023-03-27 08:21:23','1',1),(2893,1764,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Roberto',' Great Product','Great cookie cutters! (unfortunately, I do not know the secret for getting the dark lines to show like the photo online but they work very well)','','2023-03-27 08:22:00','2023-03-27 08:22:00','1',1),(2894,1774,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wade','Lovely Array of Possibilities',' I\'m using these for mini book covers. Just a lovely array of possibilities for creating.','','2023-03-30 07:49:51','2023-03-30 07:49:51','1',1),(2895,1774,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dave','Miniature wood crafts perfect for garden potted planters designs','The unfinished wood grain is deeper at the door hinges, This is perfect for when I stain them darker than the rest of each of the doors, which will be a lighter stain. Then they will be glued onto outdoor potted planters in a wooded country scene on each.','','2023-03-30 07:50:30','2023-03-30 07:50:30','1',1),(2896,1774,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Seth','Fun','Love the product. It\'s fun and easy to use','','2023-03-30 07:50:58','2023-03-30 07:50:58','1',1),(2897,1774,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ivan','LOTS of fun!',' Grandchildren and I have been making fairy houses and these are perfect. Nice variety of doors and windows that are a great size to use on the little wooden birdhouses we often start with. And they are thin enough to cut with sturdy scissors for the ones that need a little \"haircut\" to fit.','','2023-03-30 07:51:36','2023-03-30 07:51:36','1',1),(2898,1774,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Riley',' Really cute for the garden','Shipped fast, cute for mommy and my art activity','','2023-03-30 07:52:20','2023-03-30 07:52:20','1',1),(2899,1774,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Gilbert','Perfect size',' I bought these for my daughter’s birthday party. They made fairy houses for their gardens. I loved the different designs and they were of nice quality.','','2023-03-30 07:52:57','2023-03-30 07:52:57','1',1),(2900,1774,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jorge','Perfect for my project!!!',' Well made and exactly as described. Perfect for my project. I would recommend them and order again.','','2023-03-30 07:53:31','2023-03-30 07:53:31','1',1),(2901,1774,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dan','Great fairy doors and windows!','These are great fairy doors and little windows! Such a fabulous value! I will be painting these and can hardly wait to install these on my displays.','','2023-03-30 07:54:06','2023-03-30 07:54:06','1',1),(2902,1774,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Brian','Cute','Easy to paint. Right size. Thank you','','2023-03-30 07:54:41','2023-03-30 07:54:41','1',1),(2903,1774,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Roberto','Fun projects','I love these. Made a slot of doors at the base of trees. Creative when paintings','','2023-03-30 07:55:17','2023-03-30 07:55:17','1',1),(2904,1776,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Wade ','So pretty!!!','Got this ring for my teenage daughter and she LOVES it! Way prettier in person! Quality seems good too.','','2023-04-04 07:51:47','2023-04-04 07:51:47','1',1),(2905,1776,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dave ','Absolutely stunning!!!','The picture and video do no justice! I’ve been wearing it for almost a full month now; washing dishes and everything; never take it off! It has held up so well, my finger hasn’t turned green like all the other rings ','','2023-04-04 07:52:37','2023-04-04 07:52:37','1',1),(2906,1776,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Seth ','It was perfect','The quality','','2023-04-04 07:53:06','2023-04-04 07:53:06','1',1),(2907,1776,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Ivan','Thank you','My daughter loves this ring','','2023-04-04 07:53:38','2023-04-04 07:53:38','1',1),(2908,1776,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Riley ','Real gold','This was given to my daughter that\'s a gift. It\'s a beautiful piece and she loves it','','2023-04-04 07:54:08','2023-04-04 07:54:08','1',1),(2909,1776,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Gilbert','I bought','I like it','','2023-04-04 07:54:43','2023-04-04 07:54:43','1',1),(2910,1776,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Jorge','It’s an amazing ring',' This ring looks so pretty and well done. I’ve been using a whole week. I’ve been doing my chores and still look beautiful and shiny.','','2023-04-04 07:55:36','2023-04-04 07:55:36','1',1),(2911,1776,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Dan','beautiful ring',' the ring is beautiful. It fits great and is a beautiful colour. I love it','','2023-04-04 07:56:10','2023-04-04 07:56:10','1',1),(2912,1776,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Brian','So pretty','Very pretty. The band is a decent size thickness it shouldn’t bend easily.','','2023-04-04 07:56:41','2023-04-04 07:56:41','1',1),(2913,1776,NULL,0,5,0,5,'Roberto','Amazing especially for the price','It\'s simple but so pretty ','','2023-04-04 07:57:09','2023-04-04 07:57:09','1',1);
